{
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.actor": "Stage acting was a waste of my immense talent. Not only am I a born leader, my talent is more profitable when it is used for conning people.",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.captain_1": "I'd have been a much better captain then Kid was. I played several captains on stage and I was good! ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.captain_2": "Where Kid longed for the appreciation of his men, I would rule by fear and with an iron fist!",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.cell": "If you find some way to release me I might even let you live as reward! So you'd better do your best or I'll kill you!",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.greet": "GET ME OUT OF HERE! NOW!",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.job": "I am a great and famous actor! Not a princess, at all. I was only PRETENDING to be a princess. But try explaining that to those stupid pirates.",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.key_1": "The key was lost in the underground river and has probably washed into the seven seas by now! ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.key_2": "If that stupid Kid hadn't been so obsessed with kidnapping he'd not have sold his ship to buy the most expensive and complicated locks for his cells!",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.kid": "He was always a fool with a heart too soft to become a feared pirate.",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.kidnap_1": "Ah kidnapping is so much fun. That is, if you're not on the receiving end. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.kidnap_2": "It's easy money and you have a chance to frighten and torture someone who can't fight back!",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.name": "How dare you? I left to rot in this dirty cell and you have nothing better to do than chit chat?",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.pirate_1": "In a just world, I would be captain of a grand ship, ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.pirate_2": "Those pirates out there would now be my minions, and we would brave the seas and become the terror of the coastal towns! ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.pirate_3": "If only our plan had worked!",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.plan_1": "It was all captain Kid's idea. You see, he hated his name and planned to become known by the name captain Kidnap. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.plan_10": "Things went bad when they decided to have a victory party. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.plan_11": "As far as I could make out from the mumblings of the pirates, Kid lost the key to my cell while relieving himself in the underground river. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.plan_12": "The fool decided to dive after it .. never to be seen again. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.plan_13": "When I found out about Kid's demise I tried to convince the pirates it was a hoax, but they just won't believe me!",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.plan_2": "All he needed was someone famous to kidnap. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.plan_3": "Given his men's dismal lack of talent and intelligence that would have been quite a feat. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.plan_4": "We knew each other from a few scams we did together in the past, so he contacted me. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.plan_5": "I was to impersonate the famous Princess Lumelia. You know, the one everyone was looking for. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.plan_6": "That would show his men and the other pirates what a great kidnapper he was. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.plan_7": "He promised me that I would become his second in command and lead a wonderful life of plundering, robbing and pillaging. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.plan_8": "So I agreed to impersonate the Princess for a while and it worked fine at first. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.plan_9": "He returned with me dressed as the Princess from a raid on his own and was instantaneously the hero of the day for his men. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.plundering_1": "As long as we stick to undefended coastal towns we can make an easy fortune. Har Har! ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.plundering_2": "As soon as I get out of here I'll finally become a pirate captain on my own. I don't need Captain Kid!",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.princess": "Me playing a princess was just part of a cunning plan we had.",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.rot": "YOU .. YOU .. You are as good as dead! I will get you! Do you hear me? I will have your head! On a platter!",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.scams_1": "The more stupid the people are, the easier it is to con them. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.scams_2": "And the poorer they are the less means they have to get revenge. Har Har! ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.scams_3": "So I make sure I ruin those I scam. Then they have other things to worry about than getting revenge on me.",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.ship_1": "Captain Kid sold his ship to buy pointless things like those insanely expensive locks for the cell doors. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.ship_2": "He said the canoes would do for a while. ...",
  "npc.a_bearded_woman.ship_3": "I got the impression he was not overly sad to part with the ship because he was known to suffer a lot from seasickness.",
  "npc.a_beautiful_girl.greet": "So you have come, {0}. I hoped you would not...",
  "npc.a_beggar.greet": "Hi! What is it, what d'ye {want}?",
  "npc.a_beggar.want": "The guys from the magistrate sent you here, didn't they?",
  "npc.a_beggar.yes_audience": "Thought so. You'll have to talk to the king though. The beggar king that is. The king does not grant an audience to just everyone. You know how those kings are, don't you?",
  "npc.a_beggar.yes_dedication": "So why don't you show your dedication to the poor? Go and help Chavis at the poor house. He's collecting food for people like us.",
  "npc.a_beggar.yes_help": "However, to get an audience with the king, you'll have to help his subjects a bit.",
  "npc.a_beggar.yes_palace": "If you brought enough of the stuff you'll see that the king will grant you entrance in his {palace}.",
  "npc.a_beggar.yes_subjects": "His subjects that would be us, the poor, you know?",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.ask_vocation": "Alright {0}. Vocation?",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.farewell": "Good bye and don't forget me!",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.form287_denied": "Oh, what a pity. Go see one of my colleagues. I give you the permission to get Form 287. Bye!",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.form287_grant": "Sure, you can get it from me. Here you are. Bye.",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.form145_intro": "Tell me if you liked it when you come back. What is your name?",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.form356_done": "INCREDIBLE, you did it!! Have fun at Pumin's Domain!",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.form356_intro": "How very interesting. I need to tell that to my master immediately. Please go to my colleagues and ask for Form 356. You will need it in order to proceed.",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.form356_need_145": "Sorry, you need Form 145 to get Form 356. Come back when you have it.",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.form356_granted": "You are better than I thought! Congratulations, here you are: Form 356!",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.form411_granted": "Great. Here you are. Form 411. Come back anytime you want to talk. Bye.",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.greet": "Hello {0}, welcome to the atrium of Pumin's Domain. We require some information from you before we can let you pass. Where do you want to go?",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.pumin_intro_cautious": "I'm not sure if you know what you are doing but anyway. Your name is?",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.need_form287": "Form 411? You need Form 287 to get that! Do you have it?",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.pumin_intro": "Sure, where else. Everyone likes to meet my master, he is a great demon, isn't he? Your name is ...?",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.walkaway": "Good bye and don't forget me!",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.same_vocation": "I was a {0}, too, before I died!! What do you want from me?",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.form145_require_411": "That's right, you can get Form 145 from me. However, I need Form 411 first. Come back when you have it.",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.form145_granted": "Well done! You have Form 411! Here is Form 145. Have fun with it.",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.spell_vocation": "{0}, is that right?! What do you want from me?",
  "npc.a_dead_bureaucrat.warn_weapon": "Huhu, please don't hurt me with your {0}! Reason of your visit?",
  "npc.a_behemoth.greet": "Pssst! Keep it down! <gives you an elaborate report on monster activity>",
  "npc.a_dragon_lord.greet": "Greetings, mortal. What brings you to my domain?",
  "npc.a_dragon_mother.assistance_1": "Wretched creatures of ice have stolen my egg that was close to hatching.",
  "npc.a_dragon_mother.assistance_2": "Since I'm too huge to enter those lower Tunnels I have to ask you to take care of my {egg}. Will you do this?",
  "npc.a_dragon_mother.egg_1": "As I told you, fiendish ice creatures dragged my egg into the lower caves.",
  "npc.a_dragon_mother.egg_2": "Without enough heat the egg will die soon. Venture there and save my hatchling and the knowledge you seek shall be yours!",
  "npc.a_dragon_mother.greet_done": "You have done me a favour and the knowledge you are seeking shall be yours. I melted the ice for you, you can pass now.",
  "npc.a_dragon_mother.greet_grrr": "Grrr.",
  "npc.a_dragon_mother.greet_need_help": "Greetings humans! Consider yourselfs lucky, I'm in need of {help}.",
  "npc.a_dragon_mother.help": "I'm aware what you are looking for. Usually I would rather devour you, but due to unfortunate circumstances, I need your {assistance}.",
  "npc.a_dragon_mother.yes_1": "So return to the upper tunnels where cultists and ice golems dwell. Somewhere in these tunnels you will find a small prison haunted by a ghost. South of this prison cell there is a tunnel that will lead you eastwards.",
  "npc.a_dragon_mother.yes_2": "Follow the tunnel until you reach a small cave. Step down and down until you see a blue energy field. It will lead you to my egg. It is sealed so that not everyone may enter the room. But you have the permission now.",
  "npc.a_fluffy_squirrel.acorn": "Chh? Chhh?? <though you don't understand squirrelish, that one seems really excited>",
  "npc.a_fluffy_squirrel.farewell": "Chh...",
  "npc.a_fluffy_squirrel.greet": "Chhchh?",
  "npc.a_fluffy_squirrel.trade_offer": "Chchch. Chh! <you're not sure, but it seems that squirrel wants to trade your valuable acorns for useless stones that it found and considered uneatable>",
  "npc.a_fluffy_squirrel.trade_sold": "Sold {0}x {1} for {2} gold.",
  "npc.a_fluffy_squirrel.walkaway": "Chh...",
  "npc.a_grumpy_cyclops.farewell": "Finally, some peace.",
  "npc.a_grumpy_cyclops.greet": "Grmph. Speak quickly, {0}.",
  "npc.a_grumpy_cyclops.walkaway": "Hrmph. Lil' ones never listen.",
  "npc.a_swan.greet": "I salute you, mortal being.",
  "npc.a_swan.mission_intro.1": "My sister Ikassis sent you? Blessed be her soul! Yes, it is true: I need help. Listen, I will tell you a secret but please don't break it. As you might already suspect I'm not really a swan but a fae. ...",
  "npc.a_swan.mission_intro.2": "But other than many of my siblings I did not take over a swan's body. I'm a swan maiden and this is one of my two aspects. I can take the shape of a swan as well as that of a young maiden. ...",
  "npc.a_swan.mission_intro.3": "But to do so I need a magical artefact: a cloak made of swan feathers. If I lose this cloak - or someone steals it from me - I'm stuck to the form of a swan and can't change shape anymore. And this is exactly what happened: ...",
  "npc.a_swan.mission_intro.4": "A troll stalked me while I was bathing in the river and he stole my cloak. Now I am trapped in the form of a swan. Please, can you find the thief and bring back the cloak?",
  "npc.a_swan.mission_recover.1": "This is everything that remained of my cloak? That's terrible! However, I guess I can put the feathers together again. Yes, that should be enough feathers. ...",
  "npc.a_swan.mission_recover.2": "Please give them to me so I can restore my cloak. But don't watch me! Swan maidens don't like to be observed. Nature's blessings, human being. I will tell Ikassis that you have been of great assistance.",
  "npc.a_swan.mission_accept.1": "Thank you, human being! I guess the thieving troll headed to the mountains east of here. As far as I know you can only reach these mountain tops by diving into a small cave. ...",
  "npc.a_swan.mission_accept.2": "The connecting tunnels will lead you to a mountain where you may discover him. I heard a man named Jerom talking about this when he passed by this river. Perhaps he knows more about it.",
  "npc.a_swan.need_feathers": "You need to deliver me like 5 feathers.",
  "npc.a_swan.not_on_mission": "You are not on that mission.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.ab_dendriel": "Me parents live here before town was. Me not care about lil' ones.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.cenath": "Is one of elven family or such thing. Me not understand lil' ones and their business.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.cyclops": "Me people not live here much. Most are far away.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.dragon_shield": "Do lil' one want to trade a dragon shield?",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.elves": "Me not fight them, they not fight me.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.excalibug": "Me wish I could make weapon like it.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.farewell": "Good bye lil' one.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.fire_sword": "Do lil' one want to trade a fire sword?",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.god": "You shut up. Me not want to hear.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.greet": "Hum Humm! Welcume lil' {0}.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.job": "I am smith.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.lil_lil": "Lil' lil' ones are so fun. We often chat.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.mesh_kaha_rogh": "Steel that is singing when forged. No one knows where find today.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.minotaurs": "They were friend with me parents. Long before elves here, they often made visit. No longer come here.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.name": "I called Bencthyclthrtrprr by me people. Lil' ones me call Big Ben.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.quest_bast_check": "Lil' one bring three bast skirts?",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.quest_bast_complete": "Good good! Woman happy will be. Now me happy too and help you.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.quest_bast_reminder": "Lil' one bring three bast skirts.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.quest_bast_request": "Me need gift for woman. We dance, so me want to give her bast skirt. But she big is. So I need many to make big one. Bring three okay? Me wait.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.quest_bast_wait": "Wait. Me work no cheap is. Do favour for me first, yes?",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.quest_soul_orb_offer": "Uh. Me can make some nasty lil' bolt from soul orbs. Lil' one want to trade all?",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.quest_uth_kean_offer": "Very noble. Shiny. Me like. But breaks so fast. Me can make from shiny armour. Lil' one want to trade?",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.quest_uth_lokr_offer": "Firy steel it is. Need green ones' breath to melt. Or red even better. Me can make from shield. Lil' one want to trade?",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.quest_uth_prta_offer": "Good iron is. Me friends use it much for fight. Me can make from weapon. Lil' one want to trade?",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.quest_za_ralator_offer": "Hellsteel is. Cursed and evil. Dangerous to work with. Me can make from evil helmet. Lil' one want to trade?",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.response_cling_clang": "Cling clang!",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.response_cling_clang_bonus": "Cling clang! Me done good work today! Li'l one gets double bolts!",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.smith": "Working steel is my profession.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.steel": "Manny kinds of. Like {Mesh Kaha Rogh'}, {Za'Kalortith}, {Uth'Byth}, {Uth'Morc}, {Uth'Amon}, {Uth'Maer}, {Uth'Doon}, and {Zatragil}.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.sword_valor": "Do lil' one want to trade a sword of valor?",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.teshial": "Is one of elven family or such thing. Me not understand lil' ones and their business.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.tibia": "One day I'll go and look.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.uth_amon": "Heartiron from heart of big old mountain, found very deep. Lil' lil ones fiercely defend. Not wanting to have it used for stuff but holy stuff.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.uth_byth": "Not good to make stuff off. Bad steel it is. But eating magic, so useful is.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.uth_doon": "It's high steel called. Only lil' lil' ones know how make.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.uth_maer": "Brightsteel is. Much art made with it. Sorcerers too lazy and afraid to enchant much.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.walkaway": "Don't leave lil' one waiting!",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.warlord_sword": "Do lil' one want to trade a warlord sword?",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.za_kalortith": "It's evil. Demon iron is. No good cyclops goes where you can find and need evil flame to melt.",
  "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.zatragil": "Most ancients use dream silver for different stuff. Now ancients most gone. Most not know about.",
  "npc.nah_bob.cookie_ask": "You brought cookies! How nice of you! Can I have one?",
  "npc.nah_bob.cookie_no": "I see.",
  "npc.nah_bob.cookie_none": "You have no cookie that I'd like.",
  "npc.nah_bob.cookie_rage": "You see, good deeds like this will ... YOU ... YOU SPAWN OF EVIL! I WILL MAKE SURE THE MASTER LEARNS ABOUT THIS!",
  "npc.nah_bob.farewell": "Bye now, Neutrala {0}. Visit old Bob again one day!",
  "npc.nah_bob.greet": "<Sighs> Another {customer}! I've only just sat down! What is it, {0}?",
  "npc.nah_bob.laugh_1": "Hahahaha!",
  "npc.nah_bob.laugh_2": "{0}, that almost sounded like the word of greeting. Humans - cute they are!",
  "npc.nah_bob.no_place": "Whoa! A human! This is no place for you, {0}. Go and play somewhere else.",
  "npc.nah_bob.sendtrade": "At your service, just browse through my wares.",
  "npc.nah_bob.trade_denied": "I'm sorry, human. But you need Gabel's permission to trade with me.",
  "npc.nah_bob.walkaway": "Bye then.",
  "npc.nilsor.blossom_info": "The purple kiss is a plant that grows in a place called jungle. You will have to use a kitchen knife to harvest its blossom. Do you have a blossom of a purple kiss with you?",
  "npc.nilsor.cactus_info": "You will find this kind of cactus at places that are called deserts. Only an ordinary kitchen knife will be precise enough to produce the ingredient weneed. Do you have a part of that cactus with you?",
  "npc.nilsor.comeback": "Come back when you have the ingredient.",
  "npc.nilsor.greet": "Greetings, traveller {0}. Is there anything I can {do for you}?",
  "npc.nilsor.herb_info": "The frostbite herb is a local plant but its quite rare. You can find it on mountain peaks. You will need to cut it with a fine kitchen knife. Do you have a frostbite herb with you?",
  "npc.nilsor.hydra_tongue_info": "The hydra tongue is a common pest plant in warmer regions. You might find one in a shop. Do you have a hydra tongue with you?",
  "npc.nilsor.mission_accept_1": "A thousand thanks in advance. I need no less than 7 ingredients for the cure. You can ask me about each specifically ...",
  "npc.nilsor.mission_accept_2": "I need a part of the sun adorer cactus, a vial of geyser water, sulphur of a lava hole, a frostbite herb, a blossom of a purple kiss, a hydra tongue and spores of a giant glimmercap mushroom ...",
  "npc.nilsor.mission_accept_3": "Turn them in individually by talking about them to me. As soon as I obtained them all, talk to me about the medicine. First time bring a Part of the Sun Adorer {Cactus}.",
  "npc.nilsor.mission_complete_1": "Thank you. Now I have all necessary ingredients. As a reward I grant you the use of our dog sled, which is located to the east of here. ...",
  "npc.nilsor.mission_complete_2": "The dogs can be a bit moody, but if you always carry some ham with you there shouldnt be any problems. Oh, and Hjaern might have a mission for you. So maybe you go and talk to him.",
  "npc.nilsor.mission_intro_1": "I am in dire need of help. A plague has befallen my dogs. I even called a druid of Carlin for help but all he could do was to recommend some strong medicine ...",
  "npc.nilsor.mission_intro_2": "The thing is the ingredients of the medicine are extremely rare and some only exist in far away and distant lands. If you could help me collecting the ingredients, I would be eternally grateful ...",
  "npc.nilsor.mission_intro_3": "Are you willing to help me?",
  "npc.nilsor.mission_progress": "What for ingredient do you have?",
  "npc.nilsor.no_ingredient": "Then come back when you have the ingredient.",
  "npc.nilsor.no_mission": "I have now no mission for you.",
  "npc.nilsor.not_enough_money": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.nilsor.spores_info": "The giant glimmercap mushroom exists in caves and other preferably warm and humid places. Use an ordinary kitchen spoon on a mushroom to collectits spores. Do you have the glimmercap spores?",
  "npc.nilsor.sulphur_info": "I need fine sulphur of an inactive lava hole. No other sulphur will do. Use an ordinary kitchen spoon on an inactive lava hole. Do you have fine sulphur with you?",
  "npc.nilsor.thanks_blossom": "Thank you for this ingredient. Now bring me the {Hydra Tongue}",
  "npc.nilsor.thanks_cactus": "Thank you for this ingredient. Now bring me Geyser {Water} in a Waterskin. ",
  "npc.nilsor.thanks_herb": "Thank you for this ingredient Now bring me Purple Kiss {Blossom}.",
  "npc.nilsor.thanks_hydra": "Thank you for this ingredient. Now bring me {Spores} of a Giant Glimmercap Mushroom.",
  "npc.nilsor.thanks_spores": "Thank you for this ingredient. Now you finish your {mission}",
  "npc.nilsor.thanks_sulphur": "Thank you for this ingredient. Now bring me the Frostbite {Herb}",
  "npc.nilsor.thanks_water": "Thank you for this ingredient. Now bring me Fine {Sulphur}.",
  "npc.nilsor.travel_ask": "Do you want to travel to Svargrond?",
  "npc.nilsor.water_info_1": "You will need a specially prepared waterskin to collect the water. You can buy one from me ...",
  "npc.nilsor.water_info_2": "Use it on a geyser that is NOT active. The water of active geysers is far too hot. You can find inactive geysers on Okolnir. Do you have some geyser water with you?",
  "npc.nilsor.waterskin_ask": "Do you want to buy a waterskin for 25 gold?",
  "npc.nilsor.waterskin_given": "Here you are. A waterskin!",
  "npc.nina.greet": "Beware, if you go any further you will have to fight a large group of Chosen. This place is called the Fire Dragon Dojo. Tread carefully since these are lizard training grounds.",
  "npc.nina.farewell": "Goodbye. Human. Being!",
  "npc.nina.walkaway": "Goodbye. Human. Being!",
  "npc.nina.chosen": "The lizards here are the chosen ones of their kind. We believe them to be the strongest warriors in these lands.So I lead my people here to learn their ways. We are mere assassins but they are using foreign techniques and seem to be far more efficient",
  "npc.nina.fire_dragon_dojo": "We of the Grey Shadow clan are studying the ways of the Chosen. Our training is hard, encounters with the lizards often deadly. Every one of us fights on his own. Each one more deadly than the other. Under my lead we wil rise renewed, as the Shadow Nina.",
  "npc.nina.name": "I am Nina, leader of the Grey Shadow clan. Me and my followers, the Shadow Nina, are exploring the largely uncharted parts of the continent Zao.",
  "npc.ninos.greet": "Hello. How may I help you {0}? Ask me for a {trade} if you want to buy something. I can also explain the {mail} system.",
  "npc.ninos.farewell": "It was a pleasure to help you, {0}.",
  "npc.ninos.measurements": "Oh they don't change that much since in the old days as... <tells a boring and confusing story about a cake, a parcel, himself and two squirrels, at least he tells you his measurements in the end>",
  "npc.nokmir.greet": "You are....kind of tall! Hello.",
  "npc.nokmir.farewell": "See you my friend.",
  "npc.nokmir.walkaway": "See you my friend.",
  "npc.nokmir.mission_intro": "I don't see how you could help me. I'm in deep, deep trouble. I'm accused of having stolen a {ring} from Rerun, but I haven't.",
  "npc.nokmir.ring_story_1": "He said he still had it after work. On that evening, {Grombur}, {Rerun} and me opened a cask of beer in one of the mine tunnels. We had a fun evening there. ...",
  "npc.nokmir.ring_story_2": "On the next day, the guards brought me to emperor {Rehal}, and Rerun was there, too. He said I had stolen his ring. I'd never steal, you have to believe me.",
  "npc.nokmir.grombur_info": "Maybe Grombur knows more than me. The thing is he won't talk to me, and he will surely not accuse his best friend as a liar. What a dilemma!",
  "npc.nokmir.rerun_info": "He's a miner in the southern wing. Maybe he has lost the ring there... but even if I find the ring, no one will believe me. Someone should talk to Grombur. He's Rerun's best friend.",
  "npc.nokmir.rehal_info": "He's a good emperor but I doubt he is wise enough to see the truth behind that false accusation against me. If just someone would find out the truth about that whole mess.",
  "npc.nokmir.mission_complete": "WHAT?! I can't believe it. You saved my life... well, at least one week of it 'cause that would have been the time I had to spend in jail. If you want to, you can pass the door now and take a look at the northern mines. Have fun!",
  "npc.norma.addon_ask": "Oh, you're back already? Did you bring a legion helmet, 100 chicken feathers and 50 honeycombs?",
  "npc.norma.addon_instructions": "Okay, here we go, listen closely! I need a few things... a basic hat of course, maybe a legion helmet would do. Then about 100 chicken feathers... and 50 honeycombs as glue. That's it, come back to me once you gathered it!!",
  "npc.norma.addon_later": "Maybe another time.",
  "npc.norma.addon_no": "Aw, I guess you don't like feather hats. No big deal.",
  "npc.norma.addon_no_feathers": "Sorry, but you don't have enough chicken feathers.",
  "npc.norma.addon_no_helmet": "Sorry, but I can't see a legion helmet.",
  "npc.norma.addon_no_honeycombs": "Sorry, but you don't have enough honeycombs.",
  "npc.norma.addon_offer": "Pretty, isn't it? I made it myself, but I could teach you how to do that if you like. What do you say?",
  "npc.norma.addon_success": "Great job! That must have taken a lot of work. Okay, you put it like this... then glue like this... here!",
  "npc.norma.farewell": "Bye, {0}! Visit my bar more often!",
  "npc.norma.greet": "Hello there, {0}! Looking for some fun? Step into my bar and have a {drink}!",
  "npc.norma.walkaway": "Hey! Don't leave so soon!",
  "npc.olrik.dice_lose": "Ok, here we go ... {0}! You lose! Try again.",
  "npc.olrik.dice_win": "Ok, here we go ... {0}! You have won! How lucky you are! So listen ...<tells you what you need to know>",
  "npc.olrik.measurements_gamble": "My measurements? Listen, lets make that a bit more exciting ... No, no, not what you think! I mean let's gamble. I will roll a dice. If I roll a 6 you win and I'll tell you what you need to know, else I win and get 5 gold. Deal?",
  "npc.narsai.greet_default": "How could I help you?",
  "npc.narsai.mission_ask": "Could you help me do a ritual?",
  "npc.narsai.ingredient_list": "Here is the list of ingredients that are missing to complete the ritual. ",
  "npc.narsai.sorry": "Sorry.",
  "npc.narsai.materials_ask": "Did you bring all the materials I informed you about?",
  "npc.narsai.ritual_complete": "Thank you this stage of the ritual is complete.",
  "npc.narsai.farewell": "Well, bye then.",
  "npc.nelly.voice_welcome": "Welcome to the post office!",
  "npc.nelly.voice_selling": "Also selling runes, potions and magical equipment!",
  "npc.nelly.greet": "Hello {0}, What can I do for you? I'm working for the post office, but I also trade with important {potions}, {runes} and other magical equipment.",
  "npc.nelly.farewell": "Good bye, {0}.",
  "npc.nelly.walkaway": "Ah, the impetuosity of youth.",
  "npc.nielson.voice_passages": "Passages to Senja, Folda and Vega.",
  "npc.nielson.greet": "Ahoi, young man {0} and welcome to the Nordic Tibia Ferries. If you need a {passage}, let me know.",
  "npc.nielson.farewell": "Good bye. You are welcome.",
  "npc.nielson.nice_trip": "Have a nice trip!",
  "npc.nielson.not_miss": "You shouldn't miss the experience.",
  "npc.nielson.passage_info": "Where do you want to go today? We serve the routes to {Folda}, {Senja} and {Vega} and back to Tibia.",
  "npc.nielson.job": "We are ferrymen. We transport goods and passengers to the Ice Islands.",
  "npc.ninev.greet": "Welcome, young {0}! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free or you want the {adventurer stone}?",
  "npc.ninev.farewell": "May the gods bless you, {0}!",
  "npc.ninev.walkaway": "Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.",
  "npc.ninev.stake_intro_1": "A blessed stake to defeat evil spirits? I do know an old prayer which is said to grant sacred power and to be able to bind this power to someone, or something. ...",
  "npc.ninev.stake_intro_2": "However, this prayer needs the combined energy of ten priests. Each of them has to say one line of the prayer. ...",
  "npc.ninev.stake_intro_3": "I could start with the prayer, but since the next priest has to be in a different location, you probably will have to travel a lot. ...",
  "npc.ninev.stake_intro_4": "Is this stake really important enough to you so that you are willing to take this burden?",
  "npc.ninev.stake_get_gamon": "Alright, I guess you need a stake first. Maybe Gamon can help you, the leg of a chair or something could just do. Try asking him for a stake, and if you have one, bring it back to me.",
  "npc.ninev.stake_no_item": "I guess you couldn't convince Gamon to give you a stake, eh?",
  "npc.ninev.stake_prayer_ask": "Yes, I was informed what to do. Are you prepared to receive my line of the prayer?",
  "npc.ninev.stake_prayer_1": "So receive my prayer: 'Light shall be near - and darkness afar'. Now, bring your stake to Tibra in the Carlin church for the next line of the prayer. I will inform her what to do.",
  "npc.ninev.stake_wait": "I will wait for you.",
  "npc.ninev.stake_visit_tibra": "You should visit Tibra in the Carlin church now.",
  "npc.ninev.stake_already_done": "You already received my line of the prayer.",
  "npc.ninev.twist_intro_1": "This is a special blessing I can bestow upon you once you have obtained at least one of the other blessings and which functions a bit differently. ...",
  "npc.ninev.twist_intro_2": "It only works when you're killed by other adventurers, which means that at least half of the damage leading to your death was caused by others, not by monsters or the environment. ...",
  "npc.ninev.twist_intro_3": "The {twist of fate} will not reduce the death penalty like the other blessings, but instead prevent you from losing your other blessings as well as the amulet of loss, should you wear one. It costs the same as the other blessings. ...",
  "npc.ninev.twist_intro_4": "Would you like to receive that protection for a sacrifice of |PVPBLESSCOST| gold, child?",
  "npc.ninev.twist_received": "So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  "npc.ninev.twist_declined": "Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  "npc.ninev.stone_keep": "Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  "npc.ninev.stone_free_ask": "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  "npc.ninev.stone_paid_ask": "Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 gold?",
  "npc.ninev.stone_here": "Here you are. Take care.",
  "npc.ninev.stone_no_problem": "No problem.",
  "npc.ninev.stone_no_money": "Sorry, you don't have enough money.",
  "npc.ninev.heal_fire": "You are burning. Let me quench those flames.",
  "npc.ninev.heal_poison": "You are poisoned. Let me soothe your pain.",
  "npc.ninev.heal_energy": "You are electrified, my child. Let me help you to stop trembling.",
  "npc.ninev.heal_wounds": "You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  "npc.ninev.heal_not_needed": "You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  "npc.ninev.pilgrimage_info": "Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  "npc.ninev.blessings_info": "There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  "npc.ninev.bless_spiritual_has": "I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  "npc.ninev.bless_spiritual_no": "You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  "npc.ninev.bless_embrace_has": "I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  "npc.ninev.bless_embrace_no": "The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  "npc.ninev.bless_suns_has": "I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  "npc.ninev.bless_suns_no": "You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  "npc.ninev.bless_phoenix_has": "I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  "npc.ninev.bless_phoenix_no": "The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  "npc.ninev.bless_solitude_has": "I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  "npc.ninev.bless_solitude_no": "Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  "npc.nipuna.voice_selling": "I'm selling magic equipment. Come and have a look.",
  "npc.nipuna.voice_runes": "If you need runes, this is the market stall for you!",
  "npc.obi.voice_quality": "Only quality steel and wood used for my weapons!",
  "npc.obi.voice_buy": "Buy your weapons here!",
  "npc.obi.voice_selling": "Selling and buying all sorts of weapons, come and have a look!",
  "npc.obi.voice_monsters": "Give those monsters a good whipping with my weapons!",
  "npc.obi.greet": "Hello, hello, {0}! Please come in, look, and buy! If you like to see my offers, ask me for a {trade}!",
  "npc.obi.farewell": "Farewell, I hope you were satisfied with our service.",
  "npc.obi.walkaway": "Um yeah, good day.",
  "npc.obi.trade": "Of course, just browse through my wares.",
  "npc.oblivion.voice_hm": "Hm.",
  "npc.oblivion.voice_listen": "Yes. I listen, master.",
  "npc.oblivion.voice_understand": "I understand.",
  "npc.oblivion.voice_wait": "Not yet, my brothers. Wait.",
  "npc.ocelus.greet": "Greetings, dear visitor {0}.",
  "npc.ocelus.farewell": "Good bye.",
  "npc.ocelus.walkaway": "Oh well.",
  "npc.ocelus.eleonore_response": "I heard the birds sing about her beauty. But how could a human rival the enchanting beauty of a {mermaid}?",
  "npc.ocelus.mermaid_1": "Oh yes, I noticed that lovely mermaid. From afar of course. I would not dare to step into the eyes of such a lovely creature. ...",
  "npc.ocelus.mermaid_2": "... I guess I am quite shy. Oh my, if I were not blue, I would turn red now. If there would be someone to arrange a {date} with her.",
  "npc.ocelus.mermaid_poem": "Oh my. Its not easy to impress a mermaid I guess. Please get me a {love poem}. I think elves are the greatest poets so their city seems like a good place to look for one.",
  "npc.ocelus.date_ask": "Will you ask the mermaid Marina if she would date me?",
  "npc.ocelus.date_thanks": "Thank you. How ironic, a human granting a djinn a wish.",
  "npc.ocelus.poem_enchant": "Excellent. Here, with this little spell I enable you to recite the poem like a true elven poet. Now go and ask her for a date again.",
  "npc.ocelus.poem_missing": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.ocelus.poem_ask": "Did you get a love poem from Ab'Dendriel?",
  "npc.oldrak.greet": "Welcome {0}! Only rarely I can welcome {visitors} these days.",
  "npc.oldrak.farewell": "Good Bye, {0}",
  "npc.oldrak.walkaway": "Take care, it's dangerous out there.",
  "npc.oldrak.mission_ask": "How do you know? Did you go into the infested area?",
  "npc.oldrak.mission_wait": "You better don't return here until you've defeated the Demon Oak.",
  "npc.oldrak.mission_done_1": "You chopped down the demon oak?!? Unbelievable!! Let's hope it doesn't come back. As long as evil is still existent in the soil of the plains, it won't be over. Still, the demons suffered a setback, that's for sure. ...",
  "npc.oldrak.mission_done_2": "For your brave action, I tell you a secret which has been kept for many many years. There is an old house south of the location where you found the demon oak. There should be a grave with the name 'Yesim Adeit' somewhere close by. ...",
  "npc.oldrak.mission_done_3": "It belongs to a Daramian nobleman named 'Teme Saiyid'. I knew him well and he told me -almost augured- that someone will come who is worthy to obtain his treasure. I'm sure this 'someone' is you. Good luck in finding it!",
  "npc.oldrak.mission_yes": "A demon oak?!? <mumbles some blessings> May the gods be on our side. You'll need a {hallowed axe} to harm that tree. Bring me a simple {axe} and I'll prepare it for you.",
  "npc.oldrak.mission_lie": "I don't believe a word of it! How rude to lie to a monk!",
  "npc.oldrak.axe_ask": "Ahh, you've got an axe. Very good. I can make a hallowed axe out of it. It will cost you... er... a donation of 1,000 gold. Alright?",
  "npc.oldrak.axe_first": "You have to first talk about {demon oak} or the {mission} before we continue.",
  "npc.oldrak.axe_done": "Let's see....<mumbles a prayer>....here we go. The blessing on this axe will be absorbed by all the demonic energy around here. I presume it will not last very long, so better hurry. Actually, I can refresh the blessing as often as you like.",
  "npc.oldrak.axe_missing": "There is no axe with you.",
  "npc.oldrak.money_missing": "There is not enough of money with you.",
  "npc.oldrak.mission_no": "What a pity! Let me know when you managed to get in there. Maybe I can help you when we know what we are dealing with.",
  "npc.oldrak.axe_no": "No then.",
  "npc.oldrak.hugo": "Ah, the curse of the Plains of Havoc, the hidden beast, the unbeatable foe. I've been living here for years and I'm sure this is only a myth.",
  "npc.oldrak.myth": "There are many tales about the fearsome Hugo. It's said it's an abnormality, accidentally created by Yenny the Gentle. It's half demon, half something else and people say it's still alive after all these years.",
  "npc.oldrak.yenny": "Yenny, known as the Gentle, was one of the most powerful wielders of magic in ancient times. She was known throughout the world for her mercy and kindness.",
  "npc.oldrak.tible_ask": "Would you like to buy a The Holy Tible for 1000 gold?",
  "npc.oldrak.tible_quest_first": "You need to complete the quest for the book first before you can buy The Holy Tible.",
  "npc.oldrak.tible_done": "Here is your The Holy Tible.",
  "npc.oldrak.not_enough_money": "You do not have enough money.",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.voice_1": "Did you hear that, too?",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.greet_done": "Well done! But know this: The cursed crystal seems to regenerate over time. It could be necessary to come back and repeat whatever you have done down there.",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.greet": "Hello there. I'm sorry, I hardly noticed you. I'm a bit nervous. The spooky {sounds} down there, you know",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.mission_intro_1": "As for myself I haven't been down there. But I heard some disturbing rumours. In these caves are wonderful crystal formations. Some more poetically inclined fellows call them the crystal gardens. ...",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.mission_intro_2": "At first glance it seems to be a beautiful - and precious - surrounding. But in truth, deep down in these caverns exists an old evil. Want to hear more?",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.not_done": "Hmm. No, I don't think so. I still feel this strange prickling in my toes.",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.too_bad": "Too bad.",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.protect_ears": "Protect your ears? Hmm ... Wasn't there some fabulous seafarer who used wax or something to plug his ears? There was a story about horrible bird-women or something ...? No, sounds like hogwash, doesn't it.",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.evil_crystal_1": "The evil I mentioned is a strange crystal, imbued with some kind of unholy energy. It is very hard to destroy, no weapon is able to shatter the thing. Maybe a jarring, very loud sound could destroy it. ...",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.evil_crystal_2": "I heard of creatures, that are able to utter ear-splitting sounds. Don't remember the name, though. Would you go down there and try to destroy the crystal?",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.good_luck": "Great! Good luck and be careful down there!",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.crystals_1": "In my humble opinion a pirate should win a fortune by boarding ships not by crawling through caves and tunnels. But who am I to bring into question the captain's decision. All I know is that they sell the crystals at a high price. ...",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.crystals_2": "A certain amount of the crystals is ground to crystal dust with a special kind of mill. Don't ask me why. Some kind of magical component perhaps that they sell to mages and sorcerers.",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.sounds_1": "These caves are incredibly beautiful, {crystals} in vibrant colours grow there like exotic flowers. There are more than a few captains who send down their men in order to quarry the precious crystals. ...",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.sounds_2": "But there are few volunteers. Often the crystal gatherers disappear and are never seen again. Other poor fellows then meet their former shipmates in the form of ghosts or skeletons. It's a {cursed} area, something evil is down there!",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.job": "I'm a pirate. Normally I'm sailing the seas, boarding other ships and gathering treasures. But at the moment my captain graciously assigned me to watch this {cursed} entrance.",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.name": "I'm One-Eyed Joe. From Josephina, got that? And I regard this eye patch as a personal feature of beauty!",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.bye": "Good bye adventurer. It was nice to talk with you.",
  "npc.one_eyed_joe.progress": "Ah, the brave adventurer who sought to destroy the evil crystal down there. Have you been successful?",
  "npc.oswald.greet": "Oh, hello {0}. What is it?",
  "npc.oswald.farewell": "Finally!",
  "npc.oswald.walkaway": "Good bye, and don't come back too soon.",
  "npc.oswald.invitation_ask": "What? So why in the world should I give you an invitation? It's not as if you were someone important, are you?",
  "npc.oswald.invitation_donate": "Well, rich and generous people are always welcome in the palace.If you donate 1000 gold to a fund I oversee, I'll give you an invitation, ok?",
  "npc.oswald.invitation_done": "Excellent! Here is your invitation!",
  "npc.oswald.not_enough_money": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.oswald.gold_doubt": "Not that I am bribeable but I doubt that you own 1000 gold pieces. Or do you?",
  "npc.ottokar.medicine_ask": "Did you bring me the medicine pouch?",
  "npc.ottokar.medicine_needed": "I need a {medicine pouch}, to give you the {belongings of deceased}. Come back when you have them.",
  "npc.ottokar.medicine_done": "Here you are",
  "npc.ottokar.no_items": "You do not have the required items.",
  "npc.oblivion.greet": "A shadow preceded you. You wish?",
  "npc.oblivion.scroll_intro": "Lost. Hidden. The keys are shadow names. Find them, they will talk to me and reveal what is hidden. Will you go on that quest?",
  "npc.oblivion.mission_start_1": "Then into the vampire crypts, deep down, you must go. ...",
  "npc.oblivion.mission_start_2": "There... three graves where the shadows swirl, unseen. The first one: name the colour of the silent gong. Then ...",
  "npc.oblivion.mission_start_3": "The second: the name that is silent now in the halls of Darkstone ...",
  "npc.oblivion.mission_start_4": "The third: the lost beauty of Dunesea. It must be remembered, the shadows command it. Go now.",
  "npc.oblivion.found_ask": "Yes. Have you gone there and found what you sought?",
  "npc.oblivion.begin_colour": "Tell me. Begin with the colour.",
  "npc.oblivion.bronze_correct": "Yes. The shadows say this is true. The beauty of House Dunesea, name it.",
  "npc.oblivion.floating_correct": "The floating gardens. Too beautiful to lie asleep in the memory of men. Yes. The name that is no more in Darkstone?",
  "npc.oblivion.mission_complete_1": "Ah, the Lady of Darkstone. You have done well to remember her name. ...",
  "npc.oblivion.mission_complete_2": "Now, the shadows say the thing you seek lies next to Akab, the Quarrelsome. ...",
  "npc.oblivion.mission_complete_3": "No coal is burned in his honour. Find his resting place and dig near it. Now go.",
  "npc.ahmet.the_slayer_of_1": "The slayer of my enemies is my friend! For a mere 1000 gold I will create the documents you need. Are you interested?",
  "npc.ahmet.did_you_find_2": "Did you find my stuff?",
  "npc.ahmet.i_see_you_3": "I see: You want me to add an additional story to this book. A legend about how it brings ill luck to kill a white deer. I could do that, yes. It costs 5000 gold, however. Are you still interested?",
  "npc.ahmet.and_here_they_4": "And here they are! Now forget where you got them from.",
  "npc.ahmet.you_dont_have_5": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.ahmet.great_if_you_6": "GREAT! If you ever need a job as my personal security guard, let me know. Here is the reward I promised you.",
  "npc.ahmet.come_back_when_7": "Come back when you find my stuff.",
  "npc.ahmet.you_need_gps_8": "You need 5000 gps and book with ancient legends.",
  "npc.ahmet.you_are_not_9": "You are not in this mission.",
  "npc.ajax.yours_what_is_1": "YOURS? WHAT IS YOURS! NOTHING IS YOURS! IS MINE! GO AWAY, YES?!",
  "npc.ajax.you_stupid_stubborn_2": "YOU STUPID! STUBBORN! I KILL YOU! WILL LEAVE NOW?!",
  "npc.ajax.arrrrrrrrrr_you_me_3": "ARRRRRRRRRR! YOU ME DRIVE MAD! HOW I MAKE YOU GO??",
  "npc.ajax.i_give_you_4": "I GIVE YOU NO!",
  "npc.ajax.please_what_you_5": "Please? What you mean please? Like I say please you say bye? Please?",
  "npc.ajax.annoying_kid_bro_6": "Annoying kid. Bro hates him, but talking no help. Bro needs {fighting spirit}!",
  "npc.ajax.if_you_want_7": "If you want to help bro, bring him fighting spirit. Magic fighting spirit. Ask Djinn.",
  "npc.ajax.bron_gave_me_8": "Bron gave me present. Ugly, but nice from him. Me want to give present too. You help me?",
  "npc.ajax.you_bring_iron_9": "You bring 100 iron ore?",
  "npc.ajax.you_bring_crude_10": "You bring crude iron?",
  "npc.ajax.you_bring_behemoth_11": "You bring 50 behemoth fangs?",
  "npc.ajax.you_bring_lizard_12": "You bring 50 lizard leather?",
  "npc.ajax.axe_is_done_13": "Axe is done! For you. Take. Wear like me.",
  "npc.ajax.axe_is_not_14": "Axe is not done yet!",
  "npc.ajax.oh_easy_okay_15": "Oh. Easy. Okay. Please is good. Now don't say anything. Head aches. ",
  "npc.ajax.good_you_get_16": "Good. You get 100 iron ore first. Come back.",
  "npc.ajax.good_now_bring_17": "Good! Now bring crude iron.",
  "npc.ajax.good_now_bring_18": "Good! Now bring 50 behemoth fangs.",
  "npc.ajax.good_now_bring_19": "Good! Now bring 50 lizard leather.",
  "npc.ajax.ah_all_stuff_20": "Ah! All stuff there. I will start making axes now. Come later and ask me for axe.",
  "npc.alaistar.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.albinius.the_temple_has_1": "The temple has been restored to its former glory, yet we strife to live and praise in the {Shaper} ways. Do you still need me to take some old {tomes} from you my child?",
  "npc.albinius.you_already_offered_2": "You already offered enough tomes for us to study and rebuild this temple. Thank you, my child.",
  "npc.albinius.thank_you_very_3": "Thank you very much for your contribution, child. Your first step in the ways of the {Shapers} has been taken.",
  "npc.albinius.you_need_heavy_4": "You need 5 heavy old tome.",
  "npc.albinius.i_understand_return_5": "I understand. Return to me if you change your mind, my child.",
  "npc.albinius.if_you_have_6": "If you have some old shaper tomes I would {buy} them.",
  "npc.albinius.im_sorry_i_7": "I'm sorry, I don't buy anything. My main concern right now is the bulding of this temple.",
  "npc.albinius.do_you_wish_8": "Do you wish to merge your rune parts into an astral shaper rune?",
  "npc.albinius.im_sorry_but_9": "I'm sorry but you lack the needed rune parts.",
  "npc.albinius.as_you_wish_10": "As you wish.",
  "npc.albinius.you_may_pass_11": "You may pass this portal if you have 50 fish as offering. Do you have the fish with you?",
  "npc.albinius.sorry_you_first_12": "Sorry, you first need to bring my Heavy Old Tomes or do the quest before continuing.",
  "npc.albinius.thank_you_for_13": "Thank you for your offering. You may pass the Portal to the Powers of Ice now.",
  "npc.albinius.im_sorry_you_14": "I'm sorry, you don't have enough fish. Return if you can offer fifty of them.",
  "npc.albinius.in_this_case_15": "In this case I'm sorry, you may not pass this portal.",
  "npc.albinius.you_may_pass_16": "You may pass this portal if you have 50 incantation notes as offering. Do you have the incantation notes with you?",
  "npc.albinius.sorry_first_you_17": "Sorry, first you need to bring my Heavy Old Tomes.",
  "npc.albinius.thank_you_for_18": "Thank you for your offering. You may pass the Portal to the Powers of Holy now.",
  "npc.albinius.im_sorry_you_19": "I'm sorry, you don't have enough incantation notes. Return if you can offer fifty of them.",
  "npc.albinius.in_this_case_20": "In this case I'm sorry, you may not pass this portal.",
  "npc.albinius.you_may_pass_21": "You may pass this portal if you have 50 marsh stalker feathers as offering. Do you have the marsh stalker feathers with you?",
  "npc.albinius.sorry_first_you_22": "Sorry, first you need to bring my Heavy Old Tomes.",
  "npc.albinius.thank_you_for_23": "Thank you for your offering. You may pass the Portal to the Powers of Energy now.",
  "npc.albinius.im_sorry_you_24": "I'm sorry, you don't have enough marsh stalker feathers. Return if you can offer fifty of them.",
  "npc.albinius.in_this_case_25": "In this case I'm sorry, you may not pass this portal.",
  "npc.albinius.you_may_pass_26": "You may pass this portal if you have 50 acorns as offering. Do you have the acorns with you?",
  "npc.albinius.sorry_first_you_27": "Sorry, first you need to bring my Heavy Old Tomes.",
  "npc.albinius.thank_you_for_28": "Thank you for your offering. You may pass the Portal to the Powers of Earth now.",
  "npc.albinius.im_sorry_you_29": "I'm sorry, you don't have enough acorns. Return if you can offer fifty of them.",
  "npc.albinius.in_this_case_30": "In this case I'm sorry, you may not pass this portal.",
  "npc.albinius.you_may_pass_31": "You may pass this portal if you have 50 pelvis bones as offering. Do you have the pelvis bones with you?",
  "npc.albinius.sorry_first_you_32": "Sorry, first you need to bring my Heavy Old Tomes.",
  "npc.albinius.thank_you_for_33": "Thank you for your offering. You may pass the Portal to the Powers of Death now.",
  "npc.albinius.im_sorry_you_34": "I'm sorry, you don't have enough pelvis bones. Return if you can offer fifty of them.",
  "npc.albinius.in_this_case_35": "In this case I'm sorry, you may not pass this portal.",
  "npc.aldo.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to repair your worn soft boots for 10000 gold coins?",
  "npc.aldo.sorry_you_dont_2": "Sorry, you don't have the item.",
  "npc.aldo.sorry_you_dont_3": "Sorry, you don't have enough gold.",
  "npc.aldo.here_you_are_4": "Here you are.",
  "npc.alesar_functions.did_you_find_1": "Did you find the tear of Daraman?",
  "npc.alesar_functions.dont_forget_to_2": "Don't forget to talk to Malor concerning your next mission.",
  "npc.alesar_functions.as_i_expected_3": "As I expected. You haven't got the stone. Shall I explain your mission again?",
  "npc.alesar_functions.as_i_expected_4": "As I expected. You haven't got the stone. Shall I explain your mission again?",
  "npc.alesar.shove_off_little_1": "Shove off, little one! Humans are not welcome here, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  "npc.alesar.what_do_you_2": "What do you want from me, |PLAYERNAME|?",
  "npc.alesar.did_you_find_3": "Did you find the tear of Daraman?",
  "npc.alesar.dont_forget_to_4": "Don't forget to talk to Malor concerning your next mission.",
  "npc.alesar.as_i_expected_5": "As I expected. You haven't got the stone. Shall I explain your mission again?",
  "npc.alesar.as_i_expected_6": "As I expected. You haven't got the stone. Shall I explain your mission again?",
  "npc.alesar.im_sorry_but_7": "I'm sorry, but you don't have Malor's permission to trade with me.",
  "npc.alexander.so_you_ask_1": "So you ask me for a {",
  "npc.alexander.what_i_have_2": "What? I have already gave you one {",
  "npc.alexander.sorry_you_arent_3": "Sorry, you aren't a druid either a sorcerer.",
  "npc.alexander.here_you_are_4": "Here you are young adept, take care yourself.",
  "npc.alexander.of_course_just_5": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.alkestios.uhmn_maybe_ahmet_1": "Uhmn.. Maybe Ahmet in Ankrahmun can help we to fake this book.",
  "npc.alkestios.the_poachers_are_2": "The poachers are still chasing me. Please hurry and find a way to help me.",
  "npc.alkestios.you_have_already_3": "You have already started this mission.",
  "npc.altar.prepare_your_offer_1": "Prepare your offer and cling to the sanctitity of this place.",
  "npc.altar.five_tainted_hearts_2": "Five tainted hearts and five darklight hearts drowned in a worldly wealth of 50000000 gold pieces for the righteous. Are you prepared?",
  "npc.altar.sorry_you_dont_3": "Sorry, you don't have all items.",
  "npc.altar.sorry_you_dont_4": "Sorry, you don't have enough gold.",
  "npc.altar.your_sacrifice_has_5": "Your sacrifice has been accepted, mortal. Embrace your reward!",
  "npc.altar.ok_then_not_6": "Ok then not.",
  "npc.a_majestic_warwolf.grrrrrrrrrrrrr_1": "GRRRRRRRRRRRRR",
  "npc.a_majestic_warwolf.i_can_see_2": "I can see in your eyes that you are a honest and friendly person, |PLAYERNAME|. You were patient enough to learn our language and I will grant you a special gift. Will you accept it?",
  "npc.ambassador_of_rathleton.this_is_a_1": "This is a very beautiful ring. Thank you for this generous present!",
  "npc.ambassador_of_rathleton.didnt_you_bring_2": "Didn't you bring my gift?",
  "npc.ambassador_of_rathleton.i_dont_need_3": "I don't need a present right now. Thank you.",
  "npc.amber.ah_you_noticed_1": "Ah, you noticed my new accessory? Sorry, this one is not for sale. It's handmade from rare minotaur leather.",
  "npc.amber.ah_right_almost_2": "Ah, right, almost forgot about the backpack! Have you brought me 100 pieces of minotaur leather as requested?",
  "npc.amber.just_in_time_3": "Just in time! Your backpack is finished. Here you go, I hope you like it.",
  "npc.amber.uh_i_didnt_4": "Uh... I didn't expect you to return that early. Sorry, but I'm not finished yet with your backpack. I'm doing the best I can, promised.",
  "npc.amber.sorry_but_i_5": "Sorry, but I can only make one backpack per person, else I'd have to close my shop and open a leather manufactory.",
  "npc.amber.well_if_you_6": "Well, if you really like this backpack, I could make one for you, but minotaur leather is hard to come by these days. Are you willing to put some work into this?",
  "npc.amber.alright_then_if_7": "Alright then, if you bring me 100 pieces of fine minotaur leather I will see what I can do for you. You probably have to kill really many minotaurs though... so good luck!",
  "npc.amber.sorry_but_i_8": "Sorry, but I don't run a welfare office, you know... no pain, no gain.",
  "npc.amber.sorry_but_thats_9": "Sorry, but that's not enough leather yet to make one of these backpacks. Would you rather like to buy a normal backpack for 10 gold?",
  "npc.amber.great_alright_i_10": "Great! Alright, I need a while to finish this backpack for you. Come ask me later, okay?",
  "npc.amber.i_know_its_11": "I know, it's quite some work... don't lose heart, just keep killing minotaurs and you'll eventually get lucky. Would you rather like to buy a normal backpack for 10 gold?",
  "npc.andrew_lyze.as_far_as_1": "As far as I know it is a place of helish heat with bloodthirsty monsters of all kinds.",
  "npc.andrew_lyze.this_sarcophagus_seals_2": "This sarcophagus seals the entrance to the caves down there. Only here you can get all the {materials} you need for a working compass of this kind. So no entrance here - no further magic compasses in Tibia. In theory.",
  "npc.andrew_lyze.on_first_glance_3": "On first glance, this cave does not look very spectacular, but the things you find in there, are. You have to know that this is the only place where you can find the respective materials to build the compass.",
  "npc.andrew_lyze.may_i_repair_4": "May I repair your compass if possible?",
  "npc.andrew_lyze.you_dont_have_5": "You don't have the needed itens yet.",
  "npc.andrew_lyze.heres_your_broken_6": "Here's your broken compass!",
  "npc.andrew_lyze.you_dont_have_7": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.andrew_lyze.you_dont_have_8": "You don't have the needed itens yet.",
  "npc.andrew_lyze.done_worry_the_9": "Done. Worry, the effect won't last forever!",
  "npc.andrew_lyze.youre_already_with_10": "You're already with my bait!",
  "npc.andrew_lyze.you_cannot_do_11": "You cannot do that yet.",
  "npc.andrew_lyze.it_was_decided_12": "It was decided to collect all of the compasses, destroy them and throw them in the fiery depths of Tibia. I still have some of them here. I {sell} them for a low price if you want.",
  "npc.andrew_lyze.would_you_like_13": "Would you like to buy a broken compass for 10.000 gold?",
  "npc.andrew_lyze.sorry_i_didnt_14": "Sorry, I didn't understand.",
  "npc.angelina.i_will_tell_1": "I will tell you a small secret now. My friend Lynda in Thais can create a blessed wand. Greet her from me, maybe she will aid you.",
  "npc.angelo.the_scientists_are_1": "The scientists are still missing? You just found some strange green shining mummies and a big oasis? I give you this analysis tool for the water of the oasis. Maybe that's the key. Could you bring me a sample of this water?",
  "npc.angelo.very_good_hopefully_2": "Very good. Hopefully analysing this sample will get us closer to the solution of this mistery.",
  "npc.angelo.do_you_have_3": "Do you have the sample I asked you for?",
  "npc.angelo.thanks_a_lot_4": "Thanks a lot. Let me check the result. Well, I think you need the counteragent. Please apply it to the oasis!",
  "npc.angelo.what_has_happened_5": "What has happened? You applied the counteragent to the oasis and then it was destroyed by a sandstorm? Keep on investigating the place.",
  "npc.angelo.just_get_out_6": "Just get out of my way! You killed this beautiful creature. I have nothing more to say. Damn druid of Crunor!",
  "npc.angelo.gareth_told_you_7": "{Gareth} told you that there are rumours about fake artefacts in the MoTA? And it is your task to check that with a magnifier? I see. I don't need one right now, so you can have one of mine. You find one in the crate over there.",
  "npc.angelo.so_you_found_8": "So you found out that one artefact in the MoTA is fake? And {Gareth} sent you to me to get a new artefact as a replacement? Sorry, I hardly know you so I don't trust you. I won't help you with that!",
  "npc.angelo.the_project_is_9": "The project is called 'Sandy {Cave} Project' and is funded by the {MoTA}. Its goal is the investigation of this {cave}.",
  "npc.angelo.mota_is_short_10": "MoTA is short for the recently founded Museum of Tibian Arts. We work together in close collaboration. New {results} are communicated to the museum instantly.",
  "npc.angelo.we_have_no_11": "We have no scientific results so far to reach our {goal}, because my workers aren't back yet. Should I be {worried}?",
  "npc.angelo.then_i_have_12": "Then I have to find out why they don't return. But I'm old and my back aches. Would you like to go there and look for my workers?",
  "npc.angelo.fantastic_go_there_13": "Fantastic! Go there and then tell me what you've seen. I've opened the door for you. Take care of yourself!",
  "npc.angelo.we_dont_know_14": "We don't know exactly why this cave has now exposed an entry via the {dark pyramid}. It seems that the cave already existed for a long time, however, without a connection to our world. Maybe some smaller earth movements have changed the situation.",
  "npc.angelo.we_dont_know_15": "We don't know yet to wich extent the cave and the dark pyramid belong together. Thisi s what we try to find out. Maybe the history of this place has to be rewritten.",
  "npc.angus.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to join the explorer society?",
  "npc.angus.oh_yes_an_2": "Oh yes, an interesting topic. We had vivid discussions about this discovery. But what is it that you want?",
  "npc.angus.you_bring_up_3": "You bring up this topic again? I don't think our talks make any sense unless you prove that you are a supporter of science. Do you have some proof for your dedication to science?",
  "npc.angus.a_whole_new_4": "A whole new land is indeed very tempting. I can hardly imagine all the wonders that await us there. I doubt I could stop our explorers from going there even if I tried to.",
  "npc.angus.the_missions_available_5": "The missions available for your rank are the {butterfly hunt}, {plant collection} and {ice delivery}.",
  "npc.angus.the_missions_available_6": "The missions available for your rank are {lizard urn}, {bonelord secrets} and {orc powder}.",
  "npc.angus.the_missions_available_7": "The missions available for your rank are {elven poetry}, {memory stone} and {rune writings}.",
  "npc.angus.the_explorer_society_8": "The explorer society needs a great deal of help in the research of astral travel. Are you willing to help?",
  "npc.angus.do_you_have_9": "Do you have some collected ectoplasm with you?",
  "npc.angus.have_you_acquired_10": "Have you acquired the spectral dress we need?",
  "npc.angus.oh_yes_tell_11": "Oh, yes! Tell our fellow explorer that the papers are in the mail already.",
  "npc.angus.the_reports_from_12": "The reports from Northport have already arrived here and our progress is astonishing. We think it is possible to create an astral bridge between our bases. Are you interested to assist us with this?",
  "npc.angus.did_you_get_13": "Did you get the requested pickaxe from Uzgod in Kazordoon?",
  "npc.angus.did_you_get_14": "Did you get the ice we are looking for?",
  "npc.angus.the_mission_asks_15": "The mission asks you to collect some species of butterflies, are you interested?",
  "npc.angus.did_you_acquire_16": "Did you acquire the purple butterfly we are looking for?",
  "npc.angus.did_you_acquire_17": "Did you acquire the blue butterfly we are looking for?",
  "npc.angus.did_you_acquire_18": "Did you acquire the red butterfly we are looking for?",
  "npc.angus.in_this_mission_19": "In this mission we require you to get us some plant samples from Tiquandan plants. Would you like to fulfil this mission?",
  "npc.angus.did_you_acquire_20": "Did you acquire the sample of the jungle bells plant we are looking for?",
  "npc.angus.use_this_botanists_21": "Use this botanist's container on a witches cauldron to collect a sample for us. Bring it here and report about your plant collection.",
  "npc.angus.did_you_acquire_22": "Did you acquire the sample of the witches cauldron we are looking for?",
  "npc.angus.use_this_botanists_23": "Use this botanist's container on a giant jungle rose to obtain a sample for us. Bring it here and report about your plant collection.",
  "npc.angus.did_you_acquire_24": "Did you acquire the sample of the giant jungle rose we are looking for?",
  "npc.angus.the_explorer_society_25": "The explorer society would like to acquire an ancient urn which is some sort of relic to the lizard people of Tiquanda. Would you like to accept this mission?",
  "npc.angus.did_you_manage_26": "Did you manage to get the ancient urn?",
  "npc.angus.have_you_found_27": "Have you found any proof that the pyramid was built by bonelords?",
  "npc.angus.did_you_acquire_28": "Did you acquire some of the orcish powder?",
  "npc.angus.did_you_acquire_29": "Did you acquire a copy of 'Songs of the Forest' for us?",
  "npc.angus.were_you_able_30": "Were you able to acquire a memory stone for our society?",
  "npc.angus.did_you_create_31": "Did you create a copy of the ancient runes as requested?",
  "npc.angus.we_will_see_32": "We will see if you can handle this simple task. Get the pickaxe from Uzgod in Kazordoon and bring it to one of our bases. Report there about the pickaxe.",
  "npc.angus.just_in_time_33": "Just in time. Sadly not much ice is left over but it will do. Thank you again.",
  "npc.angus.sigh_i_think_34": "*Sigh* I think the time is right to grant you another chance to get that ice. Hurry up this time.",
  "npc.angus.a_little_bit_35": "A little bit battered but it will do. Thank you! If you think you are ready, ask for another butterfly hunt.",
  "npc.angus.a_little_bit_36": "A little bit battered but it will do. Thank you! If you think you are ready, ask for another butterfly hunt.",
  "npc.angus.that_is_an_37": "That is an extraordinary species you have brought. Thank you! That was the last butterfly we needed.",
  "npc.angus.fine_here_take_38": "Fine! Here take this botanist's container. Use it on a jungle bells plant to collect a sample for us. Report about your plant collection when you have been successful.",
  "npc.angus.i_see_it_39": "I see. It seems you've got some quite useful sample by sheer luck. Thank you! Just tell me when you are ready to continue with the plant collection.",
  "npc.angus.ah_finally_i_40": "Ah, finally. I started to wonder what took you so long. But thank you! Another fine sample, indeed. Just tell me when you are ready to continue with the plant collection.",
  "npc.angus.what_a_lovely_41": "What a lovely sample! With that you have finished your plant collection missions.",
  "npc.angus.yes_that_is_42": "Yes, that is the prized relic we have been looking for so long. You did a great job, thank you.",
  "npc.angus.you_did_it_43": "You did it! Excellent! The scientific world will be shaken by this discovery!",
  "npc.angus.you_really_got_44": "You really got it? Amazing! Thank you for your efforts.",
  "npc.angus.excellent_this_mission_45": "Excellent. This mission is easy but nonetheless vital. Travel to Ab'Dendriel and get the book.",
  "npc.angus.let_me_have_46": "Let me have a look! Yes, that's what we wanted. A copy of 'Songs of the Forest'. I won't ask any questions about those bloodstains.",
  "npc.angus.in_the_ruins_47": "In the ruins of north-western Edron you should be able to find a memory stone. Good luck.",
  "npc.angus.a_flawless_memory_48": "A flawless memory stone! Incredible! It will take years even to figure out how it works but what an opportunity for science, thank you!",
  "npc.angus.excellent_here_take_49": "Excellent! Here, take this tracing paper and use it on the object you will find there to create a copy of the ancient runes.",
  "npc.angus.its_a_bit_50": "It's a bit wrinkled but it will do. Thanks again.",
  "npc.angus.good_take_this_51": "Good! Take this container and use it on a ghost that was recently slain. Return with the collected ectoplasm and hand me that container ...",
  "npc.angus.dont_lose_the_52": "Don't lose the container. They are expensive!",
  "npc.angus.phew_i_had_53": "Phew, I had no idea that ectoplasm would smell that ... oh, it's you, well, sorry. Thank you for the ectoplasm.",
  "npc.angus.just_in_time_54": "Just in time! With this spectral article we can start the final phase of our research.",
  "npc.angus.good_just_take_55": "Good, just take this spectral essence and use it on the strange carving in this building as well as on the corresponding tile in our base at Northport ...",
  "npc.angus.poor_ratha_thank_56": "Poor Ratha. Thank you for returning this skull to the society. We will see to a honourable burial of Ratha.",
  "npc.angus.come_back_when_57": "Come back when you find any information.",
  "npc.angus.marvellous_you_brought_58": "Marvellous! You brought a giant smith hammer for the explorer society!",
  "npc.angus.no_you_dont_59": "No you don't.",
  "npc.angus.what_a_strange_60": "What a strange map. I wonder if any of our explorers recognises this coastal lines. However, you earned yourself another chance to convince me. Why do you think that Farmine would be interesting for us?",
  "npc.angus.its_always_a_61": "It's always a sad day when we learn about the death of a member. But at least we learnt about his fate. Thank you, here is your reward.",
  "npc.angus.did_it_melt_62": "Did it melt away?",
  "npc.angus.come_back_when_63": "Come back when you find any information.",
  "npc.angus.come_back_when_64": "Come back when you find one.",
  "npc.angus.the_explorer_society_65": "The explorer society is looking for a genuine giant smith hammer for our collection. It is rumoured the cyclopses of the Plains of Havoc might be using one. Did you by chance obtain such a hammer?",
  "npc.an_idol.jt_bc_jbxt_1": "J-T B^C J^BXT°",
  "npc.an_old_dragon_lord.leave_the_dragons_1": "LEAVE THE DRAGONS' CEMETERY AT ONCE!",
  "npc.an_old_dragon_lord.leave_the_dragons_2": "LEAVE THE DRAGONS' CEMETERY AT ONCE!",
  "npc.an_old_dragon_lord.ahhhh_the_pain_3": "AHHHH THE PAIN OF AGESSS! I NEED MUSSSSHRROOOMSSS TO EASSSE MY PAIN! BRRRING ME MUSHRRROOOMSSS!",
  "npc.an_old_dragon_lord.ahhh_mushrrrooomsss_now_4": "AHHH MUSHRRROOOMSSS! NOW MY PAIN WILL BE EASSSED FOR A WHILE! TAKE THISS AND LEAVE THE DRAGONSSS' CEMETERY AT ONCE!",
  "npc.appaloosa.we_can_bring_1": "We can bring you to Thais with one of our coaches for 125 gold. Are you interested?",
  "npc.appaloosa.do_you_want_2": "Do you want to rent a horse for one day at a price of 500 gold?",
  "npc.appaloosa.first_get_rid_3": "First get rid of those blood stains!",
  "npc.appaloosa.you_dont_have_4": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.appaloosa.have_a_nice_5": "Have a nice trip!",
  "npc.appaloosa.you_already_have_6": "You already have a horse.",
  "npc.appaloosa.you_do_not_7": "You do not have enough money to rent a horse!",
  "npc.appaloosa.ill_give_you_8": "I'll give you one of our experienced ones. Take care! Look out for low hanging branches.",
  "npc.a_prisoner.hurray_for_that_1": "Hurray! For that I will give you my key for - hmm - let's say ... some apples. Interested?",
  "npc.a_prisoner.mnjam_excellent_apples_2": "Mnjam - excellent apples. Now - about that key. You are sure want it?",
  "npc.a_prisoner.get_some_more_3": "Get some more apples first!",
  "npc.a_prisoner.really_really_4": "Really, really?",
  "npc.a_prisoner.really_really_really_5": "Really, really, really, really?",
  "npc.a_prisoner.then_take_it_6": "Then take it and get happy - or die, hehe.",
  "npc.a_prisoner.then_go_away_7": "Then go away!",
  "npc.a_prisoner.you_already_know_8": "You already know the secrets of mathemagics! Now go and use them to learn.",
  "npc.a_prisoner.but_first_tell_9": "But first tell me your favourite colour please!",
  "npc.a_prisoner.very_interesting_so_10": "Very interesting. So are you ready to proceed in your lesson in mathemagics?",
  "npc.a_prisoner.so_know_that_11": "So know that everything is based on the simple fact that 1 + 1 = 1!",
  "npc.a_prisoner.i_think_you_12": " I think you are not in touch with yourself, come back if you have tuned in on your own feelings.",
  "npc.ariella.so_you_brought_1": "So you brought a cookie to a pirate?",
  "npc.ariella.you_mean_my_2": "You mean my hat? Well, I might have another one just like that, but I won't simply give it away, even if you earned our trust. You'd have to fulfil a task first.",
  "npc.ariella.your_task_is_3": "Your task is to bring me the shirt of the Lethal Lissy, the sabre of Ron the Ripper, the hat of Brutus Bloodbeard and the eye patch of Deadeye Devious. Did you succeed?",
  "npc.ariella.you_know_we_4": "You know, we have plenty of rum here but we lack some basic food. Especially food that easily becomes mouldy is a problem. Bring me 100 breads and you will help me a lot.",
  "npc.ariella.are_you_here_5": "Are you here to bring me the 100 pieces of bread that I requested?",
  "npc.ariella.did_you_get_6": "Did you get a sample of the whisper beer from Carlin?",
  "npc.ariella.you_have_no_7": "You have no cookie that I'd like.",
  "npc.ariella.how_sweet_of_8": "How sweet of you ... Uhh ... OH NO ... Bozo did it again. Tell this prankster I'll pay him back.",
  "npc.ariella.what_a_joy_9": "What a joy. At least for a few days adequate supply is ensured.",
  "npc.ariella.come_back_when_10": "Come back when you got all neccessary items.",
  "npc.ariella.thank_you_very_11": "Thank you very much. I will test this beauty in privacy.",
  "npc.ariella.come_back_when_12": "Come back when you got the neccessary item.",
  "npc.ariella.incredible_you_have_13": "INCREDIBLE! You have found all four of them! |PLAYERNAME|, you have my respect. You more than deserve this hat. There you go.",
  "npc.ariella.you_do_not_14": "You do not have all the required items.",
  "npc.ariella.alright_then_come_15": "Alright then. Come back when you got all neccessary items.",
  "npc.arito.and_what_did_1": "And what did they say?? Do I have to give up everything here? Come on tell me!!",
  "npc.arito.these_are_great_2": "These are great news!! Thank you for your help! I don't have much, but without you I wouldn't have anything so please take this as a reward.",
  "npc.arkulius.im_sorry_this_1": "I'm sorry this task is highly dangerous and I need experienced people for it.",
  "npc.arkulius.you_need_some_2": "You need some kind of pure elemental soil from the ",
  "npc.arkulius.amazing_im_going_3": "AMAZING!! I'm going to start immediately with the research. If it turns out the way I expect it, Alverus will be revived soon!! Here, take this as a reward and try to collect more of this substance. I'll make you a good offer, I promise. ",
  "npc.arkulius.good_dont_waste_4": "Good, don't waste time! Come back here when you have the elemental object!",
  "npc.armenius.what_kind_of_1": "What kind of strange offer is this? You're actually offering me a cookie?",
  "npc.armenius.itd_be_better_2": "It'd be better for you to leave now.",
  "npc.armenius.errrkss_coughcough_what_3": "Errrkss - coughcough - what the - heck did you put in there? Get out of my sight!",
  "npc.armenius.oh_the_nerve_4": "Oh, the nerve. Sod off.",
  "npc.aruda.i_would_never_1": "I would never have guessed that.",
  "npc.aruda.oh_sorry_i_2": "Oh, sorry, I was distracted, what did you say?",
  "npc.aruda.oh_i_just_3": "Oh, I just remember I have some work to do, sorry. Bye!",
  "npc.aruda.take_some_time_4": "Take some time to talk to me!",
  "npc.aruda.well_i_have_5": "Well ... I have met him for a little while .. but this was nothing serious.",
  "npc.aruda.i_remember_that_6": "I remember that grapes were his favourites. He was almost addicted to them.",
  "npc.aruda.thank_you_very_7": "Thank you very much. How kind of you to care about me. I am fine, thank you.",
  "npc.aruda.sorry_i_have_8": "Sorry, I have nothing to sell.",
  "npc.aruda.i_do_some_9": "I do some work now and then. Nothing unusual, though. So I have plenty time to chat. If you are interested in any topic just ask me.",
  "npc.aruda.i_am_aruda_10": "I am Aruda.",
  "npc.aruda.i_am_a_11": "I am a little sad, that you seem to have forgotten me, handsome. I am Aruda.",
  "npc.aruda.yes_thats_me_12": "Yes, that's me!",
  "npc.aruda.oh_i_like_13": "Oh, I like it, how you say my name.",
  "npc.aruda.please_dont_be_14": "Please don't be so rude to look for the time if you are talking to me.",
  "npc.aruda.i_am_deeply_15": "I am deeply sorry, I can't help you.",
  "npc.aruda.uh_what_a_16": "UH! What a terrifying topic. Please let us speak about something more pleasant, I am a weak and small woman after all.",
  "npc.aruda.what_gives_you_17": "What gives you the impression, I am the kind of women, you find in sewers?",
  "npc.aruda.you_should_ask_18": "You should ask about that in one of the temples.",
  "npc.aruda.the_king_that_19": "The king, that lives in this fascinating castle? I think he does look kind of cute in his luxurious robes, doesn't he?",
  "npc.aruda.he_is_soooo_20": "He is soooo strong! What muscles! What a body! Did you ask him for a date?",
  "npc.aruda.he_is_soooo_21": "He is soooo strong! What muscles! What a body! On the other hand, compared to you he looks quite puny.",
  "npc.aruda.he_is_a_22": "He is a little simple minded but always nice and well dressed.",
  "npc.aruda.he_should_really_23": "He should really sell some stylish gowns or something like that. We Tibians never get some clothing of the latest fashion. It's a shame.",
  "npc.aruda.i_dont_understand_24": "I don't understand this lonely monks. I love company too much to become one. Hehehe!",
  "npc.aruda.oh_isnt_he_25": "Oh, isn't he funny? I could listen to him the whole day.",
  "npc.aruda.as_far_as_26": "As far as I know, he is working in the castle.",
  "npc.aruda.i_am_a_27": "I am a little shy and so don't hear many rumors.",
  "npc.aruda.oh_you_little_28": "Oh, you little devil, stop talking like that! <blush>",
  "npc.aruda.i_know_only_29": "I know only little about weapons. Can you tell me something about them, please?",
  "npc.aruda.i_believe_that_30": "I believe that love is stronger than magic, don't you agree?",
  "npc.aruda.oh_sorry_i_31": "Oh, sorry, I have to hurry, bye!",
  "npc.aruda.i_would_like_32": "I would like to visit the beach more often, but I guess it's too dangerous.",
  "npc.aruda.i_love_this_33": "I love this castle! It's so beautiful.",
  "npc.aruda.powerful_sorcerers_fright_34": "Powerful sorcerers frighten me a little.",
  "npc.aruda.i_personally_think_35": "I personally think it's inappropriate for a woman to become a warrior, what do you think about that?",
  "npc.aruda.druids_seldom_visit_36": "Druids seldom visit a town, what do you know about druids?",
  "npc.aruda.i_like_brave_37": "I like brave fighters like him.",
  "npc.aruda.oh_he_is_38": "Oh, he is sooooo cute!",
  "npc.aruda.i_like_dogs_39": "I like dogs, the little ones at least. Do you like dogs, too?",
  "npc.aruda.oh_i_am_40": "Oh, I am just a girl and know nothing about magic swords and such things.",
  "npc.aruda.i_dont_know_41": "I ... don't know someone named like that.",
  "npc.aruda.yenny_i_know_42": "Yenny? I know no Yenny, nor have I ever used that name! You have mistook me with someone else.",
  "npc.asima.so_you_ask_1": "So you ask me for a {",
  "npc.asima.what_i_have_2": "What? I have already gave you one {",
  "npc.asima.sorry_you_arent_3": "Sorry, you aren't a druid either a sorcerer.",
  "npc.asima.here_you_are_4": "Here you are young adept, take care yourself.",
  "npc.asima.of_course_just_5": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_find_yourself_1": "You find yourself inside the dragon's dream. You can {look} around or {go} into a specific direction. You can also {take} or {use} an object. Enter {help} to display this information at any time.",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.advancing_to_the_2": "Advancing to the west, you recognise an increase of onyx on the ground.",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_carefully_lift_3": "You carefully lift the onyx attachment from its socket. It is lighter than you expected.",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_return_to_4": "You return to the plateau in the east.",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_wander_to_5": "You wander to the south, passing large obelisks of emerald to your left and sprawling trees of topaz to your right. ",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.as_you_rip_6": "As you rip the solid stand out of its socket and take it with you, the large gate opens with a deafening rumble. ",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_gasp_at_7": "You gasp at the size of the large open gate as you walk through to head further to the east.",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_reach_for_8": "You reach for a small solitary arrangement of combined small houses and put it in your pocket.",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_take_an_9": "You take an emerald from the pile. ",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_return_through_10": "You return through the semi-translucent gate to the west. ",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_head_back_11": "You head back north to the plateau. ",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_travel_east_12": "You travel east across several large emerald bluffs and edges. All sorts of gems are scattered alongside your path. ",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_take_a_13": "You take a rather large ruby out of a pile before you. ",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_head_north_14": "You head north passing countless stones in the crimson sea of stones beneath your feet.",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.avoiding_the_bright_15": "Avoiding the bright light, you carefully put the attachment on top of the strange socket. ...",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.your_path_to_16": "Your path to the north is open. You pass the gigantic gate wings to your left and right as you advance. After about an hour of travel you hear a slight rustling in the distance. You head further into that direction. ...",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_travel_all_17": "You travel all the way back down the dune and through the gate to the south. ",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_return_to_18": "You return to the crimson sea of rubies in the south. ",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_travel_back_19": "You travel back to the plateau in the west. ",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.advancing_to_the_20": "Advancing to the west, you recognise an increase of onyx on the ground. ",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_continue_travelling_21": "You continue travelling the barren sea of gemstones to the north. ",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_leave_the_22": "You leave the massive open gate behind you and go to the west. ",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_carefully_remove_23": "You carefully remove the sapphire from Bastesh's grasp.",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_head_back_24": "You head back to the east and to the plateau.",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_head_back_25": "You head back south to the site with the onyx lookout.",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_return_to_26": "You return to the plateau in the east.",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.you_put_the_27": "You put the stand into a small recess you find near the middle of the plateau.",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.as_the_ruby_28": "As the ruby slips into the notch, the strong red of the stone intensifies a thousandfold. You fear to hurt your eyes and turn away immediately. The ray seems to be directed to the centre of the plateau with astounding precision.",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.as_the_sapphire_29": "As the sapphire slips into the notch, the deep blue of the stone intensifies a thousandfold. You fear to hurt your eyes and turn away immediately. The ray seems to be directed to the centre of the plateau with astounding precision.",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.as_the_emerald_30": "As the emerald slips into the notch, the vibrant green of the stone intensifies a thousandfold. You fear to hurt your eyes and turn away immediately. The ray seems to be directed to the centre of the plateau with astounding precision.",
  "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.i_call_you_31": "I call you the wayfarer. You travelled through my dreams. You ultimately freed my mind. My mind accepted you and so will I.",
  "npc.a_strange_chalice.finally_thats_what_1": "Finally. That's what I... oh wait, you're still talking to me - you will blow my cover! What do you want? Oh wait, did my {daughter} send you? It has been some time now, indeed.",
  "npc.a_strange_fellow.a_bill_oh_1": "A bill? Oh boy so you are delivering another bill to poor me?",
  "npc.a_strange_fellow.ok_ok_ill_2": "Ok, ok, I'll take it. I guess I have no other choice anyways. And now leave me alone in my misery please.",
  "npc.a_strange_fellow.uh_what_do_3": "Uh? What do you want?!",
  "npc.a_strange_fellow.what_my_hat_4": "What? My hat?? Theres... nothing special about it!",
  "npc.a_strange_fellow.stop_bugging_me_5": "Stop bugging me about that hat, do you listen?",
  "npc.a_strange_fellow.hey_dont_touch_6": "Hey! Don't touch that hat! Leave it alone!!! Don't do this!!!!",
  "npc.a_strange_fellow.noooooo_argh_ok_7": "Noooooo! Argh, ok, ok, I guess I can't deny it anymore, I am David Brassacres, the magnificent, so what do you want?",
  "npc.atrad.you_managed_to_1": "You managed to deceive Erayo? Impressive. Well, I guess, since you have come that far, I might as well give you a task too, eh?",
  "npc.atrad.i_see_you_2": "I see you brought my stuff. Good. I'll keep my promise: Here's katana in return.",
  "npc.atrad.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.atrad.okay_listen_up_4": "Okay, listen up. I don't have a list of stupid objects, I just want two things. A behemoth claw and a nose ring. Got that?",
  "npc.atrad.good_come_back_5": "Good. Come back then you have BOTH. Should be clear where to get a behemoth claw from. There's a horned fox who wears a nose ring. Good luck.",
  "npc.avar_tar.do_you_really_1": "Do you really think you could bribe a hero like me with a meagre cookie?",
  "npc.avar_tar.so_you_want_2": "So you want to have the demon outfit, hah! Let's have a look first if you really deserve it. Tell me: {base}, {shield} or {helmet}?",
  "npc.avar_tar.you_have_no_3": "You have no cookie that I'd like.",
  "npc.avar_tar.well_you_wont_4": "Well, you won't! Though it looks tasty ...What the ... WHAT DO YOU THINK YOU ARE? THIS IS THE ULTIMATE INSULT! GET LOST!",
  "npc.avar_tar.receive_the_base_5": "Receive the base outfit, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.avar_tar.you_need_to_6": "You need to complete annihilator quest first, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.avar_tar.receive_the_shield_7": "Receive the shield, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.avar_tar.the_shield_will_8": "The shield will only be granted to those adventurers who have finished the demon helmet quest, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.avar_tar.receive_the_helmet_9": "Receive the helmet, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.avar_tar.the_helmet_is_10": "The helmet is for those who have hunted down all 6666 demons and finished the demon oak as well, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.a_weakened_forest_fury.seeds_to_give_1": "Seeds to give life to strong trees, blooming and proud. The {intruders} robbed us from them.",
  "npc.a_weakened_forest_fury.the_intruders_appeared_2": "The intruders appeared in the blink of an eye. Out of thin air, as if they came from nowhere. They overrun the glade within ours and drove away what was remaining from us within the day.",
  "npc.a_weakened_forest_fury.the_purest_water_3": "The purest water flows through this well. For centuries we concealed it, for other beings to not lay their eyes on it.",
  "npc.a_weakened_forest_fury.take_care_guardian_4": "Take care, guardian.",
  "npc.a_weakened_forest_fury.phials_for_the_5": "Phials for the purest water from our sacred well. They are finely crafted and very fragile. We keep a small supply up here around the well. Probably the only thing the intruders did not care for.",
  "npc.a_weakened_forest_fury.i_already_handed_6": "I already handed a cage to you. If you are in need of another one, you will have to return to me later.",
  "npc.baa_leal.shove_off_little_1": "Shove off, little one! Humans are not welcome here, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  "npc.baa_leal.you_know_the_2": "You know the code human! Very well then... What do you want, |PLAYERNAME|?",
  "npc.baa_leal.you_are_still_3": "You are still alive, |PLAYERNAME|? Well, what do you want?",
  "npc.baa_leal.did_you_find_4": "Did you find the thief of our supplies?",
  "npc.baa_leal.did_you_already_5": "Did you already talk to Alesar? He has another mission for you!",
  "npc.baa_leal.after_all_youre_6": "After all, you're just a human.",
  "npc.baa_leal.finally_what_is_7": "Finally! What is his name then?",
  "npc.baa_leal.then_go_to_8": "Then go to Carlin and search for him! Look for something that might give you a clue!",
  "npc.baa_leal.hmmm_i_dont_9": "Hmmm... I don't think so. Return to Thais and continue your search!",
  "npc.baa_leal.hmmm_i_dont_10": "Hmmm... I don't think so. Return to Thais and continue your search!",
  "npc.barazbaz.you_need_to_1": "You need to kill the {The Ravager}, click on statue and then come here say {ritual}, {abandoned sewers}, {notebook} and after this find Roswitha and talk with she.",
  "npc.barnabas_dee.do_you_already_1": "Do you already have 15 units of blue pollen with you?",
  "npc.barnabas_dee.ah_did_you_2": "Ah! Did you bring me the peppermoon bell pollen I asked for?",
  "npc.barnabas_dee.ah_well_done_3": "Ah! Well done! Now we shall proceed with the seance, yes?",
  "npc.barnabas_dee.ah_well_done_4": "Ah! Well done! These 15 doses will suffice for now. Here, take this vote for your effort.",
  "npc.barnabas_dee.no_no_no_5": "No no no, I need 15 doses of freshly harvested pollen! Please, harvest those 15 doses yourself, to make absolutely sure you have first-rate quality. I am afraid nothing less will do.",
  "npc.barnabas_dee.splendid_let_me_6": "Splendid. Let me make the final preparations... There. Are you ready, too?",
  "npc.barnabas_dee.yes_take_care_7": "Yes, take care, the gate is opening! Can you see a bright light?",
  "npc.barnabas_dee.ahhhhhhhh_8": "Ahhhhhhhh! ",
  "npc.barry.oh_my_where_1": "Oh my, where to begin with .. <tells about the troubles he and his men have recently encountered>.",
  "npc.barry.you_can_pass_2": "You can {pass} either to the {Magician Quarter} or {Sunken Quarter}. Which one will it be?",
  "npc.battlemart.i_sell_a_1": "I sell a selection of ",
  "npc.battlemart.of_course_just_2": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.beatrice.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to buy a football for 111 gold?",
  "npc.beatrice.here_it_is_2": "Here it is.",
  "npc.beatrice.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.benjamin.oh_they_dont_1": "Oh they don't change that much since in the old days as... <tells a boring and confusing story about a cake, a parcel, himself and two squirrels, at least he tells you his measurements in the end> ",
  "npc.berenice.oh_so_you_1": "OH! So you have safely returned from Calassa! Congratulations, were you able to retrieve the logbook?",
  "npc.berenice.the_most_important_2": "The most important mission we currently have is an expedition to {Calassa}.",
  "npc.berenice.ah_so_you_3": "Ah! So you have heard about our special mission to investigate the Quara race in their natural surrounding! Would you like to know more about it?",
  "npc.berenice.captain_max_will_4": "Captain Max will bring you to Calassa whenever you are ready. Please try to retrieve the missing logbook which must be in one of the sunken shipwrecks.",
  "npc.berenice.oh_so_you_5": "OH! So you have safely returned from Calassa! Congratulations, were you able to retrieve the logbook?",
  "npc.berenice.excellent_i_will_6": "Excellent! I will immediately inform Captain Max to bring you to {Calassa} whenever you are ready. Don't forget to make thorough preparations!",
  "npc.berenice.yes_thats_the_7": "Yes! That's the logbook! However... it seems that the water has already destroyed many of the pages. This is not your fault though, you did your best. Thank you!",
  "npc.bertha.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to buy a football for 111 gold?",
  "npc.bertha.here_it_is_2": "Here it is.",
  "npc.bertha.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.bloodshade_rotten.you_already_have_1": "You already have started this quest.",
  "npc.bloodshade_sacrifice.you_already_have_1": "You already have access.",
  "npc.bloodshade_sacrifice.you_are_willing_2": "You are willing to pay 5000000 gold pieces, then? There is no turning back after our... transaction is complete. Are you sure?",
  "npc.bloodshade_sacrifice.sorry_you_dont_3": "Sorry, you don't have enough gold.",
  "npc.bloodshade_sacrifice.the_bargain_has_4": "The bargain has been made, the business is done.",
  "npc.bloodshade_sacrifice.ok_then_not_5": "Ok then not.",
  "npc.bolfona.is_that_for_1": "Is that for me?",
  "npc.bolfona.so_did_you_2": "So did you tell her that the cake came from me?",
  "npc.bolfona.err_thanks_i_3": "Err, thanks. I doubt it's from you. Who sent it?",
  "npc.bolfona.oh_i_thought_4": "Oh, I thought you have one.",
  "npc.bolfona.oh_frafnar_thats_5": "Oh, Frafnar. That's so nice of him. I gotta invite him for a beer.",
  "npc.bolfona.never_heard_that_6": "Never heard that name. Well, I don't mind, thanks for the cake.",
  "npc.boozer.yessss_now_i_1": "Yessss! Now I only need to build my own small brewery, figure out the secret recipe, duplicate the dwarvish brew and BANG I'll be back in business! Here take this as a reward.",
  "npc.boozer.shush_i_dont_2": "Shush!! I don't want everybody to know what I am up to. Listen, things are not going too well, I need a new attraction. Do you want to help me?",
  "npc.boozer.good_listen_closely_3": "Good! Listen closely. Take this bottle and go to Kazordoon. I need a sample of their very special brown ale. You may find a cask in their brewery. Come back as soon as you got it.",
  "npc.bo_ques.whoa_a_human_1": "Whoa! A human! This is no place for you, |PLAYERNAME|. Go and play somewhere else.",
  "npc.bo_ques.hey_a_human_2": "Hey! A human! What are you doing in my kitchen, |PLAYERNAME|?",
  "npc.bo_ques.i_already_told_3": "I already told you about the recipes I am missing, now please try to find a cookbook of the dwarven kitchen.",
  "npc.bo_ques.do_you_have_4": "Do you have the cookbook of the dwarven kitchen with you? Can I have it?",
  "npc.bo_ques.thanks_again_for_5": "Thanks again, for bringing me that book!",
  "npc.bo_ques.well_too_bad_6": "Well, too bad.",
  "npc.bo_ques.too_bad_i_7": "Too bad. I must have this book.",
  "npc.bo_ques.too_bad_i_8": "Too bad. I must have this book.",
  "npc.bozo.wow_your_stupidity_1": "Wow, your stupidity would be pride and joy for every fool. You've already applied as a member. Let's rather talk about your current mission.",
  "npc.bozo.do_you_wish_2": "Do you wish to become a jester and join the fools guild?",
  "npc.bozo.im_sure_it_3": "I'm sure it suits you well.",
  "npc.bozo.no_you_arent_4": "No, you aren't! Why do only fools apply for the fools guild?",
  "npc.bozo.eeeek_what_have_5": "Eeeek! What have you done?? These pies are crawling with bugs! Those must be the infamous parcel bugs! Get some new pies at once you wannabe fool, and this time without any bugs!",
  "npc.bozo.no_you_dont_6": "No, you don't! Why do only fools apply for the fools guild?",
  "npc.bozo.too_bad_im_7": "Too bad, I'm convinced you have it in you.",
  "npc.bozo.you_wont_be_8": "You won't be successful in the fool's world with such an attitude.",
  "npc.bozo.you_wasted_the_9": "You wasted the disguise?? Why do only fools apply for the fools guild? Here... try again, but be wittier this time.",
  "npc.bozo.oh_boy_why_10": "Oh boy, why do only fools apply for the fools guild?",
  "npc.brewster.the_only_person_1": "The only person who might have some cough syrup is this druid Ustan. You find him in the tavern. Hmmm the tavern ... <hicks>",
  "npc.briasol.here_it_is_1": "Here it is.",
  "npc.briasol.you_dont_have_2": "You don't have enought money.",
  "npc.brodrosch.your_weekly_ticket_1": "Your weekly ticket is still valid. Would be a waste of money to purchase a second one",
  "npc.brodrosch.do_you_want_2": "Do you want to purchase a weekly ticket for the ore wagons? With it you can travel freely and swiftly through Kazordoon for one week. 250 gold only. Deal?",
  "npc.brodrosch.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.brodrosch.here_is_your_4": "Here is your stamp. It can't be transferred to another person and will last one week from now. You'll get notified upon using an ore wagon when it isn't valid anymore.",
  "npc.broken_servant_sentry.if_you_bring_1": "If. You. Bring. Slime. Fungus. Samples. Fro-Fro-Fro-Frrrr*chhhhchrk*From. Other. Tower. You. Must. Be. The. Master. Are. You. There. Master?",
  "npc.broken_servant_sentry.if_you_bring_2": "If. You. Bring. Slime. Fungus. Samples. Fro-Fro-Fro-Frrrr*chhhhchrk*From. Other. Tower. You. Must. Be. The. Master. Are. You. There. Master?",
  "npc.broken_servant_sentry.you_already_have_3": "You already have this outfit!",
  "npc.broken_servant_sentry.you_already_have_4": "You already have this outfit!",
  "npc.broken_servant_sentry.i_greet_you_5": "I. Greet. You. Ma-Ma-Ma-ster! Did. You. Bring. Mo-Mo-Mo-M*chhhhrrrk*ore. Samples. For. Me. To-To-To. Analyse-lyse-lyse?",
  "npc.broken_servant_sentry.thank_i_will_6": "Thank. I. Will. Start. Analysing. No-No-No-No*chhrrrk*Now.",
  "npc.broken_servant_sentry.i_greet_you_7": "I. Greet. You. Ma-Ma-Ma-ster! Did. You. Bring. Mo-Mo-Mo-M*chhhhrrrk*ore. Samples. For. Me. To-To-To. Analyse-lyse-lyse?",
  "npc.broken_servant_sentry.you_do_not_8": "You do not have all the required items.",
  "npc.bron.oh_he_really_1": "Oh! He really said that? I am so proud of you, |PLAYERNAME|. These are really good news. Everything would be great... if only there wasn't this {person} near my house.",
  "npc.bron.fighting_spirit_what_2": "Fighting spirit? What am I supposed to do with this fi... - oh! I feel strange... ME MIGHTY! ME WILL CHASE OFF ANNOYING KIDS!GROOOAARR!! RRRRRRRRRRRRAAAAAAAGE!!",
  "npc.bron.have_you_really_3": "Have you really managed to fulfil the task and brought me 50 pieces of red cloth and 50 pieces of green cloth?",
  "npc.bron.oh_did_you_4": "Oh, did you bring 10 rolls of spool of yarn for me?",
  "npc.bron.were_you_able_5": "Were you able to get hold of a flask with pure warrior's sweat?",
  "npc.bron.you_are_indeed_6": "You are indeed not only well educated, but also very courageous. I wish you good luck, you are my last hope.",
  "npc.bron.again_i_have_7": "Again, I have to thank you for your selfless offer to help me. I hope that Ajax can come up with something, now that he has experienced the power of words.",
  "npc.bron.thank_you_my_8": "Thank you, my friend! Come back to me once you have collected 50 pieces of red cloth and 50 pieces of green cloth.",
  "npc.bron.terrific_i_will_9": "Terrific! I will start to trim it while you gather 10 rolls of spider silk. I'm sure that Ajax will love it.",
  "npc.bron.im_impressed_you_10": "I'm impressed! You really managed to get spool of yarn for me! I will immediately start to work on this shirt. Please don't forget to bring me warrior's sweat!",
  "npc.bron.good_work_playername_11": "Good work, |PLAYERNAME|! Now I can finally finish this present for Ajax. Because you were such a great help, I have also a present for you. Will you accept it?",
  "npc.bron.i_have_kept_12": "I have kept this traditional barbarian wig safe for many years now. It is now yours! I hope you will wear it proudly, friend.",
  "npc.bruce.well_gives_a_1": "Well, .. <gives a short and precise report>.",
  "npc.bruce.you_can_pass_2": "You can {pass} either to the {Alchemist Quarter} or {Cemetery Quarter}. Which one will it be?",
  "npc.budrik.as_i_was_1": "As I was just saying to the others, 'this brave fellow will bring me my mining helmet back' and here you are with it!! Here take my spare helmet, I don't need it anymore!",
  "npc.budrik.we_presume_the_2": "We presume the hideout of The Horned Fox is somewhere in the south-west near the coast, good luck finding my mining helmet!",
  "npc.budrik.come_back_when_3": "Come back when you have slain {5000 minotaurs!}",
  "npc.budrik.it_was_very_4": "It was very decent of you to help me, and I am thankful, really I am, but now I have to get back to my duties as a foreman.",
  "npc.budrik.well_i_could_5": "Well, I could need help with that damn Horned Fox and his gang, but I guess since you are rather experienced, killing minotaurs would bore you to death. I'll wait for someone else. But thanks!",
  "npc.budrik.hum_what_task_6": "Hum... what, {task}?",
  "npc.budrik.i_knew_you_7": "I knew you have the guts for that task! We presume the hideout of The Horned Fox somewhere in the south-west near the coast. Good luck!",
  "npc.budrik.hussah_lets_bring_8": "Hussah! Let's bring war to those hoof-legged, dirt-necked, bull-headed minotaurs!! Come back to me when you are done with your {mission}.",
  "npc.bunny_bonecrusher.alright_you_delivered_1": "Alright, you delivered the parcel. So what is the password Thanita told you?",
  "npc.bunny_bonecrusher.i_am_not_2": "I am not sure if I should be glad now or not but anyway ... you will get a password so I will know if you just threw it away or actually delivered it. Here is the parcel. See you ....or not.",
  "npc.bunny_bonecrusher.thats_right_here_3": "That's right. Here is your reward some elementary arrows. You did pretty well on your mission!",
  "npc.cael.oh_that_sounds_1": "Oh! That sounds fascinating. Have you found a Tome of Knowledge for me to read?",
  "npc.cael.oh_that_sounds_2": "Oh! That sounds fascinating. Have you found a new Tome of Knowledge for me to read?",
  "npc.cael.oh_that_sounds_3": "Oh! That sounds fascinating. Have you found a new Tome of Knowledge for me to read?",
  "npc.cael.im_sorry_im_4": "I'm sorry I'm busy. Speak with Ongulf to get some missions!",
  "npc.cael.oh_that_sounds_5": "Oh! That sounds fascinating. Have you found a Tome of Knowledge for me to read? I have the feeling though that I can only share some of my experience with you now. Is that alright with you?",
  "npc.cael.im_sorry_im_6": "I'm sorry I'm busy. Speak with Ongulf to get some missions!",
  "npc.cael.thank_you_i_7": "Thank you! I look forward to reading this interesting discovery of yours and learn a few things about {Zao}.",
  "npc.cael.thank_you_i_8": "Thank you! I look forward to reading this interesting discovery of yours and learn a few things about {Zao}.",
  "npc.cael.thank_you_i_9": "Thank you! I look forward to reading this interesting discovery of yours and learn a few things about {Zao}. Let me share some experience with you.",
  "npc.cael.you_dont_have_10": "You dont have one!",
  "npc.cael.ive_learnt_more_11": "I've learnt more about the {lizard} culture. It's really fascinating.",
  "npc.cael.ive_learnt_more_12": "I've learnt more about the {minotaur} culture. It's really fascinating.",
  "npc.cael.ive_learnt_more_13": "I've learnt more about the {Draken} culture by now. It's really fascinating.",
  "npc.cael.ive_learnt_something_14": "I've learnt something interesting about a certain {food} that the lizardmen apparently prepare.",
  "npc.cael.ive_learnt_something_15": "I've learnt something interesting about a city called {Zzaion}.",
  "npc.cael.ive_learnt_a_16": "I've learnt a few things about the primitive {human} culture on this continent.",
  "npc.cael.ive_learnt_something_17": "I've learnt something interesting about the Zao {steppe}.",
  "npc.cael.ive_learnt_a_18": "I've learnt a few things about an illness, or how I prefer to call it, {corruption} of this land.",
  "npc.cael.ive_learnt_something_19": "I've learnt something interesting about the Draken {origin}.",
  "npc.cael.this_book_actually_20": "This book actually IS about Zao. Not about the continent, but about the mythical {founder} of the lizard dynasty.",
  "npc.cael.ive_learnt_something_21": "I've learnt something interesting about {dragons} and their symbolism.",
  "npc.cael.the_last_tome_22": "The last tome contained a lot of information about status symbols and insignia - such as {thrones} - and reveals some of the power structures in Zao.",
  "npc.cael.ive_learnt_many_23": "I've learnt many things from your books. Still, I guess that's just a fragment of what I could still discover about this interesting continent.",
  "npc.cael.have_you_brought_24": "Have you brought me a red lantern for a dragon statue?",
  "npc.cael.lets_put_this_25": "Let's put this little lantern here.. there you go. I wrap it up for you, just unwrap it in your house again!",
  "npc.cael.you_dont_have_26": "You don't have a red lantern.",
  "npc.cael.have_you_brought_27": "Have you brought me a piece of red cloth? I can make that throne for you if you want. But remember, I won't do that all the time - so try and don't destroy it, okay?",
  "npc.cael.lets_put_this_28": "Let's put this cloth over the seat.. there you go. I wrap it up for you, just unwrap it in your house again!",
  "npc.cael.you_dont_have_29": "You don't have a red cloth.",
  "npc.cael.oh_wow_now_30": "Oh, wow! Now THAT is an interesting relic! Can I have that serpent crest?",
  "npc.cael.oh_wow_now_31": "Oh, wow! Now THAT is an interesting relic! Can I have that tribal crest?",
  "npc.cael.you_dont_have_32": "You don't have a Warmaster Outfit or the crest to get the Addons.",
  "npc.cael.thank_you_let_33": "Thank you! Let me reward you with something I stumbled across recently and which might fit your warmaster outfit perfectly.",
  "npc.cael.you_dont_have_34": "You don't have a crest or already have this Outfitaddon.",
  "npc.cael.thank_you_let_35": "Thank you! Let me reward you with something I stumbled across recently and which might fit your warmaster outfit perfectly.",
  "npc.cael.you_dont_have_36": "You don't have a crest or already have this Outfitaddon.",
  "npc.cael.sorry_i_dont_37": "Sorry, I don't have items to trade now.",
  "npc.canary.this_the_our_1": "This the our discord group link: {https://discordapp.com/invite/3NxYnyV}",
  "npc.captain_dreadnought.so_you_want_1": "So you want to donate ",
  "npc.captain_dreadnought.well_har_har_2": "Well, har har. Very funny. Come on, pick up the gold you just dropped.",
  "npc.captain_dreadnought.what_whatever_that_3": "What? Whatever that is, it's not a port I sail to. ",
  "npc.captain_dreadnought.what_whatever_that_4": "What? Whatever that is, it's not a port I sail to. ",
  "npc.captain_dreadnought.changed_your_mind_5": "Changed your mind? Which city do you want to head to, ",
  "npc.captain_dreadnought.changed_your_mind_6": "Changed your mind? Which city do you want to head to, ",
  "npc.captain_dreadnought.errr_was_that_7": "Errr... was that a foreign language? Could you just answer with a clear {yes} or {no}?",
  "npc.captain_dreadnought.aw_come_on_8": "Aw, come on! Talk to me in human words! {Yes}, {no}, or mention a city's name, that kind of stuff.",
  "npc.captain_haba.hold_your_horses_1": "Hold your horses! First we need to get more {bait} fo' the sea serpent. Bring me the fish I requested and we can set sails immediately.",
  "npc.captain_haba.ya_wanna_join_2": "Ya wanna join the hunt fo' the {sea serpent}? Be warned ya may pay with ya life! Are ya in to it?",
  "npc.captain_haba.you_got_any_3": "You got any {baits} for me?",
  "npc.captain_haba.aright_wanna_put_4": "A'right, wanna put out to sea?",
  "npc.captain_haba.aright_we_are_5": "A'right, we are here to resupply our stock of baits to catch the sea serpent. Your first task is to bring me 5 fish they are easy to catch. When you got them ask me for the {bait} again.",
  "npc.captain_haba.lets_go_fo_6": "Let's go fo' a {hunt} and bring the beast down!",
  "npc.captain_haba.excellent_now_bring_7": "Excellent, now bring me 5 northern pike.",
  "npc.captain_haba.excellent_now_bring_8": "Excellent, now bring me 5 green perch.",
  "npc.captain_haba.excellent_now_bring_9": "Excellent, now bring me 5 rainbow trout.",
  "npc.captain_haba.excellent_that_should_10": "Excellent, that should be enough fish to make the bait. Tell me when ya're ready fo' the {hunt}.",
  "npc.captain_haba.the_bait_is_11": "The bait is ready, tell me if ya're ready to start the hunt.",
  "npc.captain_haba_open_sea.harharhar_landlubber_no_1": "Harharhar, landlubber, no no!! The correct command would be STRAIGHT. Remember that! Next, what you gonna say when you see something to left?",
  "npc.captain_haba_open_sea.harharhar_landlubber_ya_2": "Harharhar, landlubber, ya got it all wrong!! The correct command would be LARBOARD side. Don't forget that, 'kay? Last one, what you gonna say to me when ya see somethin' to the right?",
  "npc.captain_haba_open_sea.is_that_all_3": "IS THAT ALL?!? SPEED UP, TIGHTEN THE MAINSAIL!!!",
  "npc.captain_haba_open_sea.already_got_enough_4": "Already got enough, huh? I kind o' expected that, landlubber! Let's head for Svargrond! Ready?",
  "npc.captain_haba_open_sea.y_already_wanna_5": "Y' already wanna give up?? I should've known. I bring ya back to Svargrond, 'kay?",
  "npc.captain_jack_rat.there_are_two_1": "There are two different routes. The dangerous one will be available once a day and it is likely that a seemonster will attack the ship once again. And a {safe} route that we can take directly there.",
  "npc.captain_jack_rat.do_you_want_2": "Do you want to take the safe route?",
  "npc.captain_waverider.ohhhh_so_lowers_1": "Ohhhh. So... <lowers his voice> you know who sent you so I sail you to you know where. <wink> <wink> It will cost 50 gold to cover my expenses. Is it that what you wish?",
  "npc.captain_waverider.sorry_my_old_2": "Sorry, my old ears can't hear you.",
  "npc.captain_waverider.sigh_i_knew_3": "<sigh> I knew someone else would claim all the treasure someday. But at least it will be you and not some greedy and selfish person. For a small fee of 200 gold pieces I will sail you to your rendezvous with fate. Do we have a deal?",
  "npc.captain_waverider.i_have_to_4": "I have to admit this leaves me a bit puzzled.",
  "npc.captain_waverider.and_there_we_5": "And there we go!",
  "npc.captain_waverider.you_dont_have_6": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.captain_waverider.and_there_we_7": "And there we go!",
  "npc.captain_waverider.you_dont_have_8": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.carina.would_you_like_1": "Would you like to buy my precious necklace for 5000 gold?",
  "npc.carina.wha_what_are_2": "Wha ... What??? Are you saying you've seen a mouse here??",
  "npc.carina.here_you_go_3": "Here you go kind sir.",
  "npc.carina.there_is_no_4": "There is no mouse here! Stop talking foolish things about serious issues!",
  "npc.carina.thank_goodness_5": "Thank goodness!",
  "npc.carlos.very_well_just_1": "Very well. Just choose an outfit and a colour combination that suits you. You can open this dialogue anytime by right-clicking on yourself and selecting 'Set Outfit'. Just try it and then talk to me again!",
  "npc.carlos.you_see_im_2": "You see, I'm quite hungry from standing here all day. Could you get me some {food}?",
  "npc.carlos.thank_you_i_3": "Thank you! I would do it myself, but I don't have a weapon. Just kill a few rabbits or deer, loot food from them and bring me one piece of {meat} or ham, will you?",
  "npc.carlos.splendid_ill_be_4": "Splendid. I'll be awaiting your return eagerly. Don't forget that you can click on the 'Chase Opponent' button to run after those fast creatures. Good {bye} for now!",
  "npc.carlos.whats_that_delicious_5": "What's that delicious smell? That must be a piece of meat! Please hurry, simply ask me for a {trade} and I'll give you two gold pieces for it!",
  "npc.carlos.hmm_no_i_6": "Hmm. No, I don't think you have something with you that I'd like to eat. Please come back once you looted a piece of meat or a piece of ham from a rabbit or deer.",
  "npc.cassino.if_you_want_1": "If you want to play with me please come near me.",
  "npc.cassino.your_bet_is_2": "Your bet is lower than the min {",
  "npc.ceiron.what_are_you_1": "What are you thinking! I would never allow you to slay my beloved friends for the sake of your narcism. Only {Faolan} can grant you a fur like this one.",
  "npc.ceiron.i_know_where_2": "I know where the great wolf mother lives, but I will not tell that to just anyone. You have to earn my respect first. Are you willing to help me?",
  "npc.ceiron.right_i_will_3": "Right, I will keep my promise. Faolan roams Tibia freely, but her favourite sleeping cave is on Cormaya. I will now enchant you so you will be able to speak the wolf language.",
  "npc.ceiron.were_you_able_4": "Were you able to obtain a sample of the Griffinclaw?",
  "npc.ceiron.did_you_bring_5": "Did you bring me a sample of water from the hydra cave?",
  "npc.ceiron.were_you_really_6": "Were you really able to collect 100 ounces of demon dust?",
  "npc.ceiron.have_you_really_7": "Have you really found my wolf tooth chain??",
  "npc.ceiron.have_you_lost_8": "Have you lost my waterskin?",
  "npc.ceiron.alright_then_take_9": "Alright then. Take this botanist's container and return to me once you were able to retrieve a sample. Don't lose patience!",
  "npc.ceiron.crunor_be_praised_10": "Crunor be praised! The Griffinclaw really exists! Now, I will make sure that it will not become extinct. If you are ready to help me again, just ask me for a {task}.",
  "npc.ceiron.great_here_take_11": "Great! Here, take my waterskin and try to fill it with water from this special trickle. Don't lose my waterskin, I will not accept some random dirty waterskin.",
  "npc.ceiron.good_work_playername_12": "Good work, |PLAYERNAME|! This water looks indeed extremely clear. I will examine it right away. If you are ready to help me again, just ask me for a {task}.",
  "npc.ceiron.im_very_impressed_13": "I'm very impressed, |PLAYERNAME|. With this task you have proven that you are on the right side and are powerful as well. If you are ready to help me again, just ask me for a {task}.",
  "npc.ceiron.im_very_impressed_14": "I'm very impressed, |PLAYERNAME|. With this task you have proven that you are on the right side and are powerful as well. If you are ready to help me again, just ask me for a {task}.",
  "npc.ceiron.thank_you_so_15": "Thank you so much. I can't wait to wear it around my neck again, it was a special present from Faolan.",
  "npc.ceiron.crunor_be_praised_16": "Crunor be praised! You found my beloved chain! |PLAYERNAME|, you really earned my respect and I consider you as a friend from now on. Remind me to tell you about {Faolan} sometime.",
  "npc.ceiron.i_can_give_17": "I can give you a new one, but I fear that I have to take a small fee for it. Would you like to buy a waterskin for 1000 gold?",
  "npc.chantalle.oh_my_you_1": "Oh my! You look so great in your uniform! You archpostmen are not only daring but also handsome. Here take it, that's the key you wanted. Just promise to visit me now and then!",
  "npc.chantalle.oh_my_such_2": "Oh my, such a lovely necklace! Here take it, that's the key you wanted. Now let me admire my precious necklace alone.",
  "npc.chantalle.i_am_sorry_3": "I am sorry, I am not interested in your money. Maybe you should try your luck with Herbert, the postman instead.",
  "npc.charles.do_you_seek_1": "Do you seek a shortcut passage to {Thais} for 100 gold, to {Edron} for 90 gold, to {Liberty Bay} for 20 gold or to {Yalahar} for 200 gold?",
  "npc.charles.set_the_sails_2": "Set the sails and good luck to us!",
  "npc.charles.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.charlotta.oh_so_you_1": "Oh, so you brought some gold from Eleonore to me?",
  "npc.charlotta.hmm_it_seems_2": "Hmm, it seems that Eleonore does trust you. Perhaps she is even right. However. Since we need some help right now I guess we can't be too picky. Return to Eleonore and tell her the secret password: 'peg leg'. She will tell you more about her problem.",
  "npc.charlotta.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have enough...",
  "npc.charos.sorry_you_have_1": "Sorry, you have traveled a lot.",
  "npc.charos.fine_you_have_2": "Fine. You have ",
  "npc.charos.goodbye_traveler_3": "Goodbye traveler!",
  "npc.charos.sorry_i_dont_4": "Sorry, I don't know about this place.",
  "npc.chartan.mhm_what_are_1": "Mhm, what are you doing here. Who zent you? ",
  "npc.chartan.zo_are_you_2": "Zo are you ready to get zomezing done?",
  "npc.chartan.zo_did_you_3": "Zo? Did you find a way to reztore ze teleporter? ",
  "npc.chavis.i_am_sorry_1": "I am sorry, you didn't harvest enough roots. You need to harvest a bundle of at least five roots - and please try doing it yourself.",
  "npc.chavis.yes_you_brought_2": "Yes? You brought some juicy roots? How nice of you - that's one additional voice in the {magistrate} of {Rathleton} for you! ...",
  "npc.chavis.spend_it_wisely_3": "Spend it wisely, though, put in a word for the poor, will ye? Sure you will.",
  "npc.chavis.you_dont_have_4": "You don't have enough items.",
  "npc.chavis.they_are_nutritious_5": "They are nutritious, cost nothing and are good for the body hair. If you can bring us bundles of five juicy roots each - we will make it worth your while for the {magistrate}.",
  "npc.chavis.they_act_so_6": "They act so important but it is us common people who keep things going. There is a lot you can do in this city to earn a right to vote in the magistrate, though. So keep an eye out for everyone who needs help.",
  "npc.chester_kahs.are_you_saying_1": "Are you saying that Gamel is a member of the rebellion?",
  "npc.chester_kahs.do_you_know_2": "Do you know what his plans are about?",
  "npc.chester_kahs.thank_you_take_3": "Thank you! Take this ring. If you ever need a healing, come, bring the scroll, and ask me to {heal}.",
  "npc.chester_kahs.sorry_but_you_4": "Sorry, but you have none.",
  "npc.chester_kahs.so_be_healed_5": "So be healed!",
  "npc.chester_kahs.sorry_you_are_6": "Sorry, you are not worthy!",
  "npc.chester_kahs.then_i_welcome_7": "Then I welcome you to the TBI. This is a great moment for you, remember it well. Talk to me about your missions whenever you feel ready.",
  "npc.chester_kahs.i_think_they_8": "I think they understood the warning the way it was meant. If not, you will have to visit Venore soon again. But for now it's settled.",
  "npc.chester_kahs.i_can_only_9": "I can only hope that this information are as valuable as we expected it. A good man died for them.",
  "npc.chester_kahs.please_bring_me_10": "Please bring me some proof of his whereabouts.",
  "npc.chester_kahs.i_can_only_11": "I can only hope that this information are as valuable as we expected it. A good man died for them.",
  "npc.chester_kahs.please_bring_me_12": "Please bring me some valuable information!",
  "npc.chester_kahs.ah_yes_very_13": "Ah yes, very interesting. Almost as I suspected. It's a good thing that we got those documents in our hands.",
  "npc.chester_kahs.we_need_those_14": "We need those intelligence reports, do whatever you need to do agent!",
  "npc.chester_kahs.now_that_venore_15": "Now that Venore is of nearly no importance anymore, there is only Carlin left to deal with.",
  "npc.chester_kahs.i_already_heard_16": "I already heard that our little trick worked quite well. Several officials of Carlin are already on their way to repair the damage done to their diplomatic efforts. It will not only cost them much money but also quite some time.",
  "npc.chester_kahs.here_you_are_17": "Here you are. Better don't loose it again.",
  "npc.chester_kahs.you_dont_have_18": "You don't have enough money",
  "npc.chester_kahs.you_have_done_19": "You have done superb work agent, I grant you the title of Top Agent! Here's a little gift you might find useful.",
  "npc.chester_kahs.please_bring_me_20": "Please bring me proof of the mad technomancers defeat!",
  "npc.chester_kahs.then_dont_bother_21": "Then don't bother me with it. I'm a busy man.",
  "npc.chester_kahs.as_you_wish_22": "As you wish.",
  "npc.chester_kahs.thats_terrible_will_23": "That's terrible! Will you give me the crystal?",
  "npc.chester_kahs.tell_me_precisely_24": "Tell me precisely what he asked you to do! It's important!",
  "npc.chester_kahs.do_you_need_25": "Do you need the healing now?",
  "npc.chester_kahs.have_you_fulfilled_26": "Have you fulfilled your current mission?",
  "npc.chester_kahs.have_you_fulfilled_27": "Have you fulfilled your current mission?",
  "npc.chester_kahs.have_you_fulfilled_28": "Have you fulfilled your current mission?",
  "npc.chester_kahs.have_you_fulfilled_29": "Have you fulfilled your current mission?",
  "npc.chester_kahs.have_you_fulfilled_30": "Have you fulfilled your current mission?",
  "npc.chester_kahs.have_you_fulfilled_31": "Have you fulfilled your current mission?",
  "npc.chester_kahs.have_you_fulfilled_32": "Have you fulfilled your current mission?",
  "npc.chester_kahs.if_you_lost_33": "If you lost or wasted your disguise kit I can replace it. It will cost you 1000 gold though since you lost royal property. Is that ok for you?",
  "npc.chief_grarkharok.hahaha_grarkharok_take_1": "Hahaha! Grarkharok take cloak from pretty girl. Then ... girl is swan. Grarkharok wants eat but flies away. Grarkharok not understand. Not need cloak, too many feathers. Give cloak to To ... Ta ... Tereban in Edron. Getting shiny coins and meat.",
  "npc.chief_grarkharok.grarkharok_already_say_2": "Grarkharok already say everything! Not want talk! Go away!",
  "npc.chief_grarkharok.hrhrhrhr_me_no_3": "Hrhrhrhr! Me no fear of human! Me Chief Grarkharok!!",
  "npc.chief_grarkharok.you_help_human_4": "You help?? Human know troll lady for Grarkharok??",
  "npc.chief_grarkharok.found_lady_for_5": "Found lady for Grarkharok?!? Must be good-looking, hairy lady, yknow! Go find!!",
  "npc.chief_grarkharok.what_name_of_6": "What name of troll lady??",
  "npc.chief_grarkharok.gimme_gimme_yumyumyum_7": "Gimme gimme! Yumyumyum! <BUUUURP>.",
  "npc.chief_grarkharok.you_no_have_8": "You no have dead frog! Bring dead frog!!! Grarkharok hungry!!",
  "npc.chief_grarkharok.gimme_gimme_yumyumyum_9": "Gimme gimme! Yumyumyum! <BUUUURP>.",
  "npc.chief_grarkharok.you_no_have_10": "You no have tasty snake! Bring tasty snake!!! Grarkharok hungry!!",
  "npc.chief_grarkharok.playername_sound_good_11": "|PLAYERNAME|?!? Sound good! Bring troll lady to Grarkharok!! Here, give troll lady! Take take! Bring lady to Grarkharok for make tribe!! Now GO!",
  "npc.chief_grarkharok.have_dead_frog_12": "Have dead frog for Grarkharok??",
  "npc.chief_grarkharok.have_tasty_snake_13": "Have tasty snake for Grarkharok??",
  "npc.chief_grarkharok.grarkharok_angry_now_14": "Grarkharok angry now!! Want throw rock on human cave down hill again!",
  "npc.chief_grarkharok.huh_no_understand_15": "Huh?? No understand!",
  "npc.chondur.the_time_has_1": "The time has come, my child. I sense great spiritual wisdom in you and I shall grant you a sign of your progress, if you can fulfil my task.",
  "npc.chondur.you_have_successfully_2": "You have successfully passed the first task. If you can fulfil my second task, I will grant you a mask like the one I wear. Will you listen to the requirements?",
  "npc.chondur.you_must_have_3": "You must have the Shaman Outfit to proceed with this task.",
  "npc.chondur.good_come_back_4": "Good! Come back once you found a mandrake and collected 5 dworcish voodoo dolls.",
  "npc.chondur.have_you_gathered_5": "Have you gathered the mandrake and the 5 voodoo dolls from the dworcs?",
  "npc.chondur.have_you_gathered_6": "Have you gathered the 5 tribal masks and the 5 banana staves?",
  "npc.chondur.i_am_proud_7": "I am proud of you, my child, excellent work. This staff shall be yours from now on!",
  "npc.chondur.you_dont_have_8": "You don't have the necessary items.",
  "npc.chondur.well_done_my_9": "Well done, my child! I hereby grant you the right to wear a shamanic mask. Do it proudly.",
  "npc.chondur.you_dont_have_10": "You don't have the necessary items.",
  "npc.chondur.maybe_next_time_11": "Maybe next time.",
  "npc.chondur.you_did_bring_12": "You did bring all the items I requested, child. Good. Shall I travel to the spirit realm and try finding a stampor companion for you?",
  "npc.chondur.you_already_have_13": "You already have stampor mount.",
  "npc.chondur.the_evil_cult_14": "The evil cult has placed a curse on one of the captains here. I need at least five of their pirate voodoo dolls to lift that curse.",
  "npc.chondur.did_you_bring_15": "Did you bring five pirate voodoo dolls?",
  "npc.chondur.sorry_you_dont_16": "Sorry you don't have the necessary items.",
  "npc.chondur.finally_i_can_17": "Finally I can put an end to that curse. I thank you so much.",
  "npc.chondur.you_dont_have_18": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.chondur.this_is_really_19": "This is really not advisable. Behind this barrier, strong forces are raging violently. Are you sure that you want to go there?",
  "npc.chondur.very_good_mumble_20": "Very good! <mumble> 'Your soul shall be protected!' Now, I need a fresh dead rat.",
  "npc.chondur.you_dont_have_21": "You don't have the necessary items.",
  "npc.chondur.very_good_chants_22": "Very good! <chants and dances> 'You shall face black magic without fear!' Now, I need a fresh dead black sheep.",
  "npc.chondur.you_dont_have_23": "You don't have the necessary items.",
  "npc.chondur.you_dont_have_25": "You don't have the necessary items.",
  "npc.chondur.ten_prayers_for_26": "Ten prayers for a blessed stake? Don't tell me they made you travel whole Tibia for it! Listen, child, if you bring me a wooden stake, I'll bless it for you. <chuckles>",
  "npc.chondur.you_dont_have_27": "You don't have a wooden stake.",
  "npc.chondur.sorry_but_im_28": "Sorry, but I'm still exhausted from the last ritual. Please come back later.",
  "npc.chondur.mumblemumble_sha_kesh_29": "<mumblemumble> Sha Kesh Mar!",
  "npc.chondur.you_should_not_30": "You should not talk about things you don't know anything about.",
  "npc.chondur.you_mean_you_31": "You mean, you are interested in a counterspell to cross the energy barrier on Goroma?",
  "npc.chondur.did_you_bring_32": "Did you bring the fresh dead chicken?",
  "npc.chondur.did_you_bring_33": "Did you bring the fresh dead rat?",
  "npc.chondur.did_you_bring_34": "Did you bring the fresh dead black sheep?",
  "npc.chondur.hm_i_dont_35": "Hm. I don't think you need another one of my counterspells to cross the barrier on Goroma.",
  "npc.chondur.ah_thank_you_36": "Ah, thank you very much! I'll honour his memory.",
  "npc.chondur.you_dont_have_37": "You don't have the necessary items.",
  "npc.chondur.ah_the_energy_38": "Ah, the energy barrier set up by the cult is maintained by lousy magic, but it's still effective. Without a proper counterspell, you won't be able to pass it.",
  "npc.chrak.i_grant_you_1": "I grant you ze permizzion to enter ze arena. Remember, you'will have to enter ze arena az a team of two. If you are not familiar wiz ze rulez, I can explain zem to you once again.",
  "npc.chrystal.if_its_necessary_1": "If its necessary ... <tells you her measurements>",
  "npc.chuckles.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.cillia.the_exhibition_is_1": "The exhibition is not for free. You have to pay 50 Gold to get in. Next please!",
  "npc.cillia.and_here_we_2": "And here we go!",
  "npc.cledwyn.if_you_have_1": "If you have any {silver} tokens with you, let's have a look! Maybe I can offer you something in exchange.",
  "npc.cledwyn.with_pleasure_bows_2": "With pleasure. <bows> I trade {token}s. There are several ways to obtain the {token}s I am interested in - killing certain bosses, for example. In exchange for a certain amount of tokens, I can offer you some first-class items.",
  "npc.cledwyn.should_i_enchant_3": "Should I enchant the item ",
  "npc.cledwyn.should_i_enchant_4": "Should I enchant the item ",
  "npc.cledwyn.sorry_you_dont_5": "Sorry, you don't have an unenchanted ",
  "npc.cledwyn.ah_excellent_here_6": "Ah, excellent. Here is your ",
  "npc.cledwyn.sorry_friend_but_7": "Sorry, friend, but one good turn deserves another. Bring enough ",
  "npc.cledwyn.alright_come_back_8": "Alright, come back if you have changed your mind.",
  "npc.cledwyn.ah_very_good_9": "Ah, very good. Now choose your addon: {first} or {second}.",
  "npc.cledwyn.sorry_friend_but_10": "Sorry, friend, but one good turn deserves another. You need to obtain the rift warrior outfit first.",
  "npc.cledwyn.ah_excellent_obtain_11": "Ah, excellent. Obtain the first addon for your rift warrior outfit.",
  "npc.cledwyn.sorry_friend_but_12": "Sorry, friend, but one good turn deserves another. Bring enough ",
  "npc.cledwyn.sorry_friend_you_13": "Sorry, friend, you already have the first Rift Warrior addon.",
  "npc.cledwyn.ah_excellent_obtain_14": "Ah, excellent. Obtain the second addon for your rift warrior outfit.",
  "npc.cledwyn.sorry_friend_but_15": "Sorry, friend, but one good turn deserves another. Bring enough ",
  "npc.cledwyn.sorry_friend_you_16": "Sorry, friend, you already have the second Rift Warrior addon.",
  "npc.cobra.begone_hissssss_you_1": "Begone! Hissssss! You bear not the mark of the cobra!",
  "npc.commander_stone.you_will_have_1": "You will have to repair some damaged crystals. Go into the Crystal grounds and repair them, using this harmonic crystal. Repair five of them and return to me. ",
  "npc.commander_stone.sorry_you_will_2": "Sorry, you will have to wait before you can undertake this mission again.",
  "npc.commander_stone.you_did_well_3": "You did well. That will help us a lot. Take your {token} and this gnomish supply package as a reward. ",
  "npc.commander_stone.you_are_not_4": "You are not done yet.",
  "npc.commander_stone.you_already_have_5": "You already have accepted this mission. Don't forget to {report} to me when you are done.",
  "npc.commander_stone.sorry_you_do_6": "Sorry, you do have not have the required rank to undertake this mission.",
  "npc.commander_stone.sorry_you_will_7": "Sorry, you will have to wait before you can undertake this mission again.",
  "npc.commander_stone.you_did_well_8": "You did well. That will help us a lot. Take your {token} and this gnomish supply package as a reward. ",
  "npc.commander_stone.you_did_not_9": "You did not draw enough energy from Crystal Crushers or you have not asked for this task.",
  "npc.commander_stone.you_already_have_10": "You already have accepted this mission. Don't forget to {report} to me when you are done.",
  "npc.commander_stone.sorry_you_do_11": "Sorry, you do have not have the required rank to undertake this mission.",
  "npc.commander_stone.the_wigglers_have_12": "The wigglers have become a pest that threaten our resources and supplies. Kill 10 wigglers in the caves like the mushroon gardens or the truffles ground. {Report} back to me when you are done. ",
  "npc.commander_stone.sorry_you_will_13": "Sorry, you will have to wait before you can undertake this mission again.",
  "npc.commander_stone.you_did_well_14": "You did well. That will help us a lot. Take your {token} and this gnomish supply package as a reward. ",
  "npc.commander_stone.you_are_not_15": "You are not done yet.",
  "npc.commander_stone.you_already_have_16": "You already have accepted this mission. Don't forget to {report} to me when you are done.",
  "npc.commander_stone.sorry_you_do_17": "Sorry, you do have not have the required rank to undertake this mission.",
  "npc.commander_stone.sorry_you_will_18": "Sorry, you will have to wait before you can undertake this mission again.",
  "npc.commander_stone.you_did_well_19": "You did well. That will help us a lot. Take your {token} and this gnomish supply package as a reward. ",
  "npc.commander_stone.you_are_not_20": "You are not done yet.",
  "npc.commander_stone.you_already_have_21": "You already have accepted this mission. Don't forget to {report} to me when you are done.",
  "npc.commander_stone.sorry_you_do_22": "Sorry, you do have not have the required rank to undertake this mission.",
  "npc.commander_stone.which_mission_do_23": "Which mission do you want to report: crystal {keeper}, {spark} hunting?",
  "npc.commander_stone.which_mission_do_24": "Which mission do you want to report: crystal {keeper}, {spark} hunting, monster {extermination} or mushroom {digging}?",
  "npc.cornelia.ah_you_must_1": "Ah, you must be the hero Trisha talked about. I'll prepare the shoulder spikes for you. Please give me some time to finish.",
  "npc.cornelia.im_not_done_2": "I'm not done yet. Please be as patient as you are courageous.",
  "npc.cornelia.finished_since_you_3": "Finished! Since you are a man, I thought you probably wanted two. Men always want that little extra status symbol. <giggles>",
  "npc.cornelia.im_selling_leather_4": "I'm selling leather armor, chain armor, and brass armor. Ask me for a {trade} if you like to take a look.",
  "npc.corym_ratter.recently_the_amount_1": "Recently the amount of delivered ores is decreasing. Could you find out the reason, why the situation has become worse?",
  "npc.corym_ratter.nice_i_have_2": "Nice! I have opened the mine for you. But take care of you! The monsters of depth won't spare you.",
  "npc.corym_servant.you_dont_have_1": "You don't have enough, return when could you bring 20 of rare earth to me.",
  "npc.costello.do_you_want_1": "Do you want me to inspect a diary?",
  "npc.costello.who_are_you_2": "Who are you to demand holy water from the White Raven Monastery? Who sent you??",
  "npc.costello.i_already_filled_3": "I already filled your vial with holy water.",
  "npc.costello.ahh_amanda_from_4": "Ahh, Amanda from Edron sent you! I hope she's doing well. So why did she send you here?",
  "npc.costello.thank_you_very_5": "Thank you very much! From now on you may open the warded doors to the catacombs.",
  "npc.costello.uhm_as_you_6": "Uhm, as you wish.",
  "npc.costello.by_the_gods_7": "By the gods! This is brother Fugio's handwriting and what I read is horrible indeed! You have done our order a great favour by giving this diary to me! Take this blessed Ankh. May it protect you in even your darkest hours.",
  "npc.costello.i_never_heard_8": "I never heard that name and you won't get holy water for some stranger.",
  "npc.costello.ohh_why_didnt_9": "Ohh, why didn't you tell me before? Sure you get some holy water if it's for Amanda! Here you are.",
  "npc.costello.uhm_as_you_10": "Uhm, as you wish.",
  "npc.curos.you_come_here_1": "You come here to ask us to spare your people? This land has no tolerance for the weak, we have it neither. If you want us to consider you as useful for us, you'll have to prove it in a {test} of strength and courage. ",
  "npc.curos.with_the_death_2": "With the death of their leader, the rebels return to our camps one by one, deeply humiliated. It might be a wise decision to let a useful tool like you continue to exist.",
  "npc.dalbrect.you_have_recovered_1": "You have recovered my brooch! I shall forever be in your debt, my friend!",
  "npc.dalbrect.what_you_want_2": "What? You want me to examine a brooch?",
  "npc.dalbrect.what_are_you_3": "What are you talking about? I am too poor to be interested in jewelry.",
  "npc.dalbrect.i_should_have_4": "I should have known better than to ask for an act of kindness in this cruel, selfish, world!",
  "npc.dalbrect.then_stop_being_5": "Then stop being a fool. I am poor and I have to work the whole day through!",
  "npc.dalbrect.i_should_have_6": "I should have known better than to ask for an act of kindness in this cruel, selfish, world!",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.very_good_we_1": "Very good, we need heroes like you to go on a suici.....er....to earn respect of the authorities here AND in addition get a great reward for it. Are you interested in the job?",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.what_you_did_2": "What? YOU DID IT?!?! That's...that's...er....<drops a piece of paper. You see the headline 'death certificate'> like I expected!! Here is your reward.",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.very_nice_playername_3": "Very nice, |PLAYERNAME|. That will push the trolls' forces back a little. Here is your reward!",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.your_current_task_4": "Your current task is to kill 100 trolls. You have already killed ",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.congratulations_youve_fou_5": "Congratulations, you've fought well against the goblin plague. Thank you! Here is your reward!",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.your_current_task_6": "Your current task is to kill 150 goblins. You have already killed ",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.well_done_thanks_7": "Well done! Thanks to you the city is a bit safer. Here's your reward!",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.your_current_task_8": "Your current task is to kill 300 rotworms. You have already killed ",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.very_good_job_9": "Very good job, |PLAYERNAME|. You've been a great help. Here's your reward!",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.your_current_task_10": "Your current task is to kill 500 cyclops. You have already killed ",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.currently_there_is_11": "Currently there is no new task I could entrust you with. However, you can repeat killing {goblins} or {trolls}. Which would you prefer?",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.maybe_you_have_12": "Maybe you have noticed the numerous rotworms that burrowed under Edron. They're quite a pest. You look strong enough to be able to vanquish a few for us. Do you think you can kill 300 rotworms?",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.im_pleased_with_13": "I'm pleased with your eagerness. To reach your goal, you have to kill the brown trolls and troll champions. Good luck!",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.fine_then_you_14": "Fine then! You can kill normal goblins as well as scavengers and assassins on the lower levels, but beware, they are a bit harder. Have a good hunt!",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.im_pleased_with_15": "I'm pleased with your eagerness. To help you find the trolls' den, I mark both the entrance to the passage and their lair on your map. To reach your goal, you have to kill the normal brown trolls, but troll champions count too. Good luck!",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.fine_then_ill_16": "Fine then! I'll show you the Goblin den on your map, here. Use the same passage you did when hunting for trolls. You can kill normal goblins as well as scavengers and assassins on the lower levels, but beware, they are a bit harder.",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.another_option_if_17": "Another option if you want to do a task for Edron would be to killing 150 goblins. Would that suit your taste better?",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.another_option_if_18": "Another option if you want to do a task for Edron would be to repeat killing 100 trolls. Would that suit your taste better?",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.another_option_if_19": "Another option if you want to do a task for Edron would be to killing 500 cyclops. Would that suit your taste better?",
  "npc.daniel_steelsoul.another_option_if_20": "Another option if you want to do a task for Edron would be to killing 300 rotworms. Would that suit your taste better?",
  "npc.dedoras.i_have_heard_1": "I have heard that it was recently planned to expand the Museum of Tibian Arts. In the course of these activities unexpected difficulties occurred.",
  "npc.dedoras.thats_simply_a_2": "That's simply a scientific sensation. It will provide me with lots of much needed knowledge!",
  "npc.dedoras.there_are_rumors_3": "There are rumors of a mysterious statue in the desert next to Darashia. Nobody really knows the meaning of it.",
  "npc.dedoras.you_brought_incredible_4": "You brought incredible news. This book proves an invaluable clue!",
  "npc.dedoras.you_brought_incredible_5": "You brought incredible news. This book proves an invaluable clue!",
  "npc.dedoras.this_is_incredible_6": "This is incredible! Thank you so much for digging out that hint!",
  "npc.dedoras.thank_you_so_7": "Thank you so much for your efforts to provide this valuable piece of the puzzle!",
  "npc.dedoras.talk_to_captain_8": "Talk to Captain Charles in Port Hope. He told me that he once ran ashore on a small island where he discovered a small ruin. The architecture was like nothing he had seen before.",
  "npc.dedoras.youre_still_searching_9": "You're still searching for informations.",
  "npc.dedoras.are_you_interested_10": "Are you interested in one or two addons to your battle mage outfit?",
  "npc.dedoras.very_good_you_11": "Very good! You gained the first addon to the battle mage outfit.",
  "npc.dedoras.very_good_you_12": "Very good! You gained the second addon to the battle mage outfit.",
  "npc.dedoras.i_provide_two_13": "I provide two addons. For the first one I need you to bring me five sturdy books. For the second addon you need twenty epaulettes. Do you want one of these addons?",
  "npc.dedoras.what_do_you_14": "What do you have for me: the sturdy books or the epaulettes?",
  "npc.denominator.ready_to_start_1": "Ready to {start}?",
  "npc.denominator.wrong_shut_down_2": "Wrong. SHUT DOWN.",
  "npc.denominator.correct_next_question_3": "Correct. {Next} question?",
  "npc.denominator.correct_next_question_4": "Correct. {Next} question?",
  "npc.denominator.wrong_shut_down_5": "Wrong. SHUT DOWN.",
  "npc.denominator.correct_last_question_6": "Correct. {Last} question?",
  "npc.denominator.wrong_shut_down_7": "Wrong. SHUT DOWN.",
  "npc.denominator.tell_me_the_8": "Tell me the correct number?",
  "npc.denominator.wrong_shut_down_9": "Wrong. SHUT DOWN.",
  "npc.denominator.correct_the_lower_10": "Correct. The lower door is now open. The druid of Crunor lies.",
  "npc.dermot.you_have_a_1": "You have a present for me?? Realy?",
  "npc.dermot.do_you_want_2": "Do you want to buy the dungeon key for 2000 gold?",
  "npc.dermot.thank_you_very_3": "Thank you very much!",
  "npc.dermot.here_it_is_4": "Here it is.",
  "npc.dermot.you_dont_have_5": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.dorian.have_you_finished_1": "Have you finished your mission?",
  "npc.dorian.have_you_finished_2": "Have you finished your mission?",
  "npc.dorian.have_you_finished_3": "Have you finished your mission?",
  "npc.dorian.have_you_finished_4": "Have you finished your mission?",
  "npc.dorian.have_you_finished_5": "Have you finished your mission?",
  "npc.dorian.have_you_finished_6": "Have you finished your mission?",
  "npc.dorian.have_you_finished_7": "Have you finished your mission?",
  "npc.dorian.have_you_finished_8": "Have you finished your mission?",
  "npc.dorian.what_a_fine_9": "What a fine material. That will be worth a coin or two. So far, so good. Ask me for another mission if you're ready for it.",
  "npc.dorian.what_an_ugly_10": "What an ugly vase. But who am I to question the taste of our customers? Anyway, I might have another mission in store for you.",
  "npc.dorian.excellent_that_serves_11": "Excellent, that serves this fool right. I fear in your next mission, you'll have to get your hands dirty. Just ask me to learn more about it.",
  "npc.dorian.that_goblet_is_12": "That goblet is hardly worth all this trouble but we had to insist on our payment. However, I assume you are eager for more missions, so just ask.",
  "npc.dorian.this_little_goldfish_13": "This little goldfish will bring us a hefty ransom! Just ask me if you're ready for another mission.",
  "npc.dorian.hm_well_we_14": "Hm. Well, we could use some fresh blood. Ahum. Do you want to join the thieves guild, |PLAYERNAME|?",
  "npc.dorian.yes_i_sell_15": "Yes, I sell lock picks. Ask me for a trade.",
  "npc.doubleday.very_nice_there_1": "Very nice, there you go! Just bring me the printout from the probe after deploying it! You can request a new probing {device} or a new {detector} if you lose it - but it takes some time for me to get a new one ready so be careful with that stuff.",
  "npc.doubleday.hey_lets_try_2": "Hey, let's try to be reasonable here, alright? That's a bit too much for what you did, isn't it? It may seem that way but the number of votes I can offer isn't limitless.",
  "npc.doubleday.good_you_just_3": "Good, you just gained 1 genuine votes in the magistrate!",
  "npc.doubleday.alright_there_you_4": "Alright, there you go - please, try to be more careful with my equipment next time!",
  "npc.doubleday.well_lets_see_5": "Well, let's see, you helped me 1 times before exchanging any votes - how many votes do you want me to give you in exchange?",
  "npc.doubleday.well_lets_see_6": "Well, let's see, you helped me 1 times before exchanging any votes - how many votes do you want me to give you in {exchange}?",
  "npc.doubleday.alright_then_thats_7": "Alright then, that's 2 vote(s) you want - I won't take them back, are you sure?",
  "npc.doubleday.alright_then_thats_8": "Alright then, that's 1 vote(s) you want - I won't take them back, are you sure?",
  "npc.doubleday.you_must_wait_9": "You must wait until the detector is ready again.",
  "npc.dove.oh_no_i_1": "Oh no! I knew that day would come! I am slightly above the allowed weight and if you can't supply me with some grapes to slim down I will get fired. Do you happen to have some grapes with you? ",
  "npc.dove.oh_thank_you_2": "Oh thank you! Thank you so much! So listen ... <whispers her measurements> ",
  "npc.dove.oh_you_dont_3": "Oh, you don't have it.",
  "npc.dukosch.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to purchase a weekly ticket for the ore wagons? With it you can travel freely and swiftly through Kazordoon for one week. 250 gold only. Deal?",
  "npc.dukosch.your_weekly_ticket_2": "Your weekly ticket is still valid. Would be a waste of money to purchase a second one",
  "npc.dukosch.here_is_your_3": "Here is your stamp. It can't be transferred to another person and will last one week from now. You'll get notified upon using an ore wagon when it isn't valid anymore.",
  "npc.dukosch.you_dont_have_4": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.duncan.youre_talking_about_1": "You're talking about my sabre? Well, even though you earned our trust, you'd have to fulfill a task first before you are granted to wear such a sabre.",
  "npc.duncan.i_need_a_2": "I need a new quality atlas for our captains. Only one of the best will do it. I heard the explorers society sells the best, but only to members of a certain rank. You will have to get this rank or ask a high ranking member to buy it for you.",
  "npc.duncan.did_you_get_3": "Did you get an atlas of the explorers society as I requested?",
  "npc.duncan.you_did_some_4": "You did some impressive things. I think people here start considering you as one of us. But these are dire times and everyone of us is expected to give his best and even exceed himself. Do you think you can handle that?",
  "npc.duncan.did_you_rescue_5": "Did you rescue one of those poor soon-to-be baby tortoises from Nargor?",
  "npc.duncan.are_you_up_6": "Are you up to the task which I'm going to give you and willing to prove you're worthy of wearing such a sabre?",
  "npc.duncan.have_you_gathered_7": "Have you gathered 100 eye patches?",
  "npc.duncan.have_you_gathered_8": "Have you gathered 100 peg legs?",
  "npc.duncan.have_you_gathered_9": "Have you gathered 100 hooks?",
  "npc.duncan.good_come_back_10": "Good! Come back to me once you have gathered 100 eye patches.",
  "npc.duncan.good_job_alright_11": "Good job. Alright, now bring me 100 peg legs.",
  "npc.duncan.you_dont_have_12": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.duncan.nice_lastly_bring_13": "Nice. Lastly, bring me 100 pirate hooks. That should be enough to earn your sabre.",
  "npc.duncan.you_dont_have_14": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.duncan.i_see_i_15": "I see, I see. Well done. Go to Morgan and tell him this codeword: 'firebird'. He'll know what to do.",
  "npc.duncan.you_dont_have_16": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.duncan.indeed_what_a_17": "Indeed, what a fine work... the book I mean. Your work was acceptable all in all.",
  "npc.duncan.you_dont_have_18": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.duncan.a_real_tortoise_19": "A real tortoise egg ... I guess you are more accustomed to rescue some noblewoman in distress but you did something goodtoday.",
  "npc.duncan.you_dont_have_20": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.elane.oh_my_winged_1": "Oh, my winged tiara? Those are traditionally awarded after having completed a difficult {task} for our guild, only to female aspirants though. Male warriors will receive a hooded cloak.",
  "npc.elane.so_you_are_2": "So you are saying that you would like to prove that you deserve to wear such a hooded cloak?",
  "npc.elane.im_so_excited_3": "I'm so excited! Have you really found my crossbow?",
  "npc.elane.did_you_bring_4": "Did you bring me 100 pieces of lizard leather and 100 pieces of red dragon leather?",
  "npc.elane.were_you_able_5": "Were you able to get hold of 5 enchanted chicken wings?",
  "npc.elane.ah_have_you_6": "Ah, have you brought one piece of royal steel, draconian steel and hell steel each?",
  "npc.elane.thats_the_spirit_7": "That's the spirit! I hope you will find my crossbow, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  "npc.elane.yeah_i_could_8": "Yeah! I could kiss you right here and there! Besides, you're a handsome one. <giggles> Please bring me 100 pieces of lizard leather and 100 pieces of red dragon leather now!",
  "npc.elane.you_dont_have_9": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.elane.good_work_playername_10": "Good work, |PLAYERNAME|! That is enough leather for a lot of sturdy quivers. Now, please bring me 5 enchanted chicken wings.",
  "npc.elane.you_dont_have_11": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.elane.great_now_we_12": "Great! Now we can create a few more Tiaras. If only they weren't that expensive... Well anyway, please obtain one piece of royal steel, draconian steel and hell steel each.",
  "npc.elane.you_dont_have_13": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.elane.wow_im_impressed_14": "Wow, I'm impressed, |PLAYERNAME|. Your really are a valuable member of our paladin guild. I shall grant you your reward now. Wear it proudly!",
  "npc.elane.you_dont_have_15": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.elathriel.here_it_is_1": "Here it is.",
  "npc.elathriel.come_back_when_2": "Come back when you have enough money.",
  "npc.elathriel.believe_me_its_3": "Believe me, it's better for you that way.",
  "npc.eleonore.oh_my_beloved_1": "Oh, my beloved ring! Have you found it and want to return it to me?",
  "npc.eleonore.i_would_need_2": "I would need some help in another matter. It is only a small errand. Are you interested?",
  "npc.eleonore.great_thank_you_3": "Great, thank you! As promised, here are your 5 gold pieces. Is there ... anything left that you might want to discuss with me?",
  "npc.eleonore.you_have_returned_4": "You have returned my ring and proven yourself as trustworthy. There is something I have to discuss with you. Are you willing to listen?",
  "npc.eleonore.blushes_oh_he_5": "<blushes> Oh, he is so wonderful. A very special man with a special place in my heart.",
  "npc.eleonore.i_cant_thank_6": "I can't thank you enough for freeing my beloved Ray from that evil spell. I am still shocked that a mermaid could steal his love that easily.",
  "npc.eleonore.oh_thank_you_7": "Oh, thank you so much! Take this gold as a reward. ... which reminds me, I would need some help in another matter. It is only a small errand. Are you interested?",
  "npc.eleonore.thank_you_it_8": "Thank you! It is not a difficult matter but a rather urgent one. I need to send some money to a person in town. Would you be willing to run this small errand for me?",
  "npc.eleonore.i_was_hoping_9": "I was hoping that you'd agree. Please deliver these 200 gold pieces to the herbalist Charlotta in the south-western part of the town. If you return from this errand, I will grant you 5 gold pieces as reward for your efforts.",
  "npc.elliott.im_glad_to_1": "I'm glad to see you back alive and healthy. Did you find anything interesting that you want to {report}?",
  "npc.elliott.the_sewers_need_2": "The sewers need repair. You in?",
  "npc.elliott.elliotts_keeps_calling_3": "Elliott's keeps calling it that. It's just another job! You fixed some broken pipes and stuff? Let me check, {ok}?",
  "npc.elliott.good_broken_pipe_4": "Good. Broken pipe and generator pieces, there's smoke evading. That's how you recognise them. See how you can fix them using your hands. Need about, oh, twenty of them at least repaired. Report to me or Jacob",
  "npc.elliott.good_thanks_man_5": "Good. Thanks, man. That's one vote you got for helping us with this. If you want to redo this task just say {abandoned sewers} to repeat it.",
  "npc.elliott.you_already_reported_6": "You already reported this mission, go to the next.",
  "npc.elvith.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to buy a poem scroll for 200 gold?",
  "npc.elvith.you_dont_have_2": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.elvith.here_it_is_3": "Here it is.",
  "npc.elyen_ravenlock.hello_brother_you_1": "Hello, brother. You come with a question to me, I believe?",
  "npc.elyen_ravenlock.and_what_is_2": "And what is it you want? Do you bring news from the undead, or do you seek a dark {artefact}?",
  "npc.elyen_ravenlock.hello_brother_you_3": "Hello, brother. You have finished the dance?",
  "npc.elyen_ravenlock.time_is_money_4": "Time is money, hurry.",
  "npc.emael.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to appropriately show off your boss trophies and buy an additional podium of vigour for 1000000 Gold?",
  "npc.emael.ah_i_see_2": "Ah, I see you killed a lot of dangerous creatures. Here's your podium of vigour!",
  "npc.emael.please_make_sure_3": "Please make sure you have free slots in your store inbox.",
  "npc.emael.you_dont_have_4": "You don'\t have enough money.",
  "npc.emael.you_have_not_5": "You have not aquired enough knowledge in hunting big scary creatures.",
  "npc.emael.blessings_on_your_6": "Blessings on your hunts!",
  "npc.emma.i_am_still_1": "I am still a bit sceptical, but well, welcome to the girls brigade.",
  "npc.emma.how_unnecessarily_complic_2": "How unnecessarily complicated, but that's the way those Thaians are. In the end we got what we wanted and they can't do anything about it.",
  "npc.emma.bring_me_the_3": "Bring me the spellbook.",
  "npc.emma.i_think_the_4": "I think the druids will be pleased to hear that the immediate threat has been averted.",
  "npc.emma.bring_me_the_5": "Bring me the heart as proof.",
  "npc.emma.great_this_blow_6": "Great! This blow strikes them where it hurts most: profit.",
  "npc.emma.i_hope_our_7": "I hope our craftsmen can do something with this stuff. For me it makes hardly any sense.",
  "npc.emma.you_need_to_8": "You need to bring me those plans!",
  "npc.emma.i_will_have_9": "I will have this correspondence examined by our specialists. I am sure they are quite revealing.",
  "npc.emma.bring_me_back_10": "Bring me back some hints or something!",
  "npc.emma.i_hope_this_11": "I hope this old book will do those researches any good. Personally I see little use to proof some bloodlines after we cut all ties to Thais.",
  "npc.emma.you_need_to_12": "You need to bring us that book of family trees!",
  "npc.emma.please_bring_me_13": "Please bring me proof of the mad technomancers defeat!",
  "npc.emma.as_you_wish_14": "As you wish.",
  "npc.emma.a_man_in_15": "A man in the girls brigade? Come on this is hilarious, this is outright stupid, this is ... exactly what no one would expect. Mhm, on second thought the element of surprise might offset your male inferiority.",
  "npc.emma.dont_try_to_16": "Don't try to fool me. We are perfectly aware to whom you are loyal.",
  "npc.emma.have_you_been_17": "Have you been successful?",
  "npc.emma.have_you_been_18": "Have you been successful?",
  "npc.emma.have_you_been_19": "Have you been successful?",
  "npc.emma.have_you_been_20": "Have you been successful?",
  "npc.emma.have_you_been_21": "Have you been successful?",
  "npc.emma.have_you_been_22": "Have you been successful?",
  "npc.emma.have_you_been_23": "Have you been successful?",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.in_exchange_for_1": "In exchange for a truly generous donation, I will offer a special outfit. Do you want to make a donation?",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.in_that_case_2": "In that case, return to me once you made up your mind.",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.take_this_armor_3": "Take this armor as a token of great gratitude. Let us forever remember this day, my friend!",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.please_make_sure_4": "Please make sure you have free slots in your store inbox.",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.you_do_not_5": "You do not have enough money to donate that amount.",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.you_alread_have_6": "You alread have that addon.",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.take_this_helmet_7": "Take this helmet as a token of great gratitude. Let us forever remember this day, my friend. ",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.you_do_not_8": "You do not have enough money to donate that amount.",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.you_alread_have_9": "You alread have that outfit.",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.you_need_to_10": "You need to donate {armor} outfit first.",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.take_this_boots_11": "Take this boots as a token of great gratitude. Let us forever remember this day, my friend. ",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.you_do_not_12": "You do not have enough money to donate that amount.",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.you_alread_have_13": "You alread have that outfit.",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.you_need_to_14": "You need to donate {helmet} addon first.",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.so_you_wold_15": "So you wold like to donate 500.000.000 gold pieces which in return will entitle you to wear a unique armor?",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.so_you_would_16": "So you would like to donate 250.000.000 gold pieces which in return will entitle you to wear unique helmet?",
  "npc.emperor_kruzak.so_you_would_17": "So you would like to donate 250.000.000 gold pieces which in return will entitle you to wear a unique boots?",
  "npc.emperor_rehal.may_fire_and_1": "May Fire and Earth bless you, stranger. What leads you to Beregar, the dwarven city?",
  "npc.emperor_rehal.i_always_liked_2": "I always liked him and I still can't believe that he really stole that ring.",
  "npc.emperor_rehal.interesting_the_fact_3": "Interesting. The fact that you have the ring means that Nokmir can't have stolen it. Combined with the information Grombur gave you, the case appears in a completely different light. ...",
  "npc.emperor_rehal.let_there_be_4": "Let there be justice for all. Nokmir is innocent and acquitted from all charges! And Rerun... I want him in prison for this malicious act!",
  "npc.emperor_rehal.hes_very_ambitious_5": "He's very ambitious and always volunteers for the long shifts.",
  "npc.emperor_rehal.as_you_have_6": "As you have proven yourself trustworthy I'm going to assign you a special mission. Are you interested?",
  "npc.emperor_rehal.my_son_was_7": "My son was captured by trolls? Doesn't sound like him, but if you say so. Now you want a reward, huh? ...",
  "npc.emperor_rehal.look_at_these_8": "Look at these dwarven legs. They were forged years ago by a dwarf who was rather tall for our kind. I want you to have them. Thank you for rescuing my son |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.emperor_rehal.alright_then_come_9": "Alright then, come back when you are ready.",
  "npc.erayo.vescu_gave_you_1": "Vescu gave you an assassin outfit? Haha. Noticed it lacks the head piece? You look a bit silly. Want my old head piece?",
  "npc.erayo.good_start_with_2": "Good. Start with the blue cloth. I'll wait.",
  "npc.erayo.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have the required items.",
  "npc.erayo.maybe_another_time_4": "Maybe another time.",
  "npc.eremo.a_letter_from_1": "A letter from that youngster Morgan? I believed him dead since years. These news are good news indeed. Thank you very much, my friend.",
  "npc.eroth.have_you_ever_1": "Have you ever heard of Elvenbane? It is the castle west of Ab'Dendriel which is inhabited by villains from all over the continent. Any support in this war is welcome. Are you willing to help?",
  "npc.eroth.i_heard_the_2": "I heard the blow! The reflection must have caused a overcharge of magical energy leading to the contraction and the implosion. Just like I hoped! Please take this as a reward. Thank you very much.",
  "npc.eruaran.you_can_try_1": "You can try to create {sword}s, {axe}s, {club}s, {bow}s, {crossbow}s and {spellbook}s.",
  "npc.eruaran.the_raw_object_2": "The raw object is nothing but a pale of shadow of its potential. As unsafe and unpredictable the imporvement is, it might boot the powers of your item immensely. You can try to improve {sword}s, {axe}s, {club}s, {bow}s, {crossbow}s and {spellbook}s.",
  "npc.eruaran.from_time_to_3": "From time to time fate smiles upon those who take great risks and have strong dreams! If you have the {ingredients}, we can try to give the ultimate refinement to {sword}s, {axe}s, {club}s, {bow}s, {crossbow}s and {spellbook}s.",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_4": "Do you want to create a crude umbral {blade} or crude umbral {slayer}?",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_5": "Do you want to improve a crude umbral {blade} or crude umbral {slayer}?",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_6": "Do you want to transform an umbral {blade} or umbral {slayer}?",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_7": "Do you want to spend ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_8": "Do you want to spend your crude umbral ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_9": "Do you want to spend your umbral ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_10": "Do you want to create a crude umbral {axe} or crude umbral {chopper}?",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_11": "Do you want to improve a crude umbral {axe} or crude umbral {chopper}?",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_12": "Do you want to transform an umbral {axe} or umbral {chopper}?",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_13": "Do you want to spend your dream matter with those 25 clusters of {solace} and give a shot. {Yes} or {no}",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_14": "Do you want to spend your crude umbral ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_15": "Do you want to spend your umbral ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_16": "Do you want to create a crude umbral {mace} or crude umbral {hammer}?",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_17": "Do you want to improve a crude umbral {mace} or crude umbral {hammer}?",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_18": "Do you want to transform an umbral {mace} or umbral {hammer}?",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_19": "Do you want to spend your dream matter with ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_20": "Do you want to spend your crude umbral ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_21": "Do you want to spend your umbral ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_22": "Do you want to spend your dream matter with ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_23": "Do you want to spend your crude umbral bow with ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_24": "Do you want to spend your umbral bow with ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_25": "Do you want to spend your dream matter with ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_26": "Do you want to spend your crude umbral crossbow with ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_27": "Do you want to spend your umbral crossbow with ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_28": "Do you want to spend your dream matter with ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_29": "Do you want to spend your crude umbral spellbook with ",
  "npc.eruaran.do_you_want_30": "Do you want to spend your umbral spellbook with ",
  "npc.eruaran.your_dreams_are_31": "Your dreams are strong, the creation was successful. Take your ",
  "npc.eruaran.something_weird_happened_32": "Something weird happened! You should contact a gamemaster.",
  "npc.eruaran.oh_no_the_33": "Oh no! The process failed.",
  "npc.eruaran.sorry_you_dont_34": "Sorry, you don't have the required ingredients.",
  "npc.eruaran.your_dreams_are_35": "Your dreams are strong, the improvement was successful. Take your ",
  "npc.eruaran.oh_no_the_36": "Oh no! The process failed.",
  "npc.eruaran.you_do_not_37": "You do not have ",
  "npc.eruaran.something_weird_happened_38": "Something weird happened! You should contact a gamemaster.",
  "npc.eruaran.your_dreams_are_39": "Your dreams are strong, the transforming was successful. Take your ",
  "npc.eruaran.oh_no_the_40": "Oh no! The process failed.",
  "npc.eruaran.you_do_not_41": "You do not have ",
  "npc.eruaran.something_weird_happened_42": "Something weird happened! You should contact a gamemaster.",
  "npc.eshaya.very_good_but_1": "Very good. But now you need the Ring of Secret Thoughts back in order to extract the Ambassador's memories.",
  "npc.eshaya.you_found_the_2": "You found the Ring of Secret Thoughts! Well done! Now give it to the Ambassador as a present. He's a peacock and will accept such a precious gift for sure. As soon as he wears it, his memories will be stored in the ring.",
  "npc.eshaya.im_willing_to_3": "I'm willing to admit that I need help. And the help of someone who is not from {Issavi} at that. But the task could be dangerous and you would become embroiled in the politics and court intrigues of {Kilmaresh}. Will you help me anyhow?",
  "npc.eshaya.this_is_the_4": "This is the proof we need! Very well done! You have to report this to our {Empress}. She will grant you an audience now.",
  "npc.eshaya.you_havent_completed_5": "You haven't completed your mission yet. Keep searching!",
  "npc.eshaya.i_dont_know_6": "I don't know whether you are experienced in such things. If not, you could ask somebody who is. But I'm not sure where in Issavi you should look to hire a thief.",
  "npc.eshaya.i_guess_claiming_7": "I guess claiming back a present would be a bit suspicious. You'll have to find another way. I resent thinking about theft but sometimes, desperate times call for desperate measures.",
  "npc.eshaya.you_got_the_8": "You got the ring back? Very well done! Now search for the memories that will prove the Ambassador's treason. I don't know much about ancient artefacts but you could ask the librarian in the palace. I'm sure he knows something helpful.",
  "npc.eshaya.good_luck_on_9": "Good luck on your audience with the Empress. May Kilmaresh prosper.",
  "npc.eustacio.i_am_eustacio_1": "I am Eustacio. At your service.",
  "npc.eustacio.its_just_the_2": "It's just the time to make a fortune.",
  "npc.eustacio.i_am_an_3": " I am an aspiring businessman, who thrives to climb the ladder of success in the Venorean society.",
  "npc.ezebeth.well_there_is_1": "Well, there is little where we need help beyond the normal tasks you can do for the city. However, there is one thing out of the ordinary where some {assistance} would be appreciated.",
  "npc.ezebeth.you_already_asked_2": "You already asked for a mission, go to the next.",
  "npc.ezebeth.its_nothing_really_3": "It's nothing really important, so no one has yet found the time to look it up. It concerns the town's beggars that have started to behave {strange} lately.",
  "npc.ezebeth.they_usually_know_4": "They usually know better than to show up in the streets and harass our citizens, but lately they've grown more bold or desperate or whatever. I ask you to investigate what they are up to. If necessary, you may scare them away a bit.",
  "npc.ezebeth.nice_work_take_5": "Nice work, take your outfit.",
  "npc.ezebeth.you_already_have_6": "You already have the outfit.",
  "npc.ezebeth.receive_the_second_7": "Receive the second addon.",
  "npc.ezebeth.receive_the_first_8": "Receive the first addon.",
  "npc.fa_hradin.whoa_a_human_1": "Whoa! A human! This is no place for you, |PLAYERNAME|. Go and play somewhere else.",
  "npc.fa_hradin.aaaah_what_have_2": "Aaaah... what have we here. A human - interesting. And such an ugly specimen, too... All right, human |PLAYERNAME|. How can I help you?",
  "npc.fa_hradin.looking_for_work_3": "Looking for work, are you? Well, it's very tempting, you know, but I'm afraid we do not really employ beginners. Perhaps our cook could need a helping hand in the kitchen.",
  "npc.fa_hradin.did_you_already_4": "Did you already retrieve the spyreport?",
  "npc.fa_hradin.did_you_already_5": "Did you already talk to Gabel about the report? I think he will have further instructions for you.",
  "npc.faloriel.so_the_librarian_1": "So, the Librarian sent you. Well, yes, I have a vial of the hallucinogen you need. I'll give it to you for 1000 gold. Do you agree?",
  "npc.faloriel.i_dont_have_2": "I don't have anything to offer you regarding a ring.",
  "npc.faloriel.great_here_take_3": "Great. Here, take it.",
  "npc.faloriel.you_do_not_4": "You do not have enough money.",
  "npc.farhilorn_of_the_winter_court.we_allow_able_1": "We allow able champions of all races to fight for our cause against the challenges of the {arena}. So are you interested? I'm not interested in fancy'wordplay, so a simple {yes} or {no} will suffice!",
  "npc.farhilorn_of_the_winter_court.you_are_now_2": "You are now able to enter the teleport.",
  "npc.farhilorn_of_the_winter_court.as_you_wish_3": "As you wish.",
  "npc.farhilorn_of_the_winter_court.this_place_has_4": "This place has always been a site where the champions of summer and winter have clashed in battle. Over the centuries this spectacle has drawn many creatures here to watch, participate and indulge in less savory activities.",
  "npc.fenech.so_you_ask_1": "So you ask me for a {",
  "npc.fenech.what_i_have_2": "What? I have already gave you one {",
  "npc.fenech.sorry_you_arent_3": "Sorry, you aren't a druid either a sorcerer.",
  "npc.fenech.here_you_are_4": "Here you are young adept, take care yourself.",
  "npc.fenech.of_course_just_5": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.flickering_soul.it_has_been_1": "It has been a while since I roamed the world of the living in a mortal shell.",
  "npc.flickering_soul.i_had_many_2": "I had many names in my live. The one that would be the most recognizable is probably the name Goshnar. Even that was an assumed name that I took when I left my mundane past behind.",
  "npc.flickering_soul.everything_in_my_3": "Everything in my life was just a tool to further my goals. The brotherhood of bones was just a tool for me. As was everyone or everything. In the path I had chosen nothing mattered but me and my ambitions.",
  "npc.flickering_soul.necromancy_was_a_4": "Necromancy was a passion at first, another tool while I amassed power and a crutch when my ambitions surpassed that what it could accomplish.",
  "npc.flickering_soul.my_demise_did_5": "My demise did not meet me unprepared. As a powerful necromancer I had fettered my soul in the living world and the realms beyond. I had prepared for my return and was confident in my power.",
  "npc.flickering_soul.my_soul_wandered_6": "My soul wandered the plains of Zarganash, waiting for my wards to power up. Waiting for my soul to be slowly pulled back and manifest in the world of the living once again. What I had not taken into consideration was peace.",
  "npc.flickering_soul.i_recognized_the_7": "I recognized the extent of my folly and failure. I decided not to return to the world of the living.",
  "npc.flickering_soul.the_only_way_8": "The only way I can get rid of them is to disperse them, to 'kill' them so to say. But they are tainted parts of myself and even going near them might endanger my sanity and stability. So all I can do is to ask you to do this daunting task.",
  "npc.flickering_soul.im_aware_i_9": "I'm aware I have no right to ask and I have little to offer as a payment, but I ask you nonetheless. Will you face my fettered vices and destroy them for me?",
  "npc.flickering_soul.thank_you_for_10": "Thank you for accepting this burden.",
  "npc.flickering_soul.you_havent_killed_11": "You haven't killed Malice yet. You haven't killed Hatred yet. You haven't killed Spite yet. You haven't killed Cruelty yet. You haven't killed Greed yet.",
  "npc.flickering_soul.my_daughter_was_12": "My daughter was as ambitious as me, yet she lacked my intellect and my raw talent. She still was great and talented yet I sadly let her feel my disdain. One of the many errors that my way of hubris made me do.",
  "npc.flickering_soul.im_not_aware_13": " I'm not aware of the fate of my linage. Neither I'm able to relate to the mortal world in that way. Each of us is an individual, not bound by ties of blood or herritage.",
  "npc.flickering_soul.his_avatar_might_14": "His avatar might be destroyed for now and it'd grip on Zarganash considerably weakened. Yet he burrowed to deep into the essence of this realm to be annihilated this easy.",
  "npc.flickering_soul.i_despised_my_15": "I despised my followers for their petty agendas and for their limited vision of my own goals and personality.",
  "npc.flickering_soul.i_have_cleansed_16": "I have cleansed you from the taints that you carried with you. You are now free from the burden that you should not have to bear.",
  "npc.flickering_soul.you_are_not_17": "You are not tainted by the darkness of the world. You are pure and free from the burdens that others carry.",
  "npc.flora.do_you_really_1": "Do you really want to enter the Glooth Fairy's hideout. There is no chickening out and I also have to charge one voting right! {Yes} or {no}?",
  "npc.flora.here_you_go_2": "Here you go!",
  "npc.frafnar.there_is_indeed_1": "There is indeed something you could do for me. You must know, I'm in love with Bolfana. I'm sure she'd have a beer with me if I got her a chocolate cake. Problem is that I can't leave this door as I'm on duty. Would you be so kind and help me?",
  "npc.frafnar.so_did_you_2": "So did you tell her that the cake came from me?",
  "npc.frafnar.great_she_works_3": "Great! She works in the tavern of Beregar. It's situated in the western part of the city. Bring her a chocolate cake and tell her that it was me who sent it.",
  "npc.frafnar.i_hope_your_4": "I hope your kidding 'cause I'll find out WHAT you've told her and I can get reeeeaaaalllly angry. I grant you access to the western part of the mine.....for NOW.",
  "npc.frans.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.frederik.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.freezhild.crate_of_weapons_1": "Crate of weapons you say.. for me?",
  "npc.freezhild.im_wondering_why_2": "I'm wondering why you are doing this. Well, we accept the gift. Don't think that this makes you a friend though.",
  "npc.freezhild.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have any crate of weapons!",
  "npc.frosty.you_already_have_1": "You already have this sleigh!",
  "npc.frosty.nasty_creatures_especiall_2": "Nasty creatures especially their queen that sits frozzen on her throne beneath this island.",
  "npc.frosty.here_you_are_3": "Here you are.",
  "npc.frosty.you_do_not_4": "You do not have needed items!",
  "npc.frosty.i_can_give_5": "I can give you one of the following sleighs: {",
  "npc.frosty.just_tell_me_6": "Just tell me which {sleigh} you want to know more about.",
  "npc.frosty.come_back_when_7": "Come back when you get these items.",
  "npc.gabel.whoa_a_human_1": "Whoa! A human! This is no place for you, |PLAYERNAME|. Go and play somewhere else.",
  "npc.gabel.welcome_human_playername_2": "Welcome, human |PLAYERNAME|, to our humble abode.",
  "npc.gabel.you_havent_finished_3": "You haven't finished your final mission yet. Shall I explain it again to you?",
  "npc.gabel.have_you_found_4": "Have you found Fa'hradin's lamp and placed it in Malor's personal chambers?",
  "npc.gabel.theres_no_mission_5": "There's no mission left for you, friend of the Marid. However, I have a task for you.",
  "npc.gabel.as_you_wish_6": "As you wish.",
  "npc.gabel.dont_give_up_7": "Don't give up! May Daraman watch over you!",
  "npc.gabel.come_back_when_8": "Come back when you kill 500 green djinns or Efreet.",
  "npc.gabel.all_right_may_9": "All right. May Daraman bless your hunt, human.",
  "npc.gail.i_always_feared_1": "I always feared that I lost her. And yet, all those years, I still had a gleam of hope. I'm devastated to learn about her fate - but at least I have certainty now. Thank you for telling me.",
  "npc.gamel.i_dont_like_1": "I don't like the way you look. Help me boys!",
  "npc.gamel.you_have_a_2": "You have a letter for me?",
  "npc.gamel.oh_well_i_3": "Oh well. I guess I am still on the hook. Tell your 'uncle' I will proceed as he suggested.",
  "npc.gamel.you_dont_have_4": "You don't have any letter!",
  "npc.gareth.if_you_like_1": "If you like to, you can pay some gold to become a patron of the arts for this wonderful museum. The price is 10,000 gold. Your personal gain will be priceless. Do you want to {pay}?",
  "npc.gareth.you_dont_have_2": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.gareth.they_want_us_3": "They want us to buy the picture back. Unfortunately this artefact is so important that I don't see an alternative. Please got to Iwar in Kazordoon and pay the money.",
  "npc.gareth.so_the_rumours_4": "So the rumours are true. How could this happen? I'll keep the picture at its place until we've got a replacement. Please fo to {Angelo} and ask him if he has a new artefact for our museum.",
  "npc.gareth.you_didnt_investigate_5": "You didn't investigate the pictures yet. Do your job and then come back.",
  "npc.gareth.it_is_planned_6": "It is planned to extend the MOTA. But this will take time, because our workers have faced a little {problem}.",
  "npc.gareth.you_are_a_7": "You are a true patron of the arts! I have opened the construction site for you. Start your work right now!",
  "npc.gate_guardian.you_want_entranzzze_1": "You want entranzzze to zzze zzzity?",
  "npc.gate_guardian.mh_zzzezzze_paperzzz_2": "Mh, zzzezzze paperzzz zzzeem legit, I have orderzzz to let you pazzz. Zzzo be it.",
  "npc.gelidrazahs_thirst.so_i_ask_1": "So I ask you: What is the name of the princess who fell in love with a Thaian nobleman during the regency of pharaoh Uthemath?",
  "npc.gelidrazahs_thirst.thats_right_listen_2": "That's right. Listen to the second question: Who is the author of the book ,The Language of the Wolves'?",
  "npc.gelidrazahs_thirst.thats_right_listen_3": "That's right. Listen to the third question: Which ancient Tibian race reportedly travelled the sky in cloud ships?",
  "npc.gelidrazahs_thirst.that_is_correct_4": "That is correct. You satisfactorily answered all questions. You may pass and enter Gelidrazah's lair.",
  "npc.gelidrazahs_thirst.i_dont_know_5": "I don't know what you are talking about.",
  "npc.gerimor.you_have_already_1": "You have already fulfilled your job to my full satisfaction. The cults are investigated and the final boss is eliminated. I have nothing more for you to do. Fare you well!",
  "npc.gerimor.you_already_done_2": "You already done this mission.",
  "npc.gerimor.very_nice_come_3": "Very nice! Come back if you have found what's going on in this cult.",
  "npc.gerimor.you_have_not_4": "You have not finished your work yet. Come back when you're done.",
  "npc.gerimor.heres_your_reward_5": "Here's your reward. Thank you and farewell!",
  "npc.gerimor.what_a_pitty_6": "What a pitty! You can come back, when ever you want, if you have changed your opinion.",
  "npc.gewen.your_weekly_ticket_1": "Your weekly ticket is still valid. Would be a waste of money to purchase a second one",
  "npc.gewen.do_you_want_2": "Do you want to purchase a weekly ticket for the ore wagons? With it you can travel freely and swiftly through Kazordoon for one week. 250 gold only. Deal?",
  "npc.gewen.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.gewen.here_is_your_4": "Here is your stamp. It can't be transferred to another person and will last one week from now. You'll get notified upon using an ore wagon when it isn't valid anymore.",
  "npc.ghorza.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.ghostly_wolf.i_guess_i_1": "I guess I will stick around for a time to watch over the grave. After this final watch I will find peace, I can feel this. Thank you, human being. You redeemed me.",
  "npc.ghostly_wolf.i_guess_i_2": "I guess I will stick around for a time to watch over the grave. After this final watch I will find peace, I can feel this. Thank you, human being. You redeemed me.",
  "npc.ghostly_wolf.you_are_not_3": "You are not on that mission.",
  "npc.ghost_of_a_priest.so_be_it_1": "So be it! Here is my part of the sceptre. Combine it with the other parts on the altar of the Great Snake in the depths of this temple.",
  "npc.ghost_of_a_priest.so_be_it_2": "So be it! Here is my part of the sceptre. Combine it with the other parts on the altar of the Great Snake in the depths of this temple.",
  "npc.ghost_of_a_priest.so_be_it_3": "So be it! Here is my part of the sceptre. Combine it with the other parts on the altar of the Great Snake in the depths of this temple.",
  "npc.ghost_of_a_priest.no_deal_then_4": "No deal then.",
  "npc.gnomad.im_the_gnomish_1": "I'm the gnomish tactical advisor for this area!",
  "npc.gnomad.ah_you_are_2": "Ah you are amazed by our crystals, aren't you? Well, you have only seen a tiny fraction of what they are able to do.",
  "npc.gnomad.in_the_last_3": "In the last century mushrooms have become more and more important for producing raw materials and tools and less important for sustenance.",
  "npc.gnomad.we_gnomes_are_4": "We gnomes are masters of growing and working crystals and we also mastered the raising of a variety of mushrooms for different purposes.",
  "npc.gnomadness.i_can_change_1": "I can change your hazard level to spice up your hunt in the gardens. Your current level is set to ",
  "npc.gnomadness.im_sorry_i_2": "I'm sorry, I don't understand. What hazard level would you like to set?",
  "npc.gnomadness.your_hazard_level_3": "Your hazard level has been set to ",
  "npc.gnomadness.youve_achieved_the_4": "You've achieved the necessary hazard level. As a reward, you've received the Noxious Ripptor mount and a primal bag.",
  "npc.gnomadness.you_cant_set_5": "You can't set your hazard level higher than your maximum unlocked level.",
  "npc.gnomally.our_relations_improve_1": "Our relations improve with every mission you undertake on our behalf. Another way to improve your relations with us gnomes is to trade in minor crystal tokens. ...",
  "npc.gnomally.your_renown_amongst_2": "Your renown amongst us gnomes is currently {",
  "npc.gnomally.you_are_not_3": "You are not even a recruit of the Bigfoots. Sorry I can't help you.",
  "npc.gnomally.do_you_really_4": "Do you really want to trade ",
  "npc.gnomally.do_you_need_5": "Do you need to buy any mission items?",
  "npc.gnomally.sorry_you_dont_6": "Sorry, you don't have enough ",
  "npc.gnomally.first_make_sure_7": "First make sure you have enough capacity to hold it.",
  "npc.gnomally.first_make_sure_8": "First make sure you have enough space in your inventory.",
  "npc.gnomally.here_have_one_9": "Here have one of our ",
  "npc.gnomally.how_many_tokens_10": "How many tokens do you want to trade?",
  "npc.gnomally.as_you_wish_11": "As you wish! Your new renown is {",
  "npc.gnomally.you_dont_have_12": "You don't have these many tokens.",
  "npc.gnomally.let_us_see_13": "Let us see if I have what you need.",
  "npc.gnomally.as_you_like_14": "As you like.",
  "npc.gnomargery.im_the_officer_1": "I'm the officer responsible for this area. I give out missions, accept mission reports and oversee our defences.",
  "npc.gnomargery.its_good_to_2": "It's good to be a gnome for sure!",
  "npc.gnomargery.now_thats_gnomish_3": "Now that's gnomish ingenuity given shape! Who but a gnome would come up with such a plan to defeat our enemies. ",
  "npc.gnomargery.sorry_but_no_4": "Sorry, but no! Your expertise could be put to better use elsewhere. You are desperately needed in the upper levels of the Spike. Report there immediately. ",
  "npc.gnomargery.i_can_offer_5": "I can offer you several missions: to {deliver} parcels to our boys and girls in the battlefield, to get reports from our {undercover} gnomes, to do some {temperature} measuring and to {kill} some drillworms.",
  "npc.gnomargery.what_mission_do_6": " What mission do you want to report about: the {delivery} of parcels, the {undercover} reports, the {temperature} measuring or {kill} of drillworms?",
  "npc.gnomargery.you_have_not_7": "You have not started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomargery.you_have_done_8": "You have done well. Here, take your reward.",
  "npc.gnomargery.gnowful_deliver_the_9": "Gnowful! Deliver the four parcels to some of our far away outposts in the caverns.",
  "npc.gnomargery.you_have_not_10": "You have not started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomargery.you_have_done_11": "You have done well. Here, take your reward.",
  "npc.gnomargery.gnowful_get_three_12": "Gnowful! Get three reports from our undercover agents posing as monsters in the caves around us.",
  "npc.gnomargery.you_have_not_13": "You have not started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomargery.you_have_done_14": "You have done well. Here, take your reward.",
  "npc.gnomargery.gnowful_use_the_15": "Gnowful! Use the gnomish temperature measurement device to locate the hottest spot at the lava pools in the cave.",
  "npc.gnomargery.you_have_not_16": "You have not started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomargery.you_have_done_17": "You have done well. Here, take your reward.",
  "npc.gnomargery.gnowful_just_go_18": "Gnowful! Just go out to the caves and kill at least seven drillworms.",
  "npc.gnomargery.thats_not_a_19": "That's not a valid mission name.",
  "npc.gnomargery.sorry_you_have_20": "Sorry, you have to wait ",
  "npc.gnomargery.sorry_you_are_21": "Sorry, you are not on the required minimum level [",
  "npc.gnomargery.we_need_someone_22": "We need someone to bring four parcels to some of our far away outposts in the caverns. If you are interested, I can give you some more {information} about it. Are you willing to accept this mission?",
  "npc.gnomargery.you_have_already_23": "You have already started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomargery.sorry_you_have_24": "Sorry, you have to wait ",
  "npc.gnomargery.sorry_you_are_25": "Sorry, you are not on the required minimum level [",
  "npc.gnomargery.someone_is_needed_26": "Someone is needed to get three reports from our undercover agents posing as monsters in the caves around us. If you are interested, I can give you some more {information} about it. Are you willing to accept this mission?",
  "npc.gnomargery.you_have_already_27": "You have already started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomargery.gnometastic_get_three_28": "Gnometastic! Get three reports from our agents. You can find them anywhere in the caves around us. Just keep looking for monsters that behave strangely and give you a wink.",
  "npc.gnomargery.sorry_you_have_29": "Sorry, you have to wait ",
  "npc.gnomargery.sorry_you_are_30": "Sorry, you are not on the required minimum level [",
  "npc.gnomargery.your_task_would_31": "Your task would be to use a gnomish temperature measurement device - short GTMD - to locate the hottest spot at the lava pools in the caves. If you are interested, I can give you some more information about it. Are you willing to accept this mission?",
  "npc.gnomargery.you_have_already_32": "You have already started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomargery.gnometastic_find_the_33": "Gnometastic! Find the hottest spot of the lava pools in the caves. If you lose the GTMD before you find the hot spot, you'll have to get yourself a new one. Gnomux sells all the equipment that is required for our missions.",
  "npc.gnomargery.sorry_you_have_34": "Sorry, you have to wait ",
  "npc.gnomargery.sorry_you_are_35": "Sorry, you are not on the required minimum level [",
  "npc.gnomargery.this_mission_will_36": "This mission will require you to kill some drillworms for us. If you are interested, I can give you some more {information} about it. Are you willing to accept this mission?",
  "npc.gnomargery.you_have_already_37": "You have already started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomargery.gnometastic_you_should_38": "Gnometastic! You should have no trouble finding enough drillworms.",
  "npc.gnomaticus.shoot_at_the_1": "Shoot at the villain targets that will pop up. DON'T shoot innocent civilians since this will reset your score and you have to start all over. {Report} to me afterwards.",
  "npc.gnomaticus.you_are_showing_2": "You are showing some promise! Now continue with the recruitment and talk to Gnomewart to the south for your endurance test!",
  "npc.gnomaticus.sorry_you_are_3": "Sorry you are not done yet.",
  "npc.gnomaticus.you_have_nothing_4": "You have nothing to report at all.",
  "npc.gnombold.im_the_officer_1": "I'm the officer responsible for this area. I give out missions, accept mission reports and oversee our defences.",
  "npc.gnombold.gnomes_have_lived_2": "Gnomes have lived autonomous for so long that it still feels odd to work with strangers for many of us.",
  "npc.gnombold.sorry_but_no_3": "Sorry, but no! Your expertise could be put to better use elsewhere. Here awaits you no challenge. You are desperately needed in the deeper levels of the Spike. Report there immediately. ",
  "npc.gnombold.i_can_offer_4": " I can offer you several missions: to gather geomantic {charges}, to {fertilise} the mushroom caves, to destroy monster {nests} and to {kill} some crystal crushers.",
  "npc.gnombold.what_mission_do_5": "What mission do you want to report about: gathering the geomantic {charges}, the {fertilisation} of the mushroom caves, about destroying monster {nests} and the {killing} of crystal crushers?",
  "npc.gnombold.you_have_not_6": "You have not started that mission.",
  "npc.gnombold.you_have_done_7": "You have done well. Here, take your reward.",
  "npc.gnombold.gnowful_charge_this_8": "Gnowful! Charge this magnet at three monoliths in the cave system. With three charges, the magnet will disintegrate and charge you with its gathered energies. Step on the magnetic extractor here to deliver the charge to us, then report to me.",
  "npc.gnombold.you_have_not_9": "You have not started that mission.",
  "npc.gnombold.you_have_done_10": "You have done well. Here, take your reward.",
  "npc.gnombold.gnowful_use_the_11": "Gnowful! Use the fertiliser on four gardener mushroom in the caves.",
  "npc.gnombold.you_have_not_12": "You have not started that mission.",
  "npc.gnombold.you_have_done_13": "You have done well. Here, take your reward.",
  "npc.gnombold.gnowful_step_into_14": "Gnowful! Step into the transformer and destroy eight monster nests.",
  "npc.gnombold.you_have_not_15": "You have not started that mission.",
  "npc.gnombold.you_have_done_16": "You have done well. Here, take your reward.",
  "npc.gnombold.gnowful_just_go_17": "Gnowful! Just go out to the caves and kill at least seven crystalcrushers.",
  "npc.gnombold.thats_not_a_18": "That's not a valid mission name.",
  "npc.gnombold.sorry_you_have_19": "Sorry, you have to wait ",
  "npc.gnombold.sorry_you_are_20": "Sorry, you are not on the required range of levels [",
  "npc.gnombold.you_have_already_21": "You have already started that mission.",
  "npc.gnombold.sorry_you_have_22": "Sorry, you have to wait ",
  "npc.gnombold.sorry_you_are_23": "Sorry, you are not on the required range of levels [",
  "npc.gnombold.your_mission_would_24": "Your mission would be to seek out gardener mushrooms in the caves and use some fertiliser on them. If you are interested, I can give you some more information about it. Are you willing to accept this mission?",
  "npc.gnombold.you_have_already_25": "You have already started that mission.",
  "npc.gnombold.gnometastic_and_here_26": "Gnometastic! And here is your fertiliser - use it on four gardener mushroom in the caves. If you lose the fertiliser you'll have to bring your own. Gnomux sells all the equipment that is required for our missions.",
  "npc.gnombold.sorry_you_have_27": "Sorry, you have to wait ",
  "npc.gnombold.sorry_you_are_28": "Sorry, you are not on the required range of levels [",
  "npc.gnombold.our_mission_for_29": "Our mission for you is to step into the gnomish transformer and then destroy eight monster nests in the caves. If you are interested, I can give you some more information about it. Are you willing to accept this mission?",
  "npc.gnombold.you_have_already_30": "You have already started that mission.",
  "npc.gnombold.gnometastic_dont_forget_31": "Gnometastic! Don't forget to step into the transformer before you go out and destroy five monster nests. If your transformation runs out, return to the transformer to get another illusion.",
  "npc.gnombold.sorry_you_have_32": "Sorry, you have to wait ",
  "npc.gnombold.sorry_you_are_33": "Sorry, you are not on the required range of levels [",
  "npc.gnombold.this_mission_will_34": "This mission will require you to kill some crystal crushers for us. If you are interested, I can give you some more information about it. Are you willing to accept this mission?",
  "npc.gnombold.you_have_already_35": "You have already started that mission.",
  "npc.gnombold.gnometastic_you_should_36": "Gnometastic! You should have no trouble to find enough crystal crushers. Killing seven of them should be enough.",
  "npc.gnomegica.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.gnomelvis.im_the_gnomish_1": "I'm the gnomish {musical} supervisor!",
  "npc.gnomelvis.what_you_have_2": "What you have to do is to find your soul melody. Use the harmonic crystals to deduce your soul melody. Every soul melody consists of seven sound sequences. ...",
  "npc.gnomelvis.you_will_have_3": "You will have to figure out your correct soul melody by trial and error.",
  "npc.gnomelvis.congratulations_on_findin_4": "Congratulations on finding your soul melody.",
  "npc.gnomeral.for_your_rank_1": "For your rank there are two missions available: {matchmaker} and golem {repair}. You can undertake each mission, but you can turn in a specific mission only once every 20 hours. ",
  "npc.gnomeral.for_your_rank_2": "For your rank there are four missions available: {matchmaker}, golem {repair}, {spore} gathering and {grindstone} hunt. You can undertake each mission, but you can turn in a specific mission only once every 20 hours.",
  "npc.gnomeral.sorry_you_will_3": "Sorry, you will have to wait before you can undertake this mission again.",
  "npc.gnomeral.gnomo_arigato_playername_4": "Gnomo arigato |PLAYERNAME|! You did well. That will help us a lot. Take your tokens and this gnomish supply package as a reward. ",
  "npc.gnomeral.you_are_not_5": "You are not done yet.",
  "npc.gnomeral.you_already_have_6": "You already have accepted this mission. Don't forget to {report} to me when you are done.",
  "npc.gnomeral.sorry_you_do_7": "Sorry, you do have not have the required rank to undertake this mission.",
  "npc.gnomeral.our_gnomish_crystal_8": "Our gnomish crystal golems sometimes go nuts. A recent earthquake has disrupted the entire production of a golem factory. ... ",
  "npc.gnomeral.sorry_you_will_9": "Sorry, you will have to wait before you can undertake this mission again.",
  "npc.gnomeral.gnomo_arigato_playername_10": "Gnomo arigato |PLAYERNAME|! You did well. That will help us a lot. Take your tokens and this gnomish supply package as a reward. ",
  "npc.gnomeral.you_are_not_11": "You are not done yet.",
  "npc.gnomeral.you_already_have_12": "You already have accepted this mission. Don't forget to {report} to me when you are done.",
  "npc.gnomeral.sorry_you_do_13": "Sorry, you do have not have the required rank to undertake this mission.",
  "npc.gnomeral.sorry_you_will_14": "Sorry, you will have to wait before you can undertake this mission again.",
  "npc.gnomeral.gnomo_arigato_playername_15": "Gnomo arigato |PLAYERNAME|! You did well. That will help us a lot. Take your tokens and this gnomish supply package as a reward. ",
  "npc.gnomeral.you_are_not_16": "You are not done yet.",
  "npc.gnomeral.you_already_have_17": "You already have accepted this mission. Don't forget to {report} to me when you are done.",
  "npc.gnomeral.sorry_you_do_18": "Sorry, you do have not have the required rank to undertake this mission.",
  "npc.gnomeral.sorry_you_will_19": "Sorry, you will have to wait before you can undertake this mission again.",
  "npc.gnomeral.gnomo_arigato_playername_20": "Gnomo arigato |PLAYERNAME|! You did well. That will help us a lot. Take your tokens and this gnomish supply package as a reward. ",
  "npc.gnomeral.you_are_not_21": "You are not done yet.",
  "npc.gnomeral.you_already_have_22": "You already have accepted this mission. Don't forget to {report} to me when you are done.",
  "npc.gnomeral.sorry_you_do_23": "Sorry, you do have not have the required rank to undertake this mission.",
  "npc.gnomeral.which_mission_do_24": "Which mission do you want to report: {matchmaker}, golem {repair}?",
  "npc.gnomeral.which_mission_do_25": "Which mission do you want to report: {matchmaker}, golem {repair}, {spore} gathering or {grindstone} hunt?",
  "npc.gnomerik.yes_yes_sigh_1": "Yes... Yes... <sigh>. We already talked about that. I can't remember if you have already tried the {test}, so lets get going.",
  "npc.gnomerik.we_are_hiring_2": "We are hiring people to fight in our so called Bigfoot company against the foes of gnomekind. Are you interested in joining?",
  "npc.gnomerik.what_do_you_3": "What do you think describes gnomish society best? {A}) Ingenuity {B}) Bravery {C}) Humility {D}) All of the above.",
  "npc.gnomerik.what_is_the_4": "What is the front part of a spear? Is it {A}) the pointed one. {B}) The blunt one. {C}) Whatever causes the most damage {D}) A spear is no weapon but a fruit that grows on surface trees.",
  "npc.gnomerik.what_comes_first_5": "What comes first? {A}) safety {B}) I {C}) duty {D}) George",
  "npc.gnomerik.in_case_of_6": "In case of emergency {A}) break glass {B}) break a leg {C}) have a break {D}) call a gnome?",
  "npc.gnomerik.the_greatest_disaster_7": "The greatest disaster I can imagine is ... {A}) to fail the gnomes {B}) a ruined mushroom pie {C}) accidentally hammering my finger {D}) having some work to do",
  "npc.gnomerik.what_would_your_8": "What would your favourite pet be? {A}) A Krazzelzak of course. {B}) An Uxmoff to be honest. {C}) Montpiffs were always my favourite. {D}) A Humdrella and nothing else!",
  "npc.gnomerik.why_do_you_9": "Why do you want to become a bigfoot? {A}) To become rich and famous. {B}) To become famous and rich. {C}) To become rich or famous. {D}) To serve the gnomish community in their struggle?",
  "npc.gnomerik.indeed_an_excellent_10": "Indeed an excellent and smart decision for an ungnomish lifeform. But let us continue with the {test}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.a_well_thought_11": "A well thought out answer I have to admit. But let us continue with the {test}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.ah_we_have_12": "Ah, we have a true warrior here I guess. But let us continue with the {test}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.fear_not_we_13": "Fear not. We don't expect too much of you anyway. But let us continue with the {test}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.ha_a_krazzelzak_14": "Ha! A Krazzelzak would for sure fit someone like you! But let us continue with the {test}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.wrong_answer_15": "Wrong answer!",
  "npc.gnomerik.stop_it_the_16": "Stop it! The test is over, you can ask me for your {results}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.although_chances_are_17": "Although chances are the gnome will end up rescuing you instead, it is the attempt that counts. But let us continue with the {test}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.i_knew_this_18": "I knew this question was too easy. But let us continue with the {test}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.wrong_answer_19": "Wrong answer!",
  "npc.gnomerik.stop_it_the_20": "Stop it! The test is over, you can ask me for your {results}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.thats_the_spirit_21": "That's the spirit! Initiative is always a good thing. Well most of the time. But let us continue with the {test}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.you_have_no_22": "You have no idea how many answer this question wrong. But let us continue with the {test}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.thats_the_spirit_23": "That's the spirit! But let us continue with the {test}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.wrong_answer_24": "Wrong answer!",
  "npc.gnomerik.stop_it_the_25": "Stop it! The test is over, you can ask me for your {results}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.of_course_you_26": "Of COURSE you wouldn't! NO ONE would! But let us continue with the {test}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.i_can_only_27": "I can only hope that is your honest opinion. But let us continue with the test.",
  "npc.gnomerik.oh_you_silver_28": "Oh, you silver tongued devil almost made me blush. But of course you're right. But let us continue with the {test}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.how_true_how_29": "How true. How true. *sigh* But fear not! We gnomes are here to help! But let us continue with the {test}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.thats_just_what_30": "That's just what I'd do - if I weren't a gnome already, that is. But let us continue with the {test}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.excellent_well_this_31": "Excellent! Well this concludes the test. Now let us see your {results}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.wrong_answer_32": "Wrong answer!",
  "npc.gnomerik.stop_it_the_33": "Stop it! The test is over, you can ask me for your {results}.",
  "npc.gnomerik.you_have_passed_34": "You have passed the test with ",
  "npc.gnomerik.excellent_now_let_35": "Excellent! Now let us begin with the gnomish aptitude test. Just tell me when you feel ready for the {test}!",
  "npc.gnomespector.dont_be_afraid_1": "Don't be afraid. It won't hurt! Just step in!",
  "npc.gnome_trooper.but_you_dont_1": "But you don't have it...",
  "npc.gnomewart.just_take_the_1": "Just take the teleporter over there to the south and follow the hallway. At the end of the hallway you'll find a teleporter. Step on it and you are done!",
  "npc.gnomewart.you_have_passed_2": "You have passed the test and are ready to create your soul melody. Talk to Gnomelvis in the east about it.",
  "npc.gnomewart.your_endurance_will_3": "Your endurance will be tested here when the time comes. For the moment please continue with the other phases of your recruitment.",
  "npc.gnomewart.you_have_passed_4": "You have passed the test. If you consider what huge feet you have to move it's quite impressive.",
  "npc.gnomilly.im_the_officer_1": "I'm the officer responsible for this area. I give out missions, accept mission reports and oversee our defences.",
  "npc.gnomilly.we_are_the_2": "We are the only protectors of the world against the enemies below. With small stature comes great responsibilities, as they say.",
  "npc.gnomilly.sorry_but_no_3": "Sorry, but no! Your expertise could be put to better use elsewhere. Here awaits you no challenge. You are desperately needed in the deeper levels of the Spike. Report there immediately. ",
  "npc.gnomilly.i_can_offer_4": "I can offer you several missions: to recharge our ghost {pacifiers}, to {release} the spiritual anger, to {track} an evil presence and to {kill} some demon skeletons.",
  "npc.gnomilly.what_mission_do_5": "What mission do you want to report about: recharging the ghost {pacifiers}, the {release} of the spiritual anger, about {tracking} an evil presence and the {killing} of demon skeletons?",
  "npc.gnomilly.you_have_not_6": "You have not started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomilly.you_have_done_7": "You have done well. Here, take your reward.",
  "npc.gnomilly.gnowful_take_the_8": "Gnowful! Take the resonance charger and use it on seven of the pacifiers in the cave.",
  "npc.gnomilly.you_have_not_9": "You have not started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomilly.you_have_done_10": "You have done well. Here, take your reward.",
  "npc.gnomilly.gnowful_take_the_11": "Gnowful! Take the spirit shovel use it on four graves in the cave system.",
  "npc.gnomilly.you_have_not_12": "You have not started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomilly.you_have_done_13": "You have done well. Here, take your reward.",
  "npc.gnomilly.gnowful_take_the_14": "Gnowful! Take the tracking device in the caves and locate the residual spirit energy.",
  "npc.gnomilly.you_have_not_15": "You have not started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomilly.you_have_done_16": "You have done well. Here, take your reward.",
  "npc.gnomilly.gnowful_just_go_17": "Gnowful! Just go out to the caves and kill at least seven demon skeletons.",
  "npc.gnomilly.thats_not_a_18": "That's not a valid mission name.",
  "npc.gnomilly.sorry_you_have_19": "Sorry, you have to wait ",
  "npc.gnomilly.sorry_you_are_20": "Sorry, you are not on the required range of levels [",
  "npc.gnomilly.you_have_already_21": "You have already started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomilly.gnometastic_take_this_22": "Gnometastic! Take this resonance charger and use it on seven of the pacifiers in the cave. If you lose the charger, you'll have to bring your own. Gnomux sells all the equipment that is required for our missions.",
  "npc.gnomilly.sorry_you_have_23": "Sorry, you have to wait ",
  "npc.gnomilly.sorry_you_are_24": "Sorry, you are not on the required range of levels [",
  "npc.gnomilly.your_task_would_25": "Your task would be to use a spirit shovel to release some spirit's anger from graves that can be found all around here. If you are interested, I can give you some more information about it. Are you willing to accept this mission?",
  "npc.gnomilly.you_have_already_26": "You have already started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomilly.gnometastic_take_this_27": "Gnometastic! Take this spirit shovel and use it on four graves in the cave system. If you lose the shovel you'll have to bring your own. Gnomux sells all the equipment that is required for our missions.",
  "npc.gnomilly.sorry_you_have_28": "Sorry, you have to wait ",
  "npc.gnomilly.sorry_you_are_29": "Sorry, you are not on the required range of levels [",
  "npc.gnomilly.you_have_already_30": "You have already started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomilly.gnometastic_use_this_31": "Gnometastic! Use this tracking device in the caves and locate the residual spirit energy. If you lose the tracking device, you'll have to bring your own. Gnomux sells all the equipment that is required for our missions.",
  "npc.gnomilly.sorry_you_have_32": "Sorry, you have to wait ",
  "npc.gnomilly.sorry_you_are_33": "Sorry, you are not on the required range of levels [",
  "npc.gnomilly.we_need_someone_34": "We need someone to reduce the steadily growing number of demon skeletons in the caves. If you are interested, I can give you some more information about it. Are you willing to accept this mission?",
  "npc.gnomilly.you_have_already_35": "You have already started that mission.",
  "npc.gnomilly.gnometastic_just_go_36": "Gnometastic! Just go out and kill them. You should find more of them than you like.",
  "npc.gnominus.your_examination_is_1": "Your examination is quite easy. Just step through the green crystal apparatus in the south! We will examine you with what we call g-rays. Where g stands for gnome of course ...",
  "npc.gnominus.afterwards_walk_up_2": "Afterwards walk up to Gnomedix for your ear examination.",
  "npc.gnominus.i_provide_the_3": "I provide the population with some fresh alcohol-free mushroom {beer}!",
  "npc.gnominus.do_you_want_4": "Do you want some mushroom beer for 10 gold?",
  "npc.gnominus.dont_be_afraid_5": "Don't be afraid. It won't hurt! Just step in!",
  "npc.gnominus.and_here_it_6": "And here it is! Drink it quick, it gets stale quite fast!",
  "npc.gnominus.you_do_not_7": "You do not have enough money.",
  "npc.gnominus.come_back_later_8": "Come back later.",
  "npc.gnomission.i_am_responsible_1": "I am responsible for our war {missions}, to {trade} with seasoned soldiers and rewarding war {heroes}. You have to be rank 4 to enter the {warzones}.",
  "npc.gnomission.it_seems_you_2": "It seems you did not even set one big foot into the warzone, I am sorry.",
  "npc.gnomission.as_a_war_3": "As a war hero you are allowed to use the warzone teleporter one for free!",
  "npc.gnomission.i_cant_let_4": "I can't let you enter the warzone teleporter one for free, unless you handle me a Deathstrike's snippet. But can still always use a red teleport crystal.",
  "npc.gnomission.weve_already_talked_5": "We've already talked about that.",
  "npc.gnomission.it_seems_you_6": "It seems you did not even set one big foot into the warzone, I am sorry.",
  "npc.gnomission.as_a_war_7": "As a war hero you are allowed to use the warzone teleporter three for free!",
  "npc.gnomission.i_cant_let_8": "I can't let you enter the warzone teleporter two for free, unless you handle me an Abyssador's lash. But can still always use a red teleport crystal.",
  "npc.gnomission.you_need_to_9": "You need to defeat the first warzone boss to be able to get free access to the second warzone.",
  "npc.gnomission.weve_already_talked_10": "We've already talked about that.",
  "npc.gnomission.it_seems_you_11": "It seems you did not even set one big foot into the warzone, I am sorry.",
  "npc.gnomission.as_a_war_12": "As a war hero you are allowed to use the warzone teleporter second for free!",
  "npc.gnomission.i_cant_let_13": "I can't let you enter the warzone teleporter three for free, unless you handle me a Gnomevil's hat. But can still always use a red teleport crystal.",
  "npc.gnomission.you_need_to_14": "You need to defeat the second warzone boss to be able to get free access to the third warzone.",
  "npc.gnomission.weve_already_talked_15": "We've already talked about that.",
  "npc.gnomission.fine_i_grant_16": "Fine, I grant you the permission to enter the warzones. Be warned though, this will be not a picnic. Better bring some friends with you. Bringing a lot of them sounds like a good idea.",
  "npc.gnomission.you_have_already_17": "You have already accepted this mission.",
  "npc.gnomission.sorry_you_have_18": "Sorry, you have not yet earned enough renown that we would risk your life in such a dangerous mission.",
  "npc.gnomission.only_if_you_19": "Only if you have killed 20 of our major enemies in the warzones I am allowed to trade with you.",
  "npc.gnommander.im_responsible_for_1": "I'm responsible for the security and reward heroes to our cause. If you are looking for missions, talk to Gnomilly, Gnombold and Gnomagery.",
  "npc.gnommander.i_can_sell_2": "I can sell special outfit parts. If your fame is high enough, you might be {worthy} of such a reward.",
  "npc.gnommander.you_are_not_3": "You are not worthy of a special reward yet.",
  "npc.gnommander.you_can_acquire_4": "You can acquire the {basic} outfit for 1000 Gold, the {first} addon for 2000 gold and the {second} addon for 3000 gold. Which do you want to buy?",
  "npc.gnommander.you_do_not_5": "You do not have enough level yet.",
  "npc.gnommander.you_already_have_6": "You already have that outfit.",
  "npc.gnommander.do_you_want_7": "Do you want to buy the basic outfit for 1000 Gold?",
  "npc.gnommander.you_do_not_8": "You do not have enough level yet.",
  "npc.gnommander.you_do_not_9": "You do not have the Cave Explorer outfit.",
  "npc.gnommander.you_already_have_10": "You already have that addon.",
  "npc.gnommander.do_you_want_11": "Do you want to buy the first addon for 2000 Gold?",
  "npc.gnommander.you_do_not_12": "You do not have enough level yet.",
  "npc.gnommander.you_do_not_13": "You do not have the Cave Explorer outfit.",
  "npc.gnommander.you_already_have_14": "You already have that addon.",
  "npc.gnommander.do_you_want_15": "Do you want to buy the second addon for 3000 Gold?",
  "npc.gnommander.you_do_not_16": "You do not have that money.",
  "npc.gnommander.here_it_is_17": "Here it is.",
  "npc.gnommander.you_do_not_18": "You do not have that money.",
  "npc.gnommander.here_it_is_19": "Here it is.",
  "npc.gnommander.you_do_not_20": "You do not have that money.",
  "npc.gnommander.here_it_is_21": "Here it is.",
  "npc.gnomus.i_dont_need_1": "I don't need your help for now. Come back later.",
  "npc.gnomus.come_back_when_2": "Come back when you have finished your job.",
  "npc.gnomus.i_dont_need_3": "I don't need your help for now. Come back later.",
  "npc.gnomus.come_back_when_4": "Come back when you have finished your job.",
  "npc.gnomus.the_other_are_5": "The other are already telling stories about you. Please return to me later if you want to help out some more!",
  "npc.gnomus.i_dont_need_6": "I don't need your help for now. Come back later.",
  "npc.gnomus.come_back_when_7": "Come back when you have finished your job.",
  "npc.gnomus.thank_you_very_8": "Thank you very much! With those structures mapped out we will be able to complete the puzzle in no time!",
  "npc.gnomus.if_you_bring_9": "If you bring me any suspicious devices on creatures you slay down here, I'll make it worth your while by telling the others of your generosity. How many do you want to offer? ",
  "npc.gnomus.you_want_to_10": "You want to offer ",
  "npc.gnomus.dont_waste_my_11": "Don't waste my time.",
  "npc.gnomus.you_dont_have_12": "You don't have enough suspicious devices.",
  "npc.gnomus.you_dont_have_13": "You don't have enough suspicious devices.",
  "npc.gnomus.you_dont_have_14": "You don't have enough suspicious devices.",
  "npc.gnomus.so_you_want_15": "So you want to know what we all think about your deeds? What leader's opinion are you interested in, the {gnomes} (Gnomus), the {dwarves} (Klom Stonecutter) or the {scouts} (Lardoc Bashsmite)?",
  "npc.gnomus.the_gnomes_are_16": "The gnomes are still in need of your help, member of Bigfoot's Brigade. Prove your worth by answering their calls! (",
  "npc.gnomus.the_dwarves_are_17": "The dwarves are still in need of your help, member of Bigfoot's Brigade. Prove your worth by answering their calls! (",
  "npc.gnomus.the_scouts_are_18": "The scouts are still in need of your help, member of Bigfoot's Brigade. Prove your worth by answering their calls! (",
  "npc.gnomux.im_responsible_for_1": "I'm responsible for resupplying foolish adventurers with equipment that they may have lost. If you're one of them, just ask me about a {trade}. ",
  "npc.gnomux.what_could_i_2": "What could I say about gnomes that anyone would not know? I mean, we're interesting if not fascinating, after all.",
  "npc.gorn.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to buy a football for 111 gold?",
  "npc.gorn.here_it_is_2": "Here it is.",
  "npc.gorn.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.gregor.sorry_but_i_1": "Sorry but I don't have anything for you at the moment.",
  "npc.gregor.sorry_but_our_2": "Sorry, but our tasks are only for premium warriors.",
  "npc.gregor.you_mean_you_3": "You mean you would like to prove that you deserve to wear such a helmet?",
  "npc.gregor.your_current_task_4": "Your current task is to bring me 100 perfect behemoth fangs, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.gregor.your_current_task_5": "Your current task is to retrieve the helmet of Ramsay the Reckless from Banuta, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.gregor.your_current_task_6": "Your current task is to obtain a flask of warrior's sweat, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.gregor.your_current_task_7": "Your current task is to bring me royal steel, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.gregor.please_talk_to_8": "Please talk to Sam and tell him I sent you. I'm sure he will be glad to refine your helmet, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.gregor.youve_already_completed_9": "You've already completed the task and can consider yourself a mighty warrior, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.gregor.have_you_really_10": "Have you really managed to fulfil the task and brought me 100 perfect behemoth fangs?",
  "npc.gregor.youre_not_serious_11": "You're not serious asking that, are you? They come from behemoths, of course. Unless there are behemoth rabbits. Duh.",
  "npc.gregor.did_you_recover_12": "Did you recover the helmet of Ramsay the Reckless?",
  "npc.gregor.these_pesky_apes_13": "These pesky apes steal everything they can get their dirty hands on.",
  "npc.gregor.were_you_able_14": "Were you able to get hold of a flask with pure warrior's sweat?",
  "npc.gregor.warriors_sweat_can_15": "Warrior's sweat can be magically extracted from headgear worn by a true warrior, but only in small amounts. Djinns are said to be good at magical extractions.",
  "npc.gregor.ah_have_you_16": "Ah, have you brought the royal steel?",
  "npc.gregor.royal_steel_can_17": "Royal steel can only be refined by very skilled smiths.",
  "npc.gregor.bah_then_you_18": "Bah. Then you will have to wait for the day these helmets are sold in shops, but that will not happen before hell freezes over.",
  "npc.gregor.alright_then_come_19": "Alright then. Come back to me once you have collected 100 perfect behemoth fangs.",
  "npc.gregor.would_you_like_20": "Would you like me to repeat the task requirements then?",
  "npc.gregor.lying_is_not_21": "Lying is not exactly honourable, |PLAYERNAME|. Shame on you.",
  "npc.gregor.im_deeply_impressed_22": "I'm deeply impressed, brave Knight |PLAYERNAME|. I expected nothing less from you. Now, please retrieve Ramsay's helmet.",
  "npc.gregor.there_is_no_23": "There is no need to rush anyway.",
  "npc.gregor.lying_is_not_24": "Lying is not exactly honourable, |PLAYERNAME|. Shame on you.",
  "npc.gregor.good_work_brave_25": "Good work, brave Knight |PLAYERNAME|! Even though it is damaged, it has a lot of sentimental value. Now, please bring me warrior's sweat.",
  "npc.gregor.there_is_no_26": "There is no need to rush anyway.",
  "npc.gregor.lying_is_not_27": "Lying is not exactly honourable, |PLAYERNAME|. Shame on you.",
  "npc.gregor.now_that_is_28": "Now that is a pleasant surprise, brave Knight |PLAYERNAME|! There is only one task left now: Obtain royal steel to have your helmet refined.",
  "npc.gregor.there_is_no_29": "There is no need to rush anyway.",
  "npc.gregor.lying_is_not_30": "Lying is not exactly honourable, |PLAYERNAME|. Shame on you.",
  "npc.gregor.you_truly_deserve_31": "You truly deserve to wear an adorned helmet, brave Knight |PLAYERNAME|. Please talk to Sam and tell him I sent you. I'm sure he will be glad to refine your helmet.",
  "npc.gregor.there_is_no_32": "There is no need to rush anyway.",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.youre_a_lucky_1": "You're a lucky one. You can go and kill him without spending your 'boss points'. Have fun!",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.you_have_already_2": "You have already complete this task ",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.youve_killed_3": "You've killed ",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.great_a_warm_4": "Great! A warm welcome to our newest member: |PLAYERNAME|! Ask me for a {task} if you want to go on a hunt.",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.you_have_nothing_5": "You have nothing to report.",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.youll_have_to_6": "You'll have to {join}, to get any {tasks}.",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.you_are_ready_7": "You are ready to advance one rank in our society |PLAYERNAME|. Ask me for a {promotion} first.",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.youre_lucky_today_8": "You're lucky today. This time you'll get an experience reward and ",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.youve_three_unfinished_9": "You've three unfinished tasks running old chap. If you want to accept a new one, you have to delete one of your old ones. Do you want to delete a task?",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.alright_what_would_10": "Alright, what would you like to hunt? {Crocodiles}, {badgers}, {tarantulas}, {carniphilas}, {stone golems}, {mammoths}, {gnarlhounds}, {terramites}, {apes}, {thornback tortoises} or {gargoyles}.",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.youve_three_unfinished_11": "You've three unfinished tasks running old chap. If you want to accept a new one, you have to delete one of your old ones. Do you want to delete a task?",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.the_spawn_of_12": "The spawn of pure evil must be erased from Tibia. You'll find demons lurking in the northern ruins of Edron as well as in some other deeper dungeons of Tibia. Slay 6666 demons for the greater good! Do you think you can handle this task?",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.in_this_task_13": "In this task you must defeat ",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.you_havent_started_14": "You haven't started any task yet.",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.congratulations_playernam_15": "Congratulations, |PLAYERNAME|! You have gained the highest rank: 'Elite hunter'. If you haven't done yet, ask me for the {special} task.",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.you_have_not_16": "You have not enough points for promotion.",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.you_can_choose_17": "You can choose between the {Snapper}, {Hide}, {Deathbine} and the {Bloodtusk}.",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.the_current_task_18": "The current task",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.you_havent_started_19": "You haven't started any task yet.",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.canceling_a_task_20": "Canceling a task will make the counter restart. ",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.you_havent_started_21": "You haven't started any task yet.",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.you_currently_killed_22": "You currently killed ",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.are_you_sure_23": "Are you sure you want to cancel this task?",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.you_currently_killed_24": "You currently killed ",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.you_currently_killed_25": "You currently killed 0/",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.you_have_canceled_26": "You have canceled the task ",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.speak_to_me_27": "Speak to me again when you are done hunting",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.you_have_already_28": "You have already started the task. Go find Tiquandas Revenge and take revenge yourself!",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.great_achievement_old_29": "Great achievement, old chap! You are an outstanding hunter, no doubt about it!",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.this_task_is_30": "This task is a very dangerous one. I want you to look for {Demodras'} hideout. It might be somewhere under the {Plains of Havoc}. Good luck, old chap, come back in one piece and ask me about the special task when you're done.",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.you_have_already_31": "You have already started the special task. Find Demodras and kill it.",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.jolly_good_show_32": "Jolly good show! You can cross swords with any creature in this world! I bow to you.",
  "npc.grizzly_adams.you_have_already_33": "You have already finished all special tasks.",
  "npc.grof_the_guard.i_think_itll_1": "I think it'll rain soon and I left some laundry out for drying.",
  "npc.grof_the_guard.yes_im_pretty_2": "Yes I'm pretty sure they have failed to send the laundry police to take care of it, you fool.",
  "npc.grombur.oh_well_i_1": "Oh well, I liked Nokmir. He used to be a good dwarf until that day on which he stole the ring from {Rerun}.",
  "npc.grombur.yeah_hes_the_2": "Yeah, he's the lucky guy in this whole story. I heard rumours that emperor Rehal had plans to promote Nokmir, but after this whole thievery story, he might pick Rerun instead.",
  "npc.grombur.got_any_dwarven_3": "Got any dwarven brown ale?? I DON'T THINK SO....and Bolfana, the tavern keeper, won't sell you anything. I'm sure about that...she doesn't like humans... I tell you what, if you get me a cask of dwarven brown ale, I allow you to enter the mine. Alright?",
  "npc.grombur.howwhereahhhh_i_dont_4": "HOW?....WHERE?....AHHHH, I don't mind....SLUUUUUURP....tastes a little flat but I had worse. Thank you. Just don't tell anyone that I let you in.",
  "npc.grombur.haha_fine_dont_5": "Haha, fine! Don't waste time and get me the ale. See you.",
  "npc.guard_saros.i_would_never_1": "I would never have guessed that.",
  "npc.guard_saros.oh_sorry_i_2": "Oh, sorry, I was distracted, what did you say?",
  "npc.guard_saros.oh_i_just_3": "Oh, I just remember I have some work to do, sorry. Bye!",
  "npc.guard_saros.take_some_time_4": "Take some time to talk to me!",
  "npc.guard_saros.well_i_have_5": "Well ... I have met him for a little while .. but this was nothing serious.",
  "npc.guard_saros.i_remember_that_6": "I remember that grapes were his favourites. He was almost addicted to them.",
  "npc.guard_saros.thank_you_very_7": "Thank you very much. How kind of you to care about me. I am fine, thank you.",
  "npc.guard_saros.this_is_the_8": "This is the continent you are currently visiting. You will find vast, dry steppes here as well as high mountains, the river Nykri and the big city {Issavi}.",
  "npc.guard_saros.issavi_is_the_9": "Issavi is the capital of {Kilmaresh}, also called the Golden City. This city has a motto: An open gate for those of peace. This means, anyone is welcome here as long as they respect our laws, be it humans, elves, minotaurs or even a medusa.",
  "npc.guard_saros.i_am_aruda_10": "I am Aruda.",
  "npc.guard_saros.i_am_a_11": "I am a little sad, that you seem to have forgotten me, handsome. I am Aruda.",
  "npc.guard_saros.yes_thats_me_12": "Yes, that's me!",
  "npc.guard_saros.oh_i_like_13": "Oh, I like it, how you say my name.",
  "npc.guard_saros.please_dont_be_14": "Please don't be so rude to look for the time if you are talking to me.",
  "npc.guard_saros.i_am_deeply_15": "I am deeply sorry, I can't help you.",
  "npc.guard_saros.uh_what_a_16": "UH! What a terrifying topic. Please let us speak about something more pleasant, I am a weak and small woman after all.",
  "npc.guard_saros.what_gives_you_17": "What gives you the impression, I am the kind of women, you find in sewers?",
  "npc.guard_saros.you_should_ask_18": "You should ask about that in one of the temples.",
  "npc.guard_saros.the_king_that_19": "The king, that lives in this fascinating castle? I think he does look kind of cute in his luxurious robes, doesn't he?",
  "npc.guard_saros.he_is_soooo_20": "He is soooo strong! What muscles! What a body! Did you ask him for a date?",
  "npc.guard_saros.he_is_soooo_21": "He is soooo strong! What muscles! What a body! On the other hand, compared to you he looks quite puny.",
  "npc.guard_saros.he_is_a_22": "He is a little simple minded but always nice and well dressed.",
  "npc.guard_saros.he_should_really_23": "He should really sell some stylish gowns or something like that. We Tibians never get some clothing of the latest fashion. It's a shame.",
  "npc.guard_saros.i_dont_understand_24": "I don't understand this lonely monks. I love company too much to become one. Hehehe!",
  "npc.guard_saros.oh_isnt_he_25": "Oh, isn't he funny? I could listen to him the whole day.",
  "npc.guard_saros.as_far_as_26": "As far as I know, he is working in the castle.",
  "npc.guard_saros.i_am_a_27": "I am a little shy and so don't hear many rumors.",
  "npc.guard_saros.oh_you_little_28": "Oh, you little devil, stop talking like that! <blush>",
  "npc.guard_saros.i_know_only_29": "I know only little about weapons. Can you tell me something about them, please?",
  "npc.guard_saros.i_believe_that_30": "I believe that love is stronger than magic, don't you agree?",
  "npc.guard_saros.oh_sorry_i_31": "Oh, sorry, I have to hurry, bye!",
  "npc.guard_saros.i_would_like_32": "I would like to visit the beach more often, but I guess it's too dangerous.",
  "npc.guard_saros.i_love_this_33": "I love this castle! It's so beautiful.",
  "npc.guard_saros.powerful_sorcerers_fright_34": "Powerful sorcerers frighten me a little.",
  "npc.guard_saros.i_personally_think_35": "I personally think it's inappropriate for a woman to become a warrior, what do you think about that?",
  "npc.guard_saros.druids_seldom_visit_36": "Druids seldom visit a town, what do you know about druids?",
  "npc.guard_saros.i_like_brave_37": "I like brave fighters like him.",
  "npc.guard_saros.oh_he_is_38": "Oh, he is sooooo cute!",
  "npc.guard_saros.i_like_dogs_39": "I like dogs, the little ones at least. Do you like dogs, too?",
  "npc.guard_saros.oh_i_am_40": "Oh, I am just a girl and know nothing about magic swords and such things.",
  "npc.guard_saros.i_dont_know_41": "I ... don't know someone named like that.",
  "npc.guard_saros.yenny_i_know_42": "Yenny? I know no Yenny, nor have I ever used that name! You have mistook me with someone else.",
  "npc.guide_alexena.would_you_like_1": "Would you like me to mark locations like - for example - the depot, bank and shops on your map?",
  "npc.guide_alexena.here_you_go_2": "Here you go.",
  "npc.guide_alexena.well_nothing_wrong_3": "Well, nothing wrong about exploring the town on your own. Let me know if you need something!",
  "npc.guide_behil.would_you_like_1": "Would you like me to mark locations like - for example - the depot, bank and shops on your map?",
