  "npc.guide_luke.well_nothing_wrong_3": "Well, nothing wrong about exploring the town on your own. Let me know if you need something!",
  "npc.guide_rahlkora.would_you_like_1": "Would you like me to mark locations like - for example - the depot, bank and shops on your map?",
