  "npc.guide_thelandil.well_nothing_wrong_3": "Well, nothing wrong about exploring the town on your own. Let me know if you need something!",
  "npc.guide_tiko.would_you_like_1": "Would you like me to mark locations like - for example - the depot, bank and shops on your map?",
  "npc.guide_tiko.here_you_go_2": "Here you go.",
  "npc.guide_tiko.well_nothing_wrong_3": "Well, nothing wrong about exploring the town on your own. Let me know if you need something!",
  "npc.habdel.my_scimitar_yes_1": "My scimitar? Yes, that is a true masterpiece. Of course I could make one for you, but I have a small request. Would you fulfil a task for me?",
  "npc.habdel.have_you_brought_2": "Have you brought a mermaid's comb for Ishina?",
  "npc.habdel.brilliant_i_will_3": "Brilliant! I will wait for you to return with a mermaid's comb then.",
  "npc.habdel.no_thats_not_4": "No... that's not it.",
  "npc.habdel.yeah_thats_it_5": "Yeah! That's it! I can't wait to give it to her! Oh - but first, I'll fulfil my promise: Here is your scimitar! Thanks again!",
  "npc.habdel.ah_well_doesnt_6": "Ah well. Doesn't matter.",
  "npc.hairycles.these_are_dire_1": "These are dire times for our people. Problems plenty are in this times. But me people not grant trust easy. Are you willing to prove you friend of ape people?",
  "npc.hairycles.oh_you_brought_2": "Oh, you brought me whisper moss? Good hairless ape you are! Can me take it?",
  "npc.hairycles.please_hurry_bring_3": "Please hurry. Bring me whisper moss from dworc lair. Make sure it is from dworc lair! Take it yourself only! If you need to hear background of all again, ask Hairycles for {background}.",
  "npc.hairycles.you_brought_me_4": "You brought me that cough syrup from human healer me asked for?",
  "npc.hairycles.little_ape_should_5": "Little ape should be healthy soon. Me so happy is. Thank you again! But me suspect we in more trouble than we thought. Will you help us again?",
  "npc.hairycles.you_got_scroll_6": "You got scroll from lizard village in south east?",
  "npc.hairycles.ah_yes_you_7": "Ah yes, you read the signs in tomb? Good! May me look into your mind to see what you saw?",
  "npc.hairycles.you_still_dont_8": "You still don't know signs on stone, go and look for it in tomb east in desert.",
  "npc.hairycles.you_bring_hairycles_9": "You bring Hairycles egg of hydra?",
  "npc.hairycles.you_brought_hairycles_10": "You brought Hairycles witches' cap from Fibula?",
  "npc.hairycles.you_do_please_11": "You do please Hairycles again, friend. Me hope madness will not spread further now. Perhaps you are ready for other mission.",
  "npc.hairycles.please_destroy_three_12": "Please destroy three casks in the complex beneath Banuta, so my people will come to senses again.",
  "npc.hairycles.you_brought_hair_13": "You brought hair of holy ape?",
  "npc.hairycles.get_a_hair_14": "Get a hair of holy ape from forbidden land in east. Speak with blind prophet in cave.",
  "npc.hairycles.me_know_its_15": "Me know its much me asked for but go into the deepest catacombs under Banuta and destroy the monument of the serpent god.",
  "npc.hairycles.no_more_missions_16": "No more missions await you right now, friend. Perhaps you want to check me offers for special friends... or shamanic powers.",
  "npc.hairycles.oh_you_bring_17": "Oh you bring cookie for old Hairycles?",
  "npc.hairycles.me_truly_proud_18": "Me truly proud of you, friend. You learn many about plants, charms and ape people. Me want grant you shamanic power now. You ready?",
  "npc.hairycles.you_already_are_19": "You already are shaman and doctor. Me proud of you.",
  "npc.hairycles.you_not_have_20": "You not have finished journey for wisdom yet, young human.",
  "npc.hairycles.you_look_for_21": "You look for food and rest.",
  "npc.hairycles.you_look_for_22": "You look for food and rest.",
  "npc.hairycles.to_become_friend_23": "To become friend of ape people a long and difficult way is. We do not trust easy but help is needed. Will you listen to story of Hairycles?",
  "npc.hairycles.hairycles_sad_is_24": "Hairycles sad is now. But perhaps you will change mind one day.",
  "npc.hairycles.hairycles_thought_better_25": "Hairycles thought better of you.",
  "npc.hairycles.stupid_you_no_26": "Stupid, you no have the moss me need. Go get it. It's somewhere in dworc lair. If you lost it, they might restocked it meanwhile. If you need to hear background of all again, ask Hairycles for {background}.",
  "npc.hairycles.ah_yes_thats_27": "Ah yes! That's it. Thank you for bringing mighty whisper moss to Hairycles. It will help but still much is to be done. Just ask for other mission if you ready.",
  "npc.hairycles.strange_being_you_28": "Strange being you are! Our people need help!",
  "npc.hairycles.no_no_not_29": "No no, not right syrup you have. Go get other, get right health syrup.",
  "npc.hairycles.you_so_good_30": "You so good! Brought syrup to me! Thank you, will prepare cure now. Just ask for {mission} if you want help again.",
  "npc.hairycles.please_hurry_urgent_31": "Please hurry, urgent it is!",
  "npc.hairycles.me_sad_me_32": "Me sad. Me expected better from you!",
  "npc.hairycles.good_thing_that_33": "Good thing that is! Report about your mission when have scroll.",
  "npc.hairycles.me_sad_me_34": "Me sad. Me expected better from you!",
  "npc.hairycles.thats_bad_news_35": "That's bad news. If you lost it, only way to get other is to kill holy serpents. But you can't go there so you must ask adventurers who can.",
  "npc.hairycles.no_that_not_36": "No! That not scroll me looking for. Silly hairless ape you are. Go to village of lizards and get it there on your own!",
  "npc.hairycles.you_brought_scroll_37": "You brought scroll with lizard text? Good! I will see what text tells me! Come back when ready for other mission.",
  "npc.hairycles.thats_bad_news_38": "That's bad news. If you lost it, only way to get other is to kill holy serpents. But you can't go there so you must ask adventurers who can.",
  "npc.hairycles.good_thing_that_39": "Good thing that is! Report about mission when you have read those signs.",
  "npc.hairycles.me_sad_me_40": "Me sad. Me expected better from you!",
  "npc.hairycles.oh_so_clear_41": "Oh, so clear is all now! Easy it will be to read the signs now! Soon we will know what to do! Thank you again! Ask for mission if you feel ready.",
  "npc.hairycles.me_need_to_42": "Me need to see it in your mind, other there is no way to proceed.",
  "npc.hairycles.you_brave_hairless_43": "You brave hairless ape! Get me hydra egg. If you lose egg, you probably have to fight many, many hydras to get another.",
  "npc.hairycles.me_sad_me_44": "Me sad. Me expected better from you!",
  "npc.hairycles.you_not_have_45": "You not have egg of hydra. Please get one!",
  "npc.hairycles.ah_the_egg_46": "Ah, the egg! Mighty warrior you be! Thank you. Hairycles will put it at safe place immediately.",
  "npc.hairycles.please_hurry_hairycles_47": "Please hurry. Hairycles not knows when evil lizards strike again.",
  "npc.hairycles.long_journey_it_48": "Long journey it will take, good luck to you.",
  "npc.hairycles.me_sad_me_49": "Me sad. Me expected better from you!",
  "npc.hairycles.not_right_mushroom_50": "Not right mushroom you have. Find me a witches' cap on Fibula!",
  "npc.hairycles.incredible_you_brought_51": "Incredible, you brought a witches' cap! Now me can prepare mighty charm of life. Yet still other {missions} will await you, friend.",
  "npc.hairycles.please_try_to_52": "Please try to find me a witches' cap on Fibula.",
  "npc.hairycles.hairycles_sure_you_53": "Hairycles sure you will make it. Good luck, friend.",
  "npc.hairycles.me_sad_please_54": "Me sad. Please reconsider.",
  "npc.hairycles.hairycles_proud_of_55": "Hairycles proud of you. Go and find holy hair. Good luck, friend.",
  "npc.hairycles.me_sad_please_56": "Me sad. Please reconsider.",
  "npc.hairycles.you_no_have_57": "You no have hair. You lost it? Go and look again.",
  "npc.hairycles.incredible_you_got_58": "Incredible! You got a hair of holy Bong! This will raise the spirit of my people. You are truly a friend. But one last mission awaits you.",
  "npc.hairycles.you_no_have_59": "You no have hair. You lost it? Go and look again.",
  "npc.hairycles.hairycles_sure_you_60": "Hairycles sure you will make it. Just use hammer on all that looks like snake or lizard. Tell Hairycles if you succeed with mission.",
  "npc.hairycles.me_sad_please_61": "Me sad. Please reconsider.",
  "npc.hairycles.friend_of_the_62": "Friend of the ape people! Take my gift and become me apprentice! Here is shaman clothing for you!",
  "npc.hairycles.come_back_if_63": "Come back if change mind.",
  "npc.hairycles.you_have_no_64": "You have no cookie that I'd like.",
  "npc.hairycles.thank_you_you_65": "Thank you, you are ... YOU SON OF LIZARD!",
  "npc.hal.hicks_i_i_1": "Hicks! I... I... <he is obviously drunk and his report more than confusing>. ",
  "npc.hal.you_can_pass_2": "You can {pass} either to the {Arena Quarter} or {Alchemist Quarter}. Which one will it be?",
  "npc.halvar.you_already_paid_1": "You already paid the fee, go and fight!",
  "npc.halvar.so_you_agree_2": "So you agree with the {rules} and want to participate in the {challenge}? The {fee} for one try in {",
  "npc.halvar.youve_already_completed_3": "You've already completed the arena in all {difficulty levels}.",
  "npc.halvar.as_you_wish_4": "As you wish! You can pass the door now and enter the teleporter to the pits.",
  "npc.halvar.you_do_not_5": "You do not have enough money.",
  "npc.halvar.come_back_when_6": "Come back when you are ready then.",
  "npc.hamish.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.hanna.pretty_isnt_it_1": "Pretty, isn't it? My friend Amber taught me how to make it, but I could help you with one if you like. What do you say?",
  "npc.hanna.oh_youre_back_2": "Oh, you're back already? Did you bring a legion helmet, 100 chicken feathers and 50 honeycombs?",
  "npc.hanna.pretty_hat_isnt_3": "Pretty hat, isn't it?",
  "npc.hanna.okay_here_we_4": "Okay, here we go, listen closely! I need a few things... a basic hat of course, maybe a legion helmet would do. Then about 100 chicken feathers... and 50 honeycombs as glue. That's it, come back to me once you gathered it!",
  "npc.hanna.aw_i_guess_5": "Aw, I guess you don't like feather hats. No big deal.",
  "npc.hanna.sorry_but_i_6": "Sorry, but I can't see a legion helmet.",
  "npc.hanna.sorry_but_you_7": "Sorry, but you don't enough chicken feathers.",
  "npc.hanna.sorry_but_you_8": "Sorry, but you don't have enough honeycombs.",
  "npc.hanna.great_job_that_9": "Great job! That must have taken a lot of work. Okay, you put it like this... then glue like this... here!",
  "npc.hanna.maybe_another_time_10": "Maybe another time.",
  "npc.harlow.what_the_heck_1": "What the heck, stop bothering me with your questions.",
  "npc.haroun.whoa_a_human_1": "Whoa! A human! This is no place for you, |PLAYERNAME|. Go and play somewhere else.",
  "npc.haroun.be_greeted_human_2": "Be greeted, human |PLAYERNAME|. How can a humble djinn be of service?",
  "npc.haroun.do_you_want_3": "Do you want to trade Boots of haste for Enchanted Chicken Wing?",
  "npc.haroun.do_you_want_4": "Do you want to trade 4 Warrior Helmet for Warrior Sweat?",
  "npc.haroun.do_you_want_5": "Do you want to trade 2 Royal Helmet for Fighting Spirit",
  "npc.haroun.do_you_want_6": "Do you want to trade 3 Fire Sword for Magic Sulphur",
  "npc.haroun.i_trade_enchanted_7": "I trade Enchanted Chicken Wing for Boots of Haste, Warrior Sweat for 4 Warrior Helmets, Fighting Spirit for 2 Royal Helmet Magic Sulphur for 3 Fire Swords",
  "npc.haroun.here_you_are_8": "Here you are.",
  "npc.haroun.sorry_but_you_9": "Sorry but you don't have the item.",
  "npc.haroun.im_sorry_human_10": "I'm sorry, human. But you need Gabel's permission to trade with me.",
  "npc.henricus.the_churches_of_1": "The churches of the gods entrusted me with the enormous and responsible task to lead the inquisition. I leave the field work to inquisitors who I recruit from fitting people that cross my way.",
  "npc.henricus.do_you_want_2": "Do you want to join the inquisition?",
  "npc.henricus.do_you_want_3": "Do you want to receive the blessing of the inquisition - which means ",
  "npc.henricus.you_cannot_get_4": "You cannot get this blessing unless you have completed The Inquisition Quest.",
  "npc.henricus.do_you_want_5": "Do you want to buy the special flask of holy water for ",
  "npc.henricus.you_do_not_6": "You do not need this flask right now.",
  "npc.henricus.do_you_want_7": "Do you want to join the inquisition?",
  "npc.henricus.your_current_mission_8": "Your current mission is to investigate the reliability of certain guards. Are you done with that mission?",
  "npc.henricus.your_current_mission_9": "Your current mission is to destroy this coven. Are you done with that mission?",
  "npc.henricus.your_current_mission_10": "Your current mission is to help the vampire hunter Storkus. Are you done with that mission? ",
  "npc.henricus.your_current_mission_11": "Your current mission is to exorcise an evil being from a house in Liberty Bay. Are you done with that mission? ",
  "npc.henricus.you_need_of_12": "You need 20 of them.",
  "npc.henricus.destroy_the_shadow_13": "Destroy the shadow nexus using this vial of holy water and kill all demon lords.",
  "npc.henricus.your_current_mission_14": "Your current mission is to destroy the shadow nexus in the Demon Forge. Are you done with that mission?",
  "npc.henricus.so_be_it_15": "So be it. Now you are a member of the inquisition. You might ask me for a {mission} to raise in my esteem.",
  "npc.henricus.you_havent_done_16": "You haven't done your mission yet.",
  "npc.henricus.good_youve_returned_17": "Good, you've returned. Your skill in practical matters seems to be useful. If you're ready for a further mission, just ask. ",
  "npc.henricus.you_havent_done_18": "You haven't done your mission with {Storkus} yet.",
  "npc.henricus.well_this_was_19": "Well, this was an easy task, but your next mission will be much more challenging. ",
  "npc.henricus.you_havent_done_20": "You haven't done your mission with {Storkus} yet.",
  "npc.henricus.come_back_when_21": "Come back when you have destroyed the shadow nexus.",
  "npc.henricus.you_already_have_22": "You already have been blessed!",
  "npc.henricus.you_have_been_23": "You have been blessed by all of five gods!, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.henricus.come_back_when_24": "Come back when you have enough money.",
  "npc.henricus.here_is_your_25": "Here is your new flask!, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.henricus.come_back_when_26": "Come back when you have enough money.",
  "npc.henricus.fine_fine_you_27": "Fine, fine. You have proven that you can work efficiently. Still, only further missions will show if you are truly capable. Ask me for another mission if you're ready.",
  "npc.henricus.you_need_bring_28": "You need bring me the witches' grimoire.",
  "npc.henricus.here_is_your_29": "Here is your demon hunter outfit. You deserve it. Unlock more addons by completing more missions.",
  "npc.henricus.here_is_your_30": "Here is your demon hunter outfit. You deserve it. Unlock more addons by completing more missions.!",
  "npc.henricus.here_is_the_31": "Here is the final addon for your demon hunter outfit. Congratulations!",
  "npc.henricus.the_priests_of_32": "The priests of Fardos are often mystics who have secluded themselves from worldly matters. Others provide guidance and healing to people in need in the temples.",
  "npc.herbert.you_would_like_1": "You would like Chantalle's letter? only if you are willing to pay a price. {gold} maybe?",
  "npc.herbert.are_you_willing_2": "Are you willing to pay 1000 gold for this letter?",
  "npc.herbert.here_you_go_3": "Here you go kind sir.",
  "npc.hireling.sorry_but_you_1": "Sorry, but you don't have enough capacity.",
  "npc.hireling.sorry_you_dont_2": "Sorry, you don't have enough room on your inbox.",
  "npc.hireling.sorry_you_dont_3": "Sorry, you don't have enough money.",
  "npc.hireling.very_well_you_4": "Very well. You may choose one of the following: {chilli con carniphila}, {svargrond salmon filet}, {carrion casserole}, {consecrated beef}, {roasted wyvern wings}, {carrot pie}, {tropical marinated tiger}, or {delicatessen salad}.",
  "npc.hireling.alright_let_me_5": "Alright, let me astonish you. Shall I?",
  "npc.hireling.which_specific_meal_6": "Which specific meal would you like? Choices are: {chilli con carniphila}, {svargrond salmon filet}, {carrion casserole}, {consecrated beef}, {roasted wyvern wings}, {carrot pie}, {tropical marinated tiger}, or {delicatessen salad}.",
  "npc.hireling.yay_i_have_7": "Yay! I have the ingredients to make a skill boost dish. Would you rather like to boost your {magic}, {melee}, {shielding}, or {distance} skill?",
  "npc.hireling.alright_then_ask_8": "Alright then, ask me for other {services}, if you want.",
  "npc.hireling.sorry_but_you_9": "Sorry, but you must choose a valid skill class. Would you like to boost your {magic}, {melee}, {shielding}, or {distance} skill?",
  "npc.hireling.im_sorry_but_10": "I'm sorry, but that's not a valid food option. Please choose from: {chilli con carniphila}, {svargrond salmon filet}, {carrion casserole}, {consecrated beef}, {roasted wyvern wings}, {carrot pie}, {tropical marinated tiger}, or {delicatessen salad}.",
  "npc.hireling.here_are_the_11": "Here are the items for the category ",
  "npc.hireling.as_you_wish_12": "As you wish!",
  "npc.hireling.in_my_youth_13": "In my youth I dreamt to wield it! Now I wield the broom of... brooming. I guess that's the next best thing!",
  "npc.hireling.what_an_uncivilised_14": "What an uncivilised place without any culture.",
  "npc.hireling.ill_keep_an_15": "I'll keep an eye open for it when cleaning up the things you brought home!",
  "npc.hireling.are_you_sure_16": "Are you sure you want me to go back to my lamp?",
  "npc.hireling.as_you_wish_17": "As you wish!",
  "npc.hireling.are_you_sure_18": "Are you sure you want me to go back to my lamp?",
  "npc.hireling.alright_then_i_19": "Alright then, I will be here.",
  "npc.hireling.of_course_just_20": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.hjaern.the_spirits_are_1": "The spirits are at peace now. The threat of the chakoyas is averted for now. I thank you for your help. Perhaps you should ask Silfind if you can help her in some matters. ",
  "npc.hjaern.i_have_now_2": "I have now no mission for you.",
  "npc.hjaern.do_you_bring_3": "Do you bring frostheart shards for our spell?",
  "npc.hjaern.do_you_bring_4": "Do you bring frostheart shards for our spell? ",
  "npc.hjaern.do_you_want_5": "Do you want to sell all your shards for 2000 gold coins per each? ",
  "npc.hjaern.take_this_it_6": "Take this. It might suit your Nordic outfit fine. ",
  "npc.hjaern.take_this_it_7": "Take this. It might suit your Nordic outfit fine. From now on we only can give you 2000 gold pieces for each shard. ",
  "npc.hjaern.you_want_to_8": "You want to sacrifice a cookie to the spirits?",
  "npc.hjaern.this_is_good_9": "This is good news. As I explained, travel to Helheim, seek the reason for the unrest there and then report to me about your mission. ",
  "npc.hjaern.excellent_you_collected_10": "Excellent, you collected 5 of them. If you have collected 5 or more, talk to me about your {reward}. ",
  "npc.hjaern.excellent_you_collected_11": "Excellent, you collected 10 of them. If you have collected 15 or more, talk to me about your {reward}. ",
  "npc.hjaern.here_your_are_12": "Here your are. ",
  "npc.hjaern.you_have_no_13": "You have no cookie that I'd like.",
  "npc.hjaern.in_the_name_14": "In the name of the spirits I accept this offer ... UHNGH ... The spirits are not amused!",
  "npc.hugo.a_new_uniform_1": "A new uniform for the post officers? I am sorry but my dog ate the last dress pattern we used. You need to supply us with a new dress pattern.",
  "npc.hugo.it_was_wonderous_2": "It was ... wonderous beyond wildest imaginations! I have no clue where Kevin Postner got it from. Better ask him.",
  "npc.hugo.by_the_gods_3": "By the gods of fashion! Didn't it do that I fed the last dress pattern to my poor dog? Will this mocking of all which is taste and fashion never stop?? Ok, ok, you will get those ugly, stinking uniforms and now get lost, fashion terrorist.",
  "npc.hugo.sorry_but_my_4": "Sorry, but my time is currently reserved for premium matters.",
  "npc.hugo.i_am_so_5": "I am so excited! This poor man's look will be an outfit like the world has never seen before.",
  "npc.hugo.sorry_but_i_6": "Sorry, but I am not done with the outfit yet. Venore wasn't built in a day.",
  "npc.hugo.eureka_alas_the_7": "Eureka! Alas, the poor man's outfit is finished, but... to be honest... it turned out much less appealing than I expected. However, you can have it if you want, okay?",
  "npc.hugo.i_guess_my_8": "I guess my vision wasn't that grand after all. I hope there are still people who enjoy it.",
  "npc.hugo.terrific_what_are_9": "Terrific! What are you waiting for?! Start right away gathering 20 pieces of brown cloth and come back once you have them!",
  "npc.hugo.here_you_go_10": "Here you go. Maybe you enjoy if after all.",
  "npc.hugo.argh_i_guess_11": "Argh! I guess this awesome idea has to remain unimplemented. What a pity.",
  "npc.hugo.do_you_want_12": "Do you want me to repeat the task requirements?",
  "npc.hugo.hurry_i_am_13": "Hurry! I am at my creative peak right now!",
  "npc.hugo.well_if_you_14": "Well, if you should change your mind, just ask me for the beggar outfit.",
  "npc.humgolf.bah_farmine_here_1": "Bah, Farmine here, Farmine there. Is there nothing else than Farmine to talk about these days? Hrmpf, whatever. So what do you want?",
  "npc.humgolf.you_are_here_2": "You are here to apologise? Have you got anything that would make me reconsider my decision never to talk to you again about this subject?",
  "npc.humgolf.yeah_of_course_3": "Yeah, of course they can't do without my worms. Mining and worms go hand in hand. Well, in the case of the worms it is only an imaginary hand of course. I'll send them some of my finest worms.",
  "npc.humgolf.hah_now_you_4": "Hah! Now you talk like a dwarf! That's the spirit! Of course you can have some of my worms. I'll send a bunch to Farmine as soon as possible.",
  "npc.humgolf.uh_how_cute_5": "Uh, how cute! Look how he's snapping for my fingers! You really know how to make an old dwarf happy! Well, so let's try again. Why do you think I should send my precious worms to Farmine?",
  "npc.humgolf.wrong_word_6": "Wrong Word.",
  "npc.huntsman.i_hunt_game_1": "I hunt game of all sorts to earn a living. I respect the {balance} of nature though and take only as much as I need.",
  "npc.huntsman.she_is_a_2": "She is a bit overly concerned about that nature and balance stuff but she has a good heart. She is living in the woods between Carlin and Ab'Dendriel. I'll mark her hut on your map.",
  "npc.huntsman.the_white_deer_3": "The white deer are somewhat sacred to the elves. Though their fur and antlers are rumoured to earn a decent amount of {gold} on the market, it's probably not worth the trouble.",
  "npc.huntsman.just_between_you_4": "Just between you and me, I heard a guy named {Cruleo} is offering some handsome cash for the trophies of a white deer.",
  "npc.huntsman.he_has_a_5": "He has a house in the wilderness. Just between Ab'Dendriel and the orcland. I'll mark his hut on your map.",
  "npc.ikassis.the_wolfs_ghost_1": "The wolf's ghost has found peace. Thank you, human being. However, there is someone else who needs help: A sister of mine who's bereft of something very precious. You'll find her in the guise of a swan at a small river south-east of here.",
  "npc.ikassis.you_are_not_2": "You are not on that mission.",
  "npc.imbuement_assistant.sorry_you_dont_1": "Sorry, you don't have enough money",
  "npc.imbuement_assistant.do_you_want_2": "Do you want to buy items for ",
  "npc.imbuement_assistant.you_have_successfully_3": "You have successfully completed your purchase of the items.",
  "npc.inigo.im_sorry_but_1": "I'm sorry, but I cannot let you go there, you'll get much better training here than on that ancient isle.",
  "npc.inkaef.so_you_ask_1": "So you ask me for a {",
  "npc.inkaef.what_i_have_2": "What? I have already gave you one {",
  "npc.inkaef.sorry_you_arent_3": "Sorry, you aren't a druid either a sorcerer.",
  "npc.inkaef.here_you_are_4": "Here you are young adept, take care yourself.",
  "npc.irmana.currently_we_are_1": "Currently we are offering accessories for the nobleman - and, of course, noblewoman - outfit. Would you like to hear more about our offer?",
  "npc.irmana.especially_for_you_2": "Especially for you, mylady, we are offering a pretty hat and a beautiful dress like the ones I wear. Which one are you interested in?",
  "npc.irmana.great_since_our_3": "Great! Since our accessories are hand-tailored designer pieces, of course they are not made for citizens with an empty wallet. Should I inform you about our payment policy?",
  "npc.irmana.im_very_pleased_4": "I'm very pleased to hear that! Which do you prefer - paying 150000 at once or 10000 for 15 times?",
  "npc.irmana.good_i_have_5": "Good, I have noted down your order. Once you have the money, please come back to pick up your accessory.",
  "npc.irmana.ah_are_you_6": "Ah, are you here to pickup your accessory for 150000 gold pieces?",
  "npc.irmana.congratulations_here_is_7": "Congratulations! Here is your brand-new accessory, I hope you like it. Please visit us again!",
  "npc.irmana.you_do_not_8": "You do not have enough money.",
  "npc.irmana.currently_we_are_9": "Currently we are offering accessories for the nobleman - and, of course, noblewoman - outfit. Would you like to hear more about our offer?",
  "npc.irmana.especially_for_you_10": "Especially for you, mylady, we are offering a pretty hat and a beautiful dress like the ones I wear. Which one are you interested in?",
  "npc.irmana.great_since_our_11": "Great! Since our accessories are hand-tailored designer pieces, of course they are not made for citizens with an empty wallet. Should I inform you about our payment policy?",
  "npc.irmana.im_very_pleased_12": "I'm very pleased to hear that! Which do you prefer - paying 150000 at once or 10000 for 15 times?",
  "npc.irmana.good_i_have_13": "Good, I have noted down your order. Once you have the money, please come back to pick up your accessory.",
  "npc.irmana.ah_are_you_14": "Ah, are you here to pickup your accessory for 150000 gold pieces?",
  "npc.irmana.congratulations_here_is_15": "Congratulations! Here is your brand-new accessory, I hope you like it. Please visit us again!",
  "npc.irmana.you_do_not_16": "You do not have enough money.",
  "npc.irmana.currently_we_are_17": "Currently we are offering accessories for the nobleman - and, of course, noblewoman - outfit. Would you like to hear more about our offer?",
  "npc.irmana.especially_for_you_18": "Especially for you, mylord, we are offering a fashionable top hat and a fancy coat like the one Kalvin wears. Which one are you interested in?",
  "npc.irmana.great_since_our_19": "Great! Since our accessories are hand-tailored designer pieces, of course they are not made for citizens with an empty wallet. Should I inform you about our payment policy?",
  "npc.irmana.im_very_pleased_20": "I'm very pleased to hear that! Which do you prefer - paying 150000 at once or 10000 for 15 times?",
  "npc.irmana.good_i_have_21": "Good, I have noted down your order. Once you have the money, please come back to pick up your accessory.",
  "npc.irmana.ah_are_you_22": "Ah, are you here to pickup your accessory for 150000 gold pieces? Here is your nobleman coat. Enjoy!",
  "npc.irmana.you_do_not_23": "You do not have enough money.",
  "npc.irmana.currently_we_are_24": "Currently we are offering accessories for the nobleman - and, of course, noblewoman - outfit. Would you like to hear more about our offer?",
  "npc.irmana.especially_for_you_25": "Especially for you, mylord, we are offering a fashionable top hat and a fancy coat like the one Kalvin wears. Which one are you interested in?",
  "npc.irmana.great_since_our_26": "Great! Since our accessories are hand-tailored designer pieces, of course they are not made for citizens with an empty wallet. Should I inform you about our payment policy?",
  "npc.irmana.im_very_pleased_27": "I'm very pleased to hear that! Which do you prefer - paying 150000 at once or 10000 for 15 times?",
  "npc.irmana.good_i_have_28": "Good, I have noted down your order. Once you have the money, please come back to pick up your accessory.",
  "npc.irmana.ah_are_you_29": "Ah, are you here to pickup your accessory for 150000 gold pieces? Here is your nobleman hat. Enjoy!",
  "npc.irmana.you_do_not_30": "You do not have enough money.",
  "npc.irmana.you_are_not_31": "You are not on that mission.",
  "npc.irmana.a_red_robe_32": "A {Red Robe}! Great. Here, take this red piece of cloth, I don't need it anyway.",
  "npc.irmana.are_you_trying_33": "Are you trying to mess with me?!",
  "npc.irmana.a_mystic_turban_34": "A {Mystic Turban}! Great. Here, take this blue piece of cloth, I don't need it anyway.",
  "npc.irmana.are_you_trying_35": "Are you trying to mess with me?!",
  "npc.irmana.a_green_tunic_36": "A 150 {Green Tunic}! Great. Here, take this green piece of cloth, I don't need it anyway.",
  "npc.irmana.are_you_trying_37": "Are you trying to mess with me?!",
  "npc.irmana.alright_here_is_38": "Alright. Here is the fur.",
  "npc.irmana.are_you_trying_39": "Are you trying to mess with me?!",
  "npc.irmana.have_you_found_40": "Have you found a {Red Robe} for me?",
  "npc.irmana.have_you_found_41": "Have you found a {Mystic Turban} for me?",
  "npc.irmana.have_you_found_42": "Have you found {150 Green Tunic} for me?",
  "npc.ishina.my_jewelled_belt_1": "My jewelled belt? Of course I could make one for you, but I have a small request. Would you fulfil a task for me?",
  "npc.ishina.have_you_brought_2": "Have you brought me a mermaid's comb?",
  "npc.ishina.yay_i_will_3": "Yay! I will wait for you to return with a mermaid's comb then.",
  "npc.ishina.no_thats_not_4": "No... that's not it.",
  "npc.ishina.yeah_thats_it_5": "Yeah! That's it! I can't wait to comb my hair! Oh - but first, I'll fulfil my promise: Here is your jewelled belt! Thanks again!",
  "npc.ishina.oh_okay_6": "Oh... okay.",
  "npc.iskan.so_do_you_1": "So, do you want a passage to Nibelor my friend?",
  "npc.iskan.do_you_want_2": "Do you want to Nibelor?",
  "npc.iskan.you_are_a_3": "You are a friend of mine and the boys now. I tell you something. If you ever need to go to the isle of Nibelor, just ask me for a {passage}.",
  "npc.iskan.i_have_now_4": "I have now no mission for you.",
  "npc.iskan.sorry_but_i_5": "Sorry but I only give missions to those who are considered a true Barbarian. ",
  "npc.iskan.alright_we_are_6": "Alright, we are even!",
  "npc.iskan.you_dont_have_7": "You don't have enough. Bring me the money and I will forget about it.",
  "npc.iskan.sorry_first_time_8": "Sorry, first time you have to do a mission for me.",
  "npc.iskan.mhmm_you_leave_9": "Mhmm, you leave me no other choice than to inform the Jarl.",
  "npc.ivalisse.well_i_hope_1": "Well, I hope you like it here. We tried to rebuild in the {Shaper}'s will. I am a bit preoccupied at the moment because of the absence of my {father}. I may not be the best of help currently, sorry.",
  "npc.ivalisse.besides_my_various_2": "Besides my various {duties} in the temple, I also take care of visitors. Well, I would but right now I can't get my mind of how my {father}'s doing. I am sorry.",
  "npc.ivalisse.well_i_hope_3": "Well, I hope you like it here. We tried to rebuild in the Shaper's will. I am a bit preoccupied at the moment because of the absence of my father. I may not be the best of help currently, sorry.",
  "npc.ivalisse.you_would_thats_4": "You would? That's great! Thank you! If you can find my father, tell him I understand and that I really miss him!",
  "npc.ivalisse.oh_nevermind_i_5": "Oh nevermind, I am sorry I asked you for this.",
  "npc.iwar.nice_you_like_1": "Nice. You like your picture, haa? Give me 10,000 gold and I will deliver it to the museum. Do you {pay}?",
  "npc.iwar.well_done_the_2": "Well done. The picture will be delivered to the museum as last as possible.",
  "npc.iwar.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.izsh.oh_yez_let_1": "Oh yez, let me zee ze documentz. Here we go: zree cheztz filled wiz platinum, one houze, a zet of elite armor, and an unending mana cazket. Iz ziz correct?",
  "npc.jack_fate_goroma.id_love_to_1": "I'd love to bring you back to Liberty Bay, but as you can see, my ship is ruined. I also hurt my leg and can barely move. Can you help me?",
  "npc.jack_fate_goroma.have_you_brought_2": "Have you brought 30 pieces of wood so that I can repair the ship?",
  "npc.jack_fate_goroma.do_you_want_3": "Do you want to travel back to Liberty Bay?",
  "npc.jack_fate_goroma.good_please_return_4": "Good! Please return once you have gathered 30 pieces of wood.",
  "npc.jack_fate_goroma.excellent_now_we_5": "Excellent! Now we can leave this godforsaken place. Thank you for your help. Should you ever want to return to this island, ask me for a passage to Goroma.",
  "npc.jack_fate_goroma.you_dont_have_6": "You don't have enough...",
  "npc.jack_fate_goroma.set_the_sails_7": "Set the sails!",
  "npc.jack.gesundheit_are_you_1": "Gesundheit! Are you alright? Did you... want to tell me something by that?",
  "npc.jack.what_have_you_2": "What have you done? What are all these pieces of furniture doing here? Those are ugly at best and - hey! Stop! Leave the wallpaper alone! Alright, alright! Just tell me, why are you doing this? Who's behind all this?",
  "npc.jack.what_no_way_3": "WHAT?? No way, I ask you again - you DID tell me the TRUTH here... right?",
  "npc.jack.so_thats_it_4": "So that's it? Really?",
  "npc.jack.yeah_yeah_so_5": "Yeah, yeah... so what are you still doing here? I guess I... will have to seek out this Spectulus now, see what he has to say. There is nothing left for me in this place.",
  "npc.jack.i_was_sculpting_6": "I... was... sculpting sulky sculptures. For all my life. Until you came in here and DESTROYED MY MASTERPIECE. Go away. I don't like you.",
  "npc.jack_springer.by_now_the_1": "By now the cultists of the Shiron'Fal seem to have abandoned their search. But this is sadly no good news. It seems they gathered enough lich-knights to proceed with their {ultimate} plan.",
  "npc.jack_springer.sadly_i_have_2": "Sadly, I have no news yet. But I can give you information about the {locations} of the graves that we learned about. If you need more holy water just ask me for a {trade}.",
  "npc.jack_springer.here_is_your_3": "Here is your second addon for your efforts!",
  "npc.jack_springer.here_is_your_4": "Here is your first addon for your efforts!",
  "npc.jack_springer.incredible_you_averted_5": "Incredible! You averted a crisis that would have utterly crippled our defences aganist any other threat that is arising. Let me grant you the honor to be one of the hands of the inquisition alongside with the according outfit as a reward.",
  "npc.jack_springer.indeed_you_averted_6": "Indeed you averted us a great danger! We will ever be greatful to you hand of the inquisition!",
  "npc.jack_springer.you_need_to_7": "You need to travel to the isle of the kings and end this threat before they raise king Zelos!",
  "npc.jacob.im_glad_to_1": "I'm glad to see you back alive and healthy. Did you find anything interesting that you want to {report}?",
  "npc.jacob.the_sewers_need_2": "The sewers need repair. You in?",
  "npc.jacob.elliotts_keeps_calling_3": "Elliott's keeps calling it that. It's just another job! You fixed some broken pipes and stuff? Let me check, {ok}?",
  "npc.jacob.if_you_want_4": "If you want to redo this task just say {abandoned sewers} to repeat it.",
  "npc.jacob.good_broken_pipe_5": "Good. Broken pipe and generator pieces, there's smoke evading. That's how you recognise them. See how you can fix them using your hands. Need about, oh, twenty of them at least repaired. Report to me or Jacob",
  "npc.jacob.good_thanks_man_6": "Good. Thanks, man. That's one vote you got for helping us with this.",
  "npc.jacob.you_already_reported_7": "You already reported this mission, go to the next.",
  "npc.jamesfrancis.the_minotaurs_i_1": "The minotaurs I faced in the cave are much stronger than the normal ones. What I were able to see before I had to flee: all of them seem to belong to a cult worshipping their god. Could you do me a {favour}?",
  "npc.jamesfrancis.id_like_to_2": "I'd like to work in this cave researching the minotaurs. But right now there are too many of hem and what is more, they are too powerful for me. Could you enter the cave and kill at least 50 of these creatures?",
  "npc.jamesfrancis.great_job_you_3": "Great job! You have killed at least 50 of these monsters. I give this key to you to open the door to the inner area. Go there and find out what's going on.",
  "npc.jamesfrancis.come_back_when_4": "Come back when you have killed enough minotaurs.",
  "npc.jamesfrancis.very_nice_return_5": "Very nice. Return to me if you've finished your job.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.well_im_not_1": "Well, I'm not a simple cook. I travel the whole Tibian continent for the most artfully seasoned {recipes} and constantly develop new ones.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.youre_interested_in_2": "You're interested in my recipes? Well. They are not for sale, but if you want to become my {apprentice}, I'll share my knowledge with you.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.you_can_now_3": "You can now cook any dish you want from this list: {Rotworm Stew, Hydra Tongue Salad, Roasted Dragon Wings, Tropical Fried Terrorbird, Banana Chocolate Shake, Veggie Casserole, Filled Jalapeno Peppers, Blessed Steak, Northern Fishburger, Carrot Cake, Coconut Shrimp Bake, Blackjack, Demonic Candy Balls, Sweet Mangonaise Elixir}.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.hmm_you_look_4": "Hmm. You look quite promising. Can't hurt to give it a try, I guess. Would you like to become my apprentice, |PLAYERNAME|?",
  "npc.jean_pierre.fine_young_human_5": "Fine, young human. Ask me for a {recipe} anytime and I'll teach you what I know.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.make_sure_that_6": "Make sure that you have all the ingredients with you.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.it_seems_you_7": "It seems you have already cooked this dish this year. Please come back next year in August.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.make_sure_that_8": "Make sure that you have all the ingredients with you.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.it_seems_you_9": "It seems you have already cooked this dish this year. Please come back next year in August.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.make_sure_that_10": "Make sure that you have all the ingredients with you.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.it_seems_you_11": "It seems you have already cooked this dish this year. Please come back next year in August.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.make_sure_that_12": "Make sure that you have all the ingredients with you.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.it_seems_you_13": "It seems you have already cooked this dish this year. Please come back next year in August.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.make_sure_that_14": "Make sure that you have all the ingredients with you.",
