  "npc.jean_pierre.it_seems_you_25": "It seems you have already cooked this dish this year. Please come back next year in August.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.make_sure_that_26": "Make sure that you have all the ingredients with you.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.it_seems_you_27": "It seems you have already cooked this dish this year. Please come back next year in August.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.make_sure_that_28": "Make sure that you have all the ingredients with you.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.it_seems_you_29": "It seems you have already cooked this dish this year. Please come back next year in August.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.make_sure_that_30": "Make sure that you have all the ingredients with you.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.it_seems_you_31": "It seems you have already cooked this dish this year. Please come back next year in August.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.make_sure_that_32": "Make sure that you have all the ingredients with you.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.it_seems_you_33": "It seems you have already cooked this dish this year. Please come back next year in August.",
  "npc.jean_pierre.did_you_gather_34": "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to cook Rotworm Stew with me?",
  "npc.jean_pierre.did_you_gather_35": "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to prepare a Hydra Tongue Salad with me?",
  "npc.jean_pierre.did_you_gather_36": "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to prepare Roasted Dragon Wings with me?",
  "npc.jean_pierre.did_you_gather_37": "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to prepare a Tropical Fried Terrorbird with me?",
  "npc.jean_pierre.did_you_gather_38": "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to make a Banana Chocolate Shake with me?",
  "npc.jean_pierre.did_you_gather_39": "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to cook a Veggie Casserole with me?",
  "npc.jean_pierre.did_you_gather_40": "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to prepare Filled Jalapeño Peppers with me?",
  "npc.jean_pierre.did_you_gather_41": "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to prepare a Blessed Steak with me?",
  "npc.jean_pierre.did_you_gather_42": "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to make a Northern Fishburger with me?",
  "npc.jean_pierre.did_you_gather_43": "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to bake a Carrot Cake with me?",
  "npc.jean_pierre.did_you_gather_44": "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to prepare a Coconut Shrimp Bake with me?",
  "npc.jean_pierre.did_you_gather_45": "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to cook a Blackjack with me?",
  "npc.jean_pierre.did_you_gather_46": "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to make Demonic Candy Balls with me?",
  "npc.jean_pierre.did_you_gather_47": "Did you gather all necessary ingredients to mix Sweet Mangonaise Elixir with me?",
  "npc.jean_pierre.no_come_back_48": "No?, come back when you are ready to cook.",
  "npc.jerom.thank_you_sooo_1": "Thank you sooo much <sniffs>. Well, you know I lost everything, but recently I found this strange rope here. I don't need it, here take it!",
  "npc.jerom.great_finally_some_2": "Great! Finally, some light at the end of the tunnel! Come back and ask me for the quest when you solved this mystery!",
  "npc.jeronimo.in_our_website_1": "In our website enter in {Events} => {Events Shop}.",
  "npc.jeronimo.you_want_buy_2": "You want buy {",
  "npc.jeronimo.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have ",
  "npc.jeronimo.so_what_you_4": "So... what you want?",
  "npc.jeronimo.you_bought_5": "You bought {",
  "npc.jeronimo.you_dont_have_6": "You don't have enough bar's.",
  "npc.jondrin.you_already_got_1": "You already got the Necrometer.",
  "npc.jondrin.indeed_i_heard_2": "Indeed I heard you did a good job out there. <sigh> I guess that means I can hand you one of our necrometers. Handle it with care.",
  "npc.jorge.you_just_swapped_1": "You just swapped 20 silver raid tokens for 1 ",
  "npc.jorge.im_sorry_i_2": "I'm sorry, I need at least 20 silver tokens for that. Please come back when you have them.",
  "npc.julius.our_nightly_bloodsucking_1": "Our nightly blood-sucking visitors put the inhabitants of Yalahar in constant danger. The worst thing is that anyone in this city could be a vampire. Maybe an outsider like you could help us. Would you try?",
  "npc.julius.hmm_i_see_2": "Hmm, I see, I see. That necklace is only a small indication though... I think I need another proof, just to make sure. Say... have you ever baked {garlic bread}?",
  "npc.julius.i_fear_that_3": "I fear that will not do. Sorry.",
  "npc.julius.i_fear_that_4": "I fear that will not do. Sorry.",
  "npc.julius.let_me_check_5": "Let me check - yes indeed, there's garlic in it. Now eat one, in front of my eyes. Right now! Say '{aaah}' when you've chewed it all down so that I can see you're not hiding it!",
  "npc.julius.so_are_you_6": "So, are you ready for your first real task?",
  "npc.julius.are_you_back_7": "Are you back with confirmed names of possible vampires?",
  "npc.julius.oh_you_look_8": "Oh! You look horrible - I mean, rather weary. What happened? Who is the master vampire?",
  "npc.julius.well_theres_one_9": "Well, there's one problem. How would I know I can trust you? You might be one of them... hm. Can you think of something really unlikely for a vampire? If you know a way to prove it to me, ask me about your {mission}.",
  "npc.julius.fine_then_talk_10": "Fine then. Talk to me again about your mission once you have the garlic bread. You can get holy water from a member of the inquisition.",
  "npc.julius.fine_good_luck_11": "Fine. Good luck! Talk to me again about your mission once you have confirmed the names of five suspects.",
  "npc.julius.alright_wait_a_12": "Alright, wait a moment. Tell me one name at a time so I can note them down carefully. Who is a suspect?",
  "npc.julius.well_you_need_13": "Well, you need to mix flour with holy water and use that dough on garlic to create a special dough. Bake it like normal bread, but I guarantee that no vampire can eat that. Are you following me?",
  "npc.julius.i_guess_armenius_14": "I guess Armenius, Lisander, Maris, Ortheus and Serafin are all the names we can get for now. Let me think for a moment what we are going to do, talk to me about your mission again later.",
  "npc.julius.no_no_i_15": "No, no, I was asking for one of the names.",
  "npc.julius.very_well_i_16": "Very well. I think I can trust you now. Sorry that I had to put you through this embarassing procedure, but I'm sure you understand. So, are you ready for your first real task?",
  "npc.julius.no_no_you_17": "No, no, you didn't eat it! Vampire Brood! Say '{aaah}' once you have eaten the bread or get out of her instantly!",
  "npc.julius.he_really_doesnt_18": "He really doesn't look like the man of the sea he pretends to be, does he? Noted down! Any other name?",
  "npc.julius.you_already_reported_19": "You already reported that name. Any new ones?",
  "npc.julius.hm_you_dont_20": "Hm. You don't look so sure about that one. You should not report suspects that you did not confirm yourself! Any others?",
  "npc.julius.i_always_thought_21": "I always thought that there is not really a poor beggar hidden under those ragged clothes. Noted down! Any other name?",
  "npc.julius.you_already_reported_22": "You already reported that name. Any new ones?",
  "npc.julius.hm_you_dont_23": "Hm. You don't look so sure about that one. You should not report suspects that you did not confirm yourself! Any others?",
  "npc.julius.nice_angelic_name_24": "Nice angelic name for a vampire. But he didn't escape your attention, well done. Noted down! Any other name?",
  "npc.julius.you_already_reported_25": "You already reported that name. Any new ones?",
  "npc.julius.hm_you_dont_26": "Hm. You don't look so sure about that one. You should not report suspects that you did not confirm yourself! Any others?",
  "npc.julius.yes_that_pale_27": "Yes, that pale skin and those black eyes speak volumes. Noted down! Any other name?",
  "npc.julius.you_already_reported_28": "You already reported that name. Any new ones?",
  "npc.julius.hm_you_dont_29": "Hm. You don't look so sure about that one. You should not report suspects that you did not confirm yourself! Any others?",
  "npc.julius.ahh_i_always_30": "Ahh, I always thought something was suspicious about him. Noted down! Any other name?",
  "npc.julius.you_already_reported_31": "You already reported that name. Any new ones?",
  "npc.julius.hm_you_dont_32": "Hm. You don't look so sure about that one. You should not report suspects that you did not confirm yourself! Any others?",
  "npc.julius.then_try_harder_33": "Then try harder.",
  "npc.julius.hm_you_dont_34": "Hm. You don't look so sure about that one. You should not report suspects that you did not confirm yourself! Any others?",
  "npc.julius.good_dont_play_35": "Good. Don't play around with the spell, only use it when standing in front of those vampires. Come back and report to me about your progress later.",
  "npc.julius.i_see_so_36": "I see... so Armenius is the master, and the spell didn't even cause a scratch on him... Well, that went worse than expected. Let me think for a moment and then ask me about a mission again.",
  "npc.julius.getting_cold_feet_37": "Getting cold feet, eh?",
  "npc.karith.whats_that_bug_1": "What's that? Bug milk? Hm, perhaps I can find some customers for that! ",
  "npc.karith.sand_wasp_honey_2": "Sand wasp honey? Hm, interesting at least!",
  "npc.karith.some_special_spice_3": "Some special spice might be of value indeed.",
  "npc.karith.i_can_hardly_4": "I can hardly imagine that someone is interested in embalming fluid, but I'll give it a try.",
  "npc.karith.of_course_ivory_5": "Of course! Ivory! Its value is quite obvious.",
  "npc.karith.this_royal_satin_6": "This royal satin is indeed of acceptable quality.",
  "npc.karith.i_doubt_that_7": "I doubt that the esteemed Yalahari will indulge into something profane as rum. But who knows, I'll give it a try.",
  "npc.karith.i_doubt_that_8": "I doubt that these flowers will stay fresh and healthy forever. But if they do, they could be indeed valuable.",
  "npc.karith.set_the_sails_9": "Set the sails!",
  "npc.karith.you_dont_have_10": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.karith.set_the_sails_11": "Set the sails!",
  "npc.karith.you_dont_have_12": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.karith.set_the_sails_13": "Set the sails!",
  "npc.karith.you_dont_have_14": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.karith.set_the_sails_15": "Set the sails!",
  "npc.karith.you_dont_have_16": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.karith.set_the_sails_17": "Set the sails!",
  "npc.karith.you_dont_have_18": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.karith.set_the_sails_19": "Set the sails!",
  "npc.karith.you_dont_have_20": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.karith.set_the_sails_21": "Set the sails!",
  "npc.karith.you_dont_have_22": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.karith.set_the_sails_23": "Set the sails!",
  "npc.karith.you_dont_have_24": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.karith.dont_waste_my_25": "Don't waste my time.",
  "npc.karl.do_you_bring_1": "Do you bring me a barrel of beer??",
  "npc.karl.do_you_want_2": "Do you want to buy a bottle of our finest whisper beer for 80 gold?",
  "npc.karl.three_cheers_for_3": "Three cheers for the noble |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.karl.you_dont_have_4": "You don't have any barrel of beer!",
  "npc.karl.here_dont_take_5": "Here. Don't take it into the city though.",
  "npc.karl.you_dont_have_6": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.kazzan.waaaaahhh_1": "WAAAAAHHH!!!",
  "npc.kazzan.feel_welcome_in_2": "Feel welcome in the lands of the children of the enlightened Daraman, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.kazzan.do_you_know_3": "Do you know the location of the djinn fortresses in the mountains south of here?",
  "npc.kazzan.well_i_dont_4": "Well, I don't blame you for that. I am sure you did your best. Now we can just hope that peace remains. Here, take this small gratification for your effort to help and Daraman may bless you!",
  "npc.kevin.you_are_not_1": "You are not a member of our guild yet! We have high standards for our members. To rise in our guild is a difficult but rewarding task. Are you interested in joining?",
  "npc.kevin.so_you_have_2": "So you have finally made it! I did not think that you would have it in you ... However: are you ready for another assignment?",
  "npc.kevin.excellent_you_got_3": "Excellent, you got it fixed! This will teach this mailbox a lesson indeed! Are you interested in another assignment?",
  "npc.kevin.you_truly_got_4": "You truly got him? Quite impressive. You are a very promising candidate! I think I have another mission for you. Are you interested?",
  "npc.kevin.do_you_bring_5": "Do you bring all bones for our officers' safety fund at once?",
  "npc.kevin.splendid_i_knew_6": "Splendid, I knew we could trust you. I would like to ask for your help in another matter. Are you interested?",
  "npc.kevin.once_more_you_7": "Once more you have impressed me! Are you willing to do another job?",
  "npc.kevin.first_you_need_8": "First you need to complete your current mission.",
  "npc.kevin.excellent_another_job_9": "Excellent! Another job well done! Would you accept another mission?",
  "npc.kevin.fine_fine_i_10": "Fine, fine. I think that should do it. Tell Hugo that we order those uniforms. The completed dress pattern will soon arrive in Venore. Report to me when you have talked to him.",
  "npc.kevin.so_waldo_is_11": "So Waldo is dead? This is grave news indeed. Did you recover his posthorn?",
  "npc.kevin.you_did_it_12": "You did it? I hope you did not catch a flu in the cold! Anyway, there's another mission for you. Are you interested?",
  "npc.kevin.you_have_delivered_13": "You have delivered that letter? You are a true postofficer. All over the land bards shallpraise your name. There are no missions for you left right now.",
  "npc.kevin.there_are_no_14": "There are no missions for you left right now. You already have the title of Archpostman.",
  "npc.kevin.there_are_no_15": "There are no missions for you left right now. But you are worthy indeed. Do you want to advance in our guild?",
  "npc.kevin.so_are_you_16": "So are you ready for another mission?",
  "npc.kevin.so_are_you_17": "So are you ready for another mission?",
  "npc.kevin.so_are_you_18": "So are you ready for another mission?",
  "npc.kevin.excellent_another_job_19": "Excellent! Another job well done! Would you accept another mission?",
  "npc.kevin.excellent_another_job_20": "Excellent! Another job well done! Would you accept another mission?",
  "npc.kevin.you_have_made_21": "You have made it! We have enough bones for the fund! You remind me of myself when I was young! Interested in another mission?",
  "npc.kevin.you_have_made_22": "You have made it! We have enough bones for the fund! You remind me of myself when I was young! Interested in another mission?",
  "npc.kevin.you_truly_got_23": "You truly got him? Quite impressive. You are a very promising candidate! I think I have another mission for you. Are you interested?",
  "npc.kevin.so_are_you_24": "So are you ready for another mission?",
  "npc.kevin.so_are_you_25": "So are you ready for another mission?",
  "npc.kevin.oh_yes_where_26": "Oh yes, where did we get that from ...? Let's see, first ask the great technomancer in Kazordoon for the technical details. Return here afterwards.",
  "npc.kevin.the_mail_with_27": "The mail with Talphion's instructions just arived. I remember we asked Queen Eloise of Carlin for the perfect colours. Go there, ask her about the UNIFORMS and report back here.",
  "npc.kevin.the_queen_has_28": "The queen has sent me the samples we needed. The next part is tricky. We need theuniforms to emanate some odor that dogs hate.The dog with the best 'taste' in that field is Noodles,the dog of King Tibianus. Do you understand so far?",
  "npc.kevin.fine_fine_i_29": "Fine, fine. I think that should do it. Tell Hugo that we order those uniforms. The completed dress pattern will soon arrive in Venore. Report to me when you have talked to him.",
  "npc.kevin.you_are_worthy_30": "You are worthy indeed. Do you want to advance in our guild?",
  "npc.kevin.you_are_worthy_31": "You are worthy indeed. Do you want to advance in our guild?",
  "npc.kevin.you_are_worthy_32": "You are worthy indeed. Do you want to advance in our guild?",
  "npc.kevin.you_are_worthy_33": "You are worthy indeed. Do you want to advance in our guild?",
  "npc.kevin.hm_i_might_34": "Hm, I might consider your proposal, but first you will have to prove your worth by doing some tasks for us. Are you willing to do that?",
  "npc.kevin.excellent_your_first_35": "Excellent! Your first task will be quite simple. But you should better write my instructions down anyways. You can read and write?",
  "npc.kevin.so_listen_you_36": "So listen, you will check certain tours our members have to take to see if there is some trouble. First travel with Captain Bluebear's ship from Thais to Carlin, understood?",
  "npc.kevin.excellent_once_you_37": "Excellent! Once you have done that you will travel with Uzon to Edron. You will find him in the Femor Hills. Understood?",
  "npc.kevin.fine_fine_next_38": "Fine, fine! Next, travel with Captain Seahorse to the city of Venore. Understood?",
  "npc.kevin.good_finally_find_39": "Good! Finally, find the technomancer Brodrosch and travel with him to the Isle of Cormaya. After this passage report back to me here. Understood?",
  "npc.kevin.ok_remember_the_40": "Ok, remember: the Tibian mail service puts trust in you! Don't fail and report back soon. Just tell me about your {mission}.",
  "npc.kevin.i_am_glad_41": "I am glad to hear that. One of our mailboxes was reported to be jammed. It is located on the so called 'mountain' on theisle Folda. Get a crowbar and fix the mailbox. Report about your mission when you have done so.",
  "npc.kevin.for_your_noble_42": "For your noble deeds I grant you the title Assistant Postofficer. All Postofficers will charge you less money from now on. After every second mission ask me for an ADVANCEMENT. Your next task will be a bit more challenging. Do you feel ready for it?",
  "npc.kevin.i_need_you_43": "I need you to deliver a bill to the stage magician David Brassacres. He's hiding from his creditors somewhere in Venore. It's likely you will have to trick him somehow to reveal his identity. Report back when you delivered this bill.",
  "npc.kevin.ok_listen_we_44": "Ok, listen: we have some serious trouble with agressive dogs lately. We have accumulated some bones as a sort of pacifier but we need more. Collect 20 bones like the one in my room to the left and report here.",
  "npc.kevin.you_have_collected_45": "You have collected all the 20 bones needed. Excellent! Now let's talk about further missions if you are interested.",
  "npc.kevin.you_dont_have_46": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.kevin.i_grant_you_47": "I grant you the title of postman. You are now a full member of our guild. Here have your own officers hat and wear it with pride.",
  "npc.kevin.since_i_am_48": "Since I am convinced I can trust you, this time you must deliver a valuable present to Dermot on Fibula. Do NOT open it!!! You will find the present behind the door here on the lower right side of this room.",
  "npc.kevin.ok_we_need_49": "Ok. We need a new set of uniforms, and only the best will do for us. Please travel to Venore and negotiate with Hugo Chief acontract for new uniforms.",
  "npc.kevin.good_go_there_50": "Good. Go there and find out what taste he dislikes most: mouldy cheese, a piece of fur or abananaskin. Tell him to SNIFF, then the object. Show him the object and ask 'Do you like that?'.DONT let the guards know what you are doing.",
  "npc.kevin.good_so_listen_51": "Good, so listen. Hugo Chief informed me that he needs the measurements of our postofficers. Go and bring me the measurements of Ben, Lokur, Dove, Liane, Chrystal and Olrik.",
  "npc.kevin.from_now_on_52": "From now on it shall be known that you are a grand postman. You are now a privilegedmember until the end of days. Most captains around the world have an agreement with our guild to transport our privileged members, like you, for less gold.",
  "npc.kevin.ok_but_your_53": "Ok but your next assignment might be dangerous. Our Courier Waldo has been missing for a while. I must assume he is dead. Can you follow me so far?",
  "npc.kevin.find_out_about_54": "Find out about his whereabouts and retrieve him or at least his posthorn. He was looking for a new underground passage that is rumoured to be found underneath the troll-infested Mountain east of Thais.",
  "npc.kevin.thank_you_we_55": "Thank you. We will honour this. Your next mission will be a very special one. Good thing you are a special person as well. Are you ready?",
  "npc.kevin.from_now_on_56": "From now on you are a grand postman for special operations. You are an honoured member of our guild and earned the privilege of your own post horn. Here, take it.",
  "npc.kevin.so_listen_well_57": "So listen well. Behind the lower left door you will find a bag. The letters in the bag are for none other than Santa Claus! Deliver them to his house on the isle of Vega, {use} thebag on his mailbox and report back here.",
  "npc.kevin.excellent_here_is_58": "Excellent. Here is a letter for you to deliver. Well, to be honest, no one else volunteered. It's a letter from the mother of Markwin, the king of Mintwallin. Deliver that letter to him, but note that you will not be welcome there.",
  "npc.kevin.i_grant_you_59": "I grant you the title of Archpostman. You are a legend in our guild. As privilege of your newly aquired status you are allowed to make use of certain mailboxes in dangerous areas. Just look out for them and you'll see.",
  "npc.kevin.your_eagerness_is_60": "Your eagerness is a virtue, young one, but first let's talk about advancement",
  "npc.khanna.so_you_ask_1": "So you ask me for a {",
  "npc.khanna.what_i_have_2": "What? I have already gave you one {",
  "npc.khanna.sorry_you_arent_3": "Sorry, you aren't a druid either a sorcerer.",
  "npc.khanna.here_you_are_4": "Here you are young adept, take care yourself.",
  "npc.khanna.of_course_just_5": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.king_tibianus.ah_i_vaguely_1": "Ah, I vaguely remember that our little allies were eager to build some base. So speak up, what do you want?",
  "npc.king_tibianus.do_you_have_2": "Do you have anything that might change my mind?",
  "npc.king_tibianus.indeed_indeed_without_3": "Indeed, indeed. Without the help of Thais, our allies stand no chance! Well, I'll send some money to support their cause.",
  "npc.king_tibianus.in_exchange_for_4": "In exchange for a truly generous donation, I will offer a special outfit. Do you want to make a donation?",
  "npc.king_tibianus.in_that_case_5": "In that case, return to me once you made up your mind.",
  "npc.king_tibianus.take_this_armor_6": "Take this armor as a token of great gratitude. Let us forever remember this day, my friend!",
  "npc.king_tibianus.please_make_sure_7": "Please make sure you have free slots in your store inbox.",
  "npc.king_tibianus.you_do_not_8": "You do not have enough money to donate that amount.",
  "npc.king_tibianus.you_alread_have_9": "You alread have that addon.",
  "npc.king_tibianus.take_this_helmet_10": "Take this helmet as a token of great gratitude. Let us forever remember this day, my friend. ",
  "npc.king_tibianus.you_do_not_11": "You do not have enough money to donate that amount.",
  "npc.king_tibianus.you_alread_have_12": "You alread have that outfit.",
  "npc.king_tibianus.you_need_to_13": "You need to donate {armor} outfit first.",
  "npc.king_tibianus.take_this_boots_14": "Take this boots as a token of great gratitude. Let us forever remember this day, my friend. ",
  "npc.king_tibianus.you_do_not_15": "You do not have enough money to donate that amount.",
  "npc.king_tibianus.you_alread_have_16": "You alread have that outfit.",
  "npc.king_tibianus.you_need_to_17": "You need to donate {helmet} addon first.",
  "npc.king_tibianus.ah_i_vaguely_18": "Ah, I vaguely remember that our little allies were eager to build some base. So speak up, what do you want?",
  "npc.king_tibianus.so_you_wold_19": "So you wold like to donate 500.000.000 gold pieces which in return will entitle you to wear a unique armor?",
  "npc.king_tibianus.so_you_would_20": "So you would like to donate 250.000.000 gold pieces which in return will entitle you to wear unique helmet?",
  "npc.king_tibianus.so_you_would_21": "So you would like to donate 250.000.000 gold pieces which in return will entitle you to wear a unique boots?",
  "npc.king_tibianus.wrong_word_22": "Wrong Word.",
  "npc.klaus.hmm_you_look_1": "Hmm, you look like a seasoned seadog. Kill Captain Ray Striker, bring me his lucky pillow as a proof and you are our hero!",
  "npc.klaus.do_you_have_2": "Do you have Striker's pillow?",
  "npc.klaus.you_did_it_3": "You DID it!!! Incredible! Boys, lets have a PAAAAAARTY!!!!",
  "npc.klaus.come_back_when_4": "Come back when you have his lucky pillow.",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.i_dont_need_1": "I don't need your help for now. Come back later.",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.come_back_when_2": "Come back when you have finished your job.",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.il_say_im_3": "I'l say I'm blown away but a Klom Stonecutter is not that easily impressed. Still, your got your hands dirt for us and I appreciate that.",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.alright_good_those_4": "Alright, good. Those things are strolling about and I ain't gonna have that. If it moves more than two legs, destroy it. If it moves legs and tentacles, destroy it again.",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.i_dont_need_5": "I don't need your help for now. Come back later.",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.come_back_when_6": "Come back when you have finished your job.",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.so_you_did_7": "So you did it. Well, that won't be the last of 'em but this sure helps our situation down here. Return to me later if you want to help me again!",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.so_you_did_8": "So you did it. And you even made prisoners, the bonus is yours! Well, that won't be the last of 'em but this sure helps our situation down here. Return to me later if you want to help me again!",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.very_well_now_9": "Very well, now try to find some of their makeshift homes and tear'em down. There's bound to be some stragglers you can 'persuade' to surrender, eliminate any resistance. Get back here when you're done.",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.if_you_bring_10": "If you bring me any suspicious devices on creatures you slay down here, I'll make it worth your while by telling the others of your generosity. How many do you want to offer?",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.you_want_to_11": "You want to offer ",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.dont_waste_my_12": "Don't waste my time.",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.you_dont_have_13": "You don't have enough suspicious devices.",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.you_dont_have_14": "You don't have enough suspicious devices.",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.you_dont_have_15": "You don't have enough suspicious devices.",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.so_you_want_16": "So you want to know what we all think about your deeds? What leader's opinion are you interested in, the {gnomes} (Gnomus), the {dwarves} (Klom Stonecutter) or the {scouts} (Lardoc Bashsmite)?",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.the_gnomes_are_17": "The gnomes are still in need of your help, member of Bigfoot's Brigade. Prove your worth by answering their calls! (",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.the_dwarves_are_18": "The dwarves are still in need of your help, member of Bigfoot's Brigade. Prove your worth by answering their calls! (",
  "npc.klom_stonecutter.the_scouts_are_19": "The scouts are still in need of your help, member of Bigfoot's Brigade. Prove your worth by answering their calls! (",
  "npc.kroox.hm_well_i_1": "Hm, well I guess its ok to tell you ... <tells you about Lokurs measurements> ",
  "npc.kulag_the_guard.you_adventurers_become_1": "You adventurers become more and more of a pest.",
  "npc.kulag_the_guard.they_should_throw_2": "They should throw you all into jail instead of giving you all those quests and rewards an honest watchman can only dream about.",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.i_dont_need_1": "I don't need your help for now. Come back later.",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.come_back_when_2": "Come back when you have finished your job.",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.you_got_rid_3": "You got rid of a lot of corpses, very good. Now we have a realistic chance of pushing them back! Return to me later for more work if you want.",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.noted_get_one_4": "Noted. Get one of the gnomish devices from the container next to me and 'use' it on any diremaw corpses to effectively neutralise them. At least the gnomes told me this will work - good luck!",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.i_dont_need_5": "I don't need your help for now. Come back later.",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.you_did_a_6": "You did a great job out there, the stuff will continue to grow, however. Return to me later for more work.",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.noted_now_get_7": "Noted. Now, get down there and rain some fire on them.",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.if_you_bring_8": "If you bring me any suspicious devices on creatures you slay down here, I'll make it worth your while by telling the others of your generosity. How many do you want to offer? ",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.you_want_to_9": "You want to offer ",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.dont_waste_my_10": "Don't waste my time.",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.you_dont_have_11": "You don't have enough suspicious devices.",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.you_dont_have_12": "You don't have enough suspicious devices.",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.you_dont_have_13": "You don't have enough suspicious devices.",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.so_you_want_14": "So you want to know what we all think about your deeds? What leader's opinion are you interested in, the {gnomes} (Gnomus), the {dwarves} (Klom Stonecutter) or the {scouts} (Lardoc Bashsmite)?",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.the_gnomes_are_15": "The gnomes are still in need of your help, member of Bigfoot's Brigade. Prove your worth by answering their calls! (",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.the_dwarves_are_16": "The dwarves are still in need of your help, member of Bigfoot's Brigade. Prove your worth by answering their calls! (",
  "npc.lardoc_bashsmite.the_scouts_are_17": "The scouts are still in need of your help, member of Bigfoot's Brigade. Prove your worth by answering their calls! (",
  "npc.lazaran.me_people_wanting_1": "Me people wanting {peace}. No war with others. No war with {little men}. We few. We weak. Need {help}. We not wanting make {war}. No hurt.",
  "npc.lazaran.oh_you_found_2": "Oh! You found holy skull? In bone pile you found?! Thank Pandor you brought! Me can have it back?",
  "npc.lazaran.you_say_you_3": "You say you was to where sun is hot and burning? And where trees grow as high as mountain? And where Fasuon cries white tears? Me can't wait to see!! Can have holy skull back?",
  "npc.lazaran.we_been_weak_4": "We been weak for too long! We prepare for great hunt. But still need many doings! You can help us?",
  "npc.lazaran.you_bring_us_5": "You bring us big pot of strange water from little men?",
  "npc.lazaran.me_people_wanting_6": "Me people wanting peace. No war with others. No war with little men.",
  "npc.lazaran.you_mean_you_7": "You mean you want help us?",
  "npc.lazaran.you_hero_of_8": "You hero of our tribe if bring back holy skull!",
  "npc.lazaran.me_thank_you_9": "Me thank you much! All wisdom safe again now.",
  "npc.lazaran.you_do_not_10": "You do not have it!",
  "npc.lazaran.here_take_holy_11": "Here take holy skull. You bring where you think is good. See as much as possible! See where other people live!",
  "npc.lazaran.we_make_big_12": "We make big ritual soon and learn much about world outside. Me thank you many times for teaching us world. Very wise and adventurous you are!",
  "npc.lazaran.the_skull_have_13": "The skull have not seen all yet!",
  "npc.lazaran.we_need_to_14": "We need to calm and make happy gods. Best go to Ulala. She is priest of us and can tell what needs doing.",
  "npc.lazaran.we_make_big_15": "We make big ritual soon and learn much about world outside. Me thank you many times for teaching us world. Very wise and adventurous you are!",
  "npc.lazaran.you_do_not_16": "You do not have the brown strange water!",
  "npc.lazaran.me_have_many_17": "Me have many small task, but also big {mission}. You say what want.",
  "npc.lazaran.many_mighty_monster_18": "Many mighty monster rule land. We fight. We lose. We flee to mountain to hide.",
  "npc.lazaran.we_come_and_19": "We come and see little men. They like us, only very little. They having good weapon and armor, like the greens.",
  "npc.leeland.oh_yes_that_1": "Oh yes, that project the whole dwarven community is so excited about. I guess I already know why you are here, but speak up.",
  "npc.leeland.oh_yes_that_2": "Oh yes, that project the whole dwarven community is so excited about. I guess I already know why you are here, but speak up. Do you want to try again?",
  "npc.leeland.your_pathetic_whimpering_3": "Your pathetic whimpering amuses me. For this I grant you my assistance. But listen, one day I'll ask you to return this favour. From now on, you owe me one.",
  "npc.leeland.wrong_word_4": "Wrong Word.",
  "npc.leeland.the_idea_of_5": "The idea of a promising market and new resources suits us quite well. I think it is reasonable to send some assistance.",
  "npc.leeland.oh_yes_that_6": "Oh yes, that project the whole dwarven community is so excited about. I guess I already know why you are here, but speak up.",
  "npc.leeland.oh_yes_that_7": "Oh yes, that project the whole dwarven community is so excited about. I guess I already know why you are here, but speak up.",
  "npc.leeland.wrong_word_8": "Wrong Word.",
  "npc.liane.i_have_more_1": "I have more urgent problem to attend then that. Those hawks are hunting my carrier pigeons. Bring me 12 arrows and I'll see if I have the time for this nonsense. Do you have 12 arrows with you? ",
  "npc.liane.great_now_ill_2": "Great! Now I'll teach them a lesson ... For those measurements ... <tells you her measurements> ",
  "npc.liane.oh_you_dont_3": "Oh, you don't have it.",
  "npc.lisander.a_cookie_sure_1": "A cookie? Sure, is it for free?",
  "npc.lisander.whatever_you_have_2": "Whatever you have there, I think I don't want it.",
  "npc.lisander.errrkss_coughcough_what_3": "Errrkss - coughcough - what the - heck did you put in there? Get out of my sight!",
  "npc.lokur.your_weekly_ticket_1": "Your weekly ticket is still valid. Would be a waste of money to purchase a second one",
  "npc.lokur.do_you_want_2": "Do you want to purchase a weekly ticket for the ore wagons? With it you can travel freely and swiftly through Kazordoon for one week. 250 gold only. Deal?",
  "npc.lokur.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.lokur.here_is_your_4": "Here is your stamp. It can't be transferred to another person and will last one week from now. You'll get notified upon using an ore wagon when it isn't valid anymore.",
  "npc.lokur.come_on_i_5": "Come on, I have no clue what they are. Better ask my armorer Kroox for such nonsense.Go and ask him for good ol' Lokurs measurements, he'll know.",
  "npc.lorbas.you_want_me_1": "You want me to eat this cookie?",
  "npc.lorbas.you_have_no_2": "You have no cookie that I'd like.",
  "npc.lorbas.well_you_dont_3": "Well, you don't mind if I play around with this antidote rune a bit ... UHHH, YOU LOU ... uhm that was so ... funny, haha ... ha. Mhm, you better leave now.",
  "npc.lubo.sorry_the_backpack_1": "Sorry, the backpack I wear is not for sale. It's handmade from rare minotaur leather.",
  "npc.lubo.ah_right_almost_2": "Ah, right, almost forgot about the backpack! Have you brought me 100 pieces of minotaur leather as requested?",
  "npc.lubo.just_in_time_3": "Just in time! Your backpack is finished. Here you go, I hope you like it.",
  "npc.lubo.uh_i_didnt_4": "Uh... I didn't expect you to return that early. Sorry, but I'm not finished yet with your backpack. I'm doing the best I can, promised.",
  "npc.lubo.sorry_but_i_5": "Sorry, but I can only make one backpack per person, else I'd have to close my shop and open a leather manufactory.",
  "npc.lubo.well_if_you_6": "Well, if you really like this backpack, I could make one for you, but minotaur leather is hard to come by these days. Are you willing to put some work into this?",
  "npc.lubo.alright_then_if_7": "Alright then, if you bring me 100 pieces of fine minotaur leather I will see what I can do for you. You probably have to kill really many minotaurs though... so good luck!",
  "npc.lubo.sorry_but_i_8": "Sorry, but I don't run a welfare office, you know... no pain, no gain.",
  "npc.lubo.sorry_but_thats_9": "Sorry, but that's not enough leather yet to make one of these backpacks. Would you rather like to buy a normal backpack for 10 gold?",
  "npc.lubo.great_alright_i_10": "Great! Alright, I need a while to finish this backpack for you. Come ask me later, okay?",
  "npc.lubo.i_know_its_11": "I know, it's quite some work... don't lose heart, just keep killing minotaurs and you'll eventually get lucky. Would you rather like to buy a normal backpack for 10 gold?",
  "npc.lubo.ah_yes_i_12": "Ah yes, I remember my grandfather talking about that name. This house used to be an inn a long time ago. My family bought it from some of these flower guys.",
  "npc.lubo.oh_i_mean_13": "Oh, I mean druids of course. They sold the cottage to my family after some of them died in an accident or something like that.",
  "npc.lubo.as_far_as_14": "As far as I can remember the story, a pet escaped its stable behind the inn. It got somehow involved with powerful magic at a ritual and was transformed in some way.",
  "npc.lubo.my_grandpa_told_15": "My grandpa told me, in the old days there were some behind this cottage. Nothing big though, just small ones, for chicken or rabbits.",
  "npc.lugri.this_skull_shows_1": "This skull shows that you are a true follower of Zathroth and the glorious gods of darkness. Are you willing to prove your loyalty?",
  "npc.lugri.is_it_your_2": "Is it your true wish to sacrifice a medusa shield to Zathroth?",
  "npc.lugri.is_it_your_3": "Is it your true wish to sacrifice a dragon scale mail to Zathroth?",
  "npc.lugri.is_it_your_4": "Is it your true wish to sacrifice crown legs to Zathroth?",
  "npc.lugri.is_it_your_5": "Is it your true wish to sacrifice a ring of the sky to Zathroth?",
  "npc.lugri.come_back_when_6": "Come back when you have slain 4000 necromancers and priestesses!",
  "npc.lugri.come_back_when_7": "Come back when you have slain 1000 necromancers and priestesses!",
  "npc.lugri.you_cant_live_8": "You can't live without serving, can you? Although you are quite annoying, you're still somewhat useful. Continue killing Necromancers and Priestesses for me. 1000 are enough this time. What do you say?",
  "npc.lugri.it_will_be_9": "It will be a hard task which requires many sacrifices. Do you still want to proceed?",
  "npc.lugri.good_decision_playername_10": "Good decision, |PLAYERNAME|. Your first sacrifice will be a medusa shield. Bring it to me and do give it happily.",
  "npc.lugri.good_i_accept_11": "Good. I accept your sacrifice. The second sacrifice I require from you is a dragon scale mail. Bring it to me and do give it happily.",
  "npc.lugri.you_dont_have_12": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.lugri.good_i_accept_13": "Good. I accept your sacrifice. The third sacrifice I require from you are crown legs. Bring them to me and do give them happily.",
  "npc.lugri.you_dont_have_14": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.lugri.good_i_accept_15": "Good. I accept your sacrifice. The last sacrifice I require from you is a ring of the sky. Bring it to me and do give it happily.",
  "npc.lugri.you_dont_have_16": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.lugri.good_i_accept_17": "Good. I accept your sacrifice. You have proven that you are a true follower of Zathroth and do not hesitate to sacrifice worldly goods. Thus, I will reward you with this headgear. ",
  "npc.lugri.you_dont_have_18": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.lugri.good_then_go_19": "Good. Then go.",
  "npc.lukosch.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to purchase a weekly ticket for the ore wagons? With it you can travel freely and swiftly through Kazordoon for one week. 250 gold only. Deal?",
  "npc.lukosch.your_weekly_ticket_2": "Your weekly ticket is still valid. Would be a waste of money to purchase a second one",
  "npc.lukosch.here_is_your_3": "Here is your stamp. It can't be transferred to another person and will last one week from now. You'll get notified upon using an ore wagon when it isn't valid anymore.",
  "npc.lukosch.you_dont_have_4": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.lurik.ah_youve_just_1": "Ah, you've just come in time. An experienced explorer is just what we need here! Would you like to go on a mission for us?",
  "npc.lurik.youre_not_done_2": "You're not done yet...",
  "npc.lurik.have_you_retrieved_3": "Have you retrieved the memory crystal?",
  "npc.lurik.give_me_some_4": "Give me some more time!",
  "npc.lurik.excellent_just_report_5": "Excellent. Just report about your mission when you got the memory crystal.",
  "npc.lurik.ah_great_please_6": "Ah, great. Please give me some time to evaluate the information. Then talk to me again about your mission. ",
  "npc.lynda.did_you_bring_1": "Did you bring a sample of each wand and each rod with you?",
  "npc.lynda.did_you_obtain_2": "Did you obtain 10 ounces of magic sulphur?",
  "npc.lynda.were_you_actually_3": "Were you actually able to retrieve the Necromancer's soul stone?",
  "npc.lynda.am_i_sensing_4": "Am I sensing enough holy energy from ankhs here?",
  "npc.lynda.im_glad_to_5": "I'm glad to tell you that I have finished the ritual, player. Here is your new wand. I hope you carry it proudly for everyone to see..",
  "npc.lynda.please_let_me_6": "Please let me focus for a while, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.lynda.alright_then_come_7": "Alright then. Come back to with a sample of all five wands and five rods, please.",
  "npc.lynda.thank_you_that_8": "Thank you, that must have been a lot to carry. Now, please bring me 10 ounces of magic sulphur.",
  "npc.lynda.very_good_i_9": "Very good. I will immediately start to prepare the ritual and extract the elemental energy from the wands and rods. Please bring me the Necromancer's soul stone now.",
  "npc.lynda.you_have_found_10": "You have found a rarity there, |PLAYERNAME|. This will become the tip of your blessed wand. Please bring me 20 ankhs now to complete the ritual.",
  "npc.lynda.the_ingredients_for_11": "The ingredients for the ritual are complete! I will start to prepare your blessed wand, but I have to medidate first. Please come back later to hear how the ritual went.",
  "npc.lynda.you_are_already_12": "You are already married to {",
  "npc.lynda.you_already_made_13": "You already made a wedding proposal to {",
  "npc.lynda.a_player_with_14": "A player with this name does not exist.",
  "npc.lynda.you_really_want_15": "You REALLY want to marry yourself? c'mon, be serious.",
  "npc.lynda.as_i_said_16": "As I said, you need a wedding ring and the wedding outfit box in order to marry.",
  "npc.lynda.since_both_of_17": "Since both of you are willing to marry, I accept to celebrate your marriage, go prepare yourself, and tell me when you are ready for the {celebration}",
  "npc.lynda.ok_now_lets_18": "Ok, now let's wait and see if {",
  "npc.lynda.your_partner_didnt_19": "Your partner didn't accept your proposal, yet",
  "npc.lynda.are_you_sure_20": "Are you sure you want to remove your wedding proposal with {",
  "npc.lynda.you_dont_have_21": "You don't have any pending proposal to be removed.",
  "npc.lynda.are_you_sure_22": "Are you sure you want to divorce of {",
  "npc.lynda.you_arent_married_23": "You aren't married to get a divorce.",
  "npc.maelyrra.some_annoying_nightmarish_1": "Some annoying nightmarish creatures rove about in the tunnels underneath this island. They are threatening the members of my court and devastate the flora and fauna. They also threaten the natural balance. Would you go and fight them for me?",
  "npc.maelyrra.have_you_defeated_2": "Have you defeated the nightmare monsters?",
  "npc.maelyrra.have_you_found_3": "Have you found the moon mirror and freed the captured fairies?",
  "npc.maelyrra.have_you_already_4": "Have you already found the starlight vial and the sun catcher?",
  "npc.maelyrra.could_you_already_5": "Could you already gather the three lights?",
  "npc.maelyrra.have_you_repaired_6": "Have you repaired the magical barrier? Is Feyrist safe?",
  "npc.maelyrra.thank_you_again_7": "Thank you again, mortal being! The fae will be forever grateful.",
  "npc.maelyrra.i_knew_you_8": "I knew you would be willing to help us. Kill two hundred of them as well as the terrible demon Kroazur who's leading them. That should bring some relief for the fae.",
  "npc.maelyrra.thank_you_you_9": "Thank you! You rendered a great favour to the fae courts and Feyrist alike. Would you help us with another problem?",
  "npc.maelyrra.you_rendered_a_10": "You rendered a great favour to the fae courts and Feyrist alike. Would you help us with another problem?",
  "npc.maelyrra.you_have_to_11": "You have to kill two hundred of nightmare creatures and the terrible demon Kroazur who's leading them. That should bring some relief for the fae.",
  "npc.maelyrra.thank_you_mortal_12": "Thank you, mortal being! Please keep the mirror. I think you may need it soon, because there is another problem. Would you help us again?",
  "npc.maelyrra.please_keep_the_13": "Please keep the mirror. I think you may need it soon, because there is another problem. Would you help us again?",
  "npc.maelyrra.please_seek_out_14": "Please seek out the tainted fae, retrieve the artefact and free the captured fairies.",
  "npc.maelyrra.you_have_to_15": "You have to catch the respective lights and store it in the corresponding vessel.",
  "npc.maelyrra.thank_you_mortal_16": "Thank you, mortal being! The fae will be forever grateful. Take this blossom bag as a little thank-you gift. Such blossoms grow on our trees just once in a decade, so they are quite rare.",
  "npc.maelyrra.if_you_charge_17": "If you charge all fifteen arcane sources with the respective light, Feyrist's protection will be ensured again.",
  "npc.maeryn.so_you_dont_1": "So you don't know it yet. This island, Grimvale, is affected by were-sickness. Many {pitiful}, who are stricken with the curse, dwell in the {tunnels} and caverns underneath the village and the nearby hurst.",
  "npc.maeryn.yes_pitiful_for_2": "Yes, pitiful. For they are savage beasts now who regularly come up from below to attack the village. But once they were inhabitants of Grimvale, before they {changed}.",
  "npc.maeryn.through_a_bite_3": "Through a bite or even a scratch, you may be infected with the were-sickness. If that happens, there is little {hope} - until the next full moon you'll change into a were-creature, depending on the animal that hurt you.",
  "npc.maeryn.there_is_a_4": "There is a plant, the purple nightshade. It blossoms exclusively in the light of the full moon and only underground, where the full moon's light is falling through fissures in the surface. Only this plant's blossoms are able to defeat the {were-sickness}.",
  "npc.maeryn.yes_the_story_5": "Yes, the story goes that there are ancient artefacts still hidden in the temple ruins, such as helmets in the form of wolven heads, for example. It is said that moonlight crystals are needed to enchant these artefacts.",
  "npc.maeryn.three_of_these_6": "Three of these blossoms should suffice to heal some afflicted persons. But if you bring more I'd be grateful, of course.",
  "npc.maeryn.my_name_is_7": "My name is Maeryn.",
  "npc.maeryn.yes_thats_me_8": "Yes, that's me.",
  "npc.maeryn.its_exactly_9": "It's exactly ",
  "npc.maeryn.im_the_protector_10": "I'm the protector of this little village. A bit of a self-proclaimed function, I admit, but someone has to watch over {Grimvale}. It is a {dangerous} place.",
  "npc.maeryn.the_small_island_11": "The small island you are standing on. For a long time it was a peaceful and placid place. But lately it has become more {dangerous}.",
  "npc.maeryn.hes_an_experienced_12": "He's an experienced hunter and knows much about the woods, the animals that dwell there, and about the {werewolves}. He's devoted himself to finding out everything there is to know about the {Curse}.",
  "npc.maeryn.yes_my_friend_13": "Yes, my friend, werewolves. They dwell here on {Grimvale}, threatening our life. The were-sickness transforms peaceful villagers into savage beasts. We're not sure how this curse found its way into our small village. But undoubtedly it did.",
  "npc.maeryn.shes_an_old_14": "She's an old druid. She's been living here on {Grimvale} since she was a little girl, just like me. She's very interested in were-creature body parts. If you find any, I'm sure she will love to trade with you.",
  "npc.maeryn.hes_basically_a_15": "He's basically a ferryman nowadays, but I remember when he was our village's leading fisherman. He offers a ferry service between Grimvale and Edron. You must have met him - he sailed you here.",
  "npc.maeryn.you_brought_the_16": "You brought the wolven helmet, as i see. Do you want to change something?",
  "npc.maeryn.so_which_profession_17": "So, which profession would you give preference to when enchanting the helmet: {knight}, {sorcerer}, {druid} or {paladin}?",
  "npc.maeryn.and_what_would_18": "And what would be your preferred weapon? {Club}, {axe} or {sword}",
  "npc.maeryn.so_this_is_19": "So this is your choice. If you want to change it, you will have to come to me again.",
  "npc.maeryn.message_when_player_20": "Message when player do not have quest.",
  "npc.maeryn.so_this_is_21": "So this is your choice. If you want to change it, you will have to come to me again.",
  "npc.maeryn.message_when_player_22": "Message when player do not have quest.",
  "npc.malor.shove_off_little_1": "Shove off, little one! Humans are not welcome here, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  "npc.malor.greetings_human_playernam_2": "Greetings, human |PLAYERNAME|. My patience with your kind is limited, so speak quickly and choose your words well.",
  "npc.malor.you_havent_finished_3": "You haven't finished your final mission yet. Shall I explain it again to you?",
  "npc.malor.have_you_found_4": "Have you found Fa'hradin's lamp and placed it in Malor's personal chambers?",
  "npc.malor.theres_no_mission_5": "There's no mission left for you, friend of the Efreet. However, I have a {task} for you.",
  "npc.malor.your_choice_6": "Your choice.",
  "npc.malor.just_do_it_7": "Just do it!",
  "npc.malor.there_are_still_8": "There are still blue djinns everywhere! We can't let a single one of them live. I guess a start would be for you to kill 500 blue djinns and Marid. Will you assist us?",
  "npc.malor.come_back_when_9": "Come back when you kill 500 blue djinns and Marid.",
  "npc.malor.good_then_show_10": "Good, then show those pathetic Marid what you're made of.",
  "npc.marina.um_you_mean_1": "Um. You mean, you really want me to touch that gooey spider silk just because you need yarn? Well... do you think that I'm pretty?",
  "npc.marina.okay_a_deal_2": "Okay... a deal is a deal, would you like me to create a {spool of yarn} from {10 pieces of spider silk}?",
  "npc.marina.did_you_bring_3": "Did you bring me the 50 honeycombs I requested and do you absolutely admire my beauty?",
  "npc.marina.giggles_i_think_4": "<giggles> I think he has a crush on me. Well, silly man, it is only for his own good. This way he can get accustomed to TRUE beauty. And I won't give him up anymore now that he is mine.",
  "npc.marina.is_that_the_5": "Is that the best you can do? A true Djinn would have done something more poetic.",
  "npc.marina.well_everyone_would_6": "Well, everyone would say that in your position. Do you think that I'm really, absolutely the most stunning being that you have ever seen?",
  "npc.marina.oh_goodie_thank_7": "Oh goodie! Thank you! Okay... I guess since my fingers are sticky now anyway, I will help you. From now on, if you bring me {10 pieces of spider silk}, I will create one {spool of yarn}.",
  "npc.marina.you_dont_have_8": "You don't have enough honey.",
  "npc.marina.ew_gooey_there_9": "Ew... gooey... there you go.",
  "npc.marina.you_dont_have_10": "You don't have the required items.",
  "npc.maris.the_good_thing_1": "The good thing about cookies is that they last for a long time. So they are well suited for a boat trip. I'll take some of those, okay?",
  "npc.maris.itd_be_better_2": "It'd be better for you to leave now.",
  "npc.maris.lets_try_that_3": "Let's try that stuff first - ARRRRRRHH! <coughs> That must have been the worst cookie I've ever eaten. Get off my ship.",
  "npc.markwin.no_the_hornless_1": "No! The hornless have reached my city! BODYGUARDS TO ME!",
  "npc.markwin.a_letter_from_2": "A letter from my Moohmy?? Do you have a letter from my Moohmy to me?",
  "npc.markwin.you_bring_me_3": "You bring me ... a cookie???",
  "npc.markwin.uhm_well_thank_4": "Uhm, well thank you, hornless being.",
  "npc.markwin.you_have_no_5": "You have no cookie that I'd like.",
  "npc.markwin.i_understand_this_6": "I understand this as a peace-offering, human ... UNGH ... THIS IS AN OUTRAGE! THIS MEANS WAR!!!",
  "npc.markwin.hm_good_bye_7": "Hm ... good bye.",
  "npc.marvin.you_cant_vote_1": "You can't vote yet.",
  "npc.marvin.how_many_of_2": "How many of your x votes do you want to cast?",
  "npc.marvin.did_i_get_3": "Did I get that right: You want to cast 1 of your votes on funding the {archives}?",
  "npc.marvin.thanks_you_successfully_4": "Thanks, you successfully cast your vote. Feel free to continue gathering votes by helping the city! Farewell.",
  "npc.maryza.welcome_to_the_1": "Welcome to the Jolly Axeman, |PLAYERNAME|. Have a good time and eat some food!",
  "npc.maryza.the_cookbook_of_2": "The cookbook of the famous dwarven kitchen. You're lucky. I have a few copies on sale. Do you like one for 150 gold?",
  "npc.maryza.im_sorry_but_3": "I'm sorry but I sell only one copy to each customer. Otherwise they would have been sold out a long time ago.",
  "npc.maryza.no_gold_no_4": "No gold, no sale, that's it.",
  "npc.maryza.here_you_are_5": "Here you are. Happy cooking!",
  "npc.maryza.i_have_but_6": "I have but a few copies, anyway.",
  "npc.mazarius.ah_you_have_1": "Ah, you have heard about my search for experienced help. And indeed your reputation for solving certain {problems} has preceded you.",
  "npc.mazarius.my_problems_are_2": "My problems are, so to say, dire news for the whole world. <sigh> I don't want to confuse you with overly complicated and lengthy stories, so do you want to hear the {long} version or the {short}?",
  "npc.mazarius.good_but_i_3": "Good!, but I need 30 {demonic essences} to exchange with the demonic messenger for a ticket for you to enter the Abodes of Torments.",
  "npc.mazarius.do_you_have_4": "Do you have 30 demonic essences to offer to the demonic messenger?",
  "npc.mazarius.excellent_this_will_5": "Excellent! This will empower possibilty to create a breach is enough to let you pass into that hellish hiding place. ...",
  "npc.mazarius.you_dont_have_6": "You don't have the demonic essences, back here when you get it.",
  "npc.mazarius.given_the_internal_7": "Given the internal power plays amongst the Seven, they are the ideal keepers for individual parts of an powerful artefact. Not one of them would allow his compatriots to hold such a power, and neither would trust the other.",
  "npc.mazarius.ah_a_good_8": "Ah, a good man and a competent aid.",
  "npc.mazarius.i_like_the_9": "I like the quietness and the climate. And admittedly it helped my studies not to be constantly disturbed by petitioners.",
  "npc.mazarius.thais_has_become_10": "Thais has become a melting pot of some source. Yet whatever you melt, if the ingredients are corrupted, the outcome is always flawed.",
  "npc.mazarius.instead_of_banding_11": "Instead of banding together and starting to change something, they and Thais keep wasting resources in hostilities.",
  "npc.mazarius.edron_has_become_12": "Edron has become as stagnant as the teachings in its academy. No new idea has been thought there for decades. The whole Edron is an example for what happens when humanity has become fat and lazy.",
  "npc.mazarius.an_almost_laughable_13": "An almost laughable greed is persistent in that city. At least this makes knowledge and materials conveniently available to those who can match their prizes.",
  "npc.melfar.yes_i_can_1": "Yes, I can hear them even from here. It has to be a legion of beavers! I'll send the men to get the wood as soon as their gnawing frenzy has settled! You can report to Ongulf that men and wood will be on their way!",
  "npc.melfar.if_you_place_2": "If you place the beaver bait on trees on some strategic locations, we could let the beavers do the work and later on, I'll send men to get the fallen trees.",
  "npc.melfar.here_you_go_3": "Here you go.",
  "npc.melfar.you_dont_have_4": "You dont have enough of gold coins.",
  "npc.melfar.you_want_to_5": "You want to buy a Flask with Beaver Bait for 100 gold coins?",
  "npc.melfar.im_out_of_6": "Im out of stock.",
  "npc.miles_the_guard.im_fine_theres_1": "I'm fine. There's no trouble at all.",
  "npc.miles_the_guard.well_of_course_2": "Well, of course. We live in safety and peace.",
  "npc.miles_the_guard.i_think_the_3": "I think the gods are looking after us and their hands shield us from evil.",
  "npc.miles_the_guard.i_think_the_4": "I think the gods and the government do their best to keep away harm from the citizens.",
  "npc.mirabell.oh_youve_heard_1": "Oh you've heard about my excellent pies, didn't you? I am flattered. Unfortunately I'm completely out of flour. I need 2 portions of flour for one pie. Just tell me when you have enough flour for your pies.",
  "npc.mirabell.for_pies_this_2": "For 12 pies this is 240 gold. Do you want to buy them?",
  "npc.mirabell.do_you_bring_3": "Do you bring me the flour needed for your pies?",
  "npc.mirabell.i_think_you_4": "I think you are confusing the dust in your pockets with flour. You certainly do not have enough flour for 12 pies.",
  "npc.mirabell.excellent_now_i_5": "Excellent. Now I can start baking the pies. As you helped me, I will make you a good price for them.",
  "npc.mirabell.you_dont_have_6": "You don't have enough money, don't try to fool me.",
  "npc.mirabell.without_flour_i_7": "Without flour I can't do anything, sorry.",
  "npc.mirabell.what_are_you_8": "What are you? Some kind of fool?",
  "npc.miraia.hehe_would_you_1": "Hehe, would you like to wear a pretty veil like I do? Well... I could help you, but you would have to complete a task first.",
  "npc.miraia.you_mean_you_2": "You mean, you would like to prove that you deserve to wear such a veil?",
  "npc.miraia.let_me_cover_3": "Let me cover my nose before I get this for you... Would you REALLY like to buy scarab cheese for 100 gold?",
  "npc.miraia.oh_the_last_4": "Oh the last cheese molded? Would you like to buy another one for 100 gold?",
  "npc.miraia.excellent_come_back_5": "Excellent! Come back to me once you have collected 100 pieces of ape fur.",
  "npc.miraia.that_is_a_6": "That is a shameless lie.",
  "npc.miraia.here_it_is_7": "Here it is.",
  "npc.miraia.you_dont_have_8": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.miraia.what_a_pity_9": "What a pity.",
  "npc.moe.i_guess_i_1": "I guess I could do this, yes. But I have to impose a condition. If you bring me ten sphinx feathers I will steal this ring for you.",
  "npc.moe.thank_you_they_2": "Thank you! They look so pretty, I'm very pleased. Agreed, now I will steal the ring from the Ambassador of Rathleton. Just be patient, I have to wait for a good moment.",
  "npc.moe.if_you_bring_3": "If you bring me ten sphinx feathers, I will steal this ring for you.",
  "npc.moe.you_already_delivered_4": "You already delivered the feathers. Be patient while I steal the ring.",
  "npc.moe.youre_arriving_at_5": "You're arriving at the right time. I have the ring you asked for. It was not too difficult. I just had to wait until the Ambassador left his residence and then I climbed in through the window. Here it is.",
  "npc.moe.i_will_steal_6": "I will steal it, promised. I'm just waiting for a good moment.",
  "npc.moe.i_guess_i_7": "I guess I could do this, yes. But I have to impose a condition. If you bring me ten sphinx feathers I will steal this ring for you.",
  "npc.moe.you_dont_need_8": "You don't need this ring anymore.",
  "npc.moe.im_upset_to_9": "I'm upset to accuse myself, the lyre is hidden in a tomb west of Kilmaresh.",
  "npc.moe.you_already_know_10": "You already know about the lyre's location.",
  "npc.mordecai.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.morgan.ahh_so_duncan_1": "Ahh. So Duncan sent you, eh? You must have done something really impressive. Okay, take this fine sabre from me, mate.",
  "npc.morgan.thank_you_for_2": "Thank you for delivering my letter to Eremo. I have no more missions for you.",
  "npc.morgan.you_already_have_3": "You already have this outfit!",
  "npc.morgan.great_simply_bring_4": "Great! Simply bring me 100 iron ore and one royal steel and I will happily {forge} it for you.",
  "npc.morgan.alright_as_a_5": "Alright! As a matter of fact, I have one in store. Here you go!",
  "npc.morgan.you_do_not_6": "You do not have all the required items.",
  "npc.morgan.you_already_have_7": "You already have this outfit!",
  "npc.morgan.great_simply_bring_8": "Great! Simply bring me 100 Iron Ore and one Crude Iron and I will happily {forge} it for you.",
  "npc.morgan.alright_as_a_9": "Alright! As a matter of fact, I have one in store. Here you go!",
  "npc.morgan.you_do_not_10": "You do not have all the required items.",
  "npc.morgan.what_would_you_11": "What would you like me to forge for you? A {knight's sword} or a {warrior's sword}?",
  "npc.morgan.alright_we_will_12": "Alright, we will see. Here, take this letter and deliver it safely to old Eremo on Cormaya.",
  "npc.mortimer.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to join the explorer society?",
  "npc.mortimer.oh_yes_an_2": "Oh yes, an interesting topic. We had vivid discussions about this discovery. But what is it that you want?",
  "npc.mortimer.the_missions_available_3": "The missions available for your rank are the {butterfly hunt}, {plant collection} and {ice delivery}.",
  "npc.mortimer.the_missions_available_4": "The missions available for your rank are {lizard urn}, {bonelord secrets} and {orc powder}.",
  "npc.mortimer.the_missions_available_5": "The missions available for your rank are {elven poetry}, {memory stone} and {rune writings}.",
  "npc.mortimer.the_explorer_society_6": "The explorer society needs a great deal of help in the research of astral travel. Are you willing to help?",
  "npc.mortimer.do_you_have_7": "Do you have some collected ectoplasm with you?",
  "npc.mortimer.did_you_bring_8": "Did you bring the dress?",
  "npc.mortimer.oh_yes_tell_9": "Oh, yes! Tell our fellow explorer that the papers are in the mail already.",
  "npc.mortimer.the_reports_from_10": "The reports from Port Hope have already arrived here and our progress is astonishing. We think it is possible to create an astral bridge between our bases. Are you interested to assist us with this?",
  "npc.mortimer.did_you_get_11": "Did you get the requested pickaxe from Uzgod in Kazordoon?",
  "npc.mortimer.did_you_get_12": "Did you get the ice we are looking for?",
  "npc.mortimer.the_mission_asks_13": "The mission asks you to collect some species of butterflies, are you interested?",
  "npc.mortimer.did_you_acquire_14": "Did you acquire the purple butterfly we are looking for?",
  "npc.mortimer.did_you_acquire_15": "Did you acquire the blue butterfly we are looking for?",
  "npc.mortimer.did_you_acquire_16": "Did you acquire the red butterfly we are looking for?",
  "npc.mortimer.in_this_mission_17": "In this mission we require you to get us some plant samples from Tiquandan plants. Would you like to fulfil this mission?",
  "npc.mortimer.did_you_acquire_18": "Did you acquire the sample of the jungle bells plant we are looking for?",
  "npc.mortimer.use_this_botanists_19": "Use this botanist's container on a witches cauldron to collect a sample for us. Bring it here and report about your plant collection.",
  "npc.mortimer.did_you_acquire_20": "Did you acquire the sample of the witches cauldron we are looking for?",
  "npc.mortimer.use_this_botanists_21": "Use this botanist's container on a giant jungle rose to obtain a sample for us. Bring it here and report about your plant collection.",
  "npc.mortimer.did_you_acquire_22": "Did you acquire the sample of the giant jungle rose we are looking for?",
  "npc.mortimer.the_explorer_society_23": "The explorer society would like to acquire an ancient urn which is some sort of relic to the lizard people of Tiquanda. Would you like to accept this mission?",
  "npc.mortimer.did_you_manage_24": "Did you manage to get the ancient urn?",
  "npc.mortimer.have_you_found_25": "Have you found any proof that the pyramid was built by bonelords?",
  "npc.mortimer.did_you_acquire_26": "Did you acquire some of the orcish powder?",
  "npc.mortimer.did_you_acquire_27": "Did you acquire a copy of 'Songs of the Forest' for us?",
  "npc.mortimer.were_you_able_28": "Were you able to acquire a memory stone for our society?",
  "npc.mortimer.did_you_create_29": "Did you create a copy of the ancient runes as requested?",
  "npc.mortimer.we_will_see_30": "We will see if you can handle this simple task. Get the pickaxe from Uzgod in Kazordoon and bring it to one of our bases. Report there about the pickaxe.",
  "npc.mortimer.just_in_time_31": "Just in time. Sadly not much ice is left over but it will do. Thank you again.",
  "npc.mortimer.sigh_i_think_32": "*Sigh* I think the time is right to grant you another chance to get that ice. Hurry up this time.",
  "npc.mortimer.a_little_bit_33": "A little bit battered but it will do. Thank you! If you think you are ready, ask for another butterfly hunt.",
  "npc.mortimer.a_little_bit_34": "A little bit battered but it will do. Thank you! If you think you are ready, ask for another butterfly hunt.",
  "npc.mortimer.that_is_an_35": "That is an extraordinary species you have brought. Thank you! That was the last butterfly we needed.",
  "npc.mortimer.fine_here_take_36": "Fine! Here take this botanist's container. Use it on a jungle bells plant to collect a sample for us. Report about your plant collection when you have been successful.",
  "npc.mortimer.i_see_it_37": "I see. It seems you've got some quite useful sample by sheer luck. Thank you! Just tell me when you are ready to continue with the plant collection.",
  "npc.mortimer.ah_finally_i_38": "Ah, finally. I started to wonder what took you so long. But thank you! Another fine sample, indeed. Just tell me when you are ready to continue with the plant collection.",
  "npc.mortimer.what_a_lovely_39": "What a lovely sample! With that you have finished your plant collection missions.",
  "npc.mortimer.yes_that_is_40": "Yes, that is the prized relic we have been looking for so long. You did a great job, thank you.",
  "npc.mortimer.you_did_it_41": "You did it! Excellent! The scientific world will be shaken by this discovery!",
  "npc.mortimer.you_really_got_42": "You really got it? Amazing! Thank you for your efforts.",
  "npc.mortimer.excellent_this_mission_43": "Excellent. This mission is easy but nonetheless vital. Travel to Ab'Dendriel and get the book.",
  "npc.mortimer.let_me_have_44": "Let me have a look! Yes, that's what we wanted. A copy of 'Songs of the Forest'. I won't ask any questions about those bloodstains.",
  "npc.mortimer.in_the_ruins_45": "In the ruins of north-western Edron you should be able to find a memory stone. Good luck.",
  "npc.mortimer.a_flawless_memory_46": "A flawless memory stone! Incredible! It will take years even to figure out how it works but what an opportunity for science, thank you!",
  "npc.mortimer.excellent_here_take_47": "Excellent! Here, take this tracing paper and use it on the object you will find there to create a copy of the ancient runes.",
  "npc.mortimer.its_a_bit_48": "It's a bit wrinkled but it will do. Thanks again.",
  "npc.mortimer.good_take_this_49": "Good! Take this container and use it on a ghost that was recently slain. Return with the collected ectoplasm and hand me that container ...",
  "npc.mortimer.dont_lose_the_50": "Don't lose the container. They are expensive!",
  "npc.mortimer.phew_i_had_51": "Phew, I had no idea that ectoplasm would smell that ... oh, it's you, well, sorry. Thank you for the ectoplasm.",
  "npc.mortimer.good_ask_me_52": "Good! Ask me for another mission.",
  "npc.mortimer.poor_ratha_thank_53": "Poor Ratha. Thank you for returning this skull to the society. We will see to a honourable burial of Ratha.",
  "npc.mortimer.come_back_when_54": "Come back when you find any information.",
  "npc.mortimer.marvellous_you_brought_55": "Marvellous! You brought a giant smith hammer for the explorer society!",
  "npc.mortimer.no_you_dont_56": "No you don't.",
  "npc.mortimer.its_always_a_57": "It's always a sad day when we learn about the death of a member. But at least we learnt about his fate. Thank you, here is your reward.",
  "npc.mortimer.did_it_melt_58": "Did it melt away?",
  "npc.mortimer.come_back_when_59": "Come back when you find any information.",
  "npc.mortimer.come_back_when_60": "Come back when you find one.",
  "npc.mortimer.the_explorer_society_61": "The explorer society is looking for a genuine giant smith hammer for our collection. It is rumoured the cyclopses of the Plains of Havoc might be using one. Did you by chance obtain such a hammer?",
  "npc.mother_of_jack.what_about_him_1": "What about him? He's downstairs as he always has been. He never went away from home any further than into the forest nearby. He rarely ever took a walk to Edron, did he?",
  "npc.mother_of_jack.thought_so_of_2": "Thought so. Of course he wouldn't do anything wrong. And he went where? Edron. Hm. I can see nothing wrong with that. But... he wasn't there often, was he?",
  "npc.mother_of_jack.what_but_he_3": "What...? But he wasn't up to something, was he?",
  "npc.mr_morris.ah_youre_here_1": "Ah, you're here to report about the {key} - any progress?",
  "npc.mr_morris.good_just_chat_2": "Good. Just chat with the guys. Someone is bound to remember *something* about that key.",
  "npc.mr_morris.the_key_to_3": "The key to the dormitory! Finally! You're a real sleuth. Here's your reward.",
  "npc.mr_morris.ah_very_good_4": "Ah, very good job. That should put a crimp in their activities. Here's your reward.",
  "npc.mr_morris.come_back_when_5": "Come back when you have slain {20 mountain trolls!}",
  "npc.mr_morris.ah_very_good_6": "Ah, very good job. That should put a crimp in their activities. Here's your reward.",
  "npc.mr_morris.come_back_when_7": "Come back when you have slain {20 muglex clan footman!}",
  "npc.mr_morris.ah_very_good_8": "Ah, very good job. That should put a crimp in their activities. Here's your reward.",
  "npc.mr_morris.come_back_when_9": "Come back when you have slain {20 minotaur bruisers!}",
  "npc.mr_morris.you_already_done_10": "You already done this task.",
  "npc.mr._west.indeed_i_can_1": "Indeed, I can see the benefits of a mutual agreement. I will later read the details and send a letter to your superior. ",
  "npc.mr._west.yes_for_the_2": "Yes, for the sake of my life I'll accept those terms. I know when I have lost. Tell your master I will comply with his orders. ",
  "npc.muriel.indeed_there_is_1": "Indeed there is something to be done, but I need someone more experienced. Come back later if you want to.",
  "npc.muriel.excellent_now_i_2": "Excellent! Now I can try to put my theoretical thoughts into practice and find a cure for the symptoms of undead. Here, take this for your efforts.",
  "npc.muriel.i_am_very_3": "I am very glad you helped me, but I am very busy at the moment.",
  "npc.muriel.i_see_you_4": "I see you have the porcelain masks. Are you ready to exchange them for the first addon?",
  "npc.muriel.i_see_you_5": "I see you have the colourful feathers. Are you ready to exchange them for the second addon?",
  "npc.muriel.you_need_the_6": "You need the outfit and 3 porcelain masks or 50 colored feathers to get the festive costume accessories.",
  "npc.muriel.very_good_you_7": "Very good! You gained the first addon to the festive outfit.",
  "npc.muriel.oh_sorry_but_8": "Oh, sorry but you don't have enough porcelain masks!",
  "npc.muriel.very_good_you_9": "Very good! You gained the second addon to the festive outfit.",
  "npc.muriel.oh_sorry_but_10": "Oh, sorry but you don't have enough colourful feathers!",
  "npc.muriel.i_provide_two_11": "I provide two addons. For the first one I need you to bring me three porcelain masks. For the second addon you need fifty colourful ostrich feathers. Do you want one of these addons?",
  "npc.muriel.what_do_you_12": "What do you have for me: the porcelain masks or the colourful feathers?",
  "npc.muriel.i_provide_two_13": "I provide two addons. For the first one I need you to bring me three porcelain masks. For the second addon you need fifty colourful ostrich feathers. Do you want one of these addons?",
  "npc.muriel.ohh_then_i_14": "Ohh, then I need to find another adventurer who wants to earn a great reward. Bye!",
  "npc.myra.this_tiara_is_1": "This Tiara is an award by the academy of Edron in recognition of my service here.",
  "npc.myra.please_ask_about_2": "Please ask about the 'outfit' first.",
  "npc.myra.well_maybe_if_3": "Well... maybe, if you help me a little, I could convince the academy of Edron that you are a valuable help here and deserve an award too. How about it?",
  "npc.myra.before_i_can_4": "Before I can nominate you for an award, please complete your task.",
  "npc.myra.go_to_the_5": "Go to the academy in Edron and tell Zoltan that I sent you, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.myra.i_dont_have_6": "I don't have any tasks for you right now, |PLAYERNAME|. You were of great help.",
  "npc.myra.thats_a_pity_7": "That's a pity.",
  "npc.myra.fine_lets_start_8": "Fine! Let's start with the 70 bat wings. I really feel uncomfortable out there in the jungle.",
  "npc.myra.would_you_like_9": "Would you like me to repeat the task requirements then?",
  "npc.myra.oh_did_you_10": "Oh, did you bring the 70 bat wings for me?",
  "npc.myra.have_you_found_11": "Have you found 20 pieces of red cloth?",
  "npc.myra.were_you_able_12": "Were you able to retrieve 40 pieces of ape fur?",
  "npc.myra.did_you_convince_13": "Did you convince the elves to give you 35 holy orchids?",
  "npc.myra.oh_did_you_14": "Oh, did you bring 10 spools of spider silk yarn for me?",
  "npc.myra.have_you_found_15": "Have you found 60 lizard scales?",
  "npc.myra.were_you_able_16": "Were you able to get all 40 red dragon scales?",
  "npc.myra.have_you_collected_17": "Have you collected 15 ounces of magic sulphur?",
  "npc.myra.have_you_gathered_18": "Have you gathered 30 ounces of vampire dust?",
  "npc.myra.no_no_thats_19": "No, no. That's not enough, I fear.",
  "npc.myra.thank_you_i_20": "Thank you! I really needed them for my anti-wrinkle lotion. Now, please bring me 20 pieces of red cloth.",
  "npc.myra.would_you_like_21": "Would you like me to repeat the task requirements then?",
  "npc.myra.no_no_thats_22": "No, no. That's not enough, I fear.",
  "npc.myra.great_this_should_23": "Great! This should be enough for my new dress. Don't forget to bring me 40 pieces of ape fur next!",
  "npc.myra.would_you_like_24": "Would you like me to repeat the task requirements then?",
  "npc.myra.no_no_thats_25": "No, no. That's not enough, I fear.",
  "npc.myra.nice_job_player_26": "Nice job, player. You see, I'm testing a new depilation cream. I guess if it works on ape fur it's good quality. Next, please bring me 35 holy orchids.",
  "npc.myra.would_you_like_27": "Would you like me to repeat the task requirements then?",
  "npc.myra.no_no_thats_28": "No, no. That's not enough, I fear.",
  "npc.myra.thank_god_the_29": "Thank god! The scent of holy orchids is simply the only possible solution against the horrible stench from the tavern latrine. Now, please bring me 10 rolls of spider silk yarn.",
  "npc.myra.would_you_like_30": "Would you like me to repeat the task requirements then?",
  "npc.myra.no_no_thats_31": "No, no. That's not enough, I fear.",
  "npc.myra.i_appreciate_it_32": "I appreciate it. My pet doggie manages to bite through all sorts of leashes, which is why he is always gone. I'm sure this strong yarn will keep him. Now, go for the 60 lizard scales!",
  "npc.myra.would_you_like_33": "Would you like me to repeat the task requirements then?",
  "npc.myra.no_no_thats_34": "No, no. That's not enough, I fear.",
  "npc.myra.good_job_they_35": "Good job. They will look almost like sequins on my new dress. Please go for the 40 red dragon scales now.",
  "npc.myra.would_you_like_36": "Would you like me to repeat the task requirements then?",
  "npc.myra.no_no_thats_37": "No, no. That's not enough, I fear.",
  "npc.myra.thanks_they_make_38": "Thanks! They make a pretty decoration, don't you think? Please bring me 15 ounces of magic sulphur now!",
  "npc.myra.would_you_like_39": "Would you like me to repeat the task requirements then?",
  "npc.myra.no_no_thats_40": "No, no. That's not enough, I fear.",
  "npc.myra.ah_thats_enough_41": "Ah, that's enough magic sulphur for my new peeling. You should try it once, your skin gets incredibly smooth. Now, the only thing I need is vampire dust. 30 ounces will suffice.",
  "npc.myra.would_you_like_42": "Would you like me to repeat the task requirements then?",
  "npc.myra.no_no_thats_43": "No, no. That's not enough, I fear.",
  "npc.myra.ah_great_now_44": "Ah, great. Now I can finally finish the potion which the academy of Edron asked me to. I guess, now you want your reward, don't you?",
  "npc.myra.would_you_like_45": "Would you like me to repeat the task requirements then?",
  "npc.myra.this_tiara_is_46": "This Tiara is an award by the academy of Edron in recognition of my service here.",
  "npc.myra.go_to_the_47": "Go to the academy in Edron and tell Zoltan that I sent you, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.myzzi.im_just_a_1": "I'm just a mere messenger and I'm here to find brave adventurers that might {help} my friends in this time of need.",
  "npc.myzzi.lady_alivar_of_2": "Lady Alivar of the Summer Court and Lord Cadion of the Winter Court are in need of brave adventurers to avert a great {threat} for the whole world.",
  "npc.myzzi.so_are_you_3": "So, are you willing to help in this time of need?",
  "npc.navigator.lhnjei_gouthn_naumpi_1": "Lhnjei gouthn naumpi! I know why you are here. I can {explain} everything.",
  "npc.navigator.by_entering_this_2": "By entering this place, you have earned the right to learn what this is all about. This is a long story. Are you sure you want to hear this, {yes}?",
  "npc.navigator.do_you_have_3": "Do you have enough, can I stop?",
  "npc.navigator.then_take_this_4": "Then take this one. And remember: DO NOT TELL ANYONE ABOUT ME OR ANYTHING YOU HAVE HEARD HERE TODAY.",
  "npc.nelly.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.nipuna.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.noodles.sniffsniff_1": "<sniff><sniff>",
  "npc.noodles.sniffsniff_2": "<sniff><sniff>",
  "npc.noodles.sniffsniff_3": "<sniff><sniff>",
  "npc.noodles.meeep_grrrrr_spits_4": "Meeep! Grrrrr! <spits>",
  "npc.noozer.i_was_stationed_1": "I was stationed in this cave to... guard something. Right now I am not even sure what that was.",
  "npc.noozer.then_dont_waste_2": "Then don't waste my time. I'm doing some important... business... here. Actually... where am I? If I find out, I will be even more angry than I am now. Out of my sight.",
  "npc.noozer.i_was_on_3": "I was on a mission, too - I guess. It was all quite blurry back then. Maybe I'll leave this place after I recovered completely. I have to find out what happened to me.",
  "npc.nor.here_take_the_1": "Here, take the memory crystal and leave immediately.",
  "npc.nurik.excuse_me_but_1": "Excuse me, but I'm waiting for someone important!",
  "npc.nurik.wait_a_minute_2": "Wait a minute! Do I get that right? You're the owner of the dwarven bridge and you are willing to sell it to me??",
  "npc.nurik.how_splendid_do_3": "How splendid! Do you have the necessary documents with you?",
  "npc.nurik.oh_my_oh_4": "Oh my, oh my. I'm so excited! So let's seal this deal as fast as possible so I can visit my very own dwarven bridge. Are you ready for the transaction?",
  "npc.oliver.nobody_knows_the_1": "Nobody knows the trouble I've seen .. <tells a quite detailed report>. ",
  "npc.oliver.you_can_pass_2": "You can {pass} either to the {Factory Quarter} or {Sunken Quarter}. Which one will it be?",
  "npc.omrabas.hmm_you_could_1": "Hmm. You could be of assistance, I presume. I need several body parts. I will reward you adequately. Interested?",
  "npc.omrabas.ah_hello_young_2": "Ah hello, young friend! Did you bring me two ghoul snacks as requested?",
  "npc.omrabas.ah_young_friend_3": "Ah, young friend, I found a solution! Find me two {demonic skeletal hands}. That should do it. Now run along! Ask me for {mission} when you're done.",
  "npc.omrabas.ah_hello_again_4": "Ah hello again! You look as if you could, er, lend me a hand or two? Yes?",
  "npc.omrabas.yes_yes_hello_5": "Yes, yes, hello. Tell me if you lost something. If not, do you have that stimulated brain with you?",
  "npc.omrabas.hello_hello_lets_6": "Hello, hello. Let's come to the point - did you find me some intestines?",
  "npc.omrabas.ah_hello_well_7": "Ah hello! Well done there, I felt the old powers settling down. Now, {ready} to hallow the next altar?",
  "npc.omrabas.yes_do_you_8": "Yes? Do you have the {scroll} piece? ",
  "npc.omrabas.ah_hello_i_9": "Ah, hello! I take it you have the next scroll piece for me, {yes}?",
  "npc.omrabas.hello_what_you_10": "Hello - what? You have the {scroll} piece, you say?",
  "npc.omrabas.hello_young_apprentice_11": "Hello, young apprentice. Do you have that {scroll} piece from the priestess?",
  "npc.omrabas.dont_keep_me_12": "Don't keep me waiting. The last scroll piece - were you able to {restore} it?",
  "npc.omrabas.splendid_what_theyre_13": "Splendid! What? They're half gnawed! There are no hands! Hrmmm. Let me think of a solution. Ask me for a new {mission}.",
  "npc.omrabas.you_dont_have_14": "You don't have two ghoul snacks.",
  "npc.omrabas.yes_those_will_15": "Yes. Those will be adequate. Talk to me again if you want to continue with your next {mission}.",
  "npc.omrabas.you_dont_have_16": "You don't have two demonic skeletal hands.",
  "npc.omrabas.ah_sighs_very_17": "Ah... <sighs> Very good. Just say the word when you are ready for the next {mission}.",
  "npc.omrabas.you_dont_have_18": "You don't have my heart.",
  "npc.omrabas.ah_sighs_very_19": "Ah... <sighs> Very good. Just say the word when you are ready for the next {mission}.",
  "npc.omrabas.you_dont_have_20": "You don't have the brain.",
  "npc.omrabas.you_dont_have_21": "You don't have my intestine.",
  "npc.omrabas.this_is_it_22": "This is it! This is it! Well done, well done! And now, on to the {next} scroll piece, {yes}?",
  "npc.omrabas.you_dont_have_23": "You don't have my scroll.",
  "npc.omrabas.indeed_it_is_24": "Indeed it is! The second scroll piece! Splendid! Here you go - for your trouble. And now, on to the {next} scroll piece, {yes}? ",
  "npc.omrabas.you_dont_have_25": "You don't have my scroll.",
  "npc.omrabas.you_dont_have_26": "You don't have my scroll.",
  "npc.omrabas.you_dont_have_27": "You don't have my scroll.",
  "npc.omrabas.you_dont_have_28": "You don't have my scroll.",
  "npc.omrabas.what_hack_some_29": "What? Hack some off from a demon skeleton, of course! Now get moving.",
  "npc.omrabas.ah_sighs_very_30": "Ah... <sighs> Very good. Just say the word when you are ready for the next {mission}.",
  "npc.omrabas.you_dont_have_31": "You don't have my heart.",
  "npc.omrabas.what_no_bones_32": "What? No bones around you say? Hrmmm. Wait. Check the skull heap here - that's right - hah! There! Now get to work!",
  "npc.omrabas.yes_do_you_33": "Yes? Do you have the {scroll} piece?",
  "npc.omrabas.ah_hello_i_34": "Ah, hello! I take it you have the next {scroll} piece for me, {yes}?",
  "npc.omrabas.you_dont_have_35": "You don't have my scroll.",
  "npc.omrabas.hello_young_apprentice_36": "Hello, young apprentice. Do you have that {scroll} piece from the priestess?",
  "npc.omrabas.hello_young_apprentice_37": "Hello, young apprentice. Do you have that scroll piece from the priestess?",
  "npc.omrabas.welcome_welcome_finally_38": "Welcome, welcome! Finally! The last {scroll} piece.... you do have it, haven't you?",
  "npc.omrabas.you_dont_have_39": "You don't have my scroll.",
  "npc.omrabas.chzzzz_wtf_leave_40": "Chzzzz. wtf??@! leave.",
  "npc.ongulf.excellent_although_we_1": "Excellent. Although we have no idea what awaits us in this foreign land, it is always good to know something more about our surroundings.",
  "npc.ongulf.thats_good_news_2": "That's good news for sure. It will give our operation a new impulse. However, only if there is not some unexpected trouble ahead. Well, we'll talk about that when we discuss your next {mission}.",
  "npc.ongulf.shortly_after_you_3": "Shortly after you killed that creature, the others crumbled to dust and stone. I hope this incident does not foreshadow similar problems in our mines. However, for now I have other things to take care of and you have other {missions} to accomplish. ",
  "npc.ongulf.you_did_an_4": "You did an excellent job! With all this help Farmine will grow and prosper. While we put all available resources into building this base, I have another urgent {mission} for you.",
  "npc.oressa.you_are_hurt_1": "You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  "npc.oressa.you_do_not_2": "You do not need any healing right now.",
  "npc.oressa.you_do_not_3": "You do not need any healing right now.",
  "npc.oressa.you_are_hurt_4": "You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  "npc.oressa.tell_me_do_5": "Tell me: Do you prefer to fight with {bow} and {spear}, or do you want to cast {magic}?",
  "npc.oressa.so_tell_me_6": "So tell me, which {vocation} do you want to choose: {knight}, {sorcerer}, {paladin} or {druid}?",
  "npc.orockle.you_can_help_1": "You can help in the fight against the hive. There are several missions available to destabilise the hive. Just ask for them if you want to learn more. After completing many missions you might be worthy to get a reward.",
  "npc.orockle.you_could_try_2": "You could try to blind the hive, you might disrupt its digestion, you could gather acid or you can disable the swarm pores. ...",
  "npc.orockle.so_be_it_3": "So be it. Now you are a member of the inquisition. You might ask me for a mission to raise in my esteem.",
  "npc.ortheus.a_cookie_well_1": "A cookie? Well... I have to admit I haven't had one for ages. Can I have it?",
  "npc.ortheus.itd_be_better_2": "It'd be better for you to leave now.",
  "npc.ortheus.well_thanks_it_3": "Well thanks, it looks tasty, I'll just take a bi - COUGH! Are you trying to poison me?? Get out of here before I forget myself!",
  "npc.ortheus.wow_these_polite_4": "Wow. These polite young adventurers nowadays. Thank you.",
  "npc.ortheus.hmmm_you_dont_5": "Hmmm, you don't have tea with you.",
  "npc.ortheus.have_you_actually_6": "Have you actually brought me a mug of tea??",
  "npc.ortheus.what_a_pity_7": "What a pity.",
  "npc.padreia.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to buy a bottle of cough syrup for 50 gold?",
  "npc.padreia.you_must_find_2": "You MUST find that slime pool immediately or life here in Carlin will not be the same anymore.",
  "npc.padreia.you_did_it_3": "You did it! Even if only few of the Carliners will ever know about that, you saved all of their lives. Here, take this as a reward. Farewell!",
  "npc.padreia.maybe_the_guards_4": "Maybe the guards have something to do for you or know someone who could need some help.",
  "npc.padreia.you_dont_have_5": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.padreia.thank_you_here_6": "Thank you. Here it is.",
  "npc.padreia.then_the_downfall_7": "Then the downfall of Carlin is inescapable. Please think about it. You know where to find me.",
  "npc.padreia.dont_ask_they_8": "Don't ask. They were only an unimportant footnote of history.",
  "npc.padreia.they_thought_they_9": "They thought they had to bring Crunor to the people, if the people had not found Crunor on their own. To achieve this, they founded the inn called Crunor's Cottage, south of Mt. Sternum.",
  "npc.palimuth.im_an_augur_1": "I'm an Augur of the city of Yalahar. My special duty consists of coordinating the efforts to keep the city and its services running.",
  "npc.palimuth.did_you_bring_2": "Did you bring me the vampiric crest?",
  "npc.palimuth.so_are_you_3": "So are you done with your work?",
  "npc.palimuth.did_you_get_4": "Did you get all the reports my superiors asked for? ",
  "npc.palimuth.these_are_great_5": "These are great news indeed. The people of Yalahar will be grateful. The Yalahari probably not, so take care of yourself. ",
  "npc.palimuth.rumours_travel_fast_6": "Rumours travel fast in Yalahar. So the Yalahari will soon have some new toys at their disposal. I strongly doubt this has any positive effect.",
  "npc.palimuth.oh_no_so_7": "Oh no! So that's the reason for the quara attacks! I will do my best to close these sewage pipes. We will have to use other drains. ",
  "npc.palimuth.you_can_be_8": "You can be proud of your decision, my friend.",
  "npc.palimuth.so_do_you_9": "So do you want to side with me? ",
  "npc.palimuth.thank_you_very_10": "Thank you very much. You have no idea how hard it was to find someone volunteering for that job. If you feel ready for further {missions}, just tell me.",
  "npc.palimuth.excellent_my_superiors_11": "Excellent! My superiors will be pleased to get these reports. I will for sure emphasise your efforts in this mission. Please come back soon to see if there are any more {missions} available for you. ",
  "npc.palimuth.come_back_when_12": "Come back when you do.",
  "npc.palimuth.you_have_no_13": "You have no idea how much I hoped to hear that, my friend! But I have an urgent mission for you!",
  "npc.palimuth.great_here_take_14": "Great! Here, take this yalaharian addon in a return.",
  "npc.palimuth.come_back_when_15": "Come back when you do.",
  "npc.palomino.we_can_bring_1": "We can bring you to Venore with one of our coaches for 125 gold. Are you interested?",
  "npc.palomino.do_you_want_2": "Do you want to rent a horse for one day at a price of 500 gold?",
  "npc.palomino.first_get_rid_3": "First get rid of those blood stains!",
  "npc.palomino.you_dont_have_4": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.palomino.have_a_nice_5": "Have a nice trip!",
  "npc.palomino.you_already_have_6": "You already have a horse.",
  "npc.palomino.you_do_not_7": "You do not have enough money to rent a horse!",
  "npc.palomino.ill_give_you_8": "I'll give you one of our experienced ones. Take care! Look out for low hanging branches.",
  "npc.partos.i_wont_talk_1": "I won't talk about that.",
