  "npc.pemaret.wow_you_have_1": "WOW! You have a marlin!! I could make a nice decoration for your wall from it. May I have it?",
  "npc.pemaret.yeah_now_lets_2": "Yeah! Now let's see... <fumble fumble> There you go, I hope you like it!",
  "npc.pemaret.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have the fish.",
  "npc.percybald.i_hope_you_1": "I hope you learnt your role! I'll tell you a line from the script and you'll have to answer with the corresponding line! Ready?",
  "npc.percybald.how_dare_you_2": "How dare you? Are you mad? I hold the princess hostage and you drop your weapons. You're all lost!",
  "npc.percybald.too_late_puny_3": "Too late puny knight. You can't stop my master plan anymore!",
  "npc.percybald.whats_this_behind_4": "What's this? Behind the doctor?",
  "npc.percybald.haha_you_may_5": "Haha! You may not fear for your own life, but how about hers!?",
  "npc.percybald.youre_such_a_6": "You're such a monster!",
  "npc.percybald.ah_well_i_7": "Ah well, I think you passed the test! Here is your disguise kit! Now get lost, fate awaits me!",
  "npc.percybald.ok_ok_youve_8": "Ok, ok. You've got this one right! Ready for the next one?",
  "npc.percybald.no_no_no_9": "No no no! That is not correct!",
  "npc.percybald.ok_ok_youve_10": "Ok, ok. You've got this one right! Ready for the next one?",
  "npc.percybald.no_no_no_11": "No no no! That is not correct!",
  "npc.percybald.ok_ok_youve_12": "Ok, ok. You've got this one right! Ready for the next one?",
  "npc.percybald.no_no_no_13": "No no no! That is not correct!",
  "npc.percybald.ok_ok_youve_14": "Ok, ok. You've got this one right! Ready for the next one?",
  "npc.percybald.no_no_no_15": "No no no! That is not correct!",
  "npc.percybald.ok_ok_youve_16": "Ok, ok. You've got this one right! Ready for the next one?",
  "npc.percybald.no_no_no_17": "No no no! That is not correct!",
  "npc.percybald.ok_ok_youve_18": "Ok, ok. You've got this one right! Ready for the next one?",
  "npc.percybald.no_no_no_19": "No no no! That is not correct!",
  "npc.percybald.in_exchange_for_20": "In exchange for a generous donation of gold and silver tokens, I can offer you a special outfit. Would you like to donate?",
  "npc.percybald.if_you_havent_21": "If you haven't made up your mind, please come back when you are ready.",
  "npc.percybald.take_this_armor_22": "Take this armor as a token of great gratitude. Let us forever remember this day, my friend!",
  "npc.percybald.you_do_not_23": "You do not have enough tokens to donate that amount.",
  "npc.percybald.you_already_have_24": "You already have that addon.",
  "npc.percybald.take_this_shield_25": "Take this shield as a token of great gratitude. Let us forever remember this day, my friend.",
  "npc.percybald.you_do_not_26": "You do not have enough tokens to donate that amount.",
  "npc.percybald.you_already_have_27": "You already have that outfit.",
  "npc.percybald.you_need_to_28": "You need to donate the {armor} outfit first.",
  "npc.percybald.take_this_crown_29": "Take this crown as a token of great gratitude. Let us forever remember this day, my friend.",
  "npc.percybald.you_do_not_30": "You do not have enough tokens to donate that amount.",
  "npc.percybald.you_already_have_31": "You already have that outfit.",
  "npc.percybald.you_need_to_32": "You need to donate the {shield} addon first.",
  "npc.percybald.would_you_like_33": "Would you like to donate 15,000 silver tokens and 12,500 gold tokens for a unique red armor?",
  "npc.percybald.would_you_like_34": "Would you like to donate 7,500 silver tokens and 6,250 gold tokens for a unique shield?",
  "npc.percybald.would_you_like_35": "Would you like to donate 7,500 silver tokens and 6,250 gold tokens for a unique crown?",
  "npc.perod.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to buy a football for 111 gold?",
  "npc.perod.here_it_is_2": "Here it is.",
  "npc.perod.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.peter.a_report_what_1": "A report? What do they think is happening here? <gives an angry and bitter report>. ",
  "npc.peter.pass_the_gate_2": "Pass the gate? If it must be. Are you headed for the {factory} or the former {trade quarter}?",
  "npc.peter.listen_i_dont_3": "Listen, I don't get paid enough to chat with citizens. Move on.",
  "npc.peter.be_on_your_4": "Be on your guard. Some people are nice, some... aren't.",
  "npc.pig.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to try to release me with a kiss?",
  "npc.pig.mhm_uhhh_not_2": "Mhm Uhhh. Not bad, not bad at all! But you can still improve your skill a LOT.",
