  "npc.pukosch.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to purchase a weekly ticket for the ore wagons? With it you can travel freely and swiftly through Kazordoon for one week. 250 gold only. Deal?",
  "npc.pukosch.your_weekly_ticket_2": "Your weekly ticket is still valid. Would be a waste of money to purchase a second one",
  "npc.pukosch.here_is_your_3": "Here is your stamp. It can't be transferred to another person and will last one week from now. You'll get notified upon using an ore wagon when it isn't valid anymore.",
  "npc.pukosch.you_dont_have_4": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.queen_eloise.in_exchange_for_1": "In exchange for a truly generous donation, I will offer a special outfit. Do you want to make a donation?",
  "npc.queen_eloise.in_that_case_2": "In that case, return to me once you made up your mind.",
  "npc.queen_eloise.take_this_armor_3": "Take this armor as a token of great gratitude. Let us forever remember this day, my friend!",
  "npc.queen_eloise.please_make_sure_4": "Please make sure you have free slots in your store inbox.",
  "npc.queen_eloise.you_do_not_5": "You do not have enough money to donate that amount.",
  "npc.queen_eloise.you_alread_have_6": "You alread have that addon.",
  "npc.queen_eloise.take_this_helmet_7": "Take this helmet as a token of great gratitude. Let us forever remember this day, my friend. ",
  "npc.queen_eloise.you_do_not_8": "You do not have enough money to donate that amount.",
  "npc.queen_eloise.you_alread_have_9": "You alread have that outfit.",
  "npc.queen_eloise.you_need_to_10": "You need to donate {armor} outfit first.",
  "npc.queen_eloise.take_this_boots_11": "Take this boots as a token of great gratitude. Let us forever remember this day, my friend. ",
  "npc.queen_eloise.you_do_not_12": "You do not have enough money to donate that amount.",
  "npc.queen_eloise.you_alread_have_13": "You alread have that outfit.",
  "npc.queen_eloise.you_need_to_14": "You need to donate {helmet} addon first.",
  "npc.queen_eloise.so_you_wold_15": "So you wold like to donate 500.000.000 gold pieces which in return will entitle you to wear a unique armor?",
  "npc.queen_eloise.so_you_would_16": "So you would like to donate 250.000.000 gold pieces which in return will entitle you to wear unique helmet?",
  "npc.queen_eloise.so_you_would_17": "So you would like to donate 250.000.000 gold pieces which in return will entitle you to wear a unique boots?",
  "npc.rabaz.well_fantastic_work_1": "Well fantastic work, you gathered both samples! Now I can continue my work on the almanach, thank you very much for your help indeed. Can I take a look at my book please?",
  "npc.rabaz.yes_yes_thats_2": "Yes? Yes! That's the enthusiasm I need! Remember to bring a sharp knife to gather the samples, plants - even mutated deformed plants - are very sensitive you know. Off you go and be careful out there, Zao is no place for the feint hearted mind you.",
  "npc.rabaz.oh_you_dont_3": "Oh, you don't have my book.",
  "npc.rabaz.of_course_just_4": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.rachel.so_you_ask_1": "So you ask me for a {",
  "npc.rachel.what_i_have_2": "What? I have already gave you one {",
  "npc.rachel.sorry_you_arent_3": "Sorry, you aren't a druid either a sorcerer.",
  "npc.rachel.here_you_are_4": "Here you are young adept, take care yourself.",
  "npc.rachel.of_course_just_5": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.rashid_custom.well_you_could_1": "Well, you could attempt the mission to become a recognised trader, but it requires a lot of travelling. Are you willing to try?",
  "npc.rashid_custom.have_you_managed_2": "Have you managed to obtain a rare deer trophy for my customer?",
  "npc.rashid_custom.so_my_friend_3": "So, my friend, are you willing to proceed to the next mission to become a recognised trader?",
  "npc.rashid_custom.did_you_bring_4": "Did you bring me the package?",
  "npc.rashid_custom.so_my_friend_5": "So, my friend, are you willing to proceed to the next mission to become a recognised trader?",
  "npc.rashid_custom.have_you_brought_6": "Have you brought the cheese?",
  "npc.rashid_custom.so_my_friend_7": "So, my friend, are you willing to proceed to the next mission to become a recognised trader?",
  "npc.rashid_custom.have_you_brought_8": "Have you brought the vase?",
  "npc.rashid_custom.so_my_friend_9": "So, my friend, are you willing to proceed to the next mission to become a recognised trader?",
  "npc.rashid_custom.have_you_brought_10": "Have you brought a cheap but good crimson sword?",
  "npc.rashid_custom.so_my_friend_11": "So, my friend, are you willing to proceed to the next mission to become a recognised trader?",
  "npc.rashid_custom.have_you_brought_12": "Have you brought me a gold fish??",
  "npc.rashid_custom.ah_right_ahem_13": "Ah, right. <ahem> I hereby declare you - one of my recognised traders! Feel free to offer me your wares!",
  "npc.rashid_custom.fine_then_get_14": "Fine. Then get a hold of that deer trophy and bring it to me while I'm in Svargrond. Just ask me about your mission.",
  "npc.rashid_custom.well_done_ill_15": "Well done! I'll take that from you. <snags it> Come see me another day, I'll be busy for a while now. ",
  "npc.rashid_custom.fine_then_off_16": "Fine. Then off you go, just ask Willard about the 'package for Rashid'.",
  "npc.rashid_custom.great_just_place_17": "Great. Just place it over there - yes, thanks, that's it. Come see me another day, I'll be busy for a while now. ",
  "npc.rashid_custom.okay_then_please_18": "Okay, then please find Miraia in Darashia and ask her about the {'scarab cheese'}.",
  "npc.rashid_custom.mmmhh_the_lovely_19": "Mmmhh, the lovely odeur of scarab cheese! I really can't understand why most people can't stand it. Thanks, well done! ",
  "npc.rashid_custom.okay_then_please_20": "Okay, then please find {Briasol} in {Ab'Dendriel} and ask for a {'fine vase'}.",
  "npc.rashid_custom.im_surprised_that_21": "I'm surprised that you managed to bring this vase without a single crack. That was what I needed to know, thank you. ",
  "npc.rashid_custom.okay_im_curious_22": "Okay, I'm curious how you will do with {Uzgod}. Good luck!",
  "npc.rashid_custom.ha_you_are_23": "Ha! You are clever indeed, well done! I'll take this from you. Come see me tomorrow, I think we two might get into business after all.",
  "npc.rashid_custom.thanks_so_much_24": "Thanks so much! I'll be waiting eagerly for your return then.",
  "npc.rashid_custom.thank_you_ah_25": "Thank you!! Ah, this makes my day! I'll take the rest of the day off to get to know this little guy. Come see me tomorrow, if you like.",
  "npc.rashid_custom.sorry_but_you_26": "Sorry, but you do not belong to my exclusive customers. I have to make sure that I can trust in the quality of your wares.",
  "npc.rashid.well_you_could_1": "Well, you could attempt the mission to become a recognised trader, but it requires a lot of travelling. Are you willing to try?",
  "npc.rashid.have_you_managed_2": "Have you managed to obtain a rare deer trophy for my customer?",
  "npc.rashid.so_my_friend_3": "So, my friend, are you willing to proceed to the next mission to become a recognised trader?",
  "npc.rashid.did_you_bring_4": "Did you bring me the package?",
  "npc.rashid.so_my_friend_5": "So, my friend, are you willing to proceed to the next mission to become a recognised trader?",
  "npc.rashid.have_you_brought_6": "Have you brought the cheese?",
  "npc.rashid.so_my_friend_7": "So, my friend, are you willing to proceed to the next mission to become a recognised trader?",
  "npc.rashid.have_you_brought_8": "Have you brought the vase?",
  "npc.rashid.so_my_friend_9": "So, my friend, are you willing to proceed to the next mission to become a recognised trader?",
  "npc.rashid.have_you_brought_10": "Have you brought a cheap but good crimson sword?",
  "npc.rashid.so_my_friend_11": "So, my friend, are you willing to proceed to the next mission to become a recognised trader?",
  "npc.rashid.have_you_brought_12": "Have you brought me a gold fish??",
  "npc.rashid.ah_right_ahem_13": "Ah, right. <ahem> I hereby declare you - one of my recognised traders! Feel free to offer me your wares, just ask me for a {trade}!",
  "npc.rashid.fine_then_get_14": "Fine. Then get a hold of that deer trophy and bring it to me while I'm in Svargrond. Just ask me about your mission.",
  "npc.rashid.well_done_ill_15": "Well done! I'll take that from you. <snags it> Come see me another day, I'll be busy for a while now. ",
  "npc.rashid.fine_then_off_16": "Fine. Then off you go, just ask Willard about the 'package for Rashid'.",
  "npc.rashid.great_just_place_17": "Great. Just place it over there - yes, thanks, that's it. Come see me another day, I'll be busy for a while now. ",
  "npc.rashid.okay_then_please_18": "Okay, then please find Miraia in Darashia and ask her about the {'scarab cheese'}.",
  "npc.rashid.mmmhh_the_lovely_19": "Mmmhh, the lovely odeur of scarab cheese! I really can't understand why most people can't stand it. Thanks, well done! ",
  "npc.rashid.okay_then_please_20": "Okay, then please find {Briasol} in {Ab'Dendriel} and ask for a {'fine vase'}.",
  "npc.rashid.im_surprised_that_21": "I'm surprised that you managed to bring this vase without a single crack. That was what I needed to know, thank you. ",
  "npc.rashid.okay_im_curious_22": "Okay, I'm curious how you will do with {Uzgod}. Good luck!",
  "npc.rashid.ha_you_are_23": "Ha! You are clever indeed, well done! I'll take this from you. Come see me tomorrow, I think we two might get into business after all.",
  "npc.rashid.thanks_so_much_24": "Thanks so much! I'll be waiting eagerly for your return then.",
  "npc.rashid.thank_you_ah_25": "Thank you!! Ah, this makes my day! I'll take the rest of the day off to get to know this little guy. Come see me tomorrow, if you like.",
  "npc.rashid.sorry_but_you_26": "Sorry, but you do not belong to my exclusive customers. I have to make sure that I can trust in the quality of your wares.",
  "npc.rata_mari.ok_have_you_1": "Ok, have you brought me the cheese, I've asked for?",
  "npc.rata_mari.i_already_gave_2": "I already gave you the report. I'm not going to write another one!",
  "npc.rata_mari.no_cheese_no_3": "No cheese - no report.",
  "npc.rata_mari.meep_meep_great_4": "Meep! Meep! Great! Here is the spyreport for you!",
  "npc.rata_mari.no_cheese_no_5": "No cheese - no report.",
  "npc.raymond_striker.eleonore_yes_i_1": "Eleonore ... Yes, I remember her... vaguely. She is a pretty girl ... but still only a girl and now I am in love with a beautiful and passionate woman. A true {mermaid} even.",
  "npc.raymond_striker.dont_ask_about_2": "Don't ask about silly missions. All I can think about is this lovely {mermaid}.",
  "npc.raymond_striker.ask_around_in_3": "Ask around in the settlement where you can help out. If you have proven your worth I might have some missions for you.",
  "npc.raymond_striker.i_think_that_4": "I think that means 'mission accomplished'. Hehe. I guess that will put an end to their efforts to buy any alchemical substance from Edron.",
  "npc.raymond_striker.you_did_it_5": "You did it! Excellent!",
  "npc.raymond_striker.my_pillow_they_6": "My pillow?? They know me all too well... <sigh> I've owned it since my childhood. However. Here, take it and convincehim that I am dead.",
  "npc.raymond_striker.the_mermaid_is_7": "The mermaid is the most beautiful creature I have ever met. She is so wonderful. It was some kind of magic as we first met. A look in her eyes and I suddenly knew there would be never again another woman in my life but her.",
  "npc.raymond_striker.i_am_deeply_8": "I am deeply ashamed that I lacked the willpower to resist her spell. Thank you for your help in that matter. Now my head is once more free to think about our {mission}.",
  "npc.raymond_striker.ah_right_the_9": "Ah, right! The pirate outfit! Here you go, now you are truly one of us.",
  "npc.raymond_striker.ahh_thank_you_10": "Ahh, thank you, my friend! What would we do without you? Here, take this reward for your efforts. If you want to continue to help us killing pirates, just ask me about that {task}.",
  "npc.raymond_striker.go_kill_more_11": "Go kill more pirates.",
  "npc.raymond_striker.do_you_by_12": "Do you, by chance, would like to kill pirates again for us?",
  "npc.raymond_striker.perfect_i_know_13": "Perfect. I know it sounds like a lot, but really, take your time. You won't do it for nothing, I promise.",
  "npc.razan.my_turban_eh_1": "My turban? Eh no, you can't have it. Only oriental weapon masters may wear it after having completed a difficult task.",
  "npc.razan.you_mean_you_2": "You mean, you would like to prove that you deserve to wear such a turban?",
  "npc.razan.excellent_come_back_3": "Excellent! Come back to me once you have collected 100 pieces of ape fur.",
  "npc.razan.that_is_a_4": "That is a shameless lie.",
  "npc.razan.what_a_pity_5": "What a pity.",
  "npc.reed.you_have_no_1": "You have NO idea what we have to endure each day .. <gives a shocking and disturbing report>. ",
  "npc.reed.you_can_pass_2": "You can {pass} either to the {Cemetery Quarter} or {Magician Quarter}. Which one will it be?",
  "npc.rehon.by_the_gods_1": "By the Gods! You have the key to the cell! Thank you sooo much, mate. And now leave. I'll wait here until the air is clean and then I'm out of here.",
  "npc.richard.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.riddler.death_awaits_those_1": "Death awaits those who fail the test of the three seals! Do you really want me to test you?",
  "npc.riddler.hoho_right_again_2": "HOHO! Right again. All right. The final question of the first seal: Who was the first warrior to follow the path of the Mooh'Tah?",
  "npc.riddler.hmmm_so_you_3": "Hmmm, so you think cheating will get you through that test? Then your final question of the first seal is: What is the meaning of life?",
  "npc.riddler.hoho_lucky_you_4": "HOHO! Lucky you. You have passed the first seal! So ... would you like to continue with the Seal of the Mind?",
  "npc.riddler.as_you_wish_5": "As you wish, foolish one! Here is my first question: It's lighter then a feather but no living creature can hold it for ten minutes?",
  "npc.riddler.that_was_an_6": "That was an easy one. Let's try the second: If you name it, you break it.",
  "npc.riddler.argh_you_did_7": "ARGH! You did it again! Well all right. Do you wish to break the Seal of Madness?",
  "npc.riddler.good_so_i_8": "GOOD! So I will get you at last. Answer this: What is your favourite colour?",
  "npc.riddler.damn_youuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuu_9": "DAMN YOUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUU!",
  "npc.riddler.wrong_next_time_10": "WRONG! Next time get your own answers. To hell with thee, cheater Sischfried!",
  "npc.robson.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to buy a parcel for 15 gold?",
  "npc.robson.do_you_want_2": "Do you want to buy a label for 1 gold?",
  "npc.robson.sorry_thats_only_3": "Sorry, that's only dust in your purse.",
  "npc.robson.sorry_thats_only_4": "Sorry, that's only dust in your purse.",
  "npc.robson.i_knew_i_5": "I knew I would be stuck with that stuff.",
  "npc.rock_in_a_hard_place.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.rock_in_a_hard_place.you_would_be_2": "You would be surprised how many things are washed ashore here. I trade ",
  "npc.rock_steady.if_you_want_1": "If you want anything, you should talk to Old Rock Boy over there. I do {collect} stuff, though. So just ask if you're interested in helping me.",
  "npc.rock_steady.have_you_got_2": "Have you got anything for me today?",
  "npc.rock_steady.have_you_got_3": "Have you got anything for me today?",
  "npc.rock_steady.great_let_me_4": "Great! Let me see. Amazing! I will take this, thank you!",
  "npc.rock_steady.great_let_me_5": "Great! Let me see. Amazing! I will take this, thank you!",
  "npc.rock_steady.great_let_me_6": "Great! Let me see. Amazing! I will take this, thank you!",
  "npc.rock_steady.you_dont_have_7": "You dont have the required items!",
  "npc.romir.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.rose.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to buy a Hydra Tongue for 100 gold?",
  "npc.rose.here_you_are_2": "Here you are. A Hydra Tongue!",
  "npc.rose.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.roswitha.im_sorry_but_1": "I'm sorry, but Harsin no longer lives here. He ordered a local named Quandon to transport all his stuff somewhere. I don't know where he moved, but Quandon should be able to help you with this information.",
  "npc.rottin_wood.oh_you_want_1": "Oh, you want some work? You can help us, alright. Did you know that the people of the city think those rabbit feet are actually lucky charms?",
  "npc.rottin_wood.you_need_to_2": "You need to wait some hours to take another mission again or you are still on a mission.",
  "npc.rottin_wood.good_to_see_3": "Good to see you back. Now, did you bring us the lucky charms?",
  "npc.rottin_wood.you_need_to_4": "You need to wait some hours to take another mission again or you are still on a mission.",
  "npc.rottin_wood.ah_there_you_5": "Ah there you are. So, did you repair all the broken structures?",
  "npc.rottin_wood.you_need_to_6": "You need to wait some hours to take another mission again or you are still on a mission.",
  "npc.rottin_wood.you_need_to_7": "You need to wait some hours to take another mission again or you are still on a mission.",
  "npc.rottin_wood.you_did_it_8": "You did it!! And I assume you took only what you needed? Heh. No, I know it. Because my men took the rest. Thanks for helping us, you did a very good job. In fact I have a little 'extra' for you here, thanks again.",
  "npc.rottin_wood.you_need_to_9": "You need to wait some hours to take another mission again or you are still on a mission.",
  "npc.rottin_wood.good_because_that_10": "Good, because that is exactly what you will help us with - getting more 'lucky charms'. If we won't get our hands on new charms in time, we will surely have to starve... during the autumn. That would be a hard time for all of us. So... you in?",
  "npc.rottin_wood.good_hunt_that_11": "Good hunt. That will be enough to help us uhm... get through the winter yes. Now if you want to help us getting even more lucky charms, you can always ask.",
  "npc.rottin_wood.you_do_not_12": "You do not have sufficient rabbit's foot.",
  "npc.rottin_wood.good_good_do_13": "Good, good. Do you remember the old saying? If it ain't broken, it was not made by us. Now, off you go!",
  "npc.ruprecht.so_you_want_1": "So you want to exchange ",
  "npc.ruprecht.so_you_want_2": "So you want to exchange ",
  "npc.ruprecht.thank_you_here_3": "Thank you, here is your 1 christmas token.",
  "npc.ruprecht.you_dont_have_4": "You don't have a present bag.",
  "npc.ruprecht.thank_you_here_5": "Thank you, here is your ",
  "npc.ruprecht.you_dont_have_6": "You don't have enough of tokens.",
  "npc.ruprecht.come_back_when_7": "Come back when you are ready to trade some tokens!",
  "npc.sam.oh_gregor_sent_1": "Oh, Gregor sent you? I see. It will be my pleasure to adorn your helmet. Please give me some time to finish it.",
  "npc.sam.just_in_time_2": "Just in time, |PLAYERNAME|. Your helmet is finished, I hope you like it.",
  "npc.sam.please_have_some_3": "Please have some patience, |PLAYERNAME|. Forging is hard work!",
  "npc.sam.i_think_its_4": "I think it's one of my masterpieces.",
  "npc.sam.sorry_but_without_5": "Sorry, but without the permission of Gregor I cannot help you with this matter.",
  "npc.sam.what_are_you_6": "What? Are you telling me you found my old adventurer's backpack that I lost years ago??",
  "npc.sam.my_offers_are_7": "My offers are weapons, armors, helmets, legs, and shields. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a {trade}.",
  "npc.sam.what_you_want_8": "What? You want to buy 2000 steel shields??",
  "npc.sam.have_you_signed_9": "Have you signed the contract?",
  "npc.sam.you_dont_have_10": "You don't have it...",
  "npc.sam.i_cant_believe_11": "I can't believe it. Finally I will be rich! I could move to Edron and enjoy my retirement! But ... wait a minute! I will not start working without a contract! Are you willing to sign one?",
  "npc.sam.fine_here_is_12": "Fine! Here is the contract. Please sign it. Talk to me about it again when you're done.",
  "npc.sam.you_dont_have_13": "You don't have a signed contract.",
  "npc.sam.excellent_i_will_14": "Excellent! I will start working right away! Now that I am going to be rich, I will take the opportunity to tell some people what I REALLY think about them!",
  "npc.sam.this_deal_sounded_15": "This deal sounded too good to be true anyway.",
  "npc.sandomo.oh_so_you_1": "Oh, so you want a reward, hm? Well... let's see. What did you do for us - helping Mortis with his {repairs} and defended him?",
  "npc.sandomo.come_back_after_2": "Come back after you have done at least one of the tasks I talked you about.",
  "npc.sandomo.i_do_not_3": "I do not see inquisition gold registered in my book from you.",
  "npc.sandomo.ah_yes_you_4": "Ah yes, you currently have ",
  "npc.sandomo.you_do_not_5": "You do not seem to have enough inquisition gold yet to trade for clusters, as it's registered in my book.",
  "npc.sandomo.you_should_tell_6": "You should tell me a real number.",
  "npc.sandomo.you_do_not_7": "You do not have enough inquisition gold for that, so far you can ask for up to ",
  "npc.sandomo.there_you_are_8": "There you are. Now I register ",
  "npc.sandomo.head_to_brother_9": "Head to brother Maun if you are in need of basic supplies. He will help you - for a small fee.",
  "npc.sandomo.brother_maun_is_10": "Brother Maun is a valuable member of the Inquisition. He will help you out with supplies. Provided you can actually compensate of course.",
  "npc.sandra.we_have_a_1": "We have a special offer right now for depositing vials. Are you interested in hearing it?",
  "npc.sandra.would_you_like_2": "Would you like to get a lottery ticket instead of the deposit for your vials?",
  "npc.sandra.are_you_here_3": "Are you here to claim a prize?",
  "npc.sandra.pssht_not_that_4": "Pssht, not that loud. So they have sent you to get... the stuff?",
  "npc.sandra.what_how_dare_5": "What?? How dare you?! I am a sorcerer of the most reknown academy on the face of this world. Do you think some lousy pirates could scare me? Get lost! Now! I will have no further dealings with the likes of you!",
  "npc.sandra.great_ive_signed_6": "Great! I've signed you up for our bonus system. From now on, you will have the chance to win the potion belt addon!",
  "npc.sandra.alright_thank_you_7": "Alright, thank you very much! Here is your lottery ticket, good luck. Would you like to deposit more vials that way?",
  "npc.sandra.sorry_but_you_8": "Sorry, but you don't have 100 empty flasks or vials of the SAME kind and thus don't qualify for the lottery. Would you like to deposit the vials you have as usual and receive 5 gold per vial?",
  "npc.sandra.congratulations_here_from_9": "Congratulations! Here, from now on you can wear our lovely potion belt as accessory.",
  "npc.sandra.sorry_but_you_10": "Sorry, but you don't have your lottery ticket with you.",
  "npc.sandra.finally_you_have_11": "Finally. You have no idea how difficult it is to keep something secret here. And you brought me all the crystal coins I demanded?",
  "npc.santa_claus.you_cant_get_1": "You can't get other present.",
  "npc.santa_claus.merry_christmas_2": "Merry Christmas!",
  "npc.santiago.oh_whats_wrong_1": "Oh, what's wrong? As I said, simply go to my house south of here and go upstairs. Then come back and we'll continue our chat.",
  "npc.santiago.ive_forgotten_to_2": "I've forgotten to tell you something. Of course I need proof that you killed cockroaches. Please bring me at least 3 of their legs. Good luck!",
  "npc.santiago.ive_forgotten_to_3": "I've forgotten to tell you something. Of course I need proof that you killed cockroaches. Please bring me at least 3 of their legs. Good luck!",
  "npc.santiago.great_please_go_4": "Great, please go to my house, just a few steps south of here. Upstairs in my room, you'll find a chest. You can keep what you find inside of it! Come back after you got it and greet me to talk to me again. {Yes}?",
  "npc.santiago.alright_do_you_5": "Alright! Do you see the button called 'Quest Log'? There you can check the status of quests, like this one. {Bye} for now!",
  "npc.santiago.ah_no_need_6": "Ah, no need to say anything, I can see it suits you perfectly. Now we're getting to the fun part, let's get you armed! Are you ready for some {action}?",
  "npc.santiago.oh_you_dont_7": "Oh, you don't wear it properly yet. You need to drag and drop it from your bag to your armor slot. Here, let me show you again. Is it a little {clearer} now?",
  "npc.santiago.oh_no_did_8": "Oh no, did you lose my coat? Well, lucky you, I have a spare one here. Don't lose it again! Now we're getting to the fun part, let's get you armed! Are you ready for some {action}?",
  "npc.santiago.i_knew_i_9": "I knew I could count on you. Here, take this good and sturdy weapon in your hand. Then go back to my house and down the ladder. Good luck, and {bye} for now!",
  "npc.santiago.thats_just_great_10": "That's just great! Now you have more health points, can carry more stuff and walk faster. Talking about health, did you get {hurt} by those cockroaches?",
  "npc.santiago.really_you_look_11": "Really? You look fine to me, must have been just a scratch. Well, there are much more dangerous monsters than cockroaches out there. Take a look at your status bar. You have 155 Health right now. I'll show you something, {yes}?",
  "npc.santiago.this_is_an_12": "This is an important lesson from me - an experienced veteran fighter. Take this! Look at your status bar again. As you can see, you've lost health. Now I'll tell you how to heal that, {yes}?",
  "npc.santiago.i_knew_youd_13": "I knew you'd get it right away. You can loot food from many creatures, such as deer and rabbits. You can find them in the forest nearby. By the way... have you seen {Zirella}?",
  "npc.santiago.really_she_was_14": "Really?? She was looking for someone to help her. Maybe you could go and see her. She lives just to the east and down the mountain. So, thank you again and {bye} for now!",
  "npc.santiago.this_is_an_15": "This is an important lesson from me - an experienced veteran fighter. Take this! Look at your status bar again. As you can see, you've lost health. Now I'll tell you how to heal that, {yes}?",
  "npc.santiago.i_knew_i_16": "I knew I could count on you. Here, take this good and sturdy weapon in your hand. Then go back to my house and down the ladder. Good luck, and {bye} for now!",
  "npc.santiago.i_knew_youd_17": "I knew you'd get it right away. You can loot food from many creatures, such as deer and rabbits. You can find them in the forest nearby. By the way... have you seen {Zirella}?",
  "npc.sarina.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to buy a football for 111 gold?",
  "npc.sarina.here_it_is_2": "Here it is.",
  "npc.sarina.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.sebastian.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to sail Nargor for 50 gold coins?",
  "npc.sebastian.set_the_sails_2": "Set the sails!",
  "npc.serafin.oh_no_i_1": "Oh, no I don't sell cookies. Or, do you mean you'd like to give me one?",
  "npc.serafin.itd_be_better_2": "It'd be better for you to leave now.",
  "npc.serafin.cough_what_kind_3": "COUGH?! What kind of a mean trick is that? Get out of my shop!",
  "npc.servant_sentry.the_slime_has_1": "The. {Slime}. Has. Entered. Our. {Master}. Has. Left! We. Must. {Help}.",
  "npc.servant_sentry.defeat_slime_we_2": "Defeat. {Slime}. We. Will. Why. Did. You. Kill. Us? Do. You. Want. To. Rectify. And. Help?",
  "npc.servant_sentry.then_take_this_3": "Then. Take. This. Gobbler. Always. Hungry. Eats. Slime. Fungus. Go.",
  "npc.seymour.hmmm_let_me_1": "Hmmm, let me look at you. You got that intelligent sparkle in your eyes and you'd love to handle great power - that must be a future sorcerer!",
  "npc.seymour.hmmm_let_me_2": "Hmmm, let me look at you. You have an aura of great wisdom and may have healing hands as well as a sense for the powers of nature - I think you're a natural born druid!",
  "npc.seymour.hmmm_let_me_3": "Hmmm, let me look at you. <missing message, destiny for paladin>!",
  "npc.seymour.hmmm_let_me_4": "Hmmm, let me look at you. Strong and sturdy, with a determined look in your eyes - no doubt the knight profession would be suited for you!",
  "npc.shauna.what_do_you_1": "What do you think? I am the sheriff of Carlin.",
  "npc.shiantis.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to buy a football for 111 gold?",
  "npc.shiantis.here_it_is_2": "Here it is.",
  "npc.shiantis.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.shiriel.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.shirith.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to buy a key for 50 gold?",
  "npc.shirith.here_it_is_2": "Here it is.",
  "npc.shirith.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.shirtalis_of_the_summer_court.we_allow_able_1": "We allow able champions of all races to fight for our cause against the challenges of the {arena}. So are you interested? I'm not interested in fancy'wordplay, so a simple {yes} or {no} will suffice!",
  "npc.shirtalis_of_the_summer_court.you_are_now_2": "You are now able to enter the teleport.",
  "npc.shirtalis_of_the_summer_court.as_you_wish_3": "As you wish.",
  "npc.shirtalis_of_the_summer_court.this_place_has_4": "This place has always been a site where the champions of summer and winter have clashed in battle. Over the centuries this spectacle has drawn many creatures here to watch, participate and indulge in less savory activities.",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.hmm_if_you_1": "Hmm, if you can spare a coin... we can talk. What do you say?",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.persistent_little_nuisanc_2": "Persistent little nuisance, aren't we? Well, I like your spirit so I will tell you a secret. I may not look the part but I was once a {scientist}. The academy seemed to not like my... attitude and never actually invited me.",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.indeed_i_was_3": "Indeed, I was one myself a long time ago. I may seem a little... distracted by now, but I was working on many important projects. I even created a device to... well, it will cost you another gold coin if you want me to tell you the whole story. You're in?",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.well_if_that_4": "Well, if that is all you can spare... better keep it.",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.alright_it_seems_5": "Alright, it seems you are serious about this. I will tell you about my device. Every night I looked up to the stars and wondered what worlds we would be able to find if we could just look where we wanted to. So... hey are you still listening?",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.good_good_so_6": "Good, good. So eventually I found a way and invented a magic device I called the Lightboat. It was a large construction you could sit in and... well, judging by your looks you don't believe a word. Do you want to hear the story or not?",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.fine_for_years_7": "Fine. For years I gathered all the necessary items to build the device. I travelled, traded and took advantage of some rare opportunities. With luck and patience I eventually got every component I needed. Can you imagine the excitement I experienced?",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.and_there_i_8": "And there I stood before my greatest invention. Door to unknown places, mysterious worlds... yet one of my components was flawed. A small crack in a vital element of my construction quickly led to the failure of the whole project. Still following?",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.the_device_was_9": "The device was ultimately destroyed. I barely escaped the chaos with my life. My laboratory was shattered, as were all the components of the cursed device. With nothing left, I started to lead a new, different life. Do you know what that means?",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.pah_you_have_10": "Pah!! You have NO idea, leave me alone now.",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.right_im_glad_11": "Right... I'm glad everything was destroyed. I don't even know why I kept the remaining copy of the plans all those years... oh, did I say this aloud?",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.yes_well_i_12": "Yes, well... I do have one remaining copy of the plans. I will keep them as a... reminder. Such ill-fated devices only cause trouble and despair. Mankind would be better off, without them, right?",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.ah_you_think_13": "Ah, you think you are wise but you know nothing, nothing about science, nothing about the opportunities it offers... You will never understand scientists like me.",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.well_to_be_14": "Well, to be honest, I envy him a little. He can continue his research in his laboratory. He still has working equipment... I sometimes read his publications. He is an able man, but completely on the wrong track... give these plans to him.",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.mean_heartless_go_15": "Mean, heartless... go and leave me be.",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.well_whatever_then_16": "Well, whatever then...",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.then_stop_bothering_17": "Then stop bothering me.",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.your_decision_18": "Your decision.",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.yes_and_i_19": "Yes and I, I... you mean what? Can't imagine? Well, then there is no purpose to continue telling you this story.",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.thought_so_it_20": "Thought so. It means starting anew, without any home, money or goal in your life. However, it also opens up opportunities... don't you agree?",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.no_no_you_21": "No, no, you are right, I should have tried to rebuild it, I should have been more careful, I should... ah, why did I even tell you this.",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.phew_alright_it_22": "Phew... alright, it was nice talking to you.",
  "npc.shoddy_beggar.hm_maybe_you_23": "Hm, maybe you are right. You could give these plans to someone who might be able to finish this project. Someone who will not make the mistakes I made. Someone... hm, do you know the astronomer Spectulus?",
  "npc.sholley.already_clicked_the_1": "Already clicked the body on the house Roswitha ?",
  "npc.siflind.i_heard_you_1": "I heard you have already helped our cause. Are you interested in another mission, even when it requires you to travel to a distant land?",
  "npc.siflind.well_done_the_2": "Well done. The termites caused just the distraction that we needed. Are you ready for the next step of my plan?",
  "npc.siflind.you_saved_the_3": "You saved the lives of many innocent animals. Thank you very much. If you are looking for another mission, just ask me.",
  "npc.siflind.our_warriors_need_4": "Our warriors need a more potent yet more secure berserker elixir to fight our enemies. To brew it, I need several ingredients. The first things needed are 5 bat wings. Bring them to me and Ill tell you the next ingredients we need.",
  "npc.siflind.do_you_have_5": "Do you have the 5 bat wings I requested?",
  "npc.siflind.the_second_things_6": "The second things needed are 4 bear paws. Bring them to me and Ill tell you the next ingredients we need.",
  "npc.siflind.do_you_have_7": "Do you have the 4 bear paws I requested?",
  "npc.siflind.the_next_things_8": "The next things needed are 3 bonelord eyes. Bring them to me and Ill tell you the next ingredients we need.",
  "npc.siflind.do_you_have_9": "Do you have the 3 bonelord eyes I requested?",
  "npc.siflind.the_next_things_10": "The next things needed are 2 fish fins. Bring them to me and Ill tell you the next ingredients we need.",
  "npc.siflind.do_you_have_11": "Do you have the 2 fish fins I requested?",
  "npc.siflind.the_last_thing_12": "The last thing needed is a green dragon scale. Bring them to me and Ill tell you the next ingredients we need.",
  "npc.siflind.do_you_have_13": "Do you have the green dragon scale I requested?",
  "npc.siflind.i_have_now_14": "I have now no mission for you.",
  "npc.siflind.do_you_want_15": "Do you want to buy a jug for 1000 gold?",
  "npc.siflind.here_you_are_16": "Here you are.",
  "npc.siflind.good_now_listen_17": "Good! Now listen. To protect the animals there, we have to harm the profit of the hunters. Therefor, I ask you to ruin their best source of earnings. Are you willing to do that?",
  "npc.siflind.so_lets_proceed_18": "So let's proceed. Take this vial of paint. Travel to Tyrsung again and ruin as many pelts of baby seals as possible before the paint runs dry or freezes. Then return here to report about your mission. ",
  "npc.siflind.thank_you_very_19": "Thank you very much.",
  "npc.siflind.come_back_when_20": "Come back when you do.",
  "npc.siflind.thank_you_very_21": "Thank you very much.",
  "npc.siflind.come_back_when_22": "Come back when you do.",
  "npc.siflind.thank_you_very_23": "Thank you very much.",
  "npc.siflind.come_back_when_24": "Come back when you do.",
  "npc.siflind.thank_you_very_25": "Thank you very much.",
  "npc.siflind.come_back_when_26": "Come back when you do.",
  "npc.siflind.thank_you_very_27": "Thank you very much. This will help us to defend Svargrond. But I heard young Nilsor is in dire need of help. Please contact him immediately.",
  "npc.siflind.come_back_when_28": "Come back when you do.",
  "npc.siflind.you_want_to_29": "You want to buy animal cure for 400 gold coins?",
  "npc.siflind.im_out_of_30": "Im out of stock.",
  "npc.siflind.here_you_go_31": "Here you go.",
  "npc.siflind.you_dont_have_32": "You dont have enough of gold coins.",
  "npc.sigurd.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.haha_that_beard_1": "Haha, that beard is - well, not fake, but there's a trick behind it. I noticed people tend to be more generous towards a poor gramps. Want to know my trick?",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.have_you_brought_2": "Have you brought me the 100 pieces of ape fur and 20000 gold pieces?",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.hmm_im_not_3": "Hmm, I'm not done yet with your potion. But here, let me sprinkle a few drops of my own potion on your face... there you go. Now you just have to wait.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.aha_i_can_4": "Aha! I can see it! Now that you've waited patiently without shaving, your beard is perfect! All thanks to my, err, potion. Yes. Goodbye!",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.hmm_it_seems_5": "Hmm, it seems you need to wait a bit longer for the potion to take full effect. Please be patient.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.aha_i_can_6": "Aha! I can see it! Now that you've waited patiently without shaving, your beard is perfect! All thanks to my, err, potion. Yes. Goodbye!",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.hmm_it_seems_7": "Hmm, it seems you need to wait a bit longer for the potion to take full effect. Please be patient.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.oh_im_sorry_8": "Oh, I'm sorry... I almost forgot! Okay, okay... here is your promised dress. I'm sure it will look so much better on you than on me- I mean, my, err, sister.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.great_come_back_9": "Great! Come back to me once you have the 100 pieces of ape fur and I'll do my part of the deal.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.ahh_very_good_10": "Ahh! Very good. I will start mixing the potion immediately. Come back later. Bye bye.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.you_do_not_11": "You do not have all the required items.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.you_do_not_12": "You do not have all the required items.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.it_seems_you_13": "It seems you already have this addon, don't you try to mock me son!",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.no_no_our_14": "No, no. Our deal is finished, no complaining now, I don't have time all day. And no, you can't have my staff.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.i_said_no_15": "I said, no! Or well - I have a suggestion to make. Will you listen?",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.good_come_back_16": "Good! Come back to me once you have retrieved my staff. Good luck.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.did_you_bring_17": "Did you bring my favourite staff??",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.yes_thats_it_18": "Yes!! That's it! I'm so glad! Here, you can have my other one. Thanks!",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.you_do_not_19": "You do not have the staff.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.you_do_not_20": "You do not have the staff.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.sorry_but_you_21": "Sorry, but you need to have a premium account!",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.have_you_brought_22": "Have you brought a cookie for the poor?",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.i_need_gold_23": "I need gold. Can you spare 100 gold pieces for me?",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.you_have_no_24": "You have no cookie that I'd like.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.you_havent_got_25": "You haven't got enough money for me.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.thank_you_very_26": "Thank you very much. Can you spare 500 more gold pieces for me? I will give you a nice hint.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.sorry_thats_not_27": "Sorry, that's not enough.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.pah_i_said_28": "Pah! I said 200 gold. You don't have that much.",
  "npc.simon_the_beggar.now_you_own_29": "Now you own the hot key.",
  "npc.sinatuki.jinuma_suvituka_siq_1": "Jinuma, suvituka siq chuqua!! Nguraka, nguraka! <happily takes the food from you and gives you five glimmering crystals>",
  "npc.sinatuki.jinuma_suvituka_siq_2": "Jinuma, suvituka siq chuqua!! Nguraka, nguraka! <happily takes the food from you>",
  "npc.sinatuki.kisavuta_giggles_3": "Kisavuta! <giggles>",
  "npc.sinclair.so_did_you_1": "So, did you find anything worth examining? Did you actually catch a ghost?",
  "npc.sinclair.you_already_done_2": "You already done this quest.",
  "npc.sinclair.talk_research_with_3": "Talk research with spectulus to take some mission.",
  "npc.sinclair.good_now_all_4": "Good, now all you need to do is find a ghost, defeat it and catch its very essence with the cage. Once you have it, return to me and Spectulus and I will move it into our chamber device. Good luck, return to me as soon as you are prepared.",
  "npc.sinclair.go_and_use_5": "Go and use the machine in a dead ghost!",
  "npc.sinclair.good_of_course_6": "Good, of course you will also receive an additional monetary reward for your troubles. Are you fine with that?",
  "npc.sinclair.alright_let_us_7": "Alright, let us see how many ghosts you caught!",
  "npc.sinclair.you_didnt_catch_8": "You didnt catch the ghost pieces.",
  "npc.sinclair.alright_you_found_9": " Alright you found something! Are you really finished hunting out there?",
  "npc.sister_of_jack.why_are_you_1": "Why are you asking, he didn't get himself into something again did he?",
  "npc.sister_of_jack.spelltolust_that_sounds_2": "Spelltolust?! That sounds awfully nasty! What was he doing there - are you telling me he lived an alternate life and he didn't even tell {mother}?",
  "npc.sister_of_jack.what_and_what_3": "What?! And what did he do there? Who did he visit there?",
  "npc.skjaar.i_will_give_1": "I will give the key to the crypt only to the closest followers of my master. Would you like me to test you?",
  "npc.skjaar.before_we_start_2": "Before we start I must ask you for a small donation of 1000 gold coins. Are you willing to pay 1000 gold coins for the test?",
  "npc.skjaar.all_right_then_3": "All right then. Here comes the first question. What was the name of Dago's favourite pet?",
  "npc.skjaar.you_dont_have_4": "You don't have enough money",
  "npc.skjaar.perhaps_you_knew_5": "Perhaps you knew him after all. Tell me - how many fingers did he have when he died?",
  "npc.skjaar.also_true_but_6": "Also true. But can you also tell me the colour of the deamons in which master specialized?",
  "npc.skjaar.it_seems_you_7": "It seems you are worthy after all. Do you want the key to the crypt?",
  "npc.skjaar.here_you_are_8": "Here you are",
  "npc.snake_eye.so_youre_the_1": "So you're the delivery boy? Go ahead, but I warn you, it's quite heavy. You can take it from the box over there.",
  "npc.snake_eye.funny_thing_that_2": "Funny thing that everyone thinks we have forgers for fake documents here. But no, we don't. The best forger is old Ahmet in Ankrahmun.",
  "npc.spectulus.you_are_back_1": "You are back, how did the measurements go? Did you recognise anything of interest?",
  "npc.spectulus.alright_you_look_2": "Alright, you look bright enough to fulfil my requests - at least you do not fall asleep while standing there. Ahem... I heard about a certain inventor who created a {magic device} to actually sail the {sea of light}. Will you help me find him?",
  "npc.spectulus.you_should_find_3": "You should find the beggar somewhere in Edron. Stay persistent, I'm sure he knows more than he wants to tell us.",
  "npc.spectulus.o_have_you_4": "o have you talked to the beggar? What did he tell you? Where are the plans...? Wh...? He did? He is?  You've already got the plans? Beautiful!! Amazing! Alright it will take some time to recapitulate these plans.",
  "npc.spectulus.so_have_you_5": "So have you talked to the beggar? What did he tell you? Where are the plans...? Wh...? He did? He is? You've already got the plans? Beautiful!! Amazing! Alright it will take some time to recapitulate these plans.",
  "npc.spectulus.it_will_take_6": "It will take some time to work out the initial problem of the device. Come back when I've found the component needed to finish it. Alright, B connects to D and another two nails marked with S go... hmmm.",
  "npc.spectulus.connects_to_n_7": "...connects to N942. Alright!! That's it! I just finished a prototype device! And it looks like I figured out the initial failure. A very special crystal is needed for the device to work. Aren't you as curious as me to know what went wrong?",
  "npc.spectulus.did_you_enter_8": "Did you enter the Lost Mines yet? They are west of Edron, close to the sea. You will also need a pick once you get to the crystal deposit.",
  "npc.spectulus.hm_so_did_9": "Hm, so did you find a rare crystal? Show me... hey! That's not a rare crystal. What... where did you get that anyway? Please return to me with the right crystal.",
  "npc.spectulus.well_the_only_10": "Well, the only thing left to do would be to offer the crystal at the well of the collector. There must be a pedestal near the well, where you need to put your donation. Ha, do you think you could do that?",
  "npc.spectulus.found_the_well_11": "Found the well yet? Look on one of the ice isles near Carlin. I'm perfectly sure that the well with the pedestal is located on one of them. And be careful with the carrying device, I only have this one prototype.",
  "npc.spectulus.so_have_you_12": "So have you found the well and entered the lair? I hope you can find the {mirror crystal} in there. It is the only way to finish the {Lightboat}.",
  "npc.spectulus.put_the_mirror_13": "Put the mirror crystal into the special carrying device I gave you and bring it directly to me.",
  "npc.spectulus.do_you_have_14": "Do you have the mirror crystal? Unbelievable! Alright I will extract the crystal from the device myself, would you please give me the device with the crystal and step back?",
  "npc.spectulus.after_the_debacle_15": "After the debacle with the crystal, I started focussing on other things. There are also some {tasks} that still need to be done. If you can spare the time to continue helping me, it shall not be to your disadvantage. So are you in for another mission?",
  "npc.spectulus.so_you_found_16": "So you found him? Have you talked to {Jack} yet?",
  "npc.spectulus.youre_back_from_17": "You're back from {Jack}! Mh, by the looks of your face I doubt our little redecoration project yielded any success. But I had an even better idea while you were gone - ready to give it another try?",
  "npc.spectulus.so_did_you_18": "So, did you talk to his family? Were you able to convince them?",
  "npc.spectulus.did_you_find_19": "Did you find out what hobby {Jack} has? Did you separate him from this activity? Only if he has a free mind, he can truly get back to his former self! Now all you need to do is talk to him again!",
  "npc.spectulus.the_device_needs_20": "The device needs a special crystal. It's called {mirror crystal}. The inventor somehow damaged it - with fatal results. He had to give up, as no second crystal was left to try. I, however, know of another one... but are you up to the task?",
  "npc.spectulus.one_remaining_mirror_21": "One remaining mirror crystal is in the hands of a creature called the collector which collects all kinds of crystals. The only way to get access to its lair is to donate a very rare crystal to a secret well. I need you to get one, will you help me?",
  "npc.spectulus.good_because_if_22": "Good, because if you wouldn't do it... listen, this well is on one of the isles near Carlin. There you offer the crystal. Once you get access to its lair, find the collector and... convince it to give you the mirror crystal. Understood?",
  "npc.spectulus.to_collect_the_23": "To collect the unbelievably rare, practically unique mirror crystal, you will need to use this special carrying device I developed. If you find the crystal, use it to store it and transport it safely to me. There is no second one.",
  "npc.spectulus.of_course_you_24": "Of course you are. And here we go. I have to ask some questions first. One: You aint afraid of no ghost, right?",
  "npc.spectulus.good_two_you_25": "Good. Two: You know that ghosts exist and/or have found and/or defeated one or more of them?",
  "npc.spectulus.good_take_this_26": "Good. Take this wand - we call it a spirit meter - and go to the graveyard I have marked on your map and take a few measurements on the graves.",
  "npc.spectulus.let_me_see_27": "Let me see the spirit meter. Hmmm... those are grave news you bring - uhm, you know what I mean. But this is awesome! Now I know for sure that the calibration is only some short bursts of magically enhanced energy away.",
  "npc.spectulus.yes_and_he_28": "Yes? And he didn't remember anything? Not even me? That's not good. Then we will have to do everything ourselves. Are you ready to continue?",
  "npc.spectulus.ah_well_lets_29": "Ah well, let's forget about the scientific details - you will do just fine as long as you do exactly what I say. Ready for me to go on with your task?",
  "npc.spectulus.yes_maybe_it_30": "Yes, maybe it was the right decision. Astronomical research is nothing for the faint-hearted.",
  "npc.spectulus.well_the_what_31": "Well, the... what? You... mean you're no longer interested? I see, well maybe I overestimated your spirit after all.",
  "npc.spectulus.alright_alright_youll_32": "Alright, alright. You'll never find out the true secrets of life with such attitude, hm.",
  "npc.spectulus.come_on_this_33": "Come on, this is our only chance to finish the Lightboat.",
  "npc.spectulus.thought_so_well_34": "Thought so. Well, no reason to be ashamed. I'll have to find help elsewhere now, though.",
  "npc.spectulus.come_back_if_35": "Come back if you made up your mind.",
  "npc.spectulus.hmpf_mumbles_36": "Hmpf. *mumbles*",
  "npc.spectulus.then_off_you_37": "Then off you go! Im sorry that I cannot offer you any further help but Im sure you will find support along your way. And - be careful. The sea can appear pitch black down there.",
  "npc.spectulus.excellent_excellent_the_38": "Excellent, excellent. The rumours pointed to the north of Tiquanda, a sunken temple probably half drowned in water. Return to me if you find anything interesting!",
  "npc.spectulus.then_off_you_39": "Then off you go! I'm sorry that I cannot offer you any further help but I'm sure you will find support along your way. And - be careful. The sea can appear pitch black down there.",
  "npc.storkus.so_theyve_sent_1": "So they've sent another one? I just hope ye' better than the last one. Are ye' ready for a mission?",
  "npc.storkus.so_far_yeve_2": "So far ye've brought me ",
  "npc.storkus.fine_youre_done_3": "Fine, you're done! Ye' should talk to me about your {mission} again now.",
  "npc.storkus.have_ye_killed_4": "Have ye' killed the vampire lord? Because ye' have no his ring.",
  "npc.storkus.would_ye_like_5": "Would ye' like to give me vampire tokens?",
  "npc.storkus.would_ye_like_6": "Would ye' like to give me vampire tokens?",
  "npc.storkus.would_ye_like_7": "Would ye' like to give me vampire tokens?",
  "npc.storkus.would_ye_like_8": "Would ye' like to give me vampire tokens?",
  "npc.storkus.would_ye_like_9": "Would ye' like to give me vampire tokens?",
  "npc.storkus.would_ye_like_10": "Would ye' like to give me vampire tokens?",
  "npc.storkus.yeve_brought_me_11": "Ye've brought me ",
  "npc.storkus.ye_brought_the_12": "Ye' brought the token needed to advance to the first vampire hunter rank. I consider that a fluke, but still, congrats! Let me share some of my experience with ye'.",
  "npc.storkus.ye_dont_have_13": "Ye' don't have enought tokens.",
  "npc.storkus.ye_brought_the_14": "Ye' brought the four tokens needed to advance to the second vampire hunter rank. Pretty lucky ye' are! Let me share some of my experience with ye'.",
  "npc.storkus.ye_dont_have_15": "Ye' don't have enought tokens.",
  "npc.storkus.ye_brought_the_16": "Ye' brought the five tokens needed to advance to the third vampire hunter rank. Wow, you're pretty determined! Let me share some of my experience with ye'.",
  "npc.storkus.ye_dont_have_17": "Ye' don't have enought tokens.",
  "npc.storkus.ye_brought_the_18": "Ye' brought the ten tokens needed to advance to the fourth vampire hunter rank. You're absolutely painstaking! Let me share some of my experience with ye'.",
  "npc.storkus.ye_dont_have_19": "Ye' don't have enought tokens.",
  "npc.storkus.ye_brought_the_20": "Ye' brought the thirty tokens needed to advance to the fifth vampire hunter rank. You're completely obliterative, kid! Let me share some of my experience with ye'.",
  "npc.storkus.ye_dont_have_21": "Ye' don't have enought tokens.",
  "npc.storkus.ye_brought_the_22": "Ye' brought the fifty tokens needed to advance to the last vampire hunter rank. Now that's something. You're razing-amazing! Let me share some of my experience and a little something with ye'!",
  "npc.storkus.ye_dont_have_23": "Ye' don't have enought tokens.",
  "npc.storkus.as_they_might_24": "As they might have told ye', I'm a vampire hunter. If ye' want to be of any help, ye' can assist me with some of my tasks and bring me 20 ounces of vampire dust. This gives me some time to concentrate on a bigger project.",
  "npc.stricken_soul.excellent_i_hope_1": "Excellent... I hope they will haaaaaaunt my house no longer. What was your... naaaaaame again, tell me?",
  "npc.stricken_soul.yeeeees_you_need_2": "Yeeeees... you need to help meeeeeee. I want those ghosts gone... this is my home and I need it to teach my students. Will you take care of the... ghosts?",
  "npc.stricken_soul.sorry_i_didnt_3": "Sorry, I didn't understand.",
  "npc.sundara.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.sven.a_true_barbarian_1": "A true barbarian is something special among our people. Everyone who wants to become a barbarian will have to pass the barbarian {test}.",
  "npc.sven.do_you_have_2": "Do you have some honey with you?",
  "npc.sven.alright_we_are_3": "Alright, we are even!",
  "npc.sven.you_dont_have_4": "You don't have enough. Bring me the money and I will forget about it.",
  "npc.sven.good_for_this_5": "Good, for this honeycomb I allow you 20 sips from the mead bucket over there. Talk to me again about barbarian mead if you have passed the test.",
  "npc.sven.i_dont_know_6": "I don't know if you realise the consequences. You won't be a member of our community anymore. I ask you for the last time: Are you willing to pay ",
  "npc.sven.alright_its_your_7": "Alright, it's your choice. If you regret your decision and want to be a barbarian again, talk to me about the {barbarian} test.",
  "npc.svenson.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to buy a heavy ball for 123 gold?",
  "npc.svenson.here_it_is_2": "Here it is.",
  "npc.svenson.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have enough money.",
  "npc.swolt.aaargh_cael_and_1": "Aaargh! Cael and his strange thoughts! He bugged me so long about the lizard culture that I eventually agreed to prepare that rice for you if you need it. I need one ripe rice plant to prepare ten rice balls. OK?",
  "npc.swolt.you_dont_have_2": "You don't have a ripe rice plant. Thank fire and earth I was spared.",
  "npc.talphion.dress_flatten_who_1": "DRESS FLATTEN? WHO WANTS ME TO FLATTEN A DRESS?",
  "npc.talphion.a_press_lantern_2": "A PRESS LANTERN? NEVER HEARD ABOUT IT!",
  "npc.talphion.chess_i_dont_3": "CHESS? I DONT PLAY CHESS!",
  "npc.talphion.a_pattern_in_4": "A PATTERN IN THIS MESS?? HEY DON'T INSULT MY MACHINE HALL!",
  "npc.talphion.ah_yes_i_5": "AH YES! I WORKED ON THE DRESS PATTERN FOR THOSE UNIFORMS. STAINLESS TROUSERES, STEAM DRIVEN BOOTS! ANOTHERMARVEL TO BEHOLD! I'LL SENT A COPY TO KEVIN IMEDIATELY!",
  "npc.tamerin.you_have_kept_1": "You have kept your promise. Now, it's time to fulfil my part of the bargain. What kind of animals shall I raise? {Warbeasts} or {cattle}?",
  "npc.tamerin.thank_you_very_2": "Thank you very much. As I said, as soon as you have helped me to solve both of my problems, we will talk about your mission. Have you killed {morik}?",
  "npc.tamerin.come_back_when_3": "Come back when you have the cure.",
  "npc.tamerin.so_he_finally_4": "So he finally got what he deserved. As I said, as soon as you have helped me to solve both of my problems, we will talk about your {mission}.",
  "npc.tamerin.come_back_when_5": "Come back when you got rid with Morik.",
  "npc.tamerin.i_ask_you_6": "I ask you for two things! For one thing, I need an animal cure and for another thing, I ask you to get rid of the gladiator Morik for me.",
  "npc.tamoril.the_first_dragon_1": "The First Dragon? The first of all of us? The Son of Garsharak? I'm surprised you heard about him. It is such a long time that he wandered Tibia. Yet, there are some {rumours}.",
  "npc.tamoril.it_is_told_2": "It is told that the First Dragon had four {descendants}, who became the ancestors of the four kinds of dragons we know in Tibia. They perhaps still have knowledge about the First Dragon's whereabouts - if one could find them.",
  "npc.tamoril.the_names_of_3": "The names of these four are Tazhadur, Kalyassa, Gelidrazah and Zorvorax. Not only were they the ancestors of all dragons after but also the primal representation of the {draconic incitements}. About whom do you want to learn more?",
  "npc.tamoril.what_do_you_4": "What do you want to do, if you know about these mighty dragons' abodes? Go there and look for a fight?",
  "npc.tandros.of_course_just_1": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.tarak_inner.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to travel to the {monument tower} for a 50 gold fee?",
  "npc.tarak_inner.you_dont_have_2": "You don't have enought money.",
  "npc.tarak_sunken.do_you_want_1": "Do you want to go back to {Yalahar}?",
  "npc.tarun.i_hope_you_1": "I hope you will find my brother.",
  "npc.tarun.i_thank_you_2": "I thank you! This is more than I could hope!",
  "npc.tarun.as_you_wish_3": "As you wish.",
  "npc.tehlim.i_warn_you_1": "I warn you, those trolls are WAY more dangerous than the usual kind. Alone, I can't do anything for my brothers. Find a way to the trolls' hideout and rescue my brothers. Are you willing to help me?",
  "npc.tehlim.great_i_hope_2": " Great! I hope you find my brothers. Good luck!",
  "npc.telas.i_have_heard_1": "I have heard only little about this mine. I am a bit absorbed in my studies. But what does this mine have to do with me?",
  "npc.telas.you_are_starting_2": "You are starting this discussion again? Why should I listen to you this time, do you have anything to convince me to let you even try?",
  "npc.telas.well_it_sounds_3": "Well it sounds like a good idea to test my golems in some real environment. I think it is acceptable to send some of them to Farmine.",
  "npc.telas.well_of_course_4": "Well, of course my worker golems are quite usefull and it might indeed be a good idea to see who they operate on realistic conditions. I will send some to farmine soon.",
  "npc.telas.well_if_the_5": "Well, if the situation is that desperate I think it is possible to send some of the golems to help the poor dwarfs out of their misery.",
  "npc.telas.oh_how_nice_6": "Oh how nice of you. I might have misjudged you. So let us return to this matter of worker golems. Do you have any better arguments this time?",
  "npc.telas.wrong_word_7": "Wrong Word.",
  "npc.tereban_functions.you_are_not_1": "You are not on that mission.",
  "npc.tereban_functions.well_i_need_2": "Well, I need the parts of a sorcerer's robe, a paladin's bow, a knight's shield, and a druid's rod. If you cannot find one of them, ask me about it and I might provide you with some minor hints.",
  "npc.tereban_functions.thank_you_for_3": "Thank you for your help!",
  "npc.tereban_functions.i_am_relieved_4": "I am relieved someone as capable as you will handle the task. Well, I need the parts of a sorcerer's robe, a paladin's bow, a knight's shield, and a druid's wand.",
  "npc.tereban_functions.oh_my_i_5": "Oh my. I really hope you will change your mind.",
  "npc.terrence.im_not_allowed_1": "I'm not allowed to let just anyone pass. If you have proven your willingness and effort to participate in the fighting, I'm allowed to let you pass.",
  "npc.terrence.ahhhhhhhh_2": "Ahhhhhhhh! ",
  "npc.terrence.you_fought_hard_3": "You fought hard enough against the minotaurs. Since you've shown so much effort in our war, I'll let you pass through the gate.",
  "npc.testserver_assistant.there_you_have_1": "There you have",
  "npc.testserver_assistant.you_can_not_2": "You can not take it anymore",
  "npc.testserver_assistant.here_you_are_3": "Here you are |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.testserver_assistant.you_have_been_4": "You have been blessed by all gods, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  "npc.testserver_assistant.you_can_not_5": "You can not take it anymore",
  "npc.thanita.impressive_i_could_1": "Impressive!! I could need someone like you here at the watchtower! Okay, the password you need to tell Bunny is ' password* '. Come back and visit me if you like to!",
  "npc.the_beggar_king.so_i_guess_1": "So I guess you are the one that the magistrate is sending to look after us, eh? ",
  "npc.the_beggar_king.you_need_some_2": "You need some quests then come and talk with me again.",
  "npc.the_beggar_king.yeah_no_one_3": "Yeah. No one has seen it and lived to tell the tale. People are missing and sometimes there are {traces} of blood or someone heard a scream, but that's all. We have no idea if the killer is a man or a beast, but there is something out there",
  "npc.the_beggar_king.some_of_the_4": "Some of the more daring of us tried to follow the tracks that were left, but they always lost the trail close to the {abandoned sewers}, in the east of the sewer system.",
  "npc.the_blind_prophet.you_want_me_1": "You want me to transport you to forbidden land?",
  "npc.the_blind_prophet.you_are_not_2": "You are not worthy to be transported there yet.",
  "npc.the_blind_prophet.wise_decision_maybe_3": "Wise decision maybe.",
  "npc.the_bone_master.so_you_want_1": "So you want to advance to a {Hyaena} rank? Did you bring 500 demonic essences with you?",
  "npc.the_bone_master.so_you_want_2": "So you want to advance to a {Death Dealer} rank? Did you bring 1000 demonic essences with you?",
  "npc.the_bone_master.so_you_want_3": "So you want to advance to a {Dread Lord} rank? Did you bring 1500 demonic essences with you?",
  "npc.the_bone_master.you_advanced_to_4": "You advanced to {Hyaena} rank! You are now able to use teleports of second floor of Knightwatch Tower.",
  "npc.the_bone_master.come_back_when_5": "Come back when you gather all essences.",
  "npc.the_bone_master.you_advanced_to_6": "You advanced to {Death Dealer} rank!",
  "npc.the_bone_master.come_back_when_7": "Come back when you gather all essences.",
  "npc.the_bone_master.you_advanced_to_8": "You advanced to {Dread Lord} rank! You are now able to use teleports of fourth floor of Knightwatch Tower and to create addon scrolls.",
  "npc.the_bone_master.come_back_when_9": "Come back when you gather all essences.",
  "npc.the_dream_master.so_you_want_1": "So you want to advance to a {Initiate} rank? Did you bring 500 demonic essences with you?",
  "npc.the_dream_master.so_you_want_2": "So you want to advance to a {Dreamer} rank? Did you bring 1000 demonic essences with you?",
  "npc.the_dream_master.so_you_want_3": "So you want to advance to a {Lord Protector} rank? Did you bring 1500 demonic essences with you?",
  "npc.the_dream_master.please_know_that_4": "Please know that your decision is irrevocable. You will abandon the opportunity to join any order whose doctrine is incontrast to our own ...",
  "npc.the_dream_master.do_you_still_5": "Do you still want to join our order?",
  "npc.the_dream_master.you_advanced_to_6": "You advanced to {Initiate} rank! You are now able to use teleports of second floor of Knightwatch Tower.",
  "npc.the_dream_master.come_back_when_7": "Come back when you gather all essences.",
  "npc.the_dream_master.you_advanced_to_8": "You advanced to {Dreamer} rank!",
  "npc.the_dream_master.come_back_when_9": "Come back when you gather all essences.",
  "npc.the_dream_master.you_advanced_to_10": "You advanced to {Lord Protector} rank! You are now able to use teleports of fourth floor of Knightwatch Tower and to create addon scrolls.",
  "npc.the_dream_master.come_back_when_11": "Come back when you gather all essences.",
  "npc.the_librarian.you_dont_need_1": "You don't need any instructions about the ring right now.",
  "npc.the_lootmonger.i_sell_a_1": "I sell a selection of ",
  "npc.the_lootmonger.of_course_just_2": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.theodore_loveless.oh_my_have_1": "Oh my. Have you gotten an exquisite cigar for me, my young friend?",
  "npc.theodore_loveless.oh_then_there_2": "Oh, then there must be a misunderstanding.",
  "npc.the_oracle.child_come_back_1": "CHILD! COME BACK WHEN YOU HAVE GROWN UP!",
  "npc.the_oracle.you_already_have_2": "YOU ALREADY HAVE A VOCATION!",
  "npc.the_oracle.in_which_town_3": "IN WHICH TOWN DO YOU WANT TO LIVE: {CARLIN}, {THAIS}, OR {VENORE}?",
  "npc.the_oracle.in_which_town_4": "IN WHICH TOWN DO YOU WANT TO LIVE: {CARLIN}, {THAIS}, OR {VENORE}?",
  "npc.the_oracle.knight_paladin_sorcerer_5": "{KNIGHT}, {PALADIN}, {SORCERER}, OR {DRUID}?",
  "npc.the_oracle.then_what_knight_6": "THEN WHAT? {KNIGHT}, {PALADIN}, {SORCERER}, OR {DRUID}?",
  "npc.the_orc_king.arrrrgh_a_dirty_1": "Arrrrgh! A dirty paleskin! To me my children! Kill them my guards!",
  "npc.the_orc_king.for_eons_he_2": "For eons he was trapped in an enchanted lamp by some ancient race. Now he's free to roam the world again. Although he cheated me I appreciate what he and his brethren will do to this world, now it's the time of the Djinn again!",
  "npc.the_orc_king.you_bring_me_3": "You bring me a stinking cookie???",
  "npc.the_orc_king.i_was_waiting_4": "I was waiting for this day! Take the lamp and let Malor feel my wrath!",
  "npc.the_orc_king.i_dont_know_5": "I don't know your enemy, paleskin! Begone!",
  "npc.the_orc_king.you_have_no_6": "You have no cookie that I'd like.",
  "npc.the_orc_king.well_i_hope_7": "Well, I hope it stinks a lot. I like stinking cookies best ... BY MY THOUSAND SONS! YOU ARE SO DEAD HUMAN! DEAD!",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.if_you_have_1": "If you have passed the first six seals and entered the blue fires that lead to the chamber of the seal you might receive my {kiss} ... It will open the last seal. Do you think you are ready?",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.are_you_prepared_2": "Are you prepared to receive my kiss, even though this will mean that your death as well as a part of your soul will forever belong to me, my dear?",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.you_have_already_3": "You have already received my kiss. You should know better then to ask for it.",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.your_wish_for_4": "Your wish for a spectral dress is silly. Although I will grant you the permission to take one. My maidens left one in a box in a room, directly south of here.",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.say_i_have_5": "Say... I have been longing for something for an eternity now... if you help me retrieve it, I will reward you. Do you consent to this arrangement?",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.have_you_really_6": "Have you really brought me 50 holy orchids?",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.the_queen_of_7": "The Queen of the Banshee: Yessss, I can sense you have passed the seal of sacrifice. Have you passed any other seal yet?",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.you_have_not_8": "You have not passed the seal of sacrifice yet. Return to me when you are better prepared.",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.the_queen_of_9": "The Queen of the Banshee: I sense you have passed the hidden seal as well. Have you passed any other seal yet?",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.you_have_not_10": "You have not found the hidden seal yet. Return when you are better prepared.",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.the_queen_of_11": "The Queen of the Banshee: Oh yes, you have braved the plague seal. Have you passed any other seal yet?",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.you_have_not_12": "You have not faced the plagueseal yet. Return to me when you are better prepared.",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.the_queen_of_13": "The Queen of the Banshee: Ah, I can sense the power of the seal of demonrage burning in your heart. Have you passed any other seal yet?",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.you_are_not_14": "You are not filled with the fury of the imprisoned demon. Return when you are better prepared.",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.the_queen_of_15": "The Queen of the Banshee: So, you have managed to pass the seal of the true path. Have you passed any other seal yet?",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.you_have_not_16": "You have not found your true path yet. Return when you are better prepared.",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.the_queen_of_17": "The Queen of the Banshee: I see! You have mastered the seal of logic. You have made the sacrifice, you have seen the unseen, you possess fortitude, you have filled yourself with power and found your path. You may ask me for my {kiss} now.",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.you_have_not_18": "You have not found your true path yet. Return to meh when you are better prepared.",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.so_be_it_19": "So be it! Hmmmmmm...",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.you_have_spilled_20": "You have spilled too much blood recently and the dead are hungry for your soul. Perhaps return when you regained you inner balance.",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.listen_there_are_21": "Listen... there are no blooming flowers down here and the only smell present is that of death and decay. I wish that I could breathe the lovely smell of beautiful flowers just one more time, especially those which elves cultivate. Could you please bring me 50 holy orchids?",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.thank_you_i_22": "Thank you. I will wait for your return.",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.thank_you_you_23": "Thank you! You have no idea what that means to me. As promised, here is your reward... as a follower of Zathroth, I hope that you will like this accessory.",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.you_need_holy_24": "You need 50 holy orchid.",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.then_try_to_25": "Then try to be better prepared next time we meet.",
  "npc.the_queen_of_the_banshees.perhaps_it_is_26": "Perhaps it is the better choice for you, my dear.",
  "npc.timothy.excellent_you_will_1": "Excellent! You will find Palimuth near the entrance of the city centre. Just ask him if you can assist him in a few missions.",
  "npc.tim_the_guard.ah_well_just_1": "Ah, well. Just this morning my new toothbrush fell into the toilet.",
  "npc.tim_the_guard.what_do_you_2": "What do you mean? Of course they will immediately send someone with extra long and thin arms to retrieve it! ",
  "npc.tim_the_guard.your_humour_might_3": "Your humour might let end you up beaten in some dark alley, you know? No, I don't think someone could have prevented that accident! ",
  "npc.tom.i_had_some_1": "I had some cough syrup a while ago. It was stolen in an ape raid. I fear if you want more cough syrup you will have to buy it in the druids guild in carlin.",
  "npc.tom.would_you_like_2": "Would you like to wear bear paws like I do? No problem, just bring me 50 bear paws and 50 wolf paws and I'll fit them on.",
  "npc.tom.have_you_brought_3": "Have you brought 50 bear paws and 50 wolf paws?",
  "npc.tom.excellent_like_promised_4": "Excellent! Like promised, here are your bear paws. ",
  "npc.tom.you_dont_have_5": "You don't have all items.",
  "npc.tomruk_the_ruddy.hello_hello_did_1": "Hello hello! Did you bring those blood samples?",
  "npc.tomruk_the_ruddy.you_havent_got_2": "You haven't got any blood.",
  "npc.tomruk_the_ruddy.hello_hello_did_3": "Hello hello! Did Hello hello! Well now, painted all those blood pagodas properly?",
  "npc.tomruk_the_ruddy.hello_hell_oh_4": "Hello hell- oh, you've come for the scroll, haven't you?",
  "npc.tomruk_the_ruddy.my_heart_bleeds_5": "My heart bleeds to part from it. Here. Extend your hand - I'll just retrieve some blood from in exchange - HOLD STILL.",
  "npc.tony.uhm_report_eh_1": "Uhm, report, eh? <slowly gives a clumsy description of recent problems>. ",
  "npc.tony.you_can_pass_2": "You can {pass} either to the {Arena Quarter} or {Foreigner Quarter}. Which one will it be?",
  "npc.topsy.so_you_ask_1": "So you ask me for a {",
  "npc.topsy.what_i_have_2": "What? I have already gave you one {",
  "npc.topsy.sorry_you_arent_3": "Sorry, you aren't a druid either a sorcerer.",
  "npc.topsy.here_you_are_4": "Here you are young adept, take care yourself.",
  "npc.topsy.of_course_just_5": "Of course, just browse through my wares. You can also look at ",
  "npc.torkada.you_need_at_1": "You need at least level 250 to start our mission.",
  "npc.torkada.you_already_have_2": "You already have accepted this mission.",
  "npc.torkada.this_expedition_is_3": "This expedition is here on an important {mission} for the inquisition",
  "npc.torkada.are_you_willing_4": "Are you willing, to bring the fury of the inquisition to that foul place and eradicate all evil you find? Speak, {yes} or {no}?",
  "npc.torkada.ok_then_not_5": "Ok then not.",
  "npc.trisha.are_you_talking_1": "Are you talking about my spiky shoulder pad? You can't buy one of these. They have to be {earned}.",
  "npc.trisha.im_not_sure_2": "I'm not sure if you are enough of a hero to earn them. You could try, though. What do you think?",
  "npc.trisha.before_i_can_3": "Before I can nominate you for an award, please complete your task.",
  "npc.trisha.you_did_it_4": "You did it! I have seldom seen a man as courageous as you. I really have to say that you deserve to wear a spike. Go ask Cornelia to adorn your armour.",
  "npc.trisha.i_thought_so_5": "I thought so. Train hard and maybe some day you will be ready to face this mission.",
  "npc.trisha.excellent_dont_forget_6": "Excellent! Don't forget: Your first task is to bring me 100 hardened bones. Good luck!",
  "npc.trisha.would_you_like_7": "Would you like me to repeat the task requirements then?",
  "npc.trisha.why_do_men_8": "Why do men always lie?",
  "npc.trisha.dont_give_up_9": "Don't give up just yet.",
  "npc.ubaid.shove_off_little_1": "Shove off, little one! Humans are not welcome here, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  "npc.ubaid.what_you_know_2": "What? You know the word, |PLAYERNAME|? All right then - I won't kill you. At least, not now.  What brings you {here}?",
  "npc.ubaid.still_alive_playername_3": "Still alive, |PLAYERNAME|? What brings you {here}?",
  "npc.ubaid.you_already_pledged_4": "You already pledged loyalty to king Malor!",
  "npc.ubaid.of_course_then_5": "Of course. Then don't waste my time and shove off.",
  "npc.ubaid.who_do_you_6": "Who do you think you are? A Marid? Shove off you worm!",
  "npc.ubaid.so_you_pledge_7": "So you pledge loyalty to king Malor and you are willing to never ever set foot on Marid's territory, unless you want to kill them? Yes?",
  "npc.ubaid.of_course_then_8": "Of course. Then don't waste my time and shove off.",
  "npc.ubaid.of_course_then_9": "Of course. Then don't waste my time and shove off.",
  "npc.ulala.come_back_if_1": "Come back if you finished the dance.",
  "npc.ulala.please_help_tribe_2": "Please help tribe make Pandor happy! Did you bring us what I asked?",
  "npc.ulala.please_find_great_3": "Please find great crystal of Fasuon and pray there for his support!",
  "npc.ulala.you_prayed_to_4": "You prayed to Fasuon! Me saw ray of lights on mountain top! Beautiful it was. Me thank you for your help. Great hunt almost can't go wrong now!",
  "npc.ulala.krunus_is_god_5": "Krunus is God for plants and birth. He hidden in all that grows.",
  "npc.ulala.me_thank_you_6": "Me thank you! Me will bring sacrifice for Pandor. He surely be pleased with our work. Well your work, but me won't tell him. Teehee.",
  "npc.ulala.you_do_not_7": "You do not have these things!",
  "npc.umar.whoa_a_human_1": "Whoa! A human! This is no place for you, |PLAYERNAME|. Go and play somewhere else.",
  "npc.umar.playername_hows_it_2": "|PLAYERNAME|! How's it going these days? What brings you {here}?",
  "npc.umar.you_already_have_3": "You already have the permission to enter Ashta'daramai.",
  "npc.umar.are_you_sure_4": "Are you sure? You pledge loyalty to king Gabel, who is... you know. And you are willing to never ever set foot on Efreets' territory, unless you want to kill them? Yes?",
  "npc.umar.i_dont_believe_5": "I don't believe you! You better go now.",
  "npc.umar.this_isnt_your_6": "This isn't your war anyway, human.",
  "npc.umar.this_isnt_your_7": "This isn't your war anyway, human.",
  "npc.uncle.then_welcome_to_1": "Then welcome to the family.",
  "npc.uncle.i_hope_you_2": "I hope you did not make this little pest too nervous. He isn't serving us too well by hiding under some stone or something like that. However, nicely done for your first job.",
  "npc.uncle.ah_yes_this_3": "Ah, yes. This will be a most interesting lecture.",
  "npc.uncle.please_bring_me_4": "Please bring me the file AH-X17L89.",
  "npc.uncle.does_it_not_5": "Does it not warm up your heart if you can bring a little joy to the people while doing your job? Well, don't get carried away, most part of your job is not warming up hearts but tearing them out.",
  "npc.uncle.good_work_getting_6": "Good work getting rid of that nuisance.",
  "npc.uncle.fine_fine_this_7": "Fine, fine. This will serve us quite well. Ah, don't give me that look... you are not that stupid, are you?",
  "npc.uncle.come_back_when_8": "Come back when you've found the ring.",
  "npc.uncle.even_if_the_9": "Even if the present has not improved our relations, the weapons will enable the barbarians to put more pressure on Svargrond and Carlin. So in any case we profited from the present.",
  "npc.uncle.please_bring_me_10": "Please bring me proof of the mad technomancers defeat!",
  "npc.uncle.as_you_wish_11": "As you wish.",
  "npc.uncle.lets_start_with_12": "Let's start with a rather simple job. There is a contact in Thais with that we need to get in touch again. Deliver this note to Gamel in Thais. Get an answer from him. If he is a bit reluctant, be 'persuasive'.",
  "npc.uncle.do_you_have_13": "Do you have news to make old Uncle happy?",
  "npc.uncle.do_you_have_14": "Do you have news to make old Uncle happy?",
  "npc.uncle.do_you_have_15": "Do you have news to make old Uncle happy? Don't tell me you need another barrel of beer, though.",
  "npc.uncle.do_you_have_16": "Do you have news to make old Uncle happy?",
  "npc.uncle.i_need_you_17": "I need you to locate a lost ring on the Isle of the Kings for me, get back to me once you have it.",
  "npc.uncle.do_you_have_18": "Do you have news to make old Uncle happy?",
  "npc.uncle.do_you_have_19": "Do you have news to make old Uncle happy?",
  "npc.uncle.do_you_have_20": "Do you have news to make old Uncle happy?",
  "npc.undal.so_do_you_1": "So do you want to learn the {story} behind of this or rather talk about the {task} at hand? ",
  "npc.undal.do_you_prefer_2": "Do you prefer the {long} version or the {short} version?",
  "npc.undal.the_nightmare_beast_3": "The Nightmare Beast is slain. You have done well. The Courts of Summer and Winter will be forever grateful. For your efforts I want to reward you with our traditional dream warrior outfit. May it suit you well!",
  "npc.undal.i_already_gave_4": "I already gave your task.",
  "npc.undal.they_are_not_5": "They are not literally keys but rather puzzles you have to solve or a secret mechanism you have to discover in order to open the Dream Doors. A parchment in the chest here can tell you more about it.",
  "npc.undal.are_you_interested_6": "Are you interested in one or two addons to your dream warrior outfit?",
  "npc.undal.you_dont_even_7": "You don't even have the outfit.",
  "npc.undal.i_provide_two_8": "I provide two addons. For the first one I need you to bring me five pomegranates. For the second addon you need an ice shield. Do you want one of these addons?",
  "npc.undal.what_do_you_9": "What do you have for me: the {pomegranates} or the {ice shield}?",
  "npc.undal.very_good_you_10": "Very good! You gained the second addon to the dream warrior outfit.",
  "npc.undal.you_do_not_11": "You do not have enough items.",
  "npc.undal.very_good_you_12": "Very good! You gained the first addon to the dream warrior outfit.",
  "npc.undal.you_do_not_13": "You do not have enough items.",
  "npc.undal.sorry_i_didnt_14": "Sorry, I didn't understand.",
  "npc.ustan.i_had_some_1": "I had some cough syrup a while ago. It was stolen in an ape raid. I fear if you want more cough syrup you will have to buy it in the druids guild in carlin.",
  "npc.ustan.would_you_like_2": "Would you like to wear bear paws like I do? No problem, just bring me 50 bear paws and 50 wolf paws and I'll fit them on.",
  "npc.ustan.have_you_brought_3": "Have you brought 50 bear paws and 50 wolf paws?",
  "npc.ustan.excellent_like_promised_4": "Excellent! Like promised, here are your bear paws. ",
  "npc.uzgod.you_bringing_me_1": "You bringing me draconian steel and obsidian lance in exchange for obsidian knife?",
  "npc.uzgod.here_you_have_2": "Here you have it.",
  "npc.uzgod.you_dont_have_3": "You don't have these items.",
  "npc.uzgod.true_dwarven_pickaxes_4": "True dwarven pickaxes having to be maded by true weaponsmith! You wanting to get pickaxe for explorer society?",
  "npc.uzgod.me_dont_sell_5": "Me don't sell crimson sword.",
  "npc.uzgod.you_telling_me_6": "You telling me to forge one?! Especially for you? You making fun of me?",
  "npc.uzgod.you_got_me_7": "You got me brooch?",
  "npc.uzgod.me_order_book_8": "Me order book quite full is. But telling you what: You getting me something me lost and Uzgod seeing that your pickaxe comes first. Jawoll! You interested?",
  "npc.uzgod.good_good_you_9": "Good good. You listening: Me was stolen valuable heirloom. Brooch from my family. Good thing is criminal was caught. Bad thing is, criminal now in dwarven prison of dwacatra is and must have taken brooch with him ...",
  "npc.uzgod.to_get_into_10": "To get into dwacatra you having to get several keys. Each key opening way to other key until you get key to dwarven prison ...",
  "npc.uzgod.last_key_should_11": "Last key should be in the generals quarter near armory. Only General might have key to enter there too. But me not knowing how to enter Generals private room at barracks. You looking on your own ...",
  "npc.uzgod.when_got_key_12": "When got key, then you going down to dwarven prison and getting me that brooch. Tell me that you got brooch when having it.",
  "npc.uzgod.thanking_you_for_13": "Thanking you for brooch. Me guessing you now want your pickaxe?",
  "npc.uzgod.here_you_have_14": "Here you have it.",
  "npc.uzgod.ah_thats_how_15": "Ah, that's how me like me customers. Ok, me do this... <pling pling> ... another fine swing of the hammer here and there... <ploing>... here you have it!",
  "npc.uzgod.well_thinking_about_16": "Well. Thinking about it, me a smith, so why not. 1000 gold for your personal crimson sword. Ok?",
  "npc.uzgod.too_expensive_you_17": "Too expensive?! You think me work is cheap? Well, if you want cheap, I can make cheap. Hrmpf. I make cheap sword for 300 gold. Ok?",
  "npc.uzgod.cheap_but_good_18": "Cheap but good quality? Impossible. Unless... you bring material. Three iron ores, 250 gold. Okay?",
  "npc.vanys.so_do_you_1": "So do you want to learn the {story} behind of this or rather talk about the {task} at hand? ",
  "npc.vanys.do_you_prefer_2": "Do you prefer the {long} version or the {short} version?",
  "npc.vanys.the_nightmare_beast_3": "The Nightmare Beast is slain. You have done well. The Courts of Summer and Winter will be forever grateful. For your efforts I want to reward you with our traditional dream warrior outfit. May it suit you well!",
  "npc.vanys.i_already_gave_4": "I already gave your task.",
  "npc.vanys.they_are_not_5": "They are not literally keys but rather puzzles you have to solve or a secret mechanism you have to discover in order to open the Dream Doors. A parchment in the chest here can tell you more about it.",
  "npc.vanys.are_you_interested_6": "Are you interested in one or two addons to your dream warrior outfit?",
  "npc.vanys.you_dont_even_7": "You don't even have the outfit.",
  "npc.vanys.i_provide_two_8": "I provide two addons. For the first one I need you to bring me five pomegranates. For the second addon you need an ice shield. Do you want one of these addons?",
  "npc.vanys.what_do_you_9": "What do you have for me: the {pomegranates} or the {ice shield}?",
  "npc.vanys.very_good_you_10": "Very good! You gained the second addon to the dream warrior outfit.",
  "npc.vanys.you_do_not_11": "You do not have enough items.",
  "npc.vanys.very_good_you_12": "Very good! You gained the first addon to the dream warrior outfit.",
  "npc.vanys.you_do_not_13": "You do not have enough items.",
  "npc.vanys.sorry_i_didnt_14": "Sorry, I didn't understand.",
  "npc.vascalir.welcome_adventurer_player_1": "Welcome, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|. Thank you for offering your help - but you are already too experienced to start this quest. Just go on hunting monsters, you'll be better off that way.",
  "npc.vascalir.playername_the_only_2": "|PLAYERNAME|, the only thing left for you to do here is to talk to the oracle above the academy and leave for the Isle of Destiny. Thanks again for your great work and good luck on your journeys!",
  "npc.vascalir.greetings_playername_righ_3": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Right now I don't need your help. I heard that Lily south-west of here requires assistance though.",
  "npc.vascalir.greetings_playername_righ_4": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Right now I don't need your help. You should pay a visit to Tom the Tanner. His hut is south-west of the academy!",
  "npc.vascalir.you_can_find_5": "You can find the vault if you go down the stairs in the northern part of the academy. The book should be in a large blue chest somewhere down there - I hope it's not burnt yet.",
  "npc.vascalir.i_think_its_6": "I think it's a good idea to go see Paulie before you leave the village again. Just go downstairs and to the right to find the bank.",
  "npc.vascalir.playername_you_need_7": "|PLAYERNAME|, you need to discover the troll tunnel and find a way to make it collapse. Maybe you're able to use some of the trolls' tools. Make sure they can't enter the village via that tunnel anymore!",
  "npc.vascalir.playername_the_air_8": "|PLAYERNAME|, the air smells like victory. Head into the orc fortress and vanquish Kraknaknork once and for all. Don't forget to take the items from below the academy!",
  "npc.vascalir.you_still_need_9": "You still need to kill ",
  "npc.vescu.oh_two_ttrolls_1": "Oh, two t-trolls. Hellooo, wittle twolls. <hicks>",
  "npc.vescu.i_wish_there_2": "I wish there was like a {potion} which makes you sober in an instant. Dwarven rings wear off so fast. <hicks>",
  "npc.vescu.its_so_hard_3": "It's so hard to know the exact time when to stop drinking. <hicks> C-could you help me to brew such a potion?",
  "npc.vescu.right_hicks_since_4": "Right. <hicks> Since you helped me to b-brew that potion and thus ensured the high quality of my work <hicks>, I'll give you my old assassin costume. It lacks the head part, but it's almost like new. Don't pretend to be me though, 'kay? <hicks>",
  "npc.vescu.ggood_go_get_5": "G-good. Go get them, I'll have a beer in the meantime.",
  "npc.vescu.next_time_you_6": "Next time you lie to me I'll k-kill you. <hicks> Don't think I can't aim well just because I'm d-drunk.",
  "npc.vescu.then_not_hicks_7": "Then not <hicks>.",
  "npc.vescu.hhurry_up_hicks_8": "H-hurry up! <hicks> I have to start working soon.",
  "npc.vulturenose.hey_i_rarely_1": "Hey, I rarely see a dashing pirate like you! Get in, matey!",
  "npc.vulturenose.you_will_not_2": "YOU WILL NOT PASS! Erm ... I mean you don't look like a true pirate to me. You won't get in.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.prey_hunting_tasks_1": "Prey hunting tasks should reduce the number of certain monsters. And if you fulfil them successfully I will show my appreciation and give you some {rewards} in exchange of hunting task points.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.right_now_you_2": "Right now you have ",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.you_have_already_3": "You have already spent ",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.sorry_i_have_4": "Sorry, i have no offer to make for you today.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.i_have_no_5": "I have no outfit offer to make.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.i_offer_you_6": "I offer you the ",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.i_have_no_7": "I have no mount offer to make.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.i_offer_you_8": "I offer you the ",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.i_have_no_9": "I have no trophie offer to make.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.i_offer_you_10": "I offer you the ",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.i_have_no_11": "I have no furniture offer to make.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.i_offer_you_12": "I offer you the ",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.here_you_have_13": "Here you have it.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.sorry_but_you_14": "Sorry, but you don't have enough slots on your inbox or capacity.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.sorry_but_you_15": "Sorry, but you don't have enough hunting task points.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.here_you_have_16": "Here you have it.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.sorry_but_you_17": "Sorry, but you don't have enough slots on your inbox or capacity.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.sorry_but_you_18": "Sorry, but you don't have enough hunting task points.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.you_already_have_19": "You already have this outfit.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.here_you_have_20": "Here you have it.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.first_you_need_21": "First you need to buy the base addon to unlock this addon.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.you_already_have_22": "You already have this addon.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.here_you_have_23": "Here you have it.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.sorry_but_you_24": "Sorry, but you don't have enough hunting task points.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.first_you_need_25": "First you need to buy the base addon to unlock this addon.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.you_already_have_26": "You already have this addon.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.here_you_have_27": "Here you have it.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.sorry_but_you_28": "Sorry, but you don't have enough hunting task points.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.you_already_have_29": "You already have this mount.",
  "npc.walter_jaeger.here_you_have_30": "Here you have it.",
  "npc.walter_the_guard.i_think_there_1": "I think there is a pickpocket in town.",
  "npc.walter_the_guard.well_sooner_or_2": "Well, sooner or later we will get hold of that delinquent. That's for sure.",
  "npc.walter_the_guard.you_cant_tell_3": "You can't tell by a person's appearance who is a pickpocket and who isn't. You simply can't close the city gates for everyone.",
  "npc.walter_the_guard.if_the_gods_4": "If the gods had created the world a paradise, no one had to steal at all.",
  "npc.wentworth.your_account_balance_1": "Your account balance is ",
  "npc.wentworth.you_do_not_2": "You do not have enough gold.",
  "npc.wentworth.sorry_but_you_3": "Sorry, but you can't deposit that much.",
  "npc.wentworth.would_you_really_4": "Would you really like to deposit ",
  "npc.wentworth.you_do_not_5": "You do not have enough gold.",
  "npc.wentworth.would_you_really_6": "Would you really like to deposit ",
  "npc.wentworth.please_tell_me_7": "Please tell me how much gold it is you would like to deposit.",
  "npc.wentworth.would_you_really_8": "Would you really like to deposit ",
  "npc.wentworth.you_do_not_9": "You do not have enough gold.",
  "npc.wentworth.sorry_but_you_10": "Sorry, but you can't deposit that much.",
  "npc.wentworth.sorry_but_you_11": "Sorry, but you can't deposit that much.",
  "npc.wentworth.alright_we_have_12": "Alright, we have added the amount of ",
  "npc.wentworth.you_do_not_13": "You do not have enough gold.",
  "npc.wentworth.as_you_wish_14": "As you wish. Is there something else I can do for you?",
  "npc.wentworth.are_you_sure_15": "Are you sure you wish to withdraw ",
  "npc.wentworth.there_is_not_16": "There is not enough gold on your account.",
  "npc.wentworth.please_tell_me_17": "Please tell me how much gold you would like to withdraw.",
  "npc.wentworth.are_you_sure_18": "Are you sure you wish to withdraw ",
  "npc.wentworth.there_is_not_19": "There is not enough gold on your account.",
  "npc.wentworth.there_is_not_20": "There is not enough gold on your account.",
  "npc.wentworth.here_you_are_21": "Here you are, ",
  "npc.wentworth.the_customer_is_22": "The customer is king! Come back anytime you want to if you wish to {withdraw} your money.",
  "npc.wentworth.how_many_platinum_23": "How many platinum coins would you like to get?",
  "npc.wentworth.sorry_you_do_24": "Sorry, you do not have enough gold coins.",
